  ('1140763787046405165', 'Gallipoli', 2015, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Kodi Smit-McPhee, Nicholas Hope, Travis Jeffery, Matt Nable, Harry Greenwood, Sam Parsonson, Tom Budge, James Callis', null, 'As dawn breaks on April 25, 1915, ANZAC troops go into battle on the beaches of the Gallipoli peninsula. Landing in the dark chaos, Tolly, Bevan and their mates struggle to establish a tenuous foothold on the treacherous slopes and deep ravines. They endure the next eight months on the peninsula learning lessons of survival. By the time of the final evacuation they have also learned the skills of combat and what it means to be a young man in war.', 'As dawn breaks on April 25, 1915, ANZAC troops go into battle on the beaches of the Gallipoli peninsula. Landing in the dark chaos, Tolly, Bevan and their mates struggle to establish a tenuous foothold on the treacherous slopes and deep ravines. They endure the next eight months on the peninsula learning lessons of survival. By the time of the final evacuation they have also learned the skills of combat and what it means to be a young man in war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oreAFlmrnEsxNwZvLxBAeyYUyY9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62039'),
  ('841318997456980994', 'Gals Can''t Be Kind to Otaku!?', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shou Komura, Konomi Inagaki, Yu Serizawa, Jun Kasama, Konomi Kohara, Atsumi Tanezaki, Emiri Kato', null, 'Takuya Seo is a quiet otaku who keeps a low profile at school—until two gals from his class start talking to him. The cool but scatterbrained Kei Amane and the cheerful, energetic Kotoko Ijichi couldn’t be more different, but the three soon bond over anime, games, and shared fandom. But one question remains: do nice gals who hang out with otaku really exist?!', 'Takuya Seo is a quiet otaku who keeps a low profile at school—until two gals from his class start talking to him. The cool but scatterbrained Kei Amane and the cheerful, energetic Kotoko Ijichi couldn’t be more different, but the three soon bond over anime, games, and shared fandom. But one question remains: do nice gals who hang out with otaku really exist?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFVMNqlziHY4O41A5J3C382oXZc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:309163'),
  ('944450796449662306', 'Galtar and the Golden Lance', 1985, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Lou Richards, Brock Peters, David Mendenhall, Frank Welker, Helen Hunt, Peter Cullen, Corey Burton, Michael Bell', null, 'Galtar and the Golden Lance is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera in the 1980s. It was originally produced and released as part of a five-in-one omnibus program, The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera, of which Challenge of the Gobots, The Jetsons, Paw Paws, and Yogi''s Treasure Hunt as part of the 1985''s inaugurated allstar 1st lineup. The TV series has been considered to have been created due to the rise and popularity of the He-Man franchise.', 'Galtar and the Golden Lance is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera in the 1980s. It was originally produced and released as part of a five-in-one omnibus program, The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera, of which Challenge of the Gobots, The Jetsons, Paw Paws, and Yogi''s Treasure Hunt as part of the 1985''s inaugurated allstar 1st lineup. The TV series has been considered to have been created due to the rise and popularity of the He-Man franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OnMOs7viVu66ezCX7JMwwzcxrp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10343'),
  ('242885031095120025', 'Game Changer', 2019, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Sam Reich', null, 'Sam Reich', null, 'In this game show, the game changes every show! Players begin each round without knowing the rules -- and must figure them out while competing to win.', 'In this game show, the game changes every show! Players begin each round without knowing the rules -- and must figure them out while competing to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsucathtIn3pg5SzxmvEVQgho4P.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:129412'),
