  ('1051470379231927722', 'Game of Hunting', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jiang Wei', null, 'Hu Ge, Chen Long, Jian Renzi, Wan Qian, Zhang Lingzhi, Li Qiang, Hu Bing, Ke Lan', null, 'After a devastating fall from grace lands him in prison, ruthless headhunter Zheng Qiudong fights to reclaim his place in the cutthroat business world—only to discover that the hunt for success has become far more dangerous than before.', 'After a devastating fall from grace lands him in prison, ruthless headhunter Zheng Qiudong fights to reclaim his place in the cutthroat business world—only to discover that the hunt for success has become far more dangerous than before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/on04SMYz5hJc7JD9WOVJL4FECz1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75036'),
