  ('113791222388446443', 'Game of Outlaws', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Chatchai Plengpanich', null, 'Prin Suparat, Natapohn Tameeruks, Jaron Sorat, Pimpawee Kograbin, Chatchai Plengpanich, Boonyisa Jantrarachai, Jacqueline Muench, Sarunyoo Prachakit', null, 'When their fathers are killed in the line of duty, two grown-up daughters join the police force to avenge their deaths and fight crime.', 'When their fathers are killed in the line of duty, two grown-up daughters join the police force to avenge their deaths and fight crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkKRcPIcHih66LDZXIu0qiijAyt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136938'),
  ('1131072429642226338', 'Game of Silence', 2016, 'Drama', 'David Hudgins', null, 'David Lyons, Michael Raymond-James, Larenz Tate, Bre Blair, Claire van der Boom, Demetrius Grosse, Deidrie Henry, Conor O''Farrell', 'TV-14', 'A successful Atlanta attorney''s long-lost childhood friends unexpectedly reappear after 25 years. When a dark secret they thought they''d buried resurfaces, the brotherhood bands together to right the wrongs of their shared past - a journey that will push the limits of their loyalty and quench their thirst for revenge.', 'A successful Atlanta attorney''s long-lost childhood friends unexpectedly reappear after 25 years. When a dark secret they thought they''d buried resurfaces, the brotherhood bands together to right the wrongs of their shared past - a journey that will push the limits of their loyalty and quench their thirst for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXFCYa8Kx35aEp68F3Q9RG8mAYX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64482'),
  ('454444219769746171', 'Game of Thrones', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'David Benioff, D. B. Weiss', null, 'Peter Dinklage, Kit Harington, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Lena Headey, Emilia Clarke, Liam Cunningham, Maisie Williams, Isaac Hempstead Wright', 'TV-MA', 'Seven noble families fight for control of the mythical land of Westeros. Friction between the houses leads to full-scale war. All while a very ancient evil awakens in the farthest north. Amidst the war, a neglected military order of misfits, the Night''s Watch, is all that stands between the realms of men and icy horrors beyond.', 'Seven noble families fight for control of the mythical land of Westeros. Friction between the houses leads to full-scale war. All while a very ancient evil awakens in the farthest north. Amidst the war, a neglected military order of misfits, the Night''s Watch, is all that stands between the realms of men and icy horrors beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XS1oqL89opfnbLl8WnZY1O1uJx.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1399'),
  ('135925697702317177', 'Game of True Love', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Fan Zhixin, He Ruixian, Wang Ce, Wang Zuyi, Huang Qiao, Chen Yisha, Mei Lingzhen, Min Xinghan', null, 'Xu Nuo, the heiress to the Yuanfei Group, returns from studying abroad to find her family in disarray. Her mother has lost everything, and her foster brother, Shen Jiahe, is poised to take control of the family business. To make matters worse, her father''s fiancée is Bai Xia, her old rival. Determined to reclaim her place and expose Shen Jiahe''s true intentions, Xu Nuo devises a bold plan, setting off a high-stakes game of love and betrayal.', 'Xu Nuo, the heiress to the Yuanfei Group, returns from studying abroad to find her family in disarray. Her mother has lost everything, and her foster brother, Shen Jiahe, is poised to take control of the family business. To make matters worse, her father''s fiancée is Bai Xia, her old rival. Determined to reclaim her place and expose Shen Jiahe''s true intentions, Xu Nuo devises a bold plan, setting off a high-stakes game of love and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lyC6hEeZSuJhtHOjEfac1pkfrA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256542'),
  ('528612644487823004', 'Game On', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Davies, Bernadette Davis', 'Bernadette Davis', 'Neil Stuke, Matthew Cottle, Samantha Womack', 'NR', 'Following the lives of three 20-somethings sharing a flat in Battersea. They''re young, bright and sexy - so why aren''t they having a good time ? Join Matthew (the agoraphobic, self-obsessed, macho man); Martin (the wimpish, sex-starved underdog) and Mandy (the gorgeous blonde, who always ends up with the wrong men), in this outrageously funny flat-share comedy that is anything but politically correct.', 'Following the lives of three 20-somethings sharing a flat in Battersea. They''re young, bright and sexy - so why aren''t they having a good time ? Join Matthew (the agoraphobic, self-obsessed, macho man); Martin (the wimpish, sex-starved underdog) and Mandy (the gorgeous blonde, who always ends up with the wrong men), in this outrageously funny flat-share comedy that is anything but politically correct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1Pfoog8aMaRqInVgtCtJn7BjWl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4155'),
  ('874012155920552152', 'Game Shakers', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Dan Schneider', null, 'Cree Cicchino, Madisyn Shipman, Thomas Kuc, Benjamin Flores Jr., Kel Mitchell', 'TV-G', 'A live-action sitcom about two 12-year-old girls who start a multi-million-dollar gaming company and take on rap superstar Double G as a business partner.', 'A live-action sitcom about two 12-year-old girls who start a multi-million-dollar gaming company and take on rap superstar Double G as a business partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TMp3RMf9DCZaaR9XeAQ1N6tby4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64264'),
  ('978100497117622845', 'Game Two', 2016, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Simon Krätschmer, Daniel Budiman', null, 'Ingo Meß', null, 'At Game Two, we show our love for video games in a charmingly silly way: The latest game reviews, gaming news, a lot of humor and a good pinch of punch & cardboard - whether for full-blooded gamers, casual gamers or noobs. Game Two is a gaming show, information from the gaming cosmos and comedy. Packed into three entertaining videos per week. Be there when we test games, discuss games news with you and don''t take ourselves too seriously again.', 'At Game Two, we show our love for video games in a charmingly silly way: The latest game reviews, gaming news, a lot of humor and a good pinch of punch & cardboard - whether for full-blooded gamers, casual gamers or noobs. Game Two is a gaming show, information from the gaming cosmos and comedy. Packed into three entertaining videos per week. Be there when we test games, discuss games news with you and don''t take ourselves too seriously again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tne6Vi2FWIXsX7dIuleZQWd7IUJ.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:68739'),
  ('988136113591297324', 'Gameboys', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jun Robles Lana', null, 'Elijah Canlas, Kokoy de Santos, Adrianna So, Kyle Velino, Miggy Jimenez, Sue Prado, Kych Minemoto', null, 'Teenage streamer Cairo is caught off guard when he receives a video call from a new online rival called Gavreel. He is even more surprised when the handsome stranger asks him out. Can two gamers make romance work during the COVID-19 pandemic lockdown, or will it be game over for their love story?', 'Teenage streamer Cairo is caught off guard when he receives a video call from a new online rival called Gavreel. He is even more surprised when the handsome stranger asks him out. Can two gamers make romance work during the COVID-19 pandemic lockdown, or will it be game over for their love story?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7G7r0VeE5VD2W4mF2kL5BIQ0de2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:103831'),
  ('861225253290047212', 'Gamechangers', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Christina N. Lopez, Lala Ventura, Giselle Interior', 'River Rosal', null, null, 'It follows exceptional Filipinos shaping culture and redefining success. From athletes to culinary visionaries and industry leaders, each episode offers an intimate look at the passion, discipline, and stories behind their rise.', 'It follows exceptional Filipinos shaping culture and redefining success. From athletes to culinary visionaries and industry leaders, each episode offers an intimate look at the passion, discipline, and stories behind their rise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgY4uJzEJga8nFhNoj1MIoJMa3b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317393'),
  ('1091254414497768690', 'GameFace', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Roisin Conaty', 'Roisin Conaty, Damien Molony, Karl Theobald, Dustin Demri-Burns, Dylan Edwards, Caroline Ginty, Nina Toussaint-White, Pauline McLynn', null, 'Marcella is an aspiring actress recovering from a relationship break up. Despite her optimistic attempts, and with help from her friends, therapist and driving instructor, she is unable to get her life back on track.', 'Marcella is an aspiring actress recovering from a relationship break up. Despite her optimistic attempts, and with help from her friends, therapist and driving instructor, she is unable to get her life back on track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MpBUYJG2SBzoqpydK8CQhBkOIu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88471'),
  ('982432393534241198', 'Gamer''s Guide to Pretty Much Everything', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Devin Bunje, Nick Stanton', null, 'Cameron Boyce, Sophie Reynolds, Murray Wyatt Rundus, Felix Avitia', 'TV-G', 'Follows professional teenage video gamer, Conor, who is forced to go to high school for the first time, after a thumb injury. Coping with his new lifestyle, he focuses on friendships and visualizes life as a video game.', 'Follows professional teenage video gamer, Conor, who is forced to go to high school for the first time, after a thumb injury. Coping with his new lifestyle, he focuses on friendships and visualizes life as a video game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3llxLK0DgkaOMGpjeqBe5qhIDy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63007'),
  ('748983106059749378', 'GAMERA -Rebirth-', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hisako Kanemoto, Subaru Kimura, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Aki Toyosaki, Mamoru Miyano, Saori Hayami', 'TV-14', 'In the summer of 1989, four kids in Tokyo witness the emergence of the turtle kaiju Gamera, who bravely stands up against giant human-eating monsters.', 'In the summer of 1989, four kids in Tokyo witness the emergence of the turtle kaiju Gamera, who bravely stands up against giant human-eating monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/152TW3nHykWjpinW7WVUSYQQD8y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214592'),
  ('224593445802648734', 'GAMERS!', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Megumi Han, Hisako Kanemoto, Rumi Okubo, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Manaka Iwami', 'TV-14', 'Keita Amano is a perfectly mediocre loner with no particular distinguishing features other than his love for games. One day, his school''s prettiest girl and Gamer Club President Karen Tendo suddenly calls out to him. That moment changes Keita''s life forever, as he now finds himself in the midst of a romcom with beautiful girl gamers... or, well, that''s how it usually goes. Not with him, however.', 'Keita Amano is a perfectly mediocre loner with no particular distinguishing features other than his love for games. One day, his school''s prettiest girl and Gamer Club President Karen Tendo suddenly calls out to him. That moment changes Keita''s life forever, as he now finds himself in the midst of a romcom with beautiful girl gamers... or, well, that''s how it usually goes. Not with him, however.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib6YFh2BZpmjKhyqX4sR6VTcexp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72426'),
  ('316412516081657780', 'Games People Play', 2019, 'Drama', 'Angela Burt-Murray', null, 'Kendall Kyndall, Sarunas J. Jackson, Jackie Long, Karen Obilom, Parker McKenna Posey, Karrueche Tran', 'TV-14', 'Three ambitious women navigate the highly competitive world of professional sports.', 'Three ambitious women navigate the highly competitive world of professional sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aox7nECV3XK8SxkkGPsGk4bWDhY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88770'),
  ('578545442881269028', 'GamesMaster', 1992, 'Family, Kids', null, null, 'Patrick Moore, Dominik Diamond', null, 'GamesMaster was a British television show, screened on Channel 4 from 1992 to 1998, and was the first ever UK television show dedicated to computer and video games.', 'GamesMaster was a British television show, screened on Channel 4 from 1992 to 1998, and was the first ever UK television show dedicated to computer and video games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhJ4VymRP18ol1j5wCCN4GcCJ5a.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:3212'),
  ('1086214979839396', 'Gaming Wall St', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kieran Culkin, Tayler Wilbourn', 'TV-MA', 'Kieran Culkin narrates this docuseries exploring the historic 2021 short squeeze of GameStop, and how a group of armchair investors and online vigilantes ultimately helped expose the dark underbelly of Wall Street.', 'Kieran Culkin narrates this docuseries exploring the historic 2021 short squeeze of GameStop, and how a group of armchair investors and online vigilantes ultimately helped expose the dark underbelly of Wall Street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3x2hDJmwAo1kxv8WVZYSJSDpwvC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158534'),
  ('426727336969269480', 'Ganbare Doukichan', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Yom', null, 'Nene Hieda, Sumire Uesaka, Asami Seto, Junya Enoki', 'TV-MA', 'Douki-chan is an office lady who is working with Douki-kun in an office. Unbeknownst to Douki-kun, Douki-chan secretly has feelings for him. As Douki-chan struggles to confess her feelings, her rivals, both the kouhai and senpai, continue to vie for his affection.', 'Douki-chan is an office lady who is working with Douki-kun in an office. Unbeknownst to Douki-kun, Douki-chan secretly has feelings for him. As Douki-chan struggles to confess her feelings, her rivals, both the kouhai and senpai, continue to vie for his affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5r1QjDs9XgB7kqImNuFhLPnli8g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131168'),
  ('597029162140640027', 'Gandii Baat', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sachin Mohite, Ekta Kapoor', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Unraveling complexed relationships, closet issues, shocking truths, bizarre myths and unexplored space of men and women through a series of thrilling and exciting stories from the rural part of India. Each story is distinct from other but weaved with the thread of eccentricities which will leave you with unexpected twists and turns.', 'Unraveling complexed relationships, closet issues, shocking truths, bizarre myths and unexplored space of men and women through a series of thrilling and exciting stories from the rural part of India. Each story is distinct from other but weaved with the thread of eccentricities which will leave you with unexpected twists and turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yF0qYnvZaEflyOlElUcGGLE5FaA.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:79273'),
  ('752224318214819057', 'Gang Related', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Chris Morgan', null, 'Ramón Rodríguez, Jay Hernandez, RZA, Sung Kang, Inbar Lavi, Reynaldo Gallegos, Shantel VanSanten, Cliff Curtis', 'TV-14', 'Every villain has a noble cause, and every hero has a dark side. Detective Ryan Lopez is a rising star in Los Angeles'' elite Gang Task Force. What the world doesn''t know is that long before Ryan became a cop, he pledged allegiance to a different band of brothers – a powerful Latino gang called Los Angelicos. When Ryan''s best friend and police partner is senselessly killed by a notorious gang member, Ryan teams up with longtime Task Force member Cassius Green who has been at the forefront of the city''s war on organized crime. In this war between law enforcement and gangs, the series explores how only people who really know the streets can win the battle on the streets.', 'Every villain has a noble cause, and every hero has a dark side. Detective Ryan Lopez is a rising star in Los Angeles'' elite Gang Task Force. What the world doesn''t know is that long before Ryan became a cop, he pledged allegiance to a different band of brothers – a powerful Latino gang called Los Angelicos. When Ryan''s best friend and police partner is senselessly killed by a notorious gang member, Ryan teams up with longtime Task Force member Cassius Green who has been at the forefront of the city''s war on organized crime. In this war between law enforcement and gangs, the series explores how only people who really know the streets can win the battle on the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQSAiKxKaA79UoraSUh1UyaGTrE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51046'),
  ('696992464331288905', 'Gangaa', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Aditi Sharma, Ruhana Khanna, Vishal Vashishtha, Hiten Tejwani, Gungun Uprari, Sushmita Mukherjee', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Zz2RC9K6BpXtJHq5tpif2OKxt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:154505'),
  ('952287906867182921', 'Gangland', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Gangland was a television series that aired on The History Channel. It usually aired on Thursday evenings although it has been known to arbitrarily change days every so often. Gangland explored the history of some of America''s more notorious gangs. It premiered on November 1, 2007 with a special episode about the Aryan Brotherhood. The theme song was performed by Buckshot of the Boot Camp Clik. Reruns currently air on the cable channel Spike.', 'Gangland was a television series that aired on The History Channel. It usually aired on Thursday evenings although it has been known to arbitrarily change days every so often. Gangland explored the history of some of America''s more notorious gangs. It premiered on November 1, 2007 with a special episode about the Aryan Brotherhood. The theme song was performed by Buckshot of the Boot Camp Clik. Reruns currently air on the cable channel Spike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yggt7QeiXw48eiBI2skcajFCSIc.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:6947'),
  ('1120287433279496024', 'Gangland Undercover', 2015, 'Drama', 'Charles Falco', 'Noel S Baker', 'Damon Runyan, Ari Cohen, James Cade, Ian Matthews, Don Francks, Stephen Eric McIntyre, Ashley Tredenick, Hannah Emily Anderson', null, 'This drama series is a fictionalized retelling of the story of meth dealer-turned-ATF informant Charles Falco, who spent three years inside one of America''s most dangerous motorcycle gangs, the Vagos. Although Falco originally took on the assignment to avoid spending 20 years in prison on drug charges, it eventually evolved into a quest for justice for him. “Gangland Undercover” documents the lives of outlaw bikers, who live in a world in which respect is earned through fear. The series is based on Falco''s memoir, “Vagos, Mongols, and Outlaws,” and documented historical research of gang rivalries.', 'This drama series is a fictionalized retelling of the story of meth dealer-turned-ATF informant Charles Falco, who spent three years inside one of America''s most dangerous motorcycle gangs, the Vagos. Although Falco originally took on the assignment to avoid spending 20 years in prison on drug charges, it eventually evolved into a quest for justice for him. “Gangland Undercover” documents the lives of outlaw bikers, who live in a world in which respect is earned through fear. The series is based on Falco''s memoir, “Vagos, Mongols, and Outlaws,” and documented historical research of gang rivalries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUmANMGhx0vaw2vfvT0JdRtdQGs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62172'),
  ('100106564876026055', 'Ganglands', 2021, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Julien Leclercq, Hamid Hlioua', 'Julien Leclercq, Hamid Hlioua', 'Sami Bouajila, Tracy Gotoas, Salim Kéchiouche, Samuel Jouy, Aron Kto, Lola Le Lann', 'TV-MA', 'Mehdi, a qualified robber, and Liana, an apprentice thief, get involved in a turf war between drug dealers, and have to collaborate in order to save their loved ones.', 'Mehdi, a qualified robber, and Liana, an apprentice thief, get involved in a turf war between drug dealers, and have to collaborate in order to save their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E6IPkHH541ii41NKpU5loI4fcr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:130523'),
  ('676306440179407334', 'Gangnam B-Side', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Jo Woo-jin, Ji Chang-wook, Ha Yoon-kyung, BIBI, Jeong Jae-kwang, Um Mun-suk, Oh Ye-ju, Hyun Bong-sik', 'TV-MA', 'When Jaehee, a top call girl at a club in Gangnam, goes missing, Detective Kang Dongwoo returns to crack the case. Prosecutor Min Seojin aims to rise in rank, while the notorious pimp, Yoon Gilho becomes a prime suspect. They unravel a web of secrets and connections behind the case.', 'When Jaehee, a top call girl at a club in Gangnam, goes missing, Detective Kang Dongwoo returns to crack the case. Prosecutor Min Seojin aims to rise in rank, while the notorious pimp, Yoon Gilho becomes a prime suspect. They unravel a web of secrets and connections behind the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aeXrl8cSzUt8FHjqsHyoyZUox3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218631'),
  ('1041349659623543602', 'Gangs of Galicia', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría', null, 'Clara Lago, Tamar Novas', 'TV-MA', 'When her father''s murder reveals a hidden double life, a lawyer seeks revenge by infiltrating a Galician drug cartel and becoming close to its leader.', 'When her father''s murder reveals a hidden double life, a lawyer seeks revenge by infiltrating a Galician drug cartel and becoming close to its leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAltqHzzA1WhrN5HWCPbAgfI9xR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:227042'),
  ('993099795960711593', 'Gangs of London', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Gareth Evans, Matt Flannery', null, 'Ṣọpẹ́ Dìrísù, Michelle Fairley, Orli Shuka, Lucian Msamati, Jasmine Armando, Narges Rashidi, Brian Vernel, Pippa Bennett-Warner', 'TV-MA', 'When the head of a criminal organisation, Finn Wallace is assassinated, the sudden power vacuum his death creates threatens the fragile peace between the intricate web of gangs operating on the streets of the city. Now it’s up to the grieving, volatile and impulsive Sean Wallace to restore control and find those responsible for killing his father.', 'When the head of a criminal organisation, Finn Wallace is assassinated, the sudden power vacuum his death creates threatens the fragile peace between the intricate web of gangs operating on the streets of the city. Now it’s up to the grieving, volatile and impulsive Sean Wallace to restore control and find those responsible for killing his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVgwa6wGw9ddGM5O7mqrrwB6gHK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85021'),
  ('521425446521973303', 'Gangs of Oslo', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ole Endresen', null, 'Emir Zamwa, Mohammed Youssef, Ishak Kaya, Christopher Rygh, Heidi Toini, Ingvild Lakou, Per Kjerstad, Shaniaz Hama Ali', 'TV-MA', 'Policeman Moaz Ibrahim is forced into living a dangerous double life with the criminal gang Enemiez as an attempt to keep his shady past hidden from the outside world.', 'Policeman Moaz Ibrahim is forced into living a dangerous double life with the criminal gang Enemiez as an attempt to keep his shady past hidden from the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zz9fPM8AfrRU9RwxW8hnfshpIDD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216604'),
  ('896145481800091821', 'Gangsta.', 2015, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Animation, Crime', null, null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Junichi Suwabe, Mamiko Noto, Tetsuo Kanao, Kaito Ishikawa, Ami Koshimizu, Katsuhisa Houki, Tomohisa Hashizume', 'TV-MA', 'In the crime-ridden, mafia-governed city of Ergastulum, Worick and Nicolas are two “handymen” known as “Benriya” who would take any dirty job from either police or mafia, for a good price. After an assignment from police the two met and later joined by Alex, a former prostitute who got interested in the mysterious background of the team, in particular of Nicolas’ abilities.', 'In the crime-ridden, mafia-governed city of Ergastulum, Worick and Nicolas are two “handymen” known as “Benriya” who would take any dirty job from either police or mafia, for a good price. After an assignment from police the two met and later joined by Alex, a former prostitute who got interested in the mysterious background of the team, in particular of Nicolas’ abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ly43ajQpjpYYnx3w5BgFtcflUTD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66390'),
  ('277059454496315339', 'Gangster''s Petersburg', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Vladimir Dostal, Leonid Markin, Vladimir Bortko', null, 'Evgeniy Sidikhin, Yan Tsapnik, Anatoli Zhuravlyov, Sergey Bekhterev, Aleksandr Peskov, Vladimir Bogdanov, Valentin Bukin', null, 'A Russian detective series, based on 8 works of Andrei Konstantinov ("lawyer", "Justice / Attorney-2", "The Thief / Journalist-2", "Writer", "Inventor / Writer-2", "The prisoner "," Cop "," Scavenger ") and four works by other writers.', 'A Russian detective series, based on 8 works of Andrei Konstantinov ("lawyer", "Justice / Attorney-2", "The Thief / Journalist-2", "Writer", "Inventor / Writer-2", "The prisoner "," Cop "," Scavenger ") and four works by other writers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrNzJB2Vr39748SQ6lDfU0ebTOZ.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:64281'),
  ('464568033593965799', 'Gankutsuou', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Jouji Nakata, Daisuke Hirakawa', 'TV-MA', 'In an elegant future Paris, a Count returns to wreak havoc on those that betrayed him.', 'In an elegant future Paris, a Count returns to wreak havoc on those that betrayed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGfqtzfeBHkOSZqynL2vLx5UEQJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9543'),
  ('172653692241884129', 'Gannibal', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Masaaki Ninomiya, Shinzo Katayama', 'Takamasa Oe', 'Yuya Yagira, Show Kasamatsu, Riho Yoshioka, Takato Nagata, Mahiro Takasugi, Yuri Tsunematsu, Mitsuko Baisho, Rio Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'After causing a major incident, police officer Daigo Agawa takes his wife and daughter to live in the remote mountain village of Kuge. It seems the perfect place to recover from the ordeal, despite the mysterious disappearance of a previous officer posted there. One day, the body of an old woman is found on the mountain. The Goto family says she was attacked by a bear, but Daigo notices a human bite mark. It soon becomes clear that not all is as it seems in the village.', 'After causing a major incident, police officer Daigo Agawa takes his wife and daughter to live in the remote mountain village of Kuge. It seems the perfect place to recover from the ordeal, despite the mysterious disappearance of a previous officer posted there. One day, the body of an old woman is found on the mountain. The Goto family says she was attacked by a bear, but Daigo notices a human bite mark. It soon becomes clear that not all is as it seems in the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvjCytHUq6AN6rYOFQFATrWbGSR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210213'),
  ('333987802035298366', 'GANSO! BanG Dream Chan', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'After taking the girls'' band world by storm, "BanG Dream Chan" is back!? Get ready for a huge reunion with all your favorite pop and cute band members in the fun-filled girls'' band comedy! Come on, BanG Dream Chan! We are all BanG Dream Chan!', 'After taking the girls'' band world by storm, "BanG Dream Chan" is back!? Get ready for a huge reunion with all your favorite pop and cute band members in the fun-filled girls'' band comedy! Come on, BanG Dream Chan! We are all BanG Dream Chan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/166Zsq2TYqjbJr2v5CBU0TZnLNe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301747'),
  ('256004048994186174', 'GANTZ', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Masashi Sogo', 'Daisuke Namikawa, Hitomi Nabatame, Masashi Oosato, Mie Sonozaki, Hiroshi Kamiya', 'TV-MA', 'If you are chosen by the bizarre black sphere known as the Gantz, you are already dead—yet you might be able to reclaim your mortality. First, the Gantz demands that you undertake brutal missions of madness, killing aliens hidden among the population. It is your only chance and you have no choice. You must play this disturbing game. And if you die again—and you likely will—it’s permanent.', 'If you are chosen by the bizarre black sphere known as the Gantz, you are already dead—yet you might be able to reclaim your mortality. First, the Gantz demands that you undertake brutal missions of madness, killing aliens hidden among the population. It is your only chance and you have no choice. You must play this disturbing game. And if you die again—and you likely will—it’s permanent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spyDQ1Cv8m4L8EaXS6iXSpbLWA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11279'),
  ('1118385385467694651', 'GAP', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chao Planoy', null, 'Becky Armstrong, Sarocha Chankimha, Asavarid Pinitkanjanapun, Urassaya Malaiwong, Natnicha Vorrakittikun, Orntara Poolsak, Punnisa Sirisang, Ratchanon Kanpiang', null, 'Mon, a newly graduated student from university, starts working as an intern in a big company because she admires Sam, the super rich chairwoman since young age. However, when Mon met Sam again, her image of her completely crashed, since she was not like the media shows her.', 'Mon, a newly graduated student from university, starts working as an intern in a big company because she admires Sam, the super rich chairwoman since young age. However, when Mon met Sam again, her image of her completely crashed, since she was not like the media shows her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jF7kr8IotMYsbef1cVj6Mebvfi0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155513'),
  ('796941496959058478', 'Gap Dong', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Jeong In-gi, Jo Min-jun, Yoon Sang-hyun, Kim Min-joung, Sung Dong-il, Lee Joon, Kim Ji-won, Kang Nam-gil', 'NR', '20 years ago Moo-Yeom’s father was a suspect in the "Gap Dong” serial murder case. Because of the detectives’ oppressive investigation, Moo-Yeom’s father killed himself. Now, Moo-Yeom is a detective and works to capture the killer Gap Dong. The statue of limitations has expired for the serial murder case and Moo-Yeom resigns to the belief that Gap Dong is dead. New clues though for Gap Dong appears in front of Moo-Yeom and he sets out to catch him once and for all.', '20 years ago Moo-Yeom’s father was a suspect in the "Gap Dong” serial murder case. Because of the detectives’ oppressive investigation, Moo-Yeom’s father killed himself. Now, Moo-Yeom is a detective and works to capture the killer Gap Dong. The statue of limitations has expired for the serial murder case and Moo-Yeom resigns to the belief that Gap Dong is dead. New clues though for Gap Dong appears in front of Moo-Yeom and he sets out to catch him once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlZ37WoiTlxjpGGsT7Z8CdUEL9B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60748'),
  ('596368016498504561', 'Garavito: The Serial Beast', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The story behind the investigation that led to the capture and conviction of Luis Alfredo Garavito, the worst child murderer and rapist in history.', 'The story behind the investigation that led to the capture and conviction of Luis Alfredo Garavito, the worst child murderer and rapist in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f76iomjlGz18l52HOXes3ejiIKZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237845'),
  ('339302365733397170', 'García!', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Sara Antuña, Carlos de Pando', null, 'Francisco Ortiz, Veki Velilla, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Francisco Reyes, Daniel Freire, Silvia Abascal, Andrés Gertrúdix, Diego Martín', 'TV-MA', 'In a present-day Spain, divided and on the brink of political chaos, inquisitive millennial investigative reporter Antonia stumbles on a decades-old conspiracy: the existence of a cryogenically frozen super-agent, García, created in a laboratory in the 1950s by General Franco’s fascist secret services. The old-world collides with the new as García and Antonia must learn to work together as they are drawn deeper and deeper into a political conspiracy that threatens to overthrow democracy and plunge Spain back into brutal dictatorship.', 'In a present-day Spain, divided and on the brink of political chaos, inquisitive millennial investigative reporter Antonia stumbles on a decades-old conspiracy: the existence of a cryogenically frozen super-agent, García, created in a laboratory in the 1950s by General Franco’s fascist secret services. The old-world collides with the new as García and Antonia must learn to work together as they are drawn deeper and deeper into a political conspiracy that threatens to overthrow democracy and plunge Spain back into brutal dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lgDiqy8Y7cZ1LkJks3BqcFFhFZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125118'),
  ('739116191862649738', 'Gardeners'' World', 1968, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Monty Don', 'TV-G', 'Gardeners'' World is a long-running BBC Television programme about gardening, first broadcast in 1968 and still running as of 2013. Its first episode was presented by Ken Burras and came from Oxford Botanical Gardens. The magazine BBC Gardeners'' World is a tie-in to the programme. Most of its episodes have been 30 minutes in length, although there are many specials that last longer. The 2008 and 2009 series used a 60-minute format.', 'Gardeners'' World is a long-running BBC Television programme about gardening, first broadcast in 1968 and still running as of 2013. Its first episode was presented by Ken Burras and came from Oxford Botanical Gardens. The magazine BBC Gardeners'' World is a tie-in to the programme. Most of its episodes have been 30 minutes in length, although there are many specials that last longer. The 2008 and 2009 series used a 60-minute format.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVHz4uUMVX0UIjRrK9v4ximfb0c.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:15188'),
  ('448152764836986128', 'Gardening Australia', 2005, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Costa Georgiadis, Tino Carnevale, Jerry Coleby-Williams, Jane Edmanson', null, 'Gardening Australia provides practical, realistic and credible horticultural and gardening advice, inspiring and entertaining Australian gardeners around the nation.', 'Gardening Australia provides practical, realistic and credible horticultural and gardening advice, inspiring and entertaining Australian gardeners around the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79taCPhP1vgKCZVEHRhVZXo6G9F.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:2835'),
  ('676417694347487829', 'Garfield and Friends', 1988, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Jim Davis', null, 'Lorenzo Music, Gregg Berger, Thom Huge, Howard Morris, Frank Welker, Julie Payne, Desiree Goyette', 'TV-G', 'The animated stories of Garfield the cat, Odie the dog, their owner Jon and the trouble they get into. And also Orson the Pig and his adventures on a farm with his fellow farm animals.', 'The animated stories of Garfield the cat, Odie the dog, their owner Jon and the trouble they get into. And also Orson the Pig and his adventures on a farm with his fellow farm animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pE6l6I1ICKOu4pDUXxkl87TTLZx.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4606'),
  ('986362764873457203', 'Garfunkel and Oates', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Kate Micucci, Riki Lindhome', 'Scott Sonne', 'Riki Lindhome, Kate Micucci', 'TV-14', 'The comic/folk duo Riki Lindhome and Kate Micucci hit prime time with their act in this scripted series for IFC. It follows hard-working underdogs trying to make their mark in comedy while muddling through messy dating scenarios, and doing so by performing one satirical (and often quite saucy) song after another. Nothing stops the ukulele- and guitar-wielding twosome from singing about life''s unspoken truths, despite it leaving them detached from their peers. The series is titled after Lindhome and Micucci''s band name, inspired by "two famous rock ''n'' roll second bananas," Art Garfunkel and John Oates.', 'The comic/folk duo Riki Lindhome and Kate Micucci hit prime time with their act in this scripted series for IFC. It follows hard-working underdogs trying to make their mark in comedy while muddling through messy dating scenarios, and doing so by performing one satirical (and often quite saucy) song after another. Nothing stops the ukulele- and guitar-wielding twosome from singing about life''s unspoken truths, despite it leaving them detached from their peers. The series is titled after Lindhome and Micucci''s band name, inspired by "two famous rock ''n'' roll second bananas," Art Garfunkel and John Oates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssli1RoRtD81vuHPj86OtKJSnBJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61880'),
  ('831897954745028870', 'Gargantia on the Verdurous Planet', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Gen Urobuchi', 'Hisako Kanemoto, Kaito Ishikawa, Ai Kayano, Hideaki Tezuka, Kana Asumi, Katsuyuki Konishi, Sayaka Ohara, Shizuka Itoh', 'TV-14', 'While fighting an intense inter-galactic war, a mecha pilot is accidentally warped into a space-time neither he nor his computer recognize. After waking up from a long-time hibernation, he finds himself trapped on a planet, with human residents talking in an unknown form of language, using inferior technologies, and - most shocking to him - naturally breathable air.', 'While fighting an intense inter-galactic war, a mecha pilot is accidentally warped into a space-time neither he nor his computer recognize. After waking up from a long-time hibernation, he finds himself trapped on a planet, with human residents talking in an unknown form of language, using inferior technologies, and - most shocking to him - naturally breathable air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3E4DPo520fO7QQm53shMLVxsb2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55011'),
  ('12249704720422025', 'Gargoyles', 1994, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Keith David, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Ed Asner, Jeff Bennett, Thom Adcox-Hernandez, Bill Fagerbakke, Frank Welker, Jonathan Frakes', 'TV-Y7', 'In Scotland, 994 A.D. Goliath and his clan of gargoyles defend a medieval castle. In present day, David Xanatos buys the castle and moves it to New York City. When the castle is attacked the gargoyles are awakened from a 1000 year curse.', 'In Scotland, 994 A.D. Goliath and his clan of gargoyles defend a medieval castle. In present day, David Xanatos buys the castle and moves it to New York City. When the castle is attacked the gargoyles are awakened from a 1000 year curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDTZYbiRUapeWRJL6EU3ZtLUAYA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1719'),
  ('141626971177798168', 'GARO', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Keita Amemiya', null, 'Tatsuya Koyanagi, Yuhi, Tokito, Toman, Naoya Shimizu, Shutaro Kadoshita, Reiji, Nashiko Momotsuki', null, 'The Makai fight a secret war against the demon forces known as Horrors, evil creatures that manifest themselves through darkness to devour Humanity. On the frontlines are the Makai Knights, given the task of watching over a district and eliminating any Horrors that manifest there. GARO follows the tales of the Knights bearing the title of ‘Golden Knight Garo’, and their duty to vanquish the Horrors and protect Humanity from the darkness.', 'The Makai fight a secret war against the demon forces known as Horrors, evil creatures that manifest themselves through darkness to devour Humanity. On the frontlines are the Makai Knights, given the task of watching over a district and eliminating any Horrors that manifest there. GARO follows the tales of the Knights bearing the title of ‘Golden Knight Garo’, and their duty to vanquish the Horrors and protect Humanity from the darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IBGi1F4oRlykR0k9beIwygn8YM.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1941'),
  ('451171950938712998', 'GARO -VANISHING LINE-', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Rie Kugimiya, Romi Park, Hironobu Kageyama, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Ami Koshimizu, Takaya Hashi, Ayahi Takagaki', 'TV-MA', 'In a prosperous city named Russell City, an omen that threatens to shake its world begins to move within it. A man named Sword is the first to hear the first stirrings of the plot, and throws himself into a shadow war in order to expose it. His only clue is the key word "El Dorado." He meets Sophie, a woman searching for her missing older brother who has only left her with the same words: "El Dorado." With Sword having also lost his younger sister in the past, both are drawn together by the words, and work together to find out its meaning.', 'In a prosperous city named Russell City, an omen that threatens to shake its world begins to move within it. A man named Sword is the first to hear the first stirrings of the plot, and throws himself into a shadow war in order to expose it. His only clue is the key word "El Dorado." He meets Sophie, a woman searching for her missing older brother who has only left her with the same words: "El Dorado." With Sword having also lost his younger sister in the past, both are drawn together by the words, and work together to find out its meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZ6QbEjU2J829zSFyDJlHZaFYVe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74089'),
  ('1061832466216135201', 'GARO: Makai no Hana', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Masei Nakayama, Natsumi Ishibashi, Atomu Mizuishi, Hironobu Kageyama', null, 'Garo: Makai no Hana follows Raiga Saezima, the son of Kouga Saezima and Kaoru Mitsuki, who after his parents'' disappearance when he was little, was trained by Silver Knight Zero to succeed his father as the new Golden Knight Garo.', 'Garo: Makai no Hana follows Raiga Saezima, the son of Kouga Saezima and Kaoru Mitsuki, who after his parents'' disappearance when he was little, was trained by Silver Knight Zero to succeed his father as the new Golden Knight Garo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scXiLKLiSaUDpbSE78xinsRmPW4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108611'),
  ('509550262214574617', 'Garo: The Animation', 2014, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Katsuhito Nomura, Kenyu Horiuchi, Romi Park, Hidetaka Tenjin, Natsumi Tada, Mayu Udono, Mari Doi', 'TV-MA', 'Mendosa, the chief adviser of the king of Valiante, begins a campaign to hunt down "witches," resulting in the deaths of many magical knights and their sorcerer assistants. Anna, a sorceress married to the knight Herman Lewis, gives birth to a son before her execution. Herman takes their child, Leon, and flees, raising him to be the heir of the legendary Golden Armor. By the time Leon grows up, Valiante is completely in the control of Mendosa, who drives out Prince Alfonso and his mother. Alphonso decides to seek out the man who inherited the Golden Armor to reclaim the throne and save his people.', 'Mendosa, the chief adviser of the king of Valiante, begins a campaign to hunt down "witches," resulting in the deaths of many magical knights and their sorcerer assistants. Anna, a sorceress married to the knight Herman Lewis, gives birth to a son before her execution. Herman takes their child, Leon, and flees, raising him to be the heir of the legendary Golden Armor. By the time Leon grows up, Valiante is completely in the control of Mendosa, who drives out Prince Alfonso and his mother. Alphonso decides to seek out the man who inherited the Golden Armor to reclaim the throne and save his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cl9x83myIZtDSqHPu4WMekKt7E0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63453'),
  ('110784634886997590', 'Garouden: The Way of the Lone Wolf', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ryota Takeuchi, Tetsu Inada, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Rintaro Nishi, Tessyo Genda, Aya Endo, Ryota Suzuki, Hidenobu Kiuchi', 'TV-MA', 'On the run from a past crime, Juzo Fujimaki is blackmailed into joining an illicit tournament and has to face top martial artists in deadly match-ups.', 'On the run from a past crime, Juzo Fujimaki is blackmailed into joining an illicit tournament and has to face top martial artists in deadly match-ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozOjfhE6ADlWto0IKgVtniRvUOW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252425'),
  ('1140348281728967144', 'Garrison''s Gorillas', 1967, 'War & Politics', null, null, 'Ron Harper, Cesare Danova, Rudy Solari, Christopher Cary, Brendon Boone', null, 'Garrison''s Gorillas is an ABC TV series broadcast from 1967 to 1968; a total of 26 hour-long episodes were produced. It was inspired by the 1967 film The Dirty Dozen, which featured a similar scenario of training Allied prisoners for World War II military missions. Garrison''s Gorillas was canceled at the close of its first season and replaced by The Mod Squad in 1968. It managed to gather a cult following in China in the 1980s.', 'Garrison''s Gorillas is an ABC TV series broadcast from 1967 to 1968; a total of 26 hour-long episodes were produced. It was inspired by the 1967 film The Dirty Dozen, which featured a similar scenario of training Allied prisoners for World War II military missions. Garrison''s Gorillas was canceled at the close of its first season and replaced by The Mod Squad in 1968. It managed to gather a cult following in China in the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nwV06zjw9ZiKtYBUUTOKwtP6kg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1276'),
  ('1055134635034050264', 'Garth Marenghi''s Darkplace', 2004, 'Comedy, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Richard Ayoade, Matthew Holness, Billy Brown', null, 'Matthew Holness, Matt Berry, Richard Ayoade, Alice Lowe', null, 'When the Hellmouth opens beneath Darkplace Hospital in downtown Romford, kiddy doctor, Vietnam veteran and ex-warlock Dr. Rick Dagless M.D. is the only man who can close it. Joined by best buddy Dr. Lucien Sanchez, fiery hospital boss Thornton Reed, and woman Liz Asher, Dagless must fight the forces of Darkness while dealing with the burden of day-to-day admin. From the chilling pen of best-selling horror writer Garth Marenghi comes this lost masterpiece of televisual terror. Dare you enter Garth''s Darkplace?', 'When the Hellmouth opens beneath Darkplace Hospital in downtown Romford, kiddy doctor, Vietnam veteran and ex-warlock Dr. Rick Dagless M.D. is the only man who can close it. Joined by best buddy Dr. Lucien Sanchez, fiery hospital boss Thornton Reed, and woman Liz Asher, Dagless must fight the forces of Darkness while dealing with the burden of day-to-day admin. From the chilling pen of best-selling horror writer Garth Marenghi comes this lost masterpiece of televisual terror. Dare you enter Garth''s Darkplace?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aSD7ssvpkmNqOxenPiWaLpq4vg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205'),
  ('636180013033250736', 'Gary and His Demons', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mark Little, Mark Satterthwaite', null, 'Tim Gilbert, Miguel Rivas, Marito Lopez, Emma Hunter, Kyle Dooley, Kayla Lorette, Laura Cilevitz, Mark Little', 'TV-MA', 'Gary is a cantankerous, aging demon slayer who has nothing left to lose. Burdened by his “chosen one” status and backed by a team of specialists he can’t relate to, Gary struggles to keep interest in the Earth-saving duty he never asked for and doesn’t want.', 'Gary is a cantankerous, aging demon slayer who has nothing left to lose. Burdened by his “chosen one” status and backed by a team of specialists he can’t relate to, Gary struggles to keep interest in the Earth-saving duty he never asked for and doesn’t want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wN6EU9KJ2K8fwFASuwDPWrAXkTn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79478'),
  ('79981909907730304', 'Gary Unmarried', 2008, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ed Yeager', null, 'Jay Mohr, Paula Marshall, Ryan Malgarini, Kathryn Newton, Keegan-Michael Key, Brooke D''Orsay', 'TV-14', 'A recently divorced couple shares custody of their two children while starting new relationships.', 'A recently divorced couple shares custody of their two children while starting new relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13Vv0Pd4QRukFINcynAix4n1Gbn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5911'),
  ('131686672449766428', 'Gasaraki', 1998, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ryosuke Takahashi', null, 'Mami Kingetsu, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Satomi Korogi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Show Hayami, Sakura Tange, Minami Takayama, Toshihiko Nakajima', null, 'The flames of war are fanned in the Middle East as two secretive forces unleash their latest weapons of mass destruction.', 'The flames of war are fanned in the Middle East as two secretive forces unleash their latest weapons of mass destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xN2mibxO4yMqHkOmjN6uSVXX4k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34782'),
  ('318585270901376778', 'Gaslit', 2022, 'Drama', 'Robbie Pickering', null, 'Julia Roberts, Sean Penn, Dan Stevens, Betty Gilpin, Shea Whigham, Darby Camp', 'TV-MA', 'A modern take on the 1970s political Watergate scandal centering on untold stories and forgotten characters of the time.', 'A modern take on the 1970s political Watergate scandal centering on untold stories and forgotten characters of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6B1EgOGOR5VPR1UK4ERlot1H5yM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107407'),
