  ('317555309985758328', 'Gatchaman Crowds', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Ryota Osaka, Daisuke Hosomi, Daisuke Namikawa, Kotori Koiwai, Aya Hirano, Mamoru Miyano, Ayumu Murase', null, 'Tachikawa, Japan, is a "second metropolis" of Tokyo, protected by the Gatchaman, warriors who fight in special reinforced suits powered by the manifestation of their spiritual powers called NOTE. When the energetic and cheerful Hajime Ichinose becomes their newest member, the Gatchaman must deal with Berg Katze, an enigmatic alien creature bent on destroying Earth just like it did with several other planets in the past.', 'Tachikawa, Japan, is a "second metropolis" of Tokyo, protected by the Gatchaman, warriors who fight in special reinforced suits powered by the manifestation of their spiritual powers called NOTE. When the energetic and cheerful Hajime Ichinose becomes their newest member, the Gatchaman must deal with Berg Katze, an enigmatic alien creature bent on destroying Earth just like it did with several other planets in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sy6A71E7WVfBUQQkXOn1QQe1R4O.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61527'),
  ('447874651543331985', 'Gate', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Nao Toyama', 'TV-14', 'On August 20XX, a gate suddenly appears in Tokyo''s Ginza district, unleashing a portal where monsters, medieval knights and other fantasy beings come from another world and wreak havoc on Tokyo. The Japanese Defense Force take action against these monsters and push them back into the "Gate". Third Reconnaissance Team is dispatched to the "Special Region" lead by officer (and otaku) Youji Itami. On their travels, they are joined by a beautiful elf girl who is a survivor from the dragon''s rampage and guide the group across the dangerous new world.', 'On August 20XX, a gate suddenly appears in Tokyo''s Ginza district, unleashing a portal where monsters, medieval knights and other fantasy beings come from another world and wreak havoc on Tokyo. The Japanese Defense Force take action against these monsters and push them back into the "Gate". Third Reconnaissance Team is dispatched to the "Special Region" lead by officer (and otaku) Youji Itami. On their travels, they are joined by a beautiful elf girl who is a survivor from the dragon''s rampage and guide the group across the dangerous new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCuJkIUg1n9etSYrrQKlQuSrigE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63663'),
  ('929681726096221093', 'Gaus Electronics', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Seo Su-min', 'Kang Go-eun, Seo Han-na', 'Kwak Dong-yeon, Ko Sung-hee, Bae Hyeon-seong, Kang Min-ah, Bek Hyun-jin, Heo Jeong-do, Jeon Seok-chan, Koh Woo-ri', null, 'The series is about the office workers of Marketing Team 3 at the home appliance headquarters of Gaus Electronics—a multinational company. It highlights the highs and lows of corporate life, and love and friendship between the employees.', 'The series is about the office workers of Marketing Team 3 at the home appliance headquarters of Gaus Electronics—a multinational company. It highlights the highs and lows of corporate life, and love and friendship between the employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnANewDiVkqXdu9QfKH9pZDwiaF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197084'),
  ('866196310842412316', 'Gavin & Stacey', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ruth Jones, James Corden', null, 'Joanna Page, Mathew Horne, Alison Steadman, Ruth Jones, James Corden, Larry Lamb, Rob Brydon, Melanie Walters', 'NR', 'Essex and Wales collide when Gavin and Stacey fall in love - bringing their friends, family and baggage with them.', 'Essex and Wales collide when Gavin and Stacey fall in love - bringing their friends, family and baggage with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNpySE7Rwq1DlhHadMZnGquralv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3696'),
  ('716944717252736174', 'Gaycation', 2016, 'Documentary', 'David Laven', null, 'Elliot Page, Ian Daniel', 'TV-MA', 'Elliot and his best friend Ian set off on a personal journey to explore LGBTQ cultures around the world. From Japan to Brazil, Jamaica to America, they discover the multiplicity of LGBTQ experiences, meeting amazing people and hearing their deeply moving stories of struggle and triumph. Gaycation celebrates the state of LGBTQ identities across the globe.', 'Elliot and his best friend Ian set off on a personal journey to explore LGBTQ cultures around the world. From Japan to Brazil, Jamaica to America, they discover the multiplicity of LGBTQ experiences, meeting amazing people and hearing their deeply moving stories of struggle and triumph. Gaycation celebrates the state of LGBTQ identities across the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIHbQ6BHSX1o4a47J2cR1qqUXt9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65772'),
  ('398452616831781775', 'Gayliens', 2022, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mark Bessenger', null, null, 'TV-MA', '"Gayliens" is an anthology series ranging from sci-fi to comedy, where each episode details an encounter between gay men and extra-terrestrials.', '"Gayliens" is an anthology series ranging from sci-fi to comedy, where each episode details an encounter between gay men and extra-terrestrials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NHy3IvVzvRHM5ebb20yceZdkdI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209860'),
  ('680143885493894696', 'GCB', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Leslie Bibb, Kristin Chenoweth, Annie Potts, Jennifer Aspen, Miriam Shor, Marisol Nichols, David James Elliott, Brad Beyer', 'TV-PG', 'Amanda Vaughn, once the ultimate high school "mean girl," is forced to return home in disgrace after her marriage ends in scandal. As Amanda and her teenage kids try to adjust to their new lives, the ladies from her past alternate between sympathy and scheming.', 'Amanda Vaughn, once the ultimate high school "mean girl," is forced to return home in disgrace after her marriage ends in scandal. As Amanda and her teenage kids try to adjust to their new lives, the ladies from her past alternate between sympathy and scheming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBRvJhjEoVYWqYwTR3P7T6zsVCi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39302'),
  ('675956204986986313', 'GDR', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Vyacheslav Rogozhkin, Andrey Zhitkov', 'Aleksandr Gorbatov, Darya Ursulyak, Linda Lapinsh, Vitaliy Kovalenko, Madlen Dzhabrailova, Sergey Zharkov, Aleksandr Golubev, Evgeny Kharitonov', null, '1989-1990. General Secretary of the CPSU Mikhail Gorbachyov begins global transformations in the USSR. He passionately wants to become a star in world politics and for this he is ready to go as far as he can to meet the West. But the perestroika planned by Gorbachyov leads to fatal, irreversible consequences. Intelligence officer Alexander Nechaev finds himself at the center of an operation organized by the intelligence services of several countries. During the months spent in Berlin at the moment of the breakdown of the entire post-war world order, Nechaev changed a lot. He no longer knows who is a friend and who is a traitor, but continues to defend the honor and interests of his Motherland...', '1989-1990. General Secretary of the CPSU Mikhail Gorbachyov begins global transformations in the USSR. He passionately wants to become a star in world politics and for this he is ready to go as far as he can to meet the West. But the perestroika planned by Gorbachyov leads to fatal, irreversible consequences. Intelligence officer Alexander Nechaev finds himself at the center of an operation organized by the intelligence services of several countries. During the months spent in Berlin at the moment of the breakdown of the entire post-war world order, Nechaev changed a lot. He no longer knows who is a friend and who is a traitor, but continues to defend the honor and interests of his Motherland...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0opnZSYdDfPQkYgkgbz3xCRuTR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245303'),
  ('251747969563131003', 'Geek Girl', 2024, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Holly Smale, Jessica Ruston', null, 'Emily Carey, Tim Downie, Sarah Parish, Jemima Rooper, Liam Woodrum, Emmanuel Imani', 'TV-PG', 'Awkward teen Harriet has always wanted to fit in. Until she gets scouted by a top London model agent and learns that some people are meant to stand out.', 'Awkward teen Harriet has always wanted to fit in. Until she gets scouted by a top London model agent and learns that some people are meant to stand out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9v0yiDRpx6KQ3EGKDSAdFoNN0y.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:252605'),
  ('36174557370869131', 'Geeking Out', 2016, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Kevin Smith, Greg Grunberg', null, 'Kevin Smith, Greg Grunberg, Tiffany Smith', null, 'A 30-minute talk show that takes a timely look at pop culture through a fanboy lens and features celebrity interviews, discussion and out-of-the-studio segments.', 'A 30-minute talk show that takes a timely look at pop culture through a fanboy lens and features celebrity interviews, discussion and out-of-the-studio segments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXBM3kq3mGmYAVCbj5YAlaGcH2U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68010'),
