  ('343261438367166685', 'Geronimo Stilton', 2009, 'Mystery, Comedy, Animation, Kids', 'Elisabetta Dami', null, 'Monica Bonetto, Patrizio Prata, Debora Magnaghi, Riccardo Peroni, Emanuela Pacotto, Marco Balbi, Patrizia Salmoiraghi', 'TV-Y', 'Geronimo Stilton is about the titular character, a mouse journalist and head of the Geronimo Stilton Media Group. He searches New Mouse City and places around the world for new scoops while having adventures along the way with his nephew Benjamin, cousin Trap, sister Thea and Benjamin''s friend Pandora Woz. Most episodes share no story connections and are generally self-contained, though some episodes feature ties and characters from others.', 'Geronimo Stilton is about the titular character, a mouse journalist and head of the Geronimo Stilton Media Group. He searches New Mouse City and places around the world for new scoops while having adventures along the way with his nephew Benjamin, cousin Trap, sister Thea and Benjamin''s friend Pandora Woz. Most episodes share no story connections and are generally self-contained, though some episodes feature ties and characters from others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTywtYZoEw73qCmRlXexwRRd1jj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32066'),
