  ('858046749909209131', 'Get a Life', 1990, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Chris Elliott, David Mirkin, Adam Resnick', null, 'Chris Elliott, Brian Doyle-Murray, Elinor Donahue, Taylor Fry, Sam Robards, Robin Riker, Bob Elliott, Brady Bluhm', null, 'Surreal, twisted and hilariously funny, Get a Life is the ultimate anti-sitcom. Chris Peterson is a 30-year-old paperboy who still lives with his parents and who seems to have an ever decreasing grip on reality.', 'Surreal, twisted and hilariously funny, Get a Life is the ultimate anti-sitcom. Chris Peterson is a 30-year-old paperboy who still lives with his parents and who seems to have an ever decreasing grip on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5u3xjVAtOn5gCfOWXwXA8w9En1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5030'),
  ('111563059104306900', 'Get Even', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Holly Phillips', null, 'Kim Adis, Jessica Alexander, Bethany Antonia, Mia McKenna-Bruce, Emily Carey, Chris J Gordon, Razan Nassar', 'TV-PG', 'On the surface Kitty, Margot, Bree and Olivia appear to have nothing in common - but there’s one passion which unites them: to expose injustice. They form their own secret society, DGM - they Don’t Get Mad, they Get Even - playing anonymous pranks to expose bullies.', 'On the surface Kitty, Margot, Bree and Olivia appear to have nothing in common - but there’s one passion which unites them: to expose injustice. They form their own secret society, DGM - they Don’t Get Mad, they Get Even - playing anonymous pranks to expose bullies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hkp2nLI84G6btRGwcYVHYZ9coT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99335'),
  ('1059237738415832752', 'Get Gotti', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Murder. Extortion. Drug smuggling. Racketeering. The charges are mounting against John Gotti — but will any of them stick to the "Teflon Don"? Told from both sides of the law, this docuseries from the makers of "Fear City" follows the FBI''s battle to bring down infamous mob boss.', 'Murder. Extortion. Drug smuggling. Racketeering. The charges are mounting against John Gotti — but will any of them stick to the "Teflon Don"? Told from both sides of the law, this docuseries from the makers of "Fear City" follows the FBI''s battle to bring down infamous mob boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfhxVG05LeWqwyMPxPJnQRfDgL5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236006'),
  ('284017909998941572', 'Get Millie Black', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marlon James', null, 'Tamara Lawrance, Joe Dempsie, Gershwyn Eustache Jnr, Chyna McQueen, Christopher Daley, Shernet Swearine, Belinda Reid, Peter John Thwaites', 'TV-MA', 'Ex Scotland Yard detective Millie-Jean Black returns to Kingston to work missing persons; soon finding herself on a quest to save a sister who won’t be saved, to find a boy who can’t be found, to solve a case that will blow her world apart and prove almost as tough to crack as Millie Black.', 'Ex Scotland Yard detective Millie-Jean Black returns to Kingston to work missing persons; soon finding herself on a quest to save a sister who won’t be saved, to find a boy who can’t be found, to solve a case that will blow her world apart and prove almost as tough to crack as Millie Black.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytXuD2ZP9Q82OzalMaGYoKUUPCG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201646'),
  ('753022268225213834', 'Get Organized with The Home Edit', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Clea Shearer, Joanna Teplin', null, 'Expert home organizers Clea and Joanna help celebrities and everyday clients edit, categorize and contain their clutter to create stunning spaces.', 'Expert home organizers Clea and Joanna help celebrities and everyday clients edit, categorize and contain their clutter to create stunning spaces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGfvGFUIpGQe0DEzfUu2DKp4zyP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:108268'),
