  ('286056018147473451', 'Get Real', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Documentary', 'Clyde Phillips', null, 'Jon Tenney, Debrah Farentino, Eric Christian Olsen, Anne Hathaway, Jesse Eisenberg, Christina Pickles', 'TV-14', 'Get Real was a short-lived comedy-drama on the FOX Network centering on the fictional Green family of Los Angeles. It ran from September 1999 to April 2000. It starred Eric Christian Olsen and Anne Hathaway in very early roles, as the older siblings to central character of the series, youngest child, Kenny.', 'Get Real was a short-lived comedy-drama on the FOX Network centering on the fictional Green family of Los Angeles. It ran from September 1999 to April 2000. It starred Eric Christian Olsen and Anne Hathaway in very early roles, as the older siblings to central character of the series, youngest child, Kenny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS1tXqVxXUtnmCVP8fp115EHGDg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3159'),
  ('412778461830454038', 'Get Rolling with Otis', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Griffin Robert Faulkner, Elliott Fullam, Katie Grober, Josiah Gaffney, Leah Janvier', 'TV-Y', 'Welcome to Long Hill Dairy Farm, home to Otis the tractor and all his friends. Otis may be little, but he has a big heart. Whenever he sees a friend in need, he hits the brakes to see what''s wrong and rolls into action to help.', 'Welcome to Long Hill Dairy Farm, home to Otis the tractor and all his friends. Otis may be little, but he has a big heart. Whenever he sees a friend in need, he hits the brakes to see what''s wrong and rolls into action to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNJHsDr3qB0gJxaGpl6vnfzG2ey.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:133152'),
  ('566410190776529093', 'Get Shorty', 2017, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Davey Holmes', null, 'Chris O''Dowd, Ray Romano, Sean Bridgers, Lidia Porto, Goya Robles, Megan Stevenson, Carolyn Dodd, Lucy Walters', 'TV-MA', 'Miles Daly works as muscle for a murderous crime ring in Nevada and attempts to change professions and become a movie producer, laundering money through a Hollywood film with the help of washed-up filmmaker Rick Moreweather. Based on Elmore Leonard’s 1990 New York Times bestselling novel.', 'Miles Daly works as muscle for a murderous crime ring in Nevada and attempts to change professions and become a movie producer, laundering money through a Hollywood film with the help of washed-up filmmaker Rick Moreweather. Based on Elmore Leonard’s 1990 New York Times bestselling novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ism3TUNdIl5MpQR6E8ApjE89LQy.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71951'),
  ('1073457712869715249', 'Get Smart', 1965, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Buck Henry, Mel Brooks', null, 'Don Adams, Barbara Feldon, Edward Platt, Robert Karvelas', 'TV-PG', 'Get Smart is an American comedy television series that satirizes the secret agent genre. Created by Mel Brooks with Buck Henry, the show stars Don Adams, Barbara Feldon, and Edward Platt. Henry said they created the show by request of Daniel Melnick, who was a partner, along with Leonard Stern and David Susskind, of the show''s production company, Talent Associates, to capitalize on "the two biggest things in the entertainment world today"—James Bond and Inspector Clouseau. Brooks said: "It''s an insane combination of James Bond and Mel Brooks comedy." This is the only Mel Brooks production to feature a laugh track. The success of the show eventually spawned the follow-up films The Nude Bomb and Get Smart, Again!, as well as a 1995 revival series and a 2008 film remake. In 2010, TV Guide ranked Get Smart''s opening title sequence at No. 2 on its list of TV''s Top 10 Credits Sequences, as selected by readers.', 'Get Smart is an American comedy television series that satirizes the secret agent genre. Created by Mel Brooks with Buck Henry, the show stars Don Adams, Barbara Feldon, and Edward Platt. Henry said they created the show by request of Daniel Melnick, who was a partner, along with Leonard Stern and David Susskind, of the show''s production company, Talent Associates, to capitalize on "the two biggest things in the entertainment world today"—James Bond and Inspector Clouseau. Brooks said: "It''s an insane combination of James Bond and Mel Brooks comedy." This is the only Mel Brooks production to feature a laugh track. The success of the show eventually spawned the follow-up films The Nude Bomb and Get Smart, Again!, as well as a 1995 revival series and a 2008 film remake. In 2010, TV Guide ranked Get Smart''s opening title sequence at No. 2 on its list of TV''s Top 10 Credits Sequences, as selected by readers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqhPucVAvnocglq5WYXbh6t9wuE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4455'),
  ('542949884459644636', 'Get Smart', 1995, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael J. Di Gaetano, Lawrence Gay', null, 'Don Adams, Andy Dick, Elaine Hendrix', null, 'Get Smart is a short-lived American comedy television series that aired in 1995 on FOX. The series was a sequel to the original Get Smart television series that ran from 1965 to 1970. The series premiered on January 8, 1995 and ended its original run on February 19, 1995.', 'Get Smart is a short-lived American comedy television series that aired in 1995 on FOX. The series was a sequel to the original Get Smart television series that ran from 1965 to 1970. The series premiered on January 8, 1995 and ended its original run on February 19, 1995.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuVYMvDExkD4TYz2qsAKFEo6AWx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15830'),
  ('527120392660071707', 'GetBackers', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Showtaro Morikubo, Nobutoshi Canna, Natsuko Kuwatani, Soichiro Hoshi, Takanori Hoshino, Takehito Koyasu, Nobuo Tobita, Mitsuki Saiga', null, 'Ban Mido and Ginji Amano run a freelance business of recovering anything lost or stolen. They call themselves the GetBackers, and they''re a super powered duo.', 'Ban Mido and Ginji Amano run a freelance business of recovering anything lost or stolen. They call themselves the GetBackers, and they''re a super powered duo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22WtfwbpWM1RFUTh5l4qfW2xCgl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62883'),
  ('1146353614940755085', 'Getroud met Rugby: Die Sepie', 2016, 'Soap', 'Deon Opperman', null, 'Stephanie Baartman, Werner Coetser, Rina Nienaber, Johan Scholtz, Altus Theart, Marijke van der Westhuizen, Louis Van Niekerk, David Johnson', null, 'Getroud met Rugby: Die Sepie is a South African soap opera based on the feature film and later drama series Getroud met Rugby by Deon Opperman, which is set amongst a rugby-playing community.', 'Getroud met Rugby: Die Sepie is a South African soap opera based on the feature film and later drama series Getroud met Rugby by Deon Opperman, which is set amongst a rugby-playing community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBp8JBN38AanXyuX4yT3SDuoieY.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:236443'),
  ('255471599719742450', 'Getter Robo', 1974, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Go Nagai, Ken Ishikawa', null, 'Akira Kamiya, Keaton Yamada, Toku Nishio, Kosei Tomita, Rihoko Yoshida', null, 'From deep within the Earth''s surface, the Dinosaur Kingdom make their move to wipe out mankind and conquer the planet with their mechanical dinosaurs. After a prototype Getter Robo is shot down by a mechanical dinosaur, the Saotome Research Institute decides to use the real Getter Robo, which is combat-capable. Due to a lack of pilots in the institute, Ryo Nagare goes to his college to persuade martial artist Musashi Tomoe and outcast Hayato Jin to join him and pilot the Getter Machines to combat the new threat and protect mankind.', 'From deep within the Earth''s surface, the Dinosaur Kingdom make their move to wipe out mankind and conquer the planet with their mechanical dinosaurs. After a prototype Getter Robo is shot down by a mechanical dinosaur, the Saotome Research Institute decides to use the real Getter Robo, which is combat-capable. Due to a lack of pilots in the institute, Ryo Nagare goes to his college to persuade martial artist Musashi Tomoe and outcast Hayato Jin to join him and pilot the Getter Machines to combat the new threat and protect mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAEFm8jc69KJVktku96OzhdJpyU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45485'),
  ('736435204002273673', 'Getter Robo Arc', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Arihiro Mukaino, Kazuhiro Sunseki, Naoya Uchida, Hideo Ishikawa, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Nozomu Sasaki, Takayuki Sugo', 'TV-14', 'Taking place several years after Getter Robo Go, Earth is now a post-apocalyptic world. Hayato, now an aging scientist, has completed Professor Saotome''s masterpiece, Getter Robo Arc. Piloting it are Ryoma''s son Takuma, the human-dinosaur Kamui, and the younger brother of Tayel, Baku. Alongside the reformed Dinosaur Empire, they fight the insectoid Andromeda Flow Country attacking from across time and space.', 'Taking place several years after Getter Robo Go, Earth is now a post-apocalyptic world. Hayato, now an aging scientist, has completed Professor Saotome''s masterpiece, Getter Robo Arc. Piloting it are Ryoma''s son Takuma, the human-dinosaur Kamui, and the younger brother of Tayel, Baku. Alongside the reformed Dinosaur Empire, they fight the insectoid Andromeda Flow Country attacking from across time and space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pGB810uRe46w97UeQP7eob8NXp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122827'),
  ('42109579110038865', 'Getting On', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Vicki Pepperdine, Joanna Scanlan', 'Jo Brand, Vicki Pepperdine, Joanna Scanlan, Ricky Grover', null, 'Darkly comic series about life on a hospital ward and a nursing team who have to get on with the job despite challenges thrown up by the modern NHS.', 'Darkly comic series about life on a hospital ward and a nursing team who have to get on with the job despite challenges thrown up by the modern NHS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdNhdbHLhscgo9DVDr2J4Z3U7hj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:21660'),
  ('225567591445525760', 'Getting On', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Mark V. Olsen, Will Scheffer', null, 'Laurie Metcalf, Alex Borstein, Niecy Nash, Mel Rodriguez', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a geriatric extended care wing of a down-at-the-heels hospital, Getting On follows put-upon nurses, anxious doctors and administrators as they struggle with the darkly comic, brutally honest and quietly compassionate realities of caring for the elderly.', 'Set in a geriatric extended care wing of a down-at-the-heels hospital, Getting On follows put-upon nurses, anxious doctors and administrators as they struggle with the darkly comic, brutally honest and quietly compassionate realities of caring for the elderly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QZcTGSu3txafurQ2zEcYK03WFJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:57756'),
  ('546466060929957248', 'Getting Under Your Skin', 2026, 'Drama', 'Simon Boulerice', 'Simon Boulerice', 'Félix-Antoine Bénard, Anthony Therrien, Josée Deschênes, Matai Stevens, Marilou Forgues', null, 'GETTING UNDER YOUR SKIN tells the story of an unlikely friendship between Gaspard, a queer 16-year-old in search of empowerment, and Dave, a 25-year-old police officer who infiltrates Gaspard’s high school to flush out drug dealers with possible organized crime connections.', 'GETTING UNDER YOUR SKIN tells the story of an unlikely friendship between Gaspard, a queer 16-year-old in search of empowerment, and Dave, a 25-year-old police officer who infiltrates Gaspard’s high school to flush out drug dealers with possible organized crime connections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a56Y9qX92aXDAEzY1xyNZhtHd9C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317346'),
  ('238635031289041058', 'GG Bond', 2006, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', '陆锦明, 古志斌', 'Tommy Wang', 'Shuang Lu, Qing Zu, Quansheng Gao, Tommy Wang', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XC8xxZU01ZMtilejudKuJtPHbV.jpg', 43, 'tmdb:tv:217772'),
  ('4090513022484634', 'GG Precinct', 2024, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Veronica Jin, Cheng Wei-hao', 'Cheng Wei-hao, Yin Chen-hao, Chou Man-Yu', 'Greg Hsu, Gingle Wang, Ma Nien-Hsien, Ng Ki-pin, LULU Huang, Lin He-hsuan, Flower Chen', 'TV-MA', 'Facing a trail of murders staged as chilling word games, a rookie police captain and a goofy detective race to solve a serial killer''s deadly puzzles.', 'Facing a trail of murders staged as chilling word games, a rookie police captain and a goofy detective race to solve a serial killer''s deadly puzzles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WY6jbTc0YUgck0NaC16gK7RbTB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245265'),
  ('1045889653912160953', 'Ghastly Prince Enma Burning Up', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Go Nagai', null, 'Mamiko Noto, Ayako Kawasumi, Kappei Yamaguchi, Takehito Koyasu, Rumi Shishido', null, 'Tokyo in the 1970s. Evil spirits are threatening the human world and the only ones who can stop them are a group known as the Spirit Patrol. Sent from the underworld the team consists of the hot-headed Enma, the stuck-up Yukiko, the half-water sprite Kapael and Chapeau-jii — the old man spirit in the form of a hat, who guides the group. This may not bode well... though.', 'Tokyo in the 1970s. Evil spirits are threatening the human world and the only ones who can stop them are a group known as the Spirit Patrol. Sent from the underworld the team consists of the hot-headed Enma, the stuck-up Yukiko, the half-water sprite Kapael and Chapeau-jii — the old man spirit in the form of a hat, who guides the group. This may not bode well... though.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfk71ua2ntncDjiHqWv7JDLQIHc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55013'),
  ('1041854423957978024', 'Ghost', 2012, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Kim Eun-hee', 'Kim Eun-hee', 'So Ji-sub, Lee Yeon-hee, Uhm Ki-joon, Kwak Do-won, Song Ha-yoon, Choi Daniel, Kwon Hae-hyo, Choi Jung-woo', null, 'The police procedural tackles crimes and clues in the cyber world, weaving a massive, twist-filled mystery of murders, identity switches, corruption and conspiracy.', 'The police procedural tackles crimes and clues in the cyber world, weaving a massive, twist-filled mystery of murders, identity switches, corruption and conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggVjRfX3jINq1JOiLH5I87Bj4jS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45018'),
  ('746721175778577401', 'Ghost Adventures', 2008, 'Reality', null, null, 'Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin', 'TV-14', 'Paranormal investigator Zak Bagans and his crew, Nick Groff and Aaron Goodwin, search for haunted locations both domestically and internationally. During their investigations, Zak and crew acquaint themselves with the general area; interview locals about the hauntings; and go face-to-face with the evil spirits who reportedly haunt these locations.', 'Paranormal investigator Zak Bagans and his crew, Nick Groff and Aaron Goodwin, search for haunted locations both domestically and internationally. During their investigations, Zak and crew acquaint themselves with the general area; interview locals about the hauntings; and go face-to-face with the evil spirits who reportedly haunt these locations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLJZuDxdeUqRFHFlqs0mIk9faMR.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:17937'),
  ('169087200968165306', 'Ghost Adventures: Aftershocks', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Billy Tolley, Jay Wasley', null, 'Zak helps a young filmmaker, and survivor of a brutal attack, who has become obsessed with spirits that allegedly haunt a hotel in Seguin, Texas. And later, he gathers compelling evidence of a possession at Birmingham''s Sloss Furnaces', 'Zak helps a young filmmaker, and survivor of a brutal attack, who has become obsessed with spirits that allegedly haunt a hotel in Seguin, Texas. And later, he gathers compelling evidence of a possession at Birmingham''s Sloss Furnaces', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1z6WyKpgQpz7kd56MrsoFB4ZSl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:63635'),
  ('1077250416038281836', 'Ghost Adventures: House Calls', 2022, 'Mystery, Reality', null, null, 'Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Billy Tolley, Jay Wasley', 'TV-14', 'Disembodied voices, objects moving on their own, shadow figures and apparitions – all are often signs of paranormal activity. When they occur inside your own home, it can bring an overwhelming sense of fear. Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Billy Tolley and Jay Wasley, the team behind GHOST ADVENTURES, have spent decades investigating ghostly activity to gain a better understanding of the afterlife. Now, they’re helping frightened families who believe they are under paranormal attack in the all-new eight-part series.', 'Disembodied voices, objects moving on their own, shadow figures and apparitions – all are often signs of paranormal activity. When they occur inside your own home, it can bring an overwhelming sense of fear. Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Billy Tolley and Jay Wasley, the team behind GHOST ADVENTURES, have spent decades investigating ghostly activity to gain a better understanding of the afterlife. Now, they’re helping frightened families who believe they are under paranormal attack in the all-new eight-part series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BrZ2NYx4LQQ3dlfJIXdlvjesAg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:198049'),
  ('309450110016656618', 'Ghost Adventures: Quarantine', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jay Wasley, Aaron Goodwin, Billy Tolley, Zak Bagans', null, 'The fearless four quarantine themselves for two weeks in Bagans'' famed ''Haunted Museum'' in Las Vegas, all by themselves.', 'The fearless four quarantine themselves for two weeks in Bagans'' famed ''Haunted Museum'' in Las Vegas, all by themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVzQUO4r2fR4bBTrjioaLpIVJ9Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104614'),
  ('205375021423250771', 'Ghost Adventures: Screaming Room', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Jay Wasley, Billy Tolley', 'TV-14', 'Paranormal investigators Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Jay Wasley and Billy Tolley are opening up to viewers as they’ve never done before. The guys are kicking back in their screening room to watch their favorite episodes of the hit series "Ghost Adventures" and get candid with fans – and each other – about their craziest experiences over the past decade. Away from the haunted locations we usually see them in, with no equipment or investigations, it’s just the team, some munchies and never-before-heard stories from the moments that created a legacy. Get ready for laughs, screams and surprises alongside the crew in the ultimate tell-all event.', 'Paranormal investigators Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Jay Wasley and Billy Tolley are opening up to viewers as they’ve never done before. The guys are kicking back in their screening room to watch their favorite episodes of the hit series "Ghost Adventures" and get candid with fans – and each other – about their craziest experiences over the past decade. Away from the haunted locations we usually see them in, with no equipment or investigations, it’s just the team, some munchies and never-before-heard stories from the moments that created a legacy. Get ready for laughs, screams and surprises alongside the crew in the ultimate tell-all event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moYtOsylVicJMMQJZnWuhrhA5yd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:97121'),
  ('561293052270079202', 'Ghost Adventures: Serial Killer Spirits', 2019, 'Reality, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Documentary', null, null, 'Zak Bagans, Aaron Goodwin, Jay Wasley, Billy Tolley', 'TV-PG', 'Exploring haunted locations associated with infamous serial killers, Zak Bagans and the Ghost Adventures team – Aaron Goodwin, Jay Wasley and Billy Tolley – seek to document whether malicious energy has been left behind by sadistic killers and their evil acts.', 'Exploring haunted locations associated with infamous serial killers, Zak Bagans and the Ghost Adventures team – Aaron Goodwin, Jay Wasley and Billy Tolley – seek to document whether malicious energy has been left behind by sadistic killers and their evil acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDy4PoVmLKBP3RnRLQssHLWEnOP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93521'),
  ('194747021974228916', 'Ghost Asylum', 2014, 'Reality, Documentary', 'Tim Hamilton', null, 'Steven McDougal, Chasey Ray McKnight, Scott Porter, Brannon Smith, Chris Smith, William J. Slevin III', 'TV-14', 'A paranormal investigation team hunt for ghosts in asylums, sanitariums and mental hospitals in this reality series.', 'A paranormal investigation team hunt for ghosts in asylums, sanitariums and mental hospitals in this reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whtJmv0r58yYhbYKcZjXshlAffB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62594'),
  ('525954075631078534', 'Ghost Brothers', 2016, 'Documentary, Mystery, Reality', 'Craig Piligian, Mike Nichols', null, 'Dalen Spratt, Juwan Mass, Marcus Harvey', 'TV-PG', 'Ghost Brothers, is a trio of friends exploring the paranormal with a dash of comedy.', 'Ghost Brothers, is a trio of friends exploring the paranormal with a dash of comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyMoRYUGfymWcMNUIPXDGT6GzkL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70674'),
  ('206048304848358398', 'Ghost Brothers: Haunted Houseguests', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dalen Spratt, Marcus Harvey, Juwan Mass', 'TV-PG', 'Best friends and ghost hunters Dalen Spratt, Juwan Mass and Marcus Harvey — known collectively as the Ghost Brothers — travel across the U.S. answering calls for help from different families. In each episode, they’ll bunk with a new family, getting embedded into their lives to help with their paranormal problems.', 'Best friends and ghost hunters Dalen Spratt, Juwan Mass and Marcus Harvey — known collectively as the Ghost Brothers — travel across the U.S. answering calls for help from different families. In each episode, they’ll bunk with a new family, getting embedded into their lives to help with their paranormal problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKpokzgFmXNxqM3fFhOaKWNrQLT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92155'),
  ('1057571315979256921', 'Ghost Brothers: Lights Out', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The Ghost Brothers (Dalen Spratt, Juwan Mass and Marcus Harvey) are the dopest brothers on television hunting ghosts. These candid and unorthodox paranormal investigators explore disturbed hotspots across the country, checking out and sizing up local legends and supernatural stories. They are ready to expose the haunted holdouts still hanging around these locations … and why they don’t leave.', 'The Ghost Brothers (Dalen Spratt, Juwan Mass and Marcus Harvey) are the dopest brothers on television hunting ghosts. These candid and unorthodox paranormal investigators explore disturbed hotspots across the country, checking out and sizing up local legends and supernatural stories. They are ready to expose the haunted holdouts still hanging around these locations … and why they don’t leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOVBzuV3HMyMVCopfT9bgNRhJ3e.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123218'),
  ('1058966405330431062', 'GHOST CONCERT: missing Songs', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Minori Fujidera, Rina Hidaka, Nao Ojika, Miyuki Sakurai, Yuri An, Satomi Sato, Satoshi Hino, Miyu Irino', null, 'The year is 2045. Singing is forbidden, and an AI system called MiucS creates music in place of people. Seria Aiba, a high school girl who can see spirits, lives quietly under these rules—until one day, she hears a real human voice singing. Following the song, Seria discovers the source: a ghost. Now Seria must decide whether to stay silent or risk everything to bring music back to the world.', 'The year is 2045. Singing is forbidden, and an AI system called MiucS creates music in place of people. Seria Aiba, a high school girl who can see spirits, lives quietly under these rules—until one day, she hears a real human voice singing. Following the song, Seria discovers the source: a ghost. Now Seria must decide whether to stay silent or risk everything to bring music back to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHOwV97JOd8zCyCIOTiadPPXAfY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:303796'),
  ('766529954757197997', 'Ghost Doctor', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Boo Seong-cheol', null, 'Rain, Kim Bum, Uee, Son Na-eun, Kim Jae-yong, Seo Ji-young, Sung Dong-il, Son Ji-na', null, 'A skilled surgeon becomes a coma patient and possesses a first-year resident who is the polar opposite of him in expertise and personality.', 'A skilled surgeon becomes a coma patient and possesses a first-year resident who is the polar opposite of him in expertise and personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TWwuZR398ytSZX0RdsOyECu9sC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152471'),
  ('1091789863535987847', 'Ghost Hound', 2007, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Akiko Yajima, Jun Fukuyama, Soichiro Hoshi, Yasunori Matsumoto, Fumihiko Tachiki, Sakiko Tamagawa, Keisuke Oda', 'TV-14', 'In an isolated region of Kyushu lies the town of Suiten. Though seeming small and modest, Suiten is not a picturesque place for a vacation, unless it is from the “Unseen World”. Taro, Makoto and Masayuki, three boys with traumatic pasts, learn to let their souls cross between the two parallel worlds. However, the Unseen World is no mere copy of the real Apparent World. The Unseen World is the home of ghosts, but changes are now allowing the souls of the dead to pass over into the Apparent World, with unpredictable effects. Follow the journey of Taro, Makoto and Masayuki, as they cross between the two worlds, trying to unravel a great mystery.', 'In an isolated region of Kyushu lies the town of Suiten. Though seeming small and modest, Suiten is not a picturesque place for a vacation, unless it is from the “Unseen World”. Taro, Makoto and Masayuki, three boys with traumatic pasts, learn to let their souls cross between the two parallel worlds. However, the Unseen World is no mere copy of the real Apparent World. The Unseen World is the home of ghosts, but changes are now allowing the souls of the dead to pass over into the Apparent World, with unpredictable effects. Follow the journey of Taro, Makoto and Masayuki, as they cross between the two worlds, trying to unravel a great mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mebvYDOMnnadzDDbJOdjQRnap63.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36024'),
  ('1006916402377070837', 'Ghost Hunt', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Ken Narita, Masami Suzuki, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Rie Kugimiya, Kousuke Okano, Kaori Nazuka, Yuuki Tai, Kenji Hamada', 'TV-14', 'Telling ghost stories is a favorite past time of Mai Taniyama and her friends—that is, until she meets 17-year-old Kazuya Shibuya, the man sent by Shibuya Psychic Research Center to investigate paranormal activity at a supposedly haunted school. When Mai gets caught in a dangerous situation, she is rescued by Kazuya''s assistant. Saving her lands the assistant incapacitated, and Kazuya demands that Mai become his assistant, instead...', 'Telling ghost stories is a favorite past time of Mai Taniyama and her friends—that is, until she meets 17-year-old Kazuya Shibuya, the man sent by Shibuya Psychic Research Center to investigate paranormal activity at a supposedly haunted school. When Mai gets caught in a dangerous situation, she is rescued by Kazuya''s assistant. Saving her lands the assistant incapacitated, and Kazuya demands that Mai become his assistant, instead...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6NdT9BDcEfIYtL0CmJEtjhVi4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34809'),
  ('948340155895516223', 'Ghost Hunters', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Reality', null, null, 'Jason Hawes, Steve Gonsalves, Dave Tango', 'TV-14', 'Paranormal investigators investigate places that are reported to be haunted. Engaging forensic experts, historical records and the most innovative technology available, the squad helps everyday people who are struggling with unexplained supernatural phenomena.', 'Paranormal investigators investigate places that are reported to be haunted. Engaging forensic experts, historical records and the most innovative technology available, the squad helps everyday people who are struggling with unexplained supernatural phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTJAKibxeynINA61p00oBsfc2mq.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:443'),
  ('1033838627996633607', 'Ghost Hunters', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Grant Wilson, Mustafa Gatollari, Daryl Marston, Kristen Luman, Brandon Alvis, Brian Murray, Richel Stratton', 'TV-PG', 'Follow one of the original team leaders, Grant Wilson, and his handpicked group of professional ghost hunters as they use their decades of field experience to investigate hauntings across the country. Engaging forensic experts, historical records and the most innovative technology available, the new squad will help everyday people who are struggling with unexplained supernatural phenomena.', 'Follow one of the original team leaders, Grant Wilson, and his handpicked group of professional ghost hunters as they use their decades of field experience to investigate hauntings across the country. Engaging forensic experts, historical records and the most innovative technology available, the new squad will help everyday people who are struggling with unexplained supernatural phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIgp40WMwl7XmcPMiFBgGQgwVpU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92820'),
  ('503619664620194230', 'Ghost Hunters International', 2008, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Barry Fitzgerald', null, 'Ghost Hunters International was a spin-off series of Ghost Hunters that aired on Syfy. The series premiered on January 9, 2008. Like its parent series, GHI was a reality series that followed a team of paranormal investigators; whereas, the original series primarily covers only locations within the United States, the GHI team traveled around the world and documented some of the world''s most legendary haunted locations.', 'Ghost Hunters International was a spin-off series of Ghost Hunters that aired on Syfy. The series premiered on January 9, 2008. Like its parent series, GHI was a reality series that followed a team of paranormal investigators; whereas, the original series primarily covers only locations within the United States, the GHI team traveled around the world and documented some of the world''s most legendary haunted locations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WAjct2Nqc6hB5maRaAwXUwjQHP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14058'),
  ('248973422783134230', 'Ghost Hunters: TAPS Returns', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Jason Hawes', null, 'Shari DeBenedetti, Jason Hawes, Steve Gonsalves, Dave Tango', null, 'Renowned TAPS team members Jason Hawes, Steve Gonsalves and Dave Tango, along with Shari DeBenedetti, reunite to revisit their most chilling cases and investigate disturbing new hauntings.', 'Renowned TAPS team members Jason Hawes, Steve Gonsalves and Dave Tango, along with Shari DeBenedetti, reunite to revisit their most chilling cases and investigate disturbing new hauntings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5viBqTOFtRPPEfiinRPDqTp6In.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:154672'),
  ('310202609885775639', 'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Alternative Architecture', 2015, 'Animation, Crime, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichirou Matsuda, Ikkyu Juku, Tarusuke Shingaki, Takuro Nakakuni, Yoji Ueda, Aya Hisakawa, Kazuya Nakai', 'TV-MA', 'The story follows Motoko Kusanagi, a highly skilled member of the military, whom upon meeting Daisuke Aramaki, a current chief of the Public Security Section 9, in less than desirable conditions struggles to clear her name whilst forming her own independent team with the highest priority under the sponsorship and guidance of the chief Aramaki himself.', 'The story follows Motoko Kusanagi, a highly skilled member of the military, whom upon meeting Daisuke Aramaki, a current chief of the Public Security Section 9, in less than desirable conditions struggles to clear her name whilst forming her own independent team with the highest priority under the sponsorship and guidance of the chief Aramaki himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zTsKmbEkzeWLMb8LOwUcyFsOcr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62070'),
  ('846247957574778399', 'Ghost in the Shell: SAC_2045', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shirow Masamune', null, 'Atsuko Tanaka, Akio Otsuka, Koichi Yamadera, Yutaka Nakano, Toru Okawa, Takashi Onozuka, Taro Yamaguchi, Sakiko Tamagawa', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2045, cybernetic mercenary Motoko Kusanagi returns to Section 9 to face a dangerous new threat: the posthumans.', 'In the year 2045, cybernetic mercenary Motoko Kusanagi returns to Section 9 to face a dangerous new threat: the posthumans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPK8BER0Pyq68IGKHrTemGlxBV4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90293'),
  ('455182338720207899', 'Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', null, null, 'Atsuko Tanaka, Akio Otsuka, Osamu Saka, Taimei Suzuki, Takashi Onozuka, Rikiya Koyama, Taro Yamaguchi, Toru Okawa', 'TV-MA', 'In the future when technological enhancements and robotics are a way of life, Major Motoko Kusanagi and Section 9 take care of the jobs that are too difficult for the police. Section 9 employs hackers, sharpshooters, detectives and cyborgs all in an effort to thwart cyber criminals and their plans to attack the innocent.', 'In the future when technological enhancements and robotics are a way of life, Major Motoko Kusanagi and Section 9 take care of the jobs that are too difficult for the police. Section 9 employs hackers, sharpshooters, detectives and cyborgs all in an effort to thwart cyber criminals and their plans to attack the innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UH2vJryPpQp38noqvchu3uEeqX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1095'),
  ('1081987763095811294', 'Ghost Nation', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Steve Gonsalves, Dave Tango, Jason Hawes, Shari DeBenedetti', 'TV-PG', 'Paranormal investigators and ghost-hunting pioneers Jason Hawes, Steve Gonsalves and Dave Tango respond to urgent calls from local paranormal investigators nationwide who have reached a dead end with their high-stakes personal cases.', 'Paranormal investigators and ghost-hunting pioneers Jason Hawes, Steve Gonsalves and Dave Tango respond to urgent calls from local paranormal investigators nationwide who have reached a dead end with their high-stakes personal cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbyFj3j8SleBYRSlwaXRbynaUsX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93313'),
  ('644144592798452463', 'Ghost Stories', 1997, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Rip Torn', null, 'Ghost Stories is an American horror anthology television series that ran from 1997 to 1998 on the cable channel The Family Channel. The show was narrated by Rip Torn and originally two episodes were presented back to back in an hour-long segment. However, towards the end of the series it was broken down into 30 minute episodes with just one story, most featuring a style similar to episodes of The Twilight Zone in which there would be a twist at the end. There have been five DVD releases and is currently being shown in the United Kingdom on the TV channel Zone Horror.', 'Ghost Stories is an American horror anthology television series that ran from 1997 to 1998 on the cable channel The Family Channel. The show was narrated by Rip Torn and originally two episodes were presented back to back in an hour-long segment. However, towards the end of the series it was broken down into 30 minute episodes with just one story, most featuring a style similar to episodes of The Twilight Zone in which there would be a twist at the end. There have been five DVD releases and is currently being shown in the United Kingdom on the TV channel Zone Horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HNyGCe5xg1lBa18szDx1qKWoCx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13092'),
  ('614057846977726204', 'Ghost Stories', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoko Kawakami, Kotono Mitsuishi, Kumi Sakuma, Kurumi Mamiya, Makoto Tsumura, Takako Honda, Ryusei Nakao, Takehiro Murozono', 'TV-14', 'When nearby construction disturbs a spiritual resting place, its disgruntled denizens do what any supernatural beings would do after a rude awakening: they terrorize the local school. And that means it’s up to a scruffy band of young ghostbusters to expel their satanic schoolmates before everyone gets sent to permanent detention! So join Satsuki, her crybaby brother, the resident class stud, the school nerd and "physical researcher," a born-again beauty, and a resentful, demon-possessed cat in the funniest, scariest school you’ve ever enrolled in.', 'When nearby construction disturbs a spiritual resting place, its disgruntled denizens do what any supernatural beings would do after a rude awakening: they terrorize the local school. And that means it’s up to a scruffy band of young ghostbusters to expel their satanic schoolmates before everyone gets sent to permanent detention! So join Satsuki, her crybaby brother, the resident class stud, the school nerd and "physical researcher," a born-again beauty, and a resentful, demon-possessed cat in the funniest, scariest school you’ve ever enrolled in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9muUVVBl5gpBzZTGUmvjzKWUge9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35466'),
  ('3243989330046377', 'Ghost Story', 1972, 'Drama, Mystery', 'William Castle, Richard Matheson', null, null, 'NR', 'Ghost Story is an American television anthology series that aired for one season on NBC from 1972 to 1973. Executive-produced by William Castle, it initially featured supernatural entities such as ghosts, vampires, and witches. By mid-season, low ratings led to a shift -- for the most part -- away from paranormal themes and a title change to Circle of Fear.', 'Ghost Story is an American television anthology series that aired for one season on NBC from 1972 to 1973. Executive-produced by William Castle, it initially featured supernatural entities such as ghosts, vampires, and witches. By mid-season, low ratings led to a shift -- for the most part -- away from paranormal themes and a title change to Circle of Fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJHLiAWFv77qHwLt6kvcPoexrut.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26051'),
  ('719459905398108618', 'Ghost Sweeper GS Mikami', 1993, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kazuyuki Sogabe, Nobuo Tobita, Michie Tomizawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Hirohiko Kakegawa, Ryo Horikawa, Maria Kawamura, Kumiko Nishihara', null, 'Overdevelopment and crowding in Japan has forced many of its indigenous spirits and ghosts to lose their homes. Due to problems caused by the homeless spirits, a new profession was created, the Ghost Sweepers (GS). Private exorcists for hire, they serve only the highest bidder to survive in the cutthroat corporate world. Among this, the Mikami GS Company, led by 20-year-old Reiko Mikami and her two assistants, the 17-year-old boy Tadao Yokoshima and the ghost girl Okinu, is said to be the best.', 'Overdevelopment and crowding in Japan has forced many of its indigenous spirits and ghosts to lose their homes. Due to problems caused by the homeless spirits, a new profession was created, the Ghost Sweepers (GS). Private exorcists for hire, they serve only the highest bidder to survive in the cutthroat corporate world. Among this, the Mikami GS Company, led by 20-year-old Reiko Mikami and her two assistants, the 17-year-old boy Tadao Yokoshima and the ghost girl Okinu, is said to be the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ajmgm9d0CewrUeyUSRsoRc68Eb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46390'),
  ('552652273627421574', 'Ghost Wars', 2017, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Simon Barry, Mathias Herndl', null, 'Avan Jogia, Kim Coates, Luvia Petersen', 'TV-14', 'Set in a remote Alaskan town that has been overrun by paranormal forces, the series focuses on local outcast Roman Mercer who must overcome the town’s prejudices and his own personal demons if he’s to harness his repressed psychic powers and save everyone from the mass haunting that’s threatening to destroy them all.', 'Set in a remote Alaskan town that has been overrun by paranormal forces, the series focuses on local outcast Roman Mercer who must overcome the town’s prejudices and his own personal demons if he’s to harness his repressed psychic powers and save everyone from the mass haunting that’s threatening to destroy them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdOWk4uAKXXPBdyLd54ejmbzpVP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72752'),
  ('730908108135616830', 'Ghost Whisperer', 2005, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'John Gray', null, 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Camryn Manheim, Jamie Kennedy, Connor Gibbs, David Conrad', 'TV-PG', 'Newlywed Melinda Gordon tries to help the dead communicate with loved ones, but sometimes the messages she receives are intense and confusing. Most of Melinda''s efforts involve resolving conflicts that are preventing the spirits from passing over.', 'Newlywed Melinda Gordon tries to help the dead communicate with loved ones, but sometimes the messages she receives are intense and confusing. Most of Melinda''s efforts involve resolving conflicts that are preventing the spirits from passing over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZtGupUFaHhws7mOcwhNTtRpRHC.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1606'),
  ('1134302075563271104', 'Ghostbusters', 1986, 'Mystery, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Marc Richards', null, 'Lou Scheimer, Alan Oppenheimer, Pat Fraley, Susan Blu, Linda Gary, Erika Scheimer, Peter Cullen', 'TV-Y7', 'Jake Kong Jr. and Eddie Spencer Jr. are sons of the original Ghost Busters, and they work alongside Tracy the Gorilla (who also worked with their fathers). Together, they are dedicated to ridding the world of the evil ghost wizard Prime Evil and his cast of henchmen.', 'Jake Kong Jr. and Eddie Spencer Jr. are sons of the original Ghost Busters, and they work alongside Tracy the Gorilla (who also worked with their fathers). Together, they are dedicated to ridding the world of the evil ghost wizard Prime Evil and his cast of henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCFVXOKruQ5Rt5Pv87si2LcnmRU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18131'),
  ('962954352809280396', 'Ghosted', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Tom Gormican', null, 'Craig Robinson, Ally Walker, Amber Stevens West, Adam Scott, Brian Huskey, Adeel Akhtar', 'TV-14', 'A skeptic is forced to work with a firm believer of the paranormal on unexplained occurrences in Los Angeles.', 'A skeptic is forced to work with a firm believer of the paranormal on unexplained occurrences in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sH6dEC1m7Ar43BeZU0NVl20gpV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71739'),
  ('603375176950897091', 'Ghosts', 2019, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mathew Baynton, Simon Farnaby, Laurence Rickard', null, 'Charlotte Ritchie, Kiell Smith-Bynoe, Mathew Baynton, Simon Farnaby, Martha Howe-Douglas, Jim Howick, Laurence Rickard, Ben Willbond', 'TV-14', 'A cash-strapped young couple inherits a grand country house, only to find it is both falling apart and teeming with the ghosts of former inhabitants.', 'A cash-strapped young couple inherits a grand country house, only to find it is both falling apart and teeming with the ghosts of former inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Xz4JtqISyVCKct96O94k4Mz5sU.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:17174'),
  ('737646169193983973', 'Ghosts', 2021, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joe Port, Joe Wiseman', null, 'Rose McIver, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Brandon Scott Jones, Danielle Pinnock, Richie Moriarty, Asher Grodman, Rebecca Wisocky, Sheila Carrasco', 'TV-14', 'Samantha and Jay throw caution to the wind when they convert their recently inherited country estate into a bed-and-breakfast. Call it mislaid plans. Not only is the place falling apart, but it’s also inhabited by spirits of previous residents -- whom only Samantha can see and hear.', 'Samantha and Jay throw caution to the wind when they convert their recently inherited country estate into a bed-and-breakfast. Call it mislaid plans. Not only is the place falling apart, but it’s also inhabited by spirits of previous residents -- whom only Samantha can see and hear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yBQYa6AdvMY5H9CiAv0HkvF3UE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:126027'),
  ('909096381920139793', 'Ghosts', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Eva Holtmann', 'Yves Hensel, Aylin Kockler', 'Cristina do Rego, Benito Bause, Jan van Weyde, Max Giermann, Antje Widdra, Meltem Kaptan, Sebastian Schwarz, Sina Tkotsch', null, 'Young couple Emma and Felix inherit an old mansion and decide to turn it into a hotel, but after a near-death accident, Emma begins seeing ghosts.', 'Young couple Emma and Felix inherit an old mansion and decide to turn it into a hotel, but after a near-death accident, Emma begins seeing ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OY5yZRENENthOFfvMsx1xeUaHr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256084'),
  ('694690071145687584', 'Ghosts of Beirut', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lior Raz, Avi Issacharoff, Greg Barker', null, 'Dina Shihabi, Amir Khoury, Ned Bellamy', 'TV-MA', 'Told from the American, Israeli and Lebanese perspectives, discover one of the greatest espionage stories of modern times: the manhunt for Imad Mughniyeh, the elusive Lebanese terrorist who outwitted his adversaries in the CIA and Mossad for over two decades.', 'Told from the American, Israeli and Lebanese perspectives, discover one of the greatest espionage stories of modern times: the manhunt for Imad Mughniyeh, the elusive Lebanese terrorist who outwitted his adversaries in the CIA and Mossad for over two decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w40j5uqjJIUvRSP5zJ7Q5qRdNRs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224009'),
  ('626400137287370', 'Ghostwriter', 1992, 'Mystery, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Liz Nealon', null, 'Marcella Lowery, William Hernandez, Blaze Berdahl, Todd Alexander Cohen, Melissa Gonzalez, Spike Lee, Sheldon Turnipseed, Tram-Anh Tran', 'TV-Y', 'Ghostwriter is an American television program created by Liz Nealon and produced by the Children''s Television Workshop and BBC One. It began airing on PBS on October 4, 1992, and the final episode aired on February 13, 1995. The series revolves around a close knit circle of friends from Brooklyn who solve neighborhood crimes and mysteries as a team of young detectives with the help of an invisible ghost named Ghostwriter. Ghostwriter can communicate with the kids only by manipulating whatever text and letters he can find and using them to form words and sentences. The series was filmed on location in Fort Greene, Brooklyn.', 'Ghostwriter is an American television program created by Liz Nealon and produced by the Children''s Television Workshop and BBC One. It began airing on PBS on October 4, 1992, and the final episode aired on February 13, 1995. The series revolves around a close knit circle of friends from Brooklyn who solve neighborhood crimes and mysteries as a team of young detectives with the help of an invisible ghost named Ghostwriter. Ghostwriter can communicate with the kids only by manipulating whatever text and letters he can find and using them to form words and sentences. The series was filmed on location in Fort Greene, Brooklyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1enj0PMkMBUtRYbWZbfsmv7DUrO.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3925'),
  ('1001217211764474184', 'Ghostwriter', 2019, 'Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Princess K. Mapp, Nour Assaf, Daire McLeod, Lisa Berry', 'TV-G', 'When a ghost haunts a neighborhood bookstore and starts releasing fictional characters into the real world, a group of friends team up to solve an exciting mystery surrounding the ghost''s unfinished business.', 'When a ghost haunts a neighborhood bookstore and starts releasing fictional characters into the real world, a group of friends team up to solve an exciting mystery surrounding the ghost''s unfinished business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cylPAXqLws5yM9oJa47MsHItBy8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93520'),
  ('1068644444714777597', 'GHOUL', 2018, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Patrick Graham', null, 'Radhika Apte, Manav Kaul, Rohit Pathak, Ratnabali Bhattacharjee', 'TV-MA', 'A newly minted military interrogator arrives at a covert detention center to discover that some of the terrorists held there are not of this world.', 'A newly minted military interrogator arrives at a covert detention center to discover that some of the terrorists held there are not of this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3cbfNl77zK7XhFMNpdbxy0B7gW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80707'),
  ('1048399860950945547', 'Ghum Hai Kisikey Pyaar Meiin', 2020, 'Drama, Soap, Family', 'Leena Gangopadhyay', null, null, null, 'Sai Joshi, a fearless girl who aspires to become a doctor, marries an IPS officer, Virat Chavan, pretending to be a deal. The story revolves around the life of Sai in orthodox joint family of Virat and how Sai and Virat fall in love.', 'Sai Joshi, a fearless girl who aspires to become a doctor, marries an IPS officer, Virat Chavan, pretending to be a deal. The story revolves around the life of Sai in orthodox joint family of Virat and how Sai and Virat fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3NVGYCpkAgBArXogLuHPfpSNwG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111453'),
  ('70454420670103563', 'GialappaShow', 2023, 'Reality', 'Marco Santin, Lucio Wilson, Giorgio Gherarducci', null, 'Giorgio Gherarducci, Marco Santin, Michele Foresta, Marcello Cesena, Alessandro Betti, Brenda Lodigiani, Ubaldo Pantani, Toni Bonji', null, 'Marco Santin and Giorgio Gherarducci - supported in the studio by Mago Forest, a great cast of comedians and many surprise guests - comment with biting irony on the most popular TV programs, the main sporting events and the last web trends.', 'Marco Santin and Giorgio Gherarducci - supported in the studio by Mago Forest, a great cast of comedians and many surprise guests - comment with biting irony on the most popular TV programs, the main sporting events and the last web trends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gczG92zbCmVDI2ahOpchGzr6895.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:226680'),
  ('343449442875692248', 'Giant Beasts of ARS', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hina Youmiya, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Yu Serizawa, Hiromu Mineta, Yoko Hikasa, Asami Seto, Wakana Kuramochi, Ryota Takeuchi', 'TV-14', 'Jiro, who makes his living hunting beasts, encounters Kuumi, who is on the run, and saves her. As rumors spread regarding humanity and a mysterious experiment, they seek to discover the world’s secrets together.', 'Jiro, who makes his living hunting beasts, encounters Kuumi, who is on the run, and saves her. As rumors spread regarding humanity and a mysterious experiment, they seek to discover the world’s secrets together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MyHJxDQQdzaV290BlXyzR2VN6p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211093'),
  ('102410829157290541', 'Giant Killing', 2010, 'Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Takahiro Mizushima, Ryotaro Okiayu, Daisuke Ono, Tokuyoshi Kawashima, Masumi Asano, Taiten Kusunoki, Taketoshi Kawano', null, 'Giant Killing follows a ragtag bunch from East Tokyo who are struggling in Japan''s top football league. Nearing the bottom, they have lost 5 matches in a row which hasn''t done much to team morale. Even with the fan''s turning their backs on the team, it seems as if the end is near. East Tokyo United can only blame their coach right now. However, their Coach is going to do something drastic to prove to his team and fans, that against the biggest club in the nation, he can make this team win...', 'Giant Killing follows a ragtag bunch from East Tokyo who are struggling in Japan''s top football league. Nearing the bottom, they have lost 5 matches in a row which hasn''t done much to team morale. Even with the fan''s turning their backs on the team, it seems as if the end is near. East Tokyo United can only blame their coach right now. However, their Coach is going to do something drastic to prove to his team and fans, that against the biggest club in the nation, he can make this team win...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnzTdetoQt6S9KblPcSWqeaxjXn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46668'),
  ('157768832878749742', 'Giant Robo: The Day the Earth Stood Still', 1992, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mitsuteru Yokoyama', null, 'Koichi Chiba, Yûji Mikimoto, Kappei Yamaguchi, Yosuke Akimoto, Takeshi Aono, Kazue Komiya, Shinji Ogawa, Iemasa Kayumi', null, 'Dr. Shizuma invented a revolutionary new form of renewable energy drive but had to pay a heavy price for his success in a catastrophic accident that the world wants to forget. 10 years later the secret organization Big Fire have obtained two of three mysterious Shizuma drives as part of their world domination plans. The third drive has however been taken by Dr. Shizuma who during his escape is saved by Giant Robo. A desperate struggle begins between the Giant Robo and Big Fire for the control of the last drive as Big Fire unleashes their ultimate weapon, the Eye of Volger.', 'Dr. Shizuma invented a revolutionary new form of renewable energy drive but had to pay a heavy price for his success in a catastrophic accident that the world wants to forget. 10 years later the secret organization Big Fire have obtained two of three mysterious Shizuma drives as part of their world domination plans. The third drive has however been taken by Dr. Shizuma who during his escape is saved by Giant Robo. A desperate struggle begins between the Giant Robo and Big Fire for the control of the last drive as Big Fire unleashes their ultimate weapon, the Eye of Volger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6RAeajCWAw9BOCDuCZ2Ib1qSD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69212'),
  ('1022693121977370069', 'Giants', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Manuel Gancedo', null, 'Juan Carlos Librado (Nene), Yolanda Torosio, Elisabet Gelabert, Jose Coronado, Sofía Oria, Daniel Grao, Isak Férriz, Xenia Tostado', 'TV-MA', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn1IyyEPyQaIbpqUlUBp1Ce94Wb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82533'),
  ('686032808597888649', 'Gibiate', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Yukiyo Fujii, Hiroki Touchi, Michio Hazama, Shuichi Ikeda, Hiroki Nanami, Hiromi Sakimoto, Emi Itou', null, 'In 2030, Japan. A virus has infected humans throughout the world. Infected people turn into different forms of monsters based on their ages, sexes and races. The virus is named ''Gibia'' - after being rich in variety like gibia. Just then, a pair of samurai and ninja appeared in such a blighted wasteland of Japan. They both traveled from the early Edo period, fighting together with help from a doctor who tries to find cure for Gibia. Facing ceaseless attacks from Gibias, and outlaws that attack travelers for food, they start the dangerous journey with enemies all around.', 'In 2030, Japan. A virus has infected humans throughout the world. Infected people turn into different forms of monsters based on their ages, sexes and races. The virus is named ''Gibia'' - after being rich in variety like gibia. Just then, a pair of samurai and ninja appeared in such a blighted wasteland of Japan. They both traveled from the early Edo period, fighting together with help from a doctor who tries to find cure for Gibia. Facing ceaseless attacks from Gibias, and outlaws that attack travelers for food, they start the dangerous journey with enemies all around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AaCfEMkJlKxiFLchVmhJi7eDzb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94388'),
  ('54869622475824298', 'Gidget', 1965, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Don Porter, Sally Field, Betty Conner, Lynette Winter', 'TV-G', 'Gidget is an American sitcom about a surfing, boy-crazy teenager called "Gidget" and her widowed father Russ Lawrence, a UCLA professor. Sally Field stars as Gidget with Don Porter as father Russell Lawrence. The series was first broadcast on ABC from September 15, 1965 to April 21, 1966. Gidget was among the first regularly scheduled color programs on ABC, but did poorly in the Nielsen ratings and was cancelled at the end of its first season.', 'Gidget is an American sitcom about a surfing, boy-crazy teenager called "Gidget" and her widowed father Russ Lawrence, a UCLA professor. Sally Field stars as Gidget with Don Porter as father Russell Lawrence. The series was first broadcast on ABC from September 15, 1965 to April 21, 1966. Gidget was among the first regularly scheduled color programs on ABC, but did poorly in the Nielsen ratings and was cancelled at the end of its first season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrE03wqilfHppMB39VvHrCW6oNs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1580'),
  ('838901712152618749', 'GIFT', 2026, 'Drama', null, 'Tomoki Kanazawa', 'Shinichi Tsutsumi, Yuki Yamada, Kasumi Arimura, Michiko Kichise, Ken Yasuda, Kyoya Honda, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Kanata Hosoda', null, 'A reclusive genius astrophysicist takes on the challenge of transforming a struggling wheelchair rugby team into Japan’s champions, discovering teamwork, resilience, and purpose along the way.', 'A reclusive genius astrophysicist takes on the challenge of transforming a struggling wheelchair rugby team into Japan’s champions, discovering teamwork, resilience, and purpose along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crvnpQzcoizFzJrOnoqIUiD3lKw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314647'),
  ('396697500804697289', 'Gigantosaurus', 2019, 'Kids, Family, Animation', 'Nicolas Sedel, Fernando Worcel, Franck Salomé', null, 'Dylan Schombing, Áine Sunderland, Nahanni Mitchell, Nicholas Holmes', 'TV-G', 'Four curious young dinosaur friends explore the mystery of Gigantosaurus, the largest, fiercest dinosaur of all, facing their individual fears and working together to solve problems during their many adventures.', 'Four curious young dinosaur friends explore the mystery of Gigantosaurus, the largest, fiercest dinosaur of all, facing their individual fears and working together to solve problems during their many adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QE0FexhD5IZ6IaTyHLYzRMYUot.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88910'),
  ('851463507867760412', 'Gigolos', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Nick Hawk, Brace Land, Vin Armani, Ash Armand, Bradley Lords', 'TV-MA', 'Make a date with the Gigolos. An extremely rare and uncensored look into the personal and professional lives of five hot guys in Vegas who like to hang out, have fun and get girls, but in their case they get paid for it. They find themselves in some unexpected positions as they balance relationships, friends and family with the demands of their female clientele. A reality series like no other, Gigolos is not only provocative but also surprisingly heartfelt. It''s a wild ride for these real-life escorts who never miss a trick.', 'Make a date with the Gigolos. An extremely rare and uncensored look into the personal and professional lives of five hot guys in Vegas who like to hang out, have fun and get girls, but in their case they get paid for it. They find themselves in some unexpected positions as they balance relationships, friends and family with the demands of their female clientele. A reality series like no other, Gigolos is not only provocative but also surprisingly heartfelt. It''s a wild ride for these real-life escorts who never miss a trick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipCI4xoficgRV0Owj1noL3Gw30H.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:38953'),
  ('446222628345654379', 'Gij Weet', 2025, 'Reality, Talk', null, null, 'Hakim Chatar, Soukaïna Bennani, Patricia De Herdt', null, '"Gij Weet" is the new show where Wiam, Hakim Chatar, and Soukaïna Bennani throw their algorithms out there every week: from TikTok to YouTube and everything in between. Along with a guest, they delve into what popped up in their feeds that week: viral videos, controversial posts, trending topics, and anything that stuck while scrolling.', '"Gij Weet" is the new show where Wiam, Hakim Chatar, and Soukaïna Bennani throw their algorithms out there every week: from TikTok to YouTube and everything in between. Along with a guest, they delve into what popped up in their feeds that week: viral videos, controversial posts, trending topics, and anything that stuck while scrolling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OZAu86qoPXBxrpRYBvkPVrWVZX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:298743'),
  ('83207908079773073', 'Gilded Chopsticks', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wong Wai-Sing', null, 'Stephanie Ho, Wong Cho-Lam, Ben Wong Chi-Yin, Joey Man Yee-Man, Nancy Wu, Jack Wu, Ram Chiang Chi-Kwong, Louis Cheung', null, 'Ko Tin Bo had been an experienced eater since youth, he knows everything about food and the taste as soon as it goes into his mouth. Unfortunately due to a family crisis he and his loyal follower Lee Wai were forced to wander the streets and made a living off selling buns. Because of food, Tin Bo met a female street entertainer Gei Mo Suet, the Capital''s most beautiful woman Lin Yeuk Bik and female chef Mai Siu Yue. It is also because of fate that he encountered the Fourth Royal Prince Yan Chan who discovered his talent and recommended him to the palace to work as a palace chef. In the palace, Tin Bo meets his old enemy Choi Hok Ting and set off a series of battles in the kitchen. Tin Bo also didn''t know he was getting himself involved in the Eighth Royal Prince Yan Yik''s evil plot.', 'Ko Tin Bo had been an experienced eater since youth, he knows everything about food and the taste as soon as it goes into his mouth. Unfortunately due to a family crisis he and his loyal follower Lee Wai were forced to wander the streets and made a living off selling buns. Because of food, Tin Bo met a female street entertainer Gei Mo Suet, the Capital''s most beautiful woman Lin Yeuk Bik and female chef Mai Siu Yue. It is also because of fate that he encountered the Fourth Royal Prince Yan Chan who discovered his talent and recommended him to the palace to work as a palace chef. In the palace, Tin Bo meets his old enemy Choi Hok Ting and set off a series of battles in the kitchen. Tin Bo also didn''t know he was getting himself involved in the Eighth Royal Prince Yan Yik''s evil plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhFQ0lPPtDnBns72CaMFjY0IDAB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88389'),
  ('745010625028534985', 'Gilgamesh', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sanae Kobayashi, Chie Nakamura, Shigeru Shibuya, Akiko Kimura, Keiji Fujiwara, Mitsuki Saiga, Kae Araki, Daisuke Namikawa', 'TV-14', 'Set in a future where the sky has been changed into a giant mirror, two teenage children are caught in a struggle between a group of super-powered beings and a mysterious woman''s team of children aiming to stop them.', 'Set in a future where the sky has been changed into a giant mirror, two teenage children are caught in a struggle between a group of super-powered beings and a mysterious woman''s team of children aiming to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub3XhOLioxmxcCRwCf35SGdOlg9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26107'),
  ('859879592727886549', 'Gilligan''s Island', 1964, 'Comedy, Family', 'Sherwood Schwartz', null, 'Bob Denver, Alan Hale Jr., Jim Backus, Natalie Schafer, Tina Louise, Dawn Wells, Russell Johnson', 'TV-G', 'The slapstick adventures of hapless Gilligan, long-suffering Skipper and their gang of mismatched castaways, all stranded on an uncharted desert isle after their tiny ship hit stormy weather.', 'The slapstick adventures of hapless Gilligan, long-suffering Skipper and their gang of mismatched castaways, all stranded on an uncharted desert isle after their tiny ship hit stormy weather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PjIzzCh43hNU77C8oKLdL7XXge.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1921'),
  ('146827783631978216', 'Gilmore Girls', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amy Sherman-Palladino', null, 'Lauren Graham, Alexis Bledel, Scott Patterson, Melissa McCarthy, Keiko Agena, Yanic Truesdale, Liza Weil, Sean Gunn', 'TV-14', 'Set in the charming town of Stars Hollow, Connecticut, the series follows the captivating lives of Lorelai and Rory Gilmore, a mother/daughter pair who have a relationship most people only dream of.', 'Set in the charming town of Stars Hollow, Connecticut, the series follows the captivating lives of Lorelai and Rory Gilmore, a mother/daughter pair who have a relationship most people only dream of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwtzCwU2wdLLf8oejQu2TINiWfQ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4586'),
  ('713769713418445372', 'Gilmore Girls: A Year in the Life', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Amy Sherman-Palladino', null, 'Lauren Graham, Alexis Bledel, Scott Patterson, Kelly Bishop', 'TV-14', 'Set nearly a decade after the finale of the original series, this revival follows Lorelai, Rory and Emily Gilmore through four seasons of change.', 'Set nearly a decade after the finale of the original series, this revival follows Lorelai, Rory and Emily Gilmore through four seasons of change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vqjelflnBJAsfRWRQVGDkGfCFb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68799'),
  ('525374091862961509', 'Gimme a Break!', 1981, 'Comedy, Family', 'Morton Lachman, Sy Rosen', null, 'Nell Carter, Lara Jill Miller, John Hoyt, Joey Lawrence, Telma Hopkins, Matthew Lawrence, Paul Sand, Rosie O''Donnell', 'TV-G', 'Gimme a Break! is an American sitcom which aired on NBC for six seasons, October 29, 1981, until May 12, 1987. The series stars Nell Carter as the housekeeper for a widowed police chief and his three daughters.', 'Gimme a Break! is an American sitcom which aired on NBC for six seasons, October 29, 1981, until May 12, 1987. The series stars Nell Carter as the housekeeper for a widowed police chief and his three daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiTirUoEoBAJeOtfh2xFpaV3io4.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:5352'),
  ('1026776065511464866', 'Gimme Gimme Gimme', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Harvey', null, 'Kathy Burke, James Dreyfus', null, 'Linda La Hughes shares a flat with Tom Farrell. Linda is overweight, loudmouthed and not particularly attractive. She thinks she''s gorgeous and irrestible, however. She''s also sex mad and obsessed with men. Tom is an aspiring actor. He''s got an agent, but finds it difficult to get parts. He doesn''t like Linda much, in spite of (or perhaps because of) the fact that they share a flat. She isn''t completely comfortable with his homosexuality, perhaps because she finds it difficult to live with a man who doesn''t find her sexually attractive.', 'Linda La Hughes shares a flat with Tom Farrell. Linda is overweight, loudmouthed and not particularly attractive. She thinks she''s gorgeous and irrestible, however. She''s also sex mad and obsessed with men. Tom is an aspiring actor. He''s got an agent, but finds it difficult to get parts. He doesn''t like Linda much, in spite of (or perhaps because of) the fact that they share a flat. She isn''t completely comfortable with his homosexuality, perhaps because she finds it difficult to live with a man who doesn''t find her sexually attractive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tS2V05uCLDH6EU7O3u6aisVbPGe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1995'),
  ('821664778654834415', 'Gin''yuu Mokushiroku Meine Liebe', 2004, 'Animation', null, null, 'Akira Ishida, Takahiro Sakurai, Tomokazu Seki, Soichiro Hoshi, Toshihiko Seki, Takehito Koyasu, Taiten Kusunoki, Takahiro Hirano', null, 'It was 1935, people were afraid of the outbreak of the war. The story began in a beautiful island surrounded by the Arctic Ocean of Europe. There was a boarding school, Rosenstol School, in which young elite students gathered. The story describes the youth of five elite students who were elected to be the top of the school to realize their dreams and ideals.', 'It was 1935, people were afraid of the outbreak of the war. The story began in a beautiful island surrounded by the Arctic Ocean of Europe. There was a boarding school, Rosenstol School, in which young elite students gathered. The story describes the youth of five elite students who were elected to be the top of the school to realize their dreams and ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4ZQC6DLwpIVaT8z0NBJte12KLY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34662'),
  ('1147475257830009057', 'Gingitsune: Messenger Fox of the Gods', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hisako Kanemoto, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kensho Ono, Toshihiko Seki, Chinatsu Akasaki, Ami Koshimizu, Ayumi Fujimura, Hirofumi Nojima', 'TV-14', 'Gintarou is a fox spirit that has been protecting the small Inari temple since the Edo era. Saeki Makoto''s family possesses the power to see the gods'' agent, but the ability is limited to one living relative at a time. When Makoto''s mother passed away while she was still young, Makoto inherited the ability as the sole remaining family member. With the help of fox spirit''s power, Makoto and Gintarou help the people of their community, in spite of their many differences.', 'Gintarou is a fox spirit that has been protecting the small Inari temple since the Edo era. Saeki Makoto''s family possesses the power to see the gods'' agent, but the ability is limited to one living relative at a time. When Makoto''s mother passed away while she was still young, Makoto inherited the ability as the sole remaining family member. With the help of fox spirit''s power, Makoto and Gintarou help the people of their community, in spite of their many differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjJIWtaOL2mzsZmkPfDf0TpgkxG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72911'),
  ('117326787233833345', 'Ginny & Georgia', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sarah Lampert', 'Ayotunde Ifaturoti, Michelle Askew, Zachary Arthur', 'Antonia Gentry, Brianne Howey, Diesel La Torraca, Jennifer Robertson, Felix Mallard, Sara Waisglass, Scott Porter, Raymond Ablack', 'TV-14', 'Free-spirited Georgia and her two kids, Ginny and Austin, move north in search of a fresh start but find that the road to new beginnings can be bumpy.', 'Free-spirited Georgia and her two kids, Ginny and Austin, move north in search of a fresh start but find that the road to new beginnings can be bumpy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOwunzW4dx3n0J5mH40n9jTRSwY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:117581'),
  ('561483685386260221', 'Gintama', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Rie Kugimiya, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Akira Ishida, Fumihiko Tachiki, Kazuya Nakai, Kenichi Suzumura, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-14', 'In a world where aliens have invaded Edo Period Japan, skyscrapers, trains and motor bikes have replaced the simple life of Earth inhabitants. One man however, still carries the soul of a samurai, Gintoki Sakata, otherwise known as Yorozuya Gin-san. As reckless as he is, Gintoki carries his own resolve and is ready to take on any challenge with his fellow companions.', 'In a world where aliens have invaded Edo Period Japan, skyscrapers, trains and motor bikes have replaced the simple life of Earth inhabitants. One man however, still carries the soul of a samurai, Gintoki Sakata, otherwise known as Yorozuya Gin-san. As reckless as he is, Gintoki carries his own resolve and is ready to take on any challenge with his fellow companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7vK8pzZIqhyA8sYmBpWmp9Ae7.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:57041'),
  ('1097843254929946916', 'GINTAMA - Mr. Ginpachi''s Zany Class', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Rie Kugimiya, Satsuki Yukino, Susumu Chiba, Kazuya Nakai, Kenichi Suzumura, Tetsuharu Ota', null, 'Class is in session—and it’s out of control! Sakata Ginpachi teaches Gintama High School’s Class 3-Z, a ragtag bunch of idol otaku, stalkers, mayo guzzlers, sadists, and more. Fights break out, rules are ignored, and sanity is optional. Every day spirals into chaos, but Ginpachi somehow survives it all with nonchalance and almost zero effort. When the bell rings, chaos begins!', 'Class is in session—and it’s out of control! Sakata Ginpachi teaches Gintama High School’s Class 3-Z, a ragtag bunch of idol otaku, stalkers, mayo guzzlers, sadists, and more. Fights break out, rules are ignored, and sanity is optional. Every day spirals into chaos, but Ginpachi somehow survives it all with nonchalance and almost zero effort. When the bell rings, chaos begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx7eCCvOWR9m9dw6LPOGMvFkoZO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222624'),
  ('369860728433616317', 'Gintama 2: The Exceedingly Strange Gintama-chan', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Shun Oguri, Kantarô Nakamura, Ryo Yoshizawa, Yuya Yagira, Fumihiko Tachiki', null, 'The adventures of the Yorozuya gang and their friends.', 'The adventures of the Yorozuya gang and their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TI2ikRMuinLNW5QWUf9C9T8kSB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83072'),
  ('928123453759206584', 'Gintama: Mitsuba Arc', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Shun Oguri, Ryo Yoshizawa, Kie Kitano, Yuya Yagira, Kantarô Nakamura', null, 'Okita’s older sister, Mitsuba, visits the quarters of the Shinsengumi to announce her marriage to the trader Kuraba Toma. The two siblings spend time together. Mitsuba worries that her brother has no friends and in order to assure her, he introduces Sakata Gintoki, who happened to pass by, as his best friend. Meanwhile, there are reports of strange boats going in and out of Edo. Hijikata Toshiro investigates this and it turns out that the incident has an unexpected link to Mitsuba.', 'Okita’s older sister, Mitsuba, visits the quarters of the Shinsengumi to announce her marriage to the trader Kuraba Toma. The two siblings spend time together. Mitsuba worries that her brother has no friends and in order to assure her, he introduces Sakata Gintoki, who happened to pass by, as his best friend. Meanwhile, there are reports of strange boats going in and out of Edo. Hijikata Toshiro investigates this and it turns out that the incident has an unexpected link to Mitsuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmenB1dEZ5tjRDLQdcPORR3okyY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80611'),
  ('930170214609481200', 'Gintama: The Semi-Final', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Rie Kugimiya, Susumu Chiba, Kenichi Suzumura, Kazuya Nakai', 'TV-14', 'As the war temporarily calms down and Edo rebuilds, Gintoki finds Shinpachi—who is still unaware of his return—on a bridge. However, as a fight quickly breaks out between the Yorozuya and the Tenshouin Naraku, suspicion grows, forcing Gintoki to use what is nearest—a loincloth—to mask his identity. Saved for the time being, Gintoki enters the Yorozuya office, but unbeknownst to him, someone else is already waiting there... Meanwhile, Kondou departs Earth to marry Princess Bubbles in an attempt to improve diplomatic relations. After boarding the Gorilla Amanto mother ship, he realizes that he doesn''t speak their language. Confused, Kondou tries conversing with them, only to inadvertently gain their support. However, someone associated with the princess crashes the ongoing ceremony. Will the wedding continue, or has Kondou just been saved from becoming the next Gorilla Prince?', 'As the war temporarily calms down and Edo rebuilds, Gintoki finds Shinpachi—who is still unaware of his return—on a bridge. However, as a fight quickly breaks out between the Yorozuya and the Tenshouin Naraku, suspicion grows, forcing Gintoki to use what is nearest—a loincloth—to mask his identity. Saved for the time being, Gintoki enters the Yorozuya office, but unbeknownst to him, someone else is already waiting there... Meanwhile, Kondou departs Earth to marry Princess Bubbles in an attempt to improve diplomatic relations. After boarding the Gorilla Amanto mother ship, he realizes that he doesn''t speak their language. Confused, Kondou tries conversing with them, only to inadvertently gain their support. However, someone associated with the princess crashes the ongoing ceremony. Will the wedding continue, or has Kondou just been saved from becoming the next Gorilla Prince?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3WpYtOnj6CXwDXz8oSOALdvUvk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114211'),
  ('632626269725621661', 'Giri/Haji', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joe Barton', null, 'Takehiro Hira, Kelly Macdonald, Yosuke Kubozuka, Will Sharpe, Aoi Okuyama, Yuko Nakamura, Katsuya, Tony Pitts', 'TV-MA', 'Family duty sends a lawman to London to look for his mob-assassin brother as a yakuza war threatens to engulf Tokyo. Trust is even tougher to find.', 'Family duty sends a lawman to London to look for his mob-assassin brother as a yakuza war threatens to engulf Tokyo. Trust is even tougher to find.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOeqBvuGOcq0eN1ssGCcRtWA7XW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94659'),
  ('45942217717945837', 'Girl Friend BETA', 2014, 'Animation', null, null, 'Satomi Sato, Kaori Ishihara, Kikuko Inoue, Rina Sato, Sakura Tange, Hitomi Harada, Minako Kotobuki, Ayahi Takagaki', null, 'Shiina Kokomi is a hard working but even tempered high school girl who is the lead performer in her school''s rhythmic gymnastics club. The story follows her and her growing circle of friends as they support each other through the various trials and situations that comprise high school life.', 'Shiina Kokomi is a hard working but even tempered high school girl who is the lead performer in her school''s rhythmic gymnastics club. The story follows her and her growing circle of friends as they support each other through the various trials and situations that comprise high school life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45AsWSHZEnJYaSS3nIIYuOwn1sZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61485'),
  ('750428598566327562', 'Girl from Nowhere', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'SOUR Bangkok', null, 'Chicha Amatayakul', 'TV-MA', 'A mysterious, clever girl named Nanno transfers to different schools, exposing the lies and misdeeds of the students and faculty at every turn.', 'A mysterious, clever girl named Nanno transfers to different schools, exposing the lies and misdeeds of the students and faculty at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hDXqzN5l4lBmEtb8IstXr91k8z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83639'),
  ('831255403615022882', 'Girl from Nowhere: The Reset', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Becky Armstrong', 'TV-MA', 'In a new universe, the mysterious Nanno poses as a transfer student, exposing cruelty by turning power, guilt and desire against those who abuse them.', 'In a new universe, the mysterious Nanno poses as a transfer student, exposing cruelty by turning power, guilt and desire against those who abuse them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRMEjZHvES9XLKSFVCtveFGdOHC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310935'),
  ('1019540320150078034', 'Girl Gun Lady', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sei Shiraishi, Utano Aoi, Anna Ishii, Yuno Ohara, Momoka Ishida, Ai Mikami, Rio Teramoto, Momoka Ito', null, 'Koharu is a dull high school girl who is always alone. Her only hobby is making plastic models. One day, Koharu stops by a mysterious antique shop and purchases a plastic model gun and a toy figure named Alice. After spending the entire night assembling the gun, Koharu wakes up and witnesses bullets flying everywhere in school. She then meets Alice who moves like a human and tells her to get ready for a survival battle called "Girl Gun Fight", where she has to attack her schoolmates with a gun.', 'Koharu is a dull high school girl who is always alone. Her only hobby is making plastic models. One day, Koharu stops by a mysterious antique shop and purchases a plastic model gun and a toy figure named Alice. After spending the entire night assembling the gun, Koharu wakes up and witnesses bullets flying everywhere in school. She then meets Alice who moves like a human and tells her to get ready for a survival battle called "Girl Gun Fight", where she has to attack her schoolmates with a gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUYbbBDncfCMpdd7fnnSow4wSa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122631'),
  ('219652284590516203', 'Girl Meets Bear', 2016, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Natsumi Hioka, Hiroki Yasumoto, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Shizuka Ishigami, Eri Kitamura, Yuko Sanpei', null, 'The anime follows Machi, a middle school student who serves as a shrine maiden at a Shinto shrine and takes care of a bear, who lives on mountain in Japan''s northern Tohoku region. The bear, Natsu, has the ability to talk and is Machi''s guardian. When Machi explains to Natsu that she will attend a school in the city, he gives Machi a set of trials that she must pass in order to be able to survive city life.', 'The anime follows Machi, a middle school student who serves as a shrine maiden at a Shinto shrine and takes care of a bear, who lives on mountain in Japan''s northern Tohoku region. The bear, Natsu, has the ability to talk and is Machi''s guardian. When Machi explains to Natsu that she will attend a school in the city, he gives Machi a set of trials that she must pass in order to be able to survive city life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcvMJHvPlQJOzP5jW57RxkVa85b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65382'),
  ('365745015063585974', 'Girl Meets World', 2014, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michael Jacobs', null, 'Rowan Blanchard, Sabrina Carpenter, Peyton Meyer, Corey Fogelmanis, August Maturo, Ben Savage, Danielle Fishel', 'TV-G', 'The adventures of relatable and adventurous Riley Matthews, the tween daughter of Cory and Topanga Matthews, and her bold best friend Maya as they traverse the twists and turns of teenage years at Manhattan''s John Quincy Adams Middle School where Riley''s dad is their History teacher.', 'The adventures of relatable and adventurous Riley Matthews, the tween daughter of Cory and Topanga Matthews, and her bold best friend Maya as they traverse the twists and turns of teenage years at Manhattan''s John Quincy Adams Middle School where Riley''s dad is their History teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhU1KkPtM9fpE1HKpdghX0VlyYF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46028'),
  ('1140532539065334857', 'Girl Rules', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tipnaree Weerawatnodom, Rachanun Mahawan, Pansa Vosbein, Pattranite Limpatiyakorn, Benyapa Jeenprasom, Rattanawadee Wongtong, Rutricha Phapakithi, Alissa Intusmith', null, 'A friend group descends into chaos as their bonds are tested in a variety of ways, beginning with the return of an ex-girlfriend.', 'A friend group descends into chaos as their bonds are tested in a variety of ways, beginning with the return of an ex-girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHYyeuMfSKTqM5lZgRrpGIZZHsZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278174'),
  ('244055367444140134', 'Girl Taken', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nessah Muthy, Suzanne Cowie, David Turpin', null, 'Tallulah Evans, Delphi Evans, Jill Halfpenny, Alfie Allen, Vikash Bhai, Niamh Walsh, Levi Brown, Victoria Ekanoye', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the story of twin sisters Lily and Abby, whose lives are shattered when Lily is abducted from their quiet rural English town by beloved local teacher Rick Hansen. After years of abuse in captivity, Lily escapes - only to discover that freedom brings its own challenges.', 'Follow the story of twin sisters Lily and Abby, whose lives are shattered when Lily is abducted from their quiet rural English town by beloved local teacher Rick Hansen. After years of abuse in captivity, Lily escapes - only to discover that freedom brings its own challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upUOfPAMhjWDPu8R31r9YvYDfum.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296523'),
  ('49977690122558997', 'Girl''s High', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Masumi Asano, Satsuki Yukino, Sawa Ishige, Hitomi Nabatame, Ai Shimizu, Kyoko Hikami, Mitsuaki Madono', 'TV-14', 'Eriko and her friends Yuma and Ayano are excited about entering high school. Their excitement leads to their breaking of the rules when they toured the school before the opening ceremony. They find out their preconceptions about the all female school may not be as true as they had first thought. Despite that, Eriko and her friends are joined by new friends. They aim to get through high school life together.', 'Eriko and her friends Yuma and Ayano are excited about entering high school. Their excitement leads to their breaking of the rules when they toured the school before the opening ceremony. They find out their preconceptions about the all female school may not be as true as they had first thought. Despite that, Eriko and her friends are joined by new friends. They aim to get through high school life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UCmPslDGsMZkul7rFXZUDTjHTR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28853'),
  ('912807055902489655', 'Girlboss', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Kay Cannon', null, 'Britt Robertson, Alphonso McAuley, Ellie Reed, Johnny Simmons, Dean Norris', 'TV-MA', 'Sophia is a rebellious, broke anarchist who refuses to grow up. She stumbles upon her passion of selling vintage clothes online and becomes an unlikely businesswoman. As she builds her retail fashion empire, she realizes the value and the difficulty of being the boss of her own life.', 'Sophia is a rebellious, broke anarchist who refuses to grow up. She stumbles upon her passion of selling vintage clothes online and becomes an unlikely businesswoman. As she builds her retail fashion empire, she realizes the value and the difficulty of being the boss of her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w60XVdh93UU9k7yyXFItnZkVA5y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65856'),
  ('1101601564254320975', 'Girlfriend', 2020, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', null, 'An Zhi Xiao', 'Lawrence Wong, Xu Hao, Wu Haoze, Bai Xinyi, Tu Bing, Wang Zexuan, Ni Hanjin, Fu Shuyang', null, 'Bit-part actress, Wen Xiao Nuan, is hired to play An Ning Wen Hua''s CEO, Ye Fei Mo''s, secret admirer in order to earn funds to support the Huang Mei Opera group back in her hometown. The two fall in love while pretending to be lovers.', 'Bit-part actress, Wen Xiao Nuan, is hired to play An Ning Wen Hua''s CEO, Ye Fei Mo''s, secret admirer in order to earn funds to support the Huang Mei Opera group back in her hometown. The two fall in love while pretending to be lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WmZtqgS2uhTbD3HvgkA8Xetl7V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101472'),
  ('392826601210532604', 'Girlfriend, Girlfriend', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Ayane Sakura, Azumi Waki, Ayana Taketatsu, Rie Takahashi, Aoi Koga', 'TV-14', 'Naoya Mukai has loved Saki Saki since grade school, and when she finally accepts his feelings, he''s at his happiest. But one day, a cute girl named Nagisa Minase confesses to him! Not wishing to choose only one over another, Naoya chooses to go out with both of them!! What will be of this love triangle that challenges morality itself?', 'Naoya Mukai has loved Saki Saki since grade school, and when she finally accepts his feelings, he''s at his happiest. But one day, a cute girl named Nagisa Minase confesses to him! Not wishing to choose only one over another, Naoya chooses to go out with both of them!! What will be of this love triangle that challenges morality itself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mexwGz6xQ9kw9PMrjw9IJRX0baP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113137'),
  ('412893055028397077', 'Girlfriends', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mara Brock Akil', null, 'Tracee Ellis Ross, Golden Brooks, Persia White, Reggie Hayes, Khalil Kain', 'TV-PG', 'The series revolves around the friendship of four African-American women in different phases of their lives. They explore the many trials and tribulations that most women face today such as relationships, family, friends and other current issues that will interest most women. Whether it’s getting over a divorce, finding a career, or looking for true love, Girlfriends delivers along with comedy and wit.', 'The series revolves around the friendship of four African-American women in different phases of their lives. They explore the many trials and tribulations that most women face today such as relationships, family, friends and other current issues that will interest most women. Whether it’s getting over a divorce, finding a career, or looking for true love, Girlfriends delivers along with comedy and wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buFnsyWEg4pPR7dco5Vbsm6HCIY.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2398'),
  ('879988181704864098', 'Girlfriends'' Guide to Divorce', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marti Noxon', null, 'Lisa Edelstein, Beau Garrett, Alanna Ubach, Necar Zadegan, Retta', null, 'Follows a best-selling author of a self-help book series who is secretly hiding her separation from her husband as she starts to navigate her life as a single woman in her 40''s in Los Angeles. She starts to side with and take advice more from her divorced friends rather than her married ones and it leads her to some unexpected and life-changing experiences.', 'Follows a best-selling author of a self-help book series who is secretly hiding her separation from her husband as she starts to navigate her life as a single woman in her 40''s in Los Angeles. She starts to side with and take advice more from her divorced friends rather than her married ones and it leads her to some unexpected and life-changing experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIK9Z4LVurR2C9KgmexWGbOzYh4.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62187'),
  ('1035007348937746583', 'Girlish Number', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayaka Senbongi, Kaede Hondo, Yui Ishikawa, Eri Suzuki, Saori Onishi, Kazuya Nakai, Takuya Eguchi, Yuuichirou Umehara', null, 'College student Chitose Karasuma is determined not to do boring things as she enters the adult world. To this end, this bad-mannered beauty barges into a facility that trains would-be voice actors and actresses, somehow landing a job at “Number One Produce,” a seiyuu agency managed by her older brother, Gojo. In Chitose''s mind, she''s poised for greatness, but finds herself at a loss when she continues to only get minor roles. As she clashes with other girls in the agency, including a cunning airhead and a girl with a Kansai accent, Chitose is about to learn that there''s more to succeeding in this competitive industry than she imagined.', 'College student Chitose Karasuma is determined not to do boring things as she enters the adult world. To this end, this bad-mannered beauty barges into a facility that trains would-be voice actors and actresses, somehow landing a job at “Number One Produce,” a seiyuu agency managed by her older brother, Gojo. In Chitose''s mind, she''s poised for greatness, but finds herself at a loss when she continues to only get minor roles. As she clashes with other girls in the agency, including a cunning airhead and a girl with a Kansai accent, Chitose is about to learn that there''s more to succeeding in this competitive industry than she imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRc2keh1AJGlwqKvDtzFpzXTYsc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68403'),
  ('446443639372261396', 'Girls', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lena Dunham', null, 'Lena Dunham, Allison Williams, Zosia Mamet, Jemima Kirke, Adam Driver', 'TV-MA', 'The assorted humiliations, disasters and rare triumphs of four very different twenty-something girls: Hannah, an aspiring writer; Marnie, an art gallery assistant and cousins Jessa and Shoshanna.', 'The assorted humiliations, disasters and rare triumphs of four very different twenty-something girls: Hannah, an aspiring writer; Marnie, an art gallery assistant and cousins Jessa and Shoshanna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikyT3hnELofnYRsPIqVGgUhDbOT.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:42282'),
  ('547485556983607778', 'Girls Band Cry', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Rina, Yuri, Mirei, Natsu, Shuri', 'TV-14', 'Nina Iseri drops out of high school and moves to Tokyo by herself. In front of the station in the suburbs of Tokyo, Nina sees Momo Kawaragi singing alone and is touched by the power of music. Nina decides to form a band with Momo, Subaru Awasu, a girl who hides her true feelings, Tomo Ebutsuka, who was abandoned by her parents, and Rupa, a lonely girl without any family...', 'Nina Iseri drops out of high school and moves to Tokyo by herself. In front of the station in the suburbs of Tokyo, Nina sees Momo Kawaragi singing alone and is touched by the power of music. Nina decides to form a band with Momo, Subaru Awasu, a girl who hides her true feelings, Tomo Ebutsuka, who was abandoned by her parents, and Rupa, a lonely girl without any family...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/al3Q1yrhBN4A1GBLCwpgnq3RSka.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241928'),
  ('371596860930844731', 'Girls Beyond the Wasteland', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Satomi Akesaka, Kana Hanazawa, Seiichiro Yamashita, Haruka Chisuga, Satomi Sato', null, 'Buntarou doesn''t know what he wants to do in the future. He does not have any kind of dream that he wants to pursue, so currently he just spends his days hanging around with his friends. One day, his classmate Sayuki asks him if he wants to help with development of a gal game. She says that she had become interested in his help after she read one of his works intended for the drama club. Buntarou doesn''t know anything about gal games, but Sayuki claims that she has the ability to make it a success. Can they make the game, and will it be a success like she claims it will be? This is the story of youths taking a daring step into the unknown...', 'Buntarou doesn''t know what he wants to do in the future. He does not have any kind of dream that he wants to pursue, so currently he just spends his days hanging around with his friends. One day, his classmate Sayuki asks him if he wants to help with development of a gal game. She says that she had become interested in his help after she read one of his works intended for the drama club. Buntarou doesn''t know anything about gal games, but Sayuki claims that she has the ability to make it a success. Can they make the game, and will it be a success like she claims it will be? This is the story of youths taking a daring step into the unknown...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJLi6OVKefgr6rVihfXx7zOi28U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65661'),
  ('895241967217774521', 'Girls Bravo', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Ayaka Saito, Ayako Kawasumi, Masayo Kurata, Yuki Matsuoka, Tomoko Kaneda', 'TV-MA', 'Small for his age, Yukinari has been bullied and abused by girls all his life. Now in high school, he has developed a rare condition: whenever girls touch him, or even come close, he breaks out in hives. Imagine his surprise, when he is suddenly transported to the city of Seiren on a mystic world invisibly orbiting the Earth, and populated with vast numbers of women and very few men. Fortunately, he has a new friend, Miharu-chan, whose touch inexplicably doesn''t affect him.', 'Small for his age, Yukinari has been bullied and abused by girls all his life. Now in high school, he has developed a rare condition: whenever girls touch him, or even come close, he breaks out in hives. Imagine his surprise, when he is suddenly transported to the city of Seiren on a mystic world invisibly orbiting the Earth, and populated with vast numbers of women and very few men. Fortunately, he has a new friend, Miharu-chan, whose touch inexplicably doesn''t affect him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oi1AruNAkgzKRn47muIP6Bq8iK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34793'),
  ('129518921291126134', 'Girls Dorm', 2022, null, 'Wang Bin, Zhou Bin', null, null, null, 'Adult animation about four girls, one dorm room, and a lifetime of hormones, heartbreak, and friendship.', 'Adult animation about four girls, one dorm room, and a lifetime of hormones, heartbreak, and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuRvvdiHT3iyiPowdKDZhKarhkj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:214961'),
  ('623034751268780615', 'Girls from Ipanema', 2019, 'Drama', 'Giuliano Cedroni, Heather Roth', null, 'Maria Casadevall, Pathy Dejesus, Larissa Nunes, Mel Lisboa, Leandro Lima, Ícaro Silva, Gustavo Machado, Alexandre Cioletti', 'TV-MA', 'A 1950s housewife goes to Rio de Janeiro to meet up with her husband, only to learn he''s deserted her, but decides to stay and open a bossa nova club.', 'A 1950s housewife goes to Rio de Janeiro to meet up with her husband, only to learn he''s deserted her, but decides to stay and open a bossa nova club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3S7O45AR4kEHoGpmGy9NZQ24KH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86943'),
  ('334666864471542649', 'Girls Incarcerated', 2018, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An eight-part documentary series that goes behind the scenes at Madison Juvenile Correctional Facility in Indiana, where teenage girls struggle to overcome their troubled pasts and find hope for the future.', 'An eight-part documentary series that goes behind the scenes at Madison Juvenile Correctional Facility in Indiana, where teenage girls struggle to overcome their troubled pasts and find hope for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l693WXpW8Zc8RaAovfvBAwNEFSH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77700'),
  ('315033151680927896', 'Girls Planet 999', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Yeo Jin-goo, Tiffany Young, SUNMI, Kim Chae-hyun, Huening Bahiyyih, Choi Yu-jin, Kim Dayeon, Seo Young-eun', null, 'In order to realize their dreams of becoming super idols, girls from China, South Korea, and Japan gather at the [Girl''s Planet]. A virtual world where the girls unite as one regardless of their backgrounds. Fans around the world are also connected to this world to witness the birth of a new generation of international girl band. Which of these girls will make it to the global debut?', 'In order to realize their dreams of becoming super idols, girls from China, South Korea, and Japan gather at the [Girl''s Planet]. A virtual world where the girls unite as one regardless of their backgrounds. Fans around the world are also connected to this world to witness the birth of a new generation of international girl band. Which of these girls will make it to the global debut?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHRmru9EIfDYLNprW8Y9JsA3fD1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129289'),
  ('366533343636746666', 'Girls und Panzer', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Mai Fuchigami, Ai Kayano, Ozaki Mami, Ikumi Nakagami, Yuka Iguchi, Misato Fukuen, Mikako Takahashi, Kana Ueda', null, 'In this world, Sensha-do (戦車道), the art of tank-combat, is a traditional Japanese martial art for girls. Miho, a girl who just transferred into the Ōrai Girls'' Academy in Ibaraki Prefecture, has been ordered by the academy''s student council chairperson to join the school team and compete in the national Sensha-do championships.', 'In this world, Sensha-do (戦車道), the art of tank-combat, is a traditional Japanese martial art for girls. Miho, a girl who just transferred into the Ōrai Girls'' Academy in Ibaraki Prefecture, has been ordered by the academy''s student council chairperson to join the school team and compete in the national Sensha-do championships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKEgErh0c9ljzHyODohZWzapI9U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43967'),
  ('47966559975724586', 'Girls'' Last Tour', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tsukumizu, Takaharu Ozaki', null, 'Yurika Kubo, Inori Minase', 'TV-14', 'Civilization is dead, but Chito and Yuuri are still alive. So they hop aboard their beloved Kettenkrad motorbike and aimlessly wander the ruins of the world they once knew. Day after hopeless day, they look for their next meal and fuel for their ride. But as long as the two are together, even an existence as bleak as theirs has a ray or two of sunshine in it, whether they''re sucking down their fill of soup or hunting for machine parts to tinker with. For two girls in a world full of nothing, the experiences and feelings the two share give them something to live for.', 'Civilization is dead, but Chito and Yuuri are still alive. So they hop aboard their beloved Kettenkrad motorbike and aimlessly wander the ruins of the world they once knew. Day after hopeless day, they look for their next meal and fuel for their ride. But as long as the two are together, even an existence as bleak as theirs has a ray or two of sunshine in it, whether they''re sucking down their fill of soup or hunting for machine parts to tinker with. For two girls in a world full of nothing, the experiences and feelings the two share give them something to live for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEtkOaiI759zfO6YT4PiNmrbtv4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74185'),
  ('363629823699254675', 'Girls5eva', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Meredith Scardino', null, 'Sara Bareilles, Busy Philipps, Paula Pell, Renée Elise Goldsberry', 'TV-MA', 'When a one-hit-wonder girl group from the ''90s gets sampled by a young rapper, its members reunite to give their pop star dreams one more shot. They may be grown women balancing spouses, kids, jobs, debt, aging parents and shoulder pain, but can''t they also be Girls5Eva?', 'When a one-hit-wonder girl group from the ''90s gets sampled by a young rapper, its members reunite to give their pop star dreams one more shot. They may be grown women balancing spouses, kids, jobs, debt, aging parents and shoulder pain, but can''t they also be Girls5Eva?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RplQ2ooky3kONomTNhsptZxqAV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:100350'),
  ('970505948621208472', 'Girly Air Force', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Yuuka Morishima, Hitomi Ohwada, Shiori Izawa, Ryoko Shiraishi, Lynn', null, 'The mysterious flying creatures known as Zai suddenly appear, and in order to fight the creatures, mankind creates fighter aircraft called "Daughters," as well as the automatic fighting mechanism "Anima," which are shaped like human girls. The story centers on a young man named Narutani Kei, who yearns to fly in the sky, and an Anima considered to be humanity''s trump card, a girl name Guripen.', 'The mysterious flying creatures known as Zai suddenly appear, and in order to fight the creatures, mankind creates fighter aircraft called "Daughters," as well as the automatic fighting mechanism "Anima," which are shaped like human girls. The story centers on a young man named Narutani Kei, who yearns to fly in the sky, and an Anima considered to be humanity''s trump card, a girl name Guripen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15m3bZQaAEiTY24JcAAUqIBjE1Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83102'),
  ('257770046213885802', 'given', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shogo Yano, Yuma Uchida, Masatomo Nakazawa, Takuya Eguchi, Fumiya Imai', 'TV-14', 'Ritsuka’s lost his spark for music—until he hears Mafuyu sing. One voice pulls him back in, and suddenly, everything starts to change between them.', 'Ritsuka’s lost his spark for music—until he hears Mafuyu sing. One voice pulls him back in, and suddenly, everything starts to change between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gO4ntuWf5hTUNA76onzA62GVoBf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88040'),
  ('431079130085093177', 'Given', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jin Suzuki, Sanari, Kai Inowaki, Shuntaro Yanagi, Alissa Yagi, So Okuno, Riko Nagase, Ryutaro Yamasaki', null, 'Ritsuka Uenoyama is bored with it all—with school, with his basketball club, and even with his one true passion: playing guitar. That is, until the day he finds his favorite hidden napping spot occupied by a strange boy cradling a broken-stringed guitar. At first, Uenoyama is nonplussed by Mafuyu Satō and his slightly odd behavior, but when, on a whim, he asks Mafuyu to sing, the power of that song pierces him to the core.', 'Ritsuka Uenoyama is bored with it all—with school, with his basketball club, and even with his one true passion: playing guitar. That is, until the day he finds his favorite hidden napping spot occupied by a strange boy cradling a broken-stringed guitar. At first, Uenoyama is nonplussed by Mafuyu Satō and his slightly odd behavior, but when, on a whim, he asks Mafuyu to sing, the power of that song pierces him to the core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6j3DxwqF28aPUlJ3BQAzRbI6niU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126409'),
  ('613820790488451490', 'GJ Club', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Yume Miyamoto, Sumire Uesaka, Chika Arakawa, Hiro Shimono, Suzuko Mimori', 'TV-14', 'Within the old school building of a certain high school, is the clubroom of the GJ (Good Job) Club, into which Shinomiya Kyouya finds himself forcibly conscripted. The other members are: Mao, the short and egotistical president; Megumi, Mao''s sister who''s as generous as an angel; Shion, a genius lacking in common sense; and Kirara, who is perpetually hungry.', 'Within the old school building of a certain high school, is the clubroom of the GJ (Good Job) Club, into which Shinomiya Kyouya finds himself forcibly conscripted. The other members are: Mao, the short and egotistical president; Megumi, Mao''s sister who''s as generous as an angel; Shion, a genius lacking in common sense; and Kirara, who is perpetually hungry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFxEsG6k4ewBwwjI2jU2obewmBw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55016'),
  ('23696686298110689', 'Gladiators', 1992, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'John Seru, Suzanne Cox, Eunice Huthart, Ulrika Jonsson, Michael Willson, Warren Furman, Jeremy Guscott, Jane Omorogbe', null, 'Gladiators is a British television entertainment series, produced by LWT for ITV, and broadcast between 10 October 1992 and 1 January 2000. It is an adaptation of the American format American Gladiators. The success of the British series spawned further adaptations in Australia and Sweden. The series was revived in 2008, before again being cancelled in 2009. The series was originally presented by John Fashanu and Ulrika Jonsson, however, Fashanu was replaced by Jeremy Guscott in 1997. Guscott left the series in 1998, and subsequently, Fashanu returned for the final series in 1999. The series was refereed by John Anderson and the timekeepers over the show''s run were Andrew Norgate, Derek Redmond and Eugene Gilkes. John Sachs was the show''s commentator, and the series was accompanied by its own group of cheerleaders, known as G-Force. Despite being made by London Weekend Television, all episodes of Gladiators, International Gladiators, the second series of The Ashes and the first series of The Springbok Challenge were recorded at the National Indoor Arena in Birmingham. The first series of The Ashes and the second series of the The Springbok Challenge, however, were filmed on the sets of the Australian and South African versions of the shows respectively. The series also spawned a version for children, entitled Gladiators: Train 2 Win, which was broadcast on CITV between 1995 and 1998.', 'Gladiators is a British television entertainment series, produced by LWT for ITV, and broadcast between 10 October 1992 and 1 January 2000. It is an adaptation of the American format American Gladiators. The success of the British series spawned further adaptations in Australia and Sweden. The series was revived in 2008, before again being cancelled in 2009. The series was originally presented by John Fashanu and Ulrika Jonsson, however, Fashanu was replaced by Jeremy Guscott in 1997. Guscott left the series in 1998, and subsequently, Fashanu returned for the final series in 1999. The series was refereed by John Anderson and the timekeepers over the show''s run were Andrew Norgate, Derek Redmond and Eugene Gilkes. John Sachs was the show''s commentator, and the series was accompanied by its own group of cheerleaders, known as G-Force. Despite being made by London Weekend Television, all episodes of Gladiators, International Gladiators, the second series of The Ashes and the first series of The Springbok Challenge were recorded at the National Indoor Arena in Birmingham. The first series of The Ashes and the second series of the The Springbok Challenge, however, were filmed on the sets of the Australian and South African versions of the shows respectively. The series also spawned a version for children, entitled Gladiators: Train 2 Win, which was broadcast on CITV between 1995 and 1998.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkFimwvAkx76Y6eEdIgWSOuSyJP.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2461'),
  ('565558394379776073', 'Glamorous', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jordon Nardino', null, 'Kim Cattrall, Miss Benny, Jade Payton, Zane Phillips, Michael Rosen, Ayesha Harris, Graham Parkhurst, Lisa Gilroy', 'TV-MA', 'Aspiring influencer Marco lands a dream job with a makeup mogul and begins a dazzling journey of self-discovery amid work chaos and romantic challenges.', 'Aspiring influencer Marco lands a dream job with a makeup mogul and begins a dazzling journey of self-discovery amid work chaos and romantic challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ERKin2VLIbhZp0vuepdmen8uCG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205166'),
  ('698055275710923369', 'Glass Heart', 2025, 'Drama', 'Kensaku Kakimoto, Kohtaro Goto', null, 'Takeru Satoh, Yu Miyazaki, Keita Machida, Jun Shison, Masaki Suda, Erika Karata, Akari Takaishi, Pistol Takehara', 'TV-14', 'An aspiring drummer suddenly loses her spot in the band. But when a brilliant musician recruits her for his new band, her life takes a passionate turn.', 'An aspiring drummer suddenly loses her spot in the band. But when a brilliant musician recruits her for his new band, her life takes a passionate turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8Ox2gMtjvav2luHSQ7xdJXnmPn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247670'),
  ('576567349518323104', 'Glass Mask', 2005, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Sanae Kobayashi, Megumi Toyoguchi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Toshiko Fujita, Akiko Yajima, Ayumi Kinoshita, Fumiko Orikasa, Iemasa Kayumi', null, 'Her father passed away very early and her mother lives and works in a crowded Chinese restaurant. Kitajima Maya, a 13-year old girl, has to carry the burden of making ends meet as she fights against her ill fate. However, she is able to overcome the trials and tribulations in her life with her passion and enthusiasm. She happens to encounter the reclusive actress Tsukikage who decides to train and mould her into the foremost actress of her generation.', 'Her father passed away very early and her mother lives and works in a crowded Chinese restaurant. Kitajima Maya, a 13-year old girl, has to carry the burden of making ends meet as she fights against her ill fate. However, she is able to overcome the trials and tribulations in her life with her passion and enthusiasm. She happens to encounter the reclusive actress Tsukikage who decides to train and mould her into the foremost actress of her generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fM5Pp5PjpBkCParrCAj41ebF3uq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35175'),
  ('120860830106517431', 'Glasslip', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Daiki Yamashita, Seria Fukagawa, Ryota Osaka, Saori Hayami, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Risa Taneda, Ai Kayano, Nao Toyama', null, 'What if you hold the power to hear the voices or see fragments of images from the future? Would that be a good thing or a bad thing? Glasslip follows the life of Touko Fukami, an aspiring glass artist born from a glass artisan family. She enjoys her worry-free life in Fukui, save for the fragments of images that she sees on occasion. On her 18th summer, she meets the transfer student Kakeru Okikura at her school, and then again at her favorite café called Kazemichi together with all four of her friends. The voices from the future lead Kakeru to Touko, and his arrival disrupts her mediocre existence. All six of the friends must face their most unforgettable summer full of hope, affection, and heartache.', 'What if you hold the power to hear the voices or see fragments of images from the future? Would that be a good thing or a bad thing? Glasslip follows the life of Touko Fukami, an aspiring glass artist born from a glass artisan family. She enjoys her worry-free life in Fukui, save for the fragments of images that she sees on occasion. On her 18th summer, she meets the transfer student Kakeru Okikura at her school, and then again at her favorite café called Kazemichi together with all four of her friends. The voices from the future lead Kakeru to Touko, and his arrival disrupts her mediocre existence. All six of the friends must face their most unforgettable summer full of hope, affection, and heartache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1EOJveSrU2zUyA0bReOBrXJ46r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69606'),
  ('716908414677978085', 'Glee', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ryan Murphy, Ian Brennan, Brad Falchuk', null, 'Lea Michele, Chris Colfer, Matthew Morrison, Jane Lynch, Dot-Marie Jones, Chord Overstreet, Darren Criss, Amber Riley', 'TV-14', 'In this musical comedy, optimistic high school teacher Will Schuester tries to refuel his own passion while reinventing the high school''s glee club and challenging a group of outcasts to realize their star potential as they strive to outshine their singing competition while navigating the cruel halls of McKinley High.', 'In this musical comedy, optimistic high school teacher Will Schuester tries to refuel his own passion while reinventing the high school''s glee club and challenging a group of outcasts to realize their star potential as they strive to outshine their singing competition while navigating the cruel halls of McKinley High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62T2vsZYTje3KhdCsiLR1K1RFJW.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1417'),
  ('1014393386028504725', 'Gleipnir', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Nao Toyama, Kana Hanazawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Miku Ito, Yoshiaki Hasegawa, Shizuka Ishigami, Hiroki Yasumoto', 'TV-14', 'Shuichi Kagaya is an ordinary high school kid in a boring little town. But when a beautiful classmate is caught in a warehouse fire, he discovers a mysterious power: he can transform into a furry dog with an oversized revolver and a zipper down his back. He saves the girl’s life, sharing his secret with her. But she’s searching for the sister who killed her family, and she doesn’t care how degrading it gets: she will use Shuichi to accomplish her mission…', 'Shuichi Kagaya is an ordinary high school kid in a boring little town. But when a beautiful classmate is caught in a warehouse fire, he discovers a mysterious power: he can transform into a furry dog with an oversized revolver and a zipper down his back. He saves the girl’s life, sharing his secret with her. But she’s searching for the sister who killed her family, and she doesn’t care how degrading it gets: she will use Shuichi to accomplish her mission…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF1kUIoyL2dxPGGsxNXYrkrAPs2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96203'),
  ('964680233197732471', 'Glenn Martin, DDS', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Michael Eisner, Eric Fogel, Alex Berger', null, 'Kevin Nealon, Catherine O''Hara, Judy Greer, Jackie Clarke, Peter Oldring, Jennette McCurdy, Elijah Wood', null, 'Glenn Martin, DDS is an American-Canadian stop-motion-animated television series that premiered on Nick at Nite on August 17, 2009. The series was produced by Tornante Animation in association with Cuppa Coffee Studio. Glenn Martin, DDS was Nick at Nite''s fourth original series. The show premiered on March 18, 2010 on Sky1 in the UK and Ireland. Season two premiered on June 11, 2010. The show ended on November 7th, 2011.', 'Glenn Martin, DDS is an American-Canadian stop-motion-animated television series that premiered on Nick at Nite on August 17, 2009. The series was produced by Tornante Animation in association with Cuppa Coffee Studio. Glenn Martin, DDS was Nick at Nite''s fourth original series. The show premiered on March 18, 2010 on Sky1 in the UK and Ireland. Season two premiered on June 11, 2010. The show ended on November 7th, 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecOHyZvLWWumvw7vnzM5AuZyxis.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:19156'),
  ('162127420492864448', 'Glina', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Maciej Stuhr, Jacek Braciak', null, 'A tough, stubborn and devoid of illusions cop in a story of love, hatred, death and human emotions, so strong that they push people to crime.', 'A tough, stubborn and devoid of illusions cop in a story of love, hatred, death and human emotions, so strong that they push people to crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sjBWg5y43zZxeyY8XKBkHswy2q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:53633'),
