  ('1081295052508652343', 'Glory', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Zhou Mo', 'Hou Minghao, Gulnezer Bextiyar, Chen Ruoxuan, Zhao Yiqin, Zhang Nan', null, 'After being framed in an old murder case, rising magistrate Lu Jianglai loses everything. Rescued by tea magnate’s daughter Rong Shanbao, he is forced into servitude as part of her revenge. As they navigate power struggles and hidden agendas, they uncover secrets, solve mysteries, and transform the tea trade—ultimately forging an unexpected bond that changes their fates.', 'After being framed in an old murder case, rising magistrate Lu Jianglai loses everything. Rescued by tea magnate’s daughter Rong Shanbao, he is forced into servitude as part of her revenge. As they navigate power struggles and hidden agendas, they uncover secrets, solve mysteries, and transform the tea trade—ultimately forging an unexpected bond that changes their fates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjbFmKDFjyRntjPcJLnHYCzpFE8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284512'),
  ('103328632009090373', 'Glory Daze', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Walt Becker', null, 'Kelly Blatz, Matt Bush, Drew Seeley, Hartley Sawyer, Callard Harris, Julianna Guill, Tim Jo, James Earl', null, 'Glory Daze is an American comedy-drama television series. The one-hour series revolves around a group of college freshmen who pledge a fraternity in 1986.', 'Glory Daze is an American comedy-drama television series. The one-hour series revolves around a group of college freshmen who pledge a fraternity in 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNx3Bw7YQ03yqjRKxUFF6kDF5Ld.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34300'),
  ('762127545223139942', 'Gloves Come Off', 2012, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Natalie Tong, Selena Lee, Nancy Wu, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan, Katy Kung', null, 'TONG SHAP-YAT enters the underground boxing scene for money and learns Thai boxing with his brother KO WAI-TING in Thailand, a decision he regrets for the rest of his life. In order to turn over a new leaf, he withdraws from the boxing scene and finds himself a job as a security guard at a sports goods company. His outspokenness attracts the attention of his supervisor CHAI PAK-FAI.', 'TONG SHAP-YAT enters the underground boxing scene for money and learns Thai boxing with his brother KO WAI-TING in Thailand, a decision he regrets for the rest of his life. In order to turn over a new leaf, he withdraws from the boxing scene and finds himself a job as a security guard at a sports goods company. His outspokenness attracts the attention of his supervisor CHAI PAK-FAI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8Bii0bPufmO5iRyADgSJMCPbRa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56313'),
  ('376423793648321548', 'GLOW', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Liz Flahive, Carly Mensch', null, 'Alison Brie, Betty Gilpin, Marc Maron, Sydelle Noel, Britney Young, Chris Lowell, Britt Baron, Kate Nash', 'TV-MA', 'In 1980s LA, a crew of misfits reinvent themselves as the Gorgeous Ladies of Wrestling.', 'In 1980s LA, a crew of misfits reinvent themselves as the Gorgeous Ladies of Wrestling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqQlgRgUwVTfbdxe33vfDEMiCa2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70573'),
  ('812124895163617691', 'Glow Up: Britain''s Next Make-Up Star', 2019, 'Reality', 'Michael Fraser', null, 'Val Garland, Dominic Skinner, Leomie Anderson', null, 'A talented cast of aspiring makeup artists live and work together as they attempt to prove their potential to industry professionals from a multitude of worlds from fashion to film. With regular eliminations, the challenges not only test their skills under pressure but also give them the opportunity to unleash their creative vision with jaw-dropping results.', 'A talented cast of aspiring makeup artists live and work together as they attempt to prove their potential to industry professionals from a multitude of worlds from fashion to film. With regular eliminations, the challenges not only test their skills under pressure but also give them the opportunity to unleash their creative vision with jaw-dropping results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEyKgJIvz0S0mniYB1qBtkstjSf.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:87387'),
  ('930450718747658644', 'Glue', 2014, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Jack Thorne', 'Laura Lomas', 'Billy Howle, Callum Turner, Charlotte Spencer, Yasmin Paige, Jordan Stephens, Faye Marsay, Jessie Cave, Tommy McDonnell', 'TV-14', 'Overton is a small, countryside village where farming is its bread and butter and race horses are its beating heart. When the body of a local resident is found under a tractor, destructive forces are unleashed and the entire community is forced to watch their secrets exposed... chilling secrets that will change their particular way of life forever.', 'Overton is a small, countryside village where farming is its bread and butter and race horses are its beating heart. When the body of a local resident is found under a tractor, destructive forces are unleashed and the entire community is forced to watch their secrets exposed... chilling secrets that will change their particular way of life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MEGbAmNF3hoCK7SfbGa42PM4Mi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61380'),
  ('112793146798964939', 'GMTV', 1993, 'News', null, null, 'Anthea Turner, Alison Hammond, Eamonn Holmes, Jamie Rickers', null, 'GMTV is the name of the national Channel 3 breakfast television contractor/licensee, broadcasting in the United Kingdom from 1 January 1993 to 3 September 2010. It became a wholly owned subsidiary of ITV plc in November 2009. Shortly after, ITV plc announced the programme would end. The final edition of GMTV was broadcast on 3 September 2010.', 'GMTV is the name of the national Channel 3 breakfast television contractor/licensee, broadcasting in the United Kingdom from 1 January 1993 to 3 September 2010. It became a wholly owned subsidiary of ITV plc in November 2009. Shortly after, ITV plc announced the programme would end. The final edition of GMTV was broadcast on 3 September 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peQ3blnogd6YXfjqPJOwMx1yOVK.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:27511'),
  ('439694884873188327', 'GNOSIA', 2025, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chika Anzai, Ikumi Hasegawa, Akari Kito, Hiroki Nanami, Asami Seto, Tomokazu Seki, Saori Hayami, Aoi Yuuki', null, 'When a shapeshifting enemy known as Gnosia infiltrates a lone spaceship, the crew has only one way to survive: identify the imposter each day and put them into cryo-sleep. But for Yuri, the day never ends. Trapped in a time loop, she relives the first day of the crisis over and over. To escape, Yuri must uncover the truth behind Gnosia and the time loop itself—before it’s too late.', 'When a shapeshifting enemy known as Gnosia infiltrates a lone spaceship, the crew has only one way to survive: identify the imposter each day and put them into cryo-sleep. But for Yuri, the day never ends. Trapped in a time loop, she relives the first day of the crisis over and over. To escape, Yuri must uncover the truth behind Gnosia and the time loop itself—before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlQHZqADmu6mEsNUo2eA4FffAMt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278604'),
  ('593080813720282820', 'Go Ahead', 2020, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', null, 'Wang Xiongcheng, Shui Qianmo', 'Tan Songyun, Song Weilong, Zhang Xincheng, Tu Songyan, Zhang Xilin, Sun Yi, He Ruixian', null, 'Three friends from troubled families form a unique, lasting bond — but their pasts soon cast a cloud over their lives.', 'Three friends from troubled families form a unique, lasting bond — but their pasts soon cast a cloud over their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75SigmLMhs3x4rA149w2hxT3iXD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107329'),
