  ('914473591335667930', 'Go for It, Nakamura-kun!!', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Yuki Sakakihara, Fairouz Ai, Takuya Eguchi, Tsubasa Sasa, Yukihiro Nozuyama, Atsushi Tamaru, Yume Maihara', null, 'Nakamura falls for his classmate Hirose instantly, but they''ve never spoken. Can his bumbling attempts to say hello lead to a real connection?', 'Nakamura falls for his classmate Hirose instantly, but they''ve never spoken. Can his bumbling attempts to say hello lead to a real connection?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh3OEp0PSrns1QN0jDMfiIC4TBm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274622'),
  ('291325405028561473', 'Go Fridge', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jackson Wang, He Jiong', null, 'Go Fridge is a Chinese cooking show produced by Tencent Video. The rights were bought from South Korean television series Please Take Care of My Refrigerator. In each episode, two guests bring their refrigerators to the filming studio and sit down to talk with the hosts and other chefs. At the end of examining the fridge, a guest selects two chefs to cook a dish for them to eat, they will each have 15 minutes to cook the dishes, with the winner selected only by the guest alone. The chefs must use a randomized extra ingredient to cook with and incorporate in their dishes.', 'Go Fridge is a Chinese cooking show produced by Tencent Video. The rights were bought from South Korean television series Please Take Care of My Refrigerator. In each episode, two guests bring their refrigerators to the filming studio and sit down to talk with the hosts and other chefs. At the end of examining the fridge, a guest selects two chefs to cook a dish for them to eat, they will each have 15 minutes to cook the dishes, with the winner selected only by the guest alone. The chefs must use a randomized extra ingredient to cook with and incorporate in their dishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1hlEFGT3bx29IunJSiZHsryBAr.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:89587'),
  ('753632408373983016', 'Go Go Squid 2: Dt.Appledog''s Time', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mobao Feibao', 'Zhao Xiaolei', 'Hu Yitian, Li Yitong, Wang Anyu, Li Mingde, Xu Lexiao, Pang Hanchen, Wang Keru, Xu Yao', null, 'Ai Qing – also known by her gaming handle Appledog – is one of the top robot combat players in the land. A model professional, smart, and friendly, she has no shortage of fans, among whom is Wu Bai – also known as DT. Under Ai Qing’s tutelage, Wu Bai developed a keen passion for robot war contests and gaming, eventually becoming a star performer in his own right. Now, he has risen to become the robot combat scene’s biggest rising star, captaining a promising new team named Pirate, which threatens to outshine even Ai Qing’s powerful Appledog team. Despite their professional rivalry, the duo has remained close, and their feelings for one another continue to grow, with romance possibly in the cards. The ultimate challenge will come at the annual Robot Combat Competition, where the teams Pirate, Appledog, and others will duke it out for a coveted trophy!', 'Ai Qing – also known by her gaming handle Appledog – is one of the top robot combat players in the land. A model professional, smart, and friendly, she has no shortage of fans, among whom is Wu Bai – also known as DT. Under Ai Qing’s tutelage, Wu Bai developed a keen passion for robot war contests and gaming, eventually becoming a star performer in his own right. Now, he has risen to become the robot combat scene’s biggest rising star, captaining a promising new team named Pirate, which threatens to outshine even Ai Qing’s powerful Appledog team. Despite their professional rivalry, the duo has remained close, and their feelings for one another continue to grow, with romance possibly in the cards. The ultimate challenge will come at the annual Robot Combat Competition, where the teams Pirate, Appledog, and others will duke it out for a coveted trophy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSYbZ9ulAZvCU6URzeBCKpwFR5I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116133'),
  ('125548544644288831', 'Go Go Squid!', 2019, 'Drama', 'Xiang Xu Jing, Gia Lee', 'Mobao Feibao', 'Yang Zi, Li Xian, Lee Hong-chi, Hu Yitian, Li Zefeng, Jiang Peiyao, Wang Zhener, Wang Lejun', null, 'Tong Nian is a genius 19-year-old student with high IQ and low EQ, who is also a famous anime cosplay person and sings well. She’s falls in love at first sight with Han Shang Yan, who is a game genius in the e-sports world and never pays attention to the girls.', 'Tong Nian is a genius 19-year-old student with high IQ and low EQ, who is also a famous anime cosplay person and sings well. She’s falls in love at first sight with Han Shang Yan, who is a game genius in the e-sports world and never pays attention to the girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWnuIoWFejrYJXeEyJYUH4ILlVo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82817'),
  ('314174674903960141', 'Go On', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Scott Silveri', null, 'Matthew Perry, Laura Benanti, Julie White, Suzy Nakamura, Tyler James Williams, Brett Gelman, John Cho, Tonita Castro', 'TV-PG', 'Ryan King, a recent widower and sports talk radio host ready to get back to work after the loss of his wife. Ryan''s alpha-male boss, Stephen, has a different plan in store for Ryan, making him attend grief counseling before returning to the air. A reluctant Ryan finds himself in a support group for "life change," where he meets an oddball cast of characters, all with their own backstories filled with varying degrees of loss.', 'Ryan King, a recent widower and sports talk radio host ready to get back to work after the loss of his wife. Ryan''s alpha-male boss, Stephen, has a different plan in store for Ryan, making him attend grief counseling before returning to the air. A reluctant Ryan finds himself in a support group for "life change," where he meets an oddball cast of characters, all with their own backstories filled with varying degrees of loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v23Z8R3phUWCTeaHiNme9yepOAG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44987'),
  ('1076075051016452187', 'Go Princess Go', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Xian Cheng', 'Qin Shuang', 'Zhang Tian''ai, Peter Sheng, Yu Menglong, Jiang Qilin, Guo Junchen, Hai Ling, Peng Yuchang, An Yongchang', null, 'Zhang Peng is a playboy who hits his head as he falls into a pool when he''s trying to run away from an ex-girlfriend. He wakes up to find that he''s traveled a thousand years into the past but that''s not even the biggest problem, he woke up as the crown princess, Zhang Peng Peng, of the dynasty. Hilarity ensues as Peng weighs between trying to get back to his time and leveraging his new female identity to seduce all the concubines and women he can. Did I forget to mention the hot crown prince and his equally handsome brother the 9th prince, who eventually fall in love with her.', 'Zhang Peng is a playboy who hits his head as he falls into a pool when he''s trying to run away from an ex-girlfriend. He wakes up to find that he''s traveled a thousand years into the past but that''s not even the biggest problem, he woke up as the crown princess, Zhang Peng Peng, of the dynasty. Hilarity ensues as Peng weighs between trying to get back to his time and leveraging his new female identity to seduce all the concubines and women he can. Did I forget to mention the hot crown prince and his equally handsome brother the 9th prince, who eventually fall in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPHbc0wP54qWa7dmvaFxt5W4uwe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65288'),
  ('971968238810371061', 'Go, Diego, Go!', 2005, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', 'Valerie Walsh, Chris Gifford, Eric Weiner', 'Ligiah Villalobos', 'Jake T. Austin, Rosie Perez, Jose Zelaya', 'TV-Y', 'Go, Diego, Go! is a children''s television series created by Chris Gifferd and Valerie Walsh, and is a spin-off of Dora the Explorer. The show premiered on September 6, 2005 and ended on September 16, 2011 on Nickelodeon. It also aired as part of the Nick Jr. on CBS block from September 17, 2005 to September 9, 2006. On December 20, 2006, Nick Jr. announced that it had ordered twenty new episodes that were in production. Since April 2008, the show has been dubbed into Spanish and airs in the United States on Univision as part of their Planeta U block.', 'Go, Diego, Go! is a children''s television series created by Chris Gifferd and Valerie Walsh, and is a spin-off of Dora the Explorer. The show premiered on September 6, 2005 and ended on September 16, 2011 on Nickelodeon. It also aired as part of the Nick Jr. on CBS block from September 17, 2005 to September 9, 2006. On December 20, 2006, Nick Jr. announced that it had ordered twenty new episodes that were in production. Since April 2008, the show has been dubbed into Spanish and airs in the United States on Univision as part of their Planeta U block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xn3U14CzlMJZdYRqIj36afpjsQl.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1647'),
  ('90410493753700145', 'Go, Dog. Go!', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', 'Adam Peltzman', null, 'Michela Luci, Callum Shoniker, Martin Roach, David Berni, Anand Rajaram, Linda Ballantyne, Patrick McKenna, Katie Griffin', 'TV-Y', 'Handy and inventive pup Tag chases adventure with her best pal, Scooch, solving problems and helping the citizens of Pawston along the way.', 'Handy and inventive pup Tag chases adventure with her best pal, Scooch, solving problems and helping the citizens of Pawston along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHwkhQZ8YpHS3Wz7EWUzwp5WEpR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:117162'),
  ('891717001987732428', 'Go! Anpanman', 1988, 'Animation, Kids', 'Takashi Yanase', null, 'Keiko Toda, Ryusei Nakao, Koichi Yamadera', 'NR', 'Anpanman is a superhero who dedicates himself to the cause of justice, aiding the plight of unfortunate souls. Anpanman will go anywhere to help anyone in trouble, to drive away villains, and to save people from starvation by allowing them to eat his face. What? Let his face be eaten? No need to worry. His face is made with sweet anpan (bread filled with bean jam), hence the name Anpanman. Anpanman''s very life depends on allowing others to eat, and once eaten, Anpanman can restore himself endlessly. He does not look handsome or strong, but he never fears any adventure and is continuously flying to aid the hungry people and the children with difficulties. Anpanman is the hero of the new age, glowing with friendship, endeavour and justice.', 'Anpanman is a superhero who dedicates himself to the cause of justice, aiding the plight of unfortunate souls. Anpanman will go anywhere to help anyone in trouble, to drive away villains, and to save people from starvation by allowing them to eat his face. What? Let his face be eaten? No need to worry. His face is made with sweet anpan (bread filled with bean jam), hence the name Anpanman. Anpanman''s very life depends on allowing others to eat, and once eaten, Anpanman can restore himself endlessly. He does not look handsome or strong, but he never fears any adventure and is continuously flying to aid the hungry people and the children with difficulties. Anpanman is the hero of the new age, glowing with friendship, endeavour and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz2Hzfbgdh6lGV0gMbzYZRpKPX.jpg', 38, 'tmdb:tv:56389'),
  ('1028237283033791024', 'Go! Go! Loser Ranger!', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Daishi Kajita', 'TV-PG', 'With their old hideout and bosses wiped out, the surviving Dusters make a secret agreement with the Ranger Force to engage in the weekly Sunday Showdown - one where they will always be defeated. Tired of this charade, Fighter D finally steps up to make a change once and for all!', 'With their old hideout and bosses wiped out, the surviving Dusters make a secret agreement with the Ranger Force to engage in the weekly Sunday Showdown - one where they will always be defeated. Tired of this charade, Fighter D finally steps up to make a change once and for all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xLqRhNM41Xv0UZRZsHBhsnB1lx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215799'),
  ('894568028976049049', 'Go! Live Your Way', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sebastian Mellino', null, 'Pilar Pascual, José Giménez-Zapiola, Renata Toscano Bruzón, Santiago Saez, Gastón Ricaud, Simón Hempe, Carolina Domenech, Manuel Ramos', null, 'Charismatic Mía gets a scholarship to an elite performing arts school, where she makes close friends but clashes with the owner''s popular daughter.', 'Charismatic Mía gets a scholarship to an elite performing arts school, where she makes close friends but clashes with the owner''s popular daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyauJ4fUOdMdsWlBX9NfNm22M68.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87024'),
  ('784197631656073426', 'Go! Princess PreCure', 2015, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Family, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yu Shimamura, Masumi Asano, Hibiku Yamamura, Miyuki Sawashiro, Nao Toyama, Shiho Kokido, Haruka Yoshimura, Mayumi Shintani', null, 'Go! Princess PreCure is set in a boarding junior high school, named Noble Academy. The protagonist Haruka Haruno is a 13-year-old first-year student. Her big dream is to be a princess someday because she admired a princess in the picture book she has kept since her childhood. One day, she transforms into Cure Flora with the "Dress Up Key" which Prince Kanata of Hope Kingdom gave her as a good luck charm when she was little. Then she also finds other Pretty Cure girls in her school, 14-year-old Minami Kaidou as Cure Mermaid and 13-year-old Kirara Amanogawa as Cure Twinkle. As the Princess Pretty Cure team, with two fairies Pafu and Aroma, they fight against the dark witch Dyspear, who hates all the dreams in the world and wants to turn them to despair.', 'Go! Princess PreCure is set in a boarding junior high school, named Noble Academy. The protagonist Haruka Haruno is a 13-year-old first-year student. Her big dream is to be a princess someday because she admired a princess in the picture book she has kept since her childhood. One day, she transforms into Cure Flora with the "Dress Up Key" which Prince Kanata of Hope Kingdom gave her as a good luck charm when she was little. Then she also finds other Pretty Cure girls in her school, 14-year-old Minami Kaidou as Cure Mermaid and 13-year-old Kirara Amanogawa as Cure Twinkle. As the Princess Pretty Cure team, with two fairies Pafu and Aroma, they fight against the dark witch Dyspear, who hates all the dreams in the world and wants to turn them to despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVwqlyJ6oqk4eRXYR7QIccFJ8pd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62569'),
  ('152186748474119074', 'Goblin Slayer', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuuichirou Umehara, Yui Ogura, Nao Toyama, Yuka Iguchi, Maaya Uchida, Yuichi Nakamura, Tomokazu Sugita, Aya Endo', 'TV-MA', '"I''m not saving the world. I just kill goblins." Rumor has it that, in a certain guild in the middle of nowhere, there is an extraordinary man who has climbed all the way to the Silver rank just by killing goblins. At the same guild, a priestess who''s just become a new adventurer has formed her first party... and the man who ends up rescuing that party when they get into trouble is none other than the Goblin Slayer.', '"I''m not saving the world. I just kill goblins." Rumor has it that, in a certain guild in the middle of nowhere, there is an extraordinary man who has climbed all the way to the Silver rank just by killing goblins. At the same guild, a priestess who''s just become a new adventurer has formed her first party... and the man who ends up rescuing that party when they get into trouble is none other than the Goblin Slayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8ZQyxAFjz9jtCGivbOMYUC4Tp3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82591'),
  ('334386904500503741', 'God Eater', 2015, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryuichi Kijima, Hiroaki Hirata, Kazuya Nakai, Sayaka Ohara, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Maaya Sakamoto', 'TV-14', 'In the early 2050s, unknown life forms called “Oracle cells” begin their uncontrolled consumption of all life on Earth. Their ravenous appetite and remarkable adaptability earn them first dread, then awe, and finally the name “aragami”. In the face of an enemy completely immune to conventional weapons, urban civilization collapses, and each day humanity is driven further and further toward extinction. One single ray of hope remains for humanity. Following the development of “God Arcs”—living weapons which incorporate Oracle cells—their wielders are organized into an elite force.', 'In the early 2050s, unknown life forms called “Oracle cells” begin their uncontrolled consumption of all life on Earth. Their ravenous appetite and remarkable adaptability earn them first dread, then awe, and finally the name “aragami”. In the face of an enemy completely immune to conventional weapons, urban civilization collapses, and each day humanity is driven further and further toward extinction. One single ray of hope remains for humanity. Following the development of “God Arcs”—living weapons which incorporate Oracle cells—their wielders are organized into an elite force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5H2XJUqkuLdhoYAxUOpa3NYLo8T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62773'),
  ('876120244132012412', 'God Friended Me', 2018, 'Drama, Family, Mystery, Comedy', 'Bryan Wynbrandt, Steven Lilien', null, 'Brandon Micheal Hall, Violett Beane, Suraj Sharma, Javicia Leslie, Joe Morton, Erica Gimpel', 'TV-PG', 'A self-proclaimed "pesky atheist" is encouraged to help strangers by someone claiming to be God who friends him on Facebook.', 'A self-proclaimed "pesky atheist" is encouraged to help strangers by someone claiming to be God who friends him on Facebook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2LsYYVniqK95fKHid85x2kngRT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81114'),
  ('607938106488479339', 'God of Lost Fantasy', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Peter Sheng, Wang Ziwen, Tang Jingmei, Wu Peirou, Chang Cheng, Lin Cheng, Zhang Yao, Huang Zheng', null, 'Qin Wentian, seeking revenge for his family''s murder, joins a renowned martial arts sect. There, he meets a former crown prince ousted by his brother’s coup and teams up with the master’s daughter to help restore the prince’s rightful place.', 'Qin Wentian, seeking revenge for his family''s murder, joins a renowned martial arts sect. There, he meets a former crown prince ousted by his brother’s coup and teams up with the master’s daughter to help restore the prince’s rightful place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUsLapZMVMsuYWCcMPUluh3XTCM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108369'),
  ('384951767983201164', 'God, the Devil and Bob', 2000, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Matthew Carlson', null, 'James Garner, Alan Cumming, French Stewart, Laurie Metcalf, Kath Soucie, Nancy Cartwright, Jeff Doucette', 'TV-14', 'God strikes a wager with the Devil: if just one person can convince him that the world is worth saving, he''ll spare humanity from destruction, if not, God will scrap all of creation and start over. The Devil is allowed to choose the candidate, and true to form, he picks the least likely person to determine the fate of the world--self-centered, slow-witted Detroit autoworker Bob Alman, an icon of mediocrity. Reluctantly, Bob accepts God''s challenge, and has to live a decent life with no hints from God and constant temptation from the Devil. Caught between the forces of divinity and deviance, with the weight of the world on his shoulders, there''s nothing left to do but laugh.', 'God strikes a wager with the Devil: if just one person can convince him that the world is worth saving, he''ll spare humanity from destruction, if not, God will scrap all of creation and start over. The Devil is allowed to choose the candidate, and true to form, he picks the least likely person to determine the fate of the world--self-centered, slow-witted Detroit autoworker Bob Alman, an icon of mediocrity. Reluctantly, Bob accepts God''s challenge, and has to live a decent life with no hints from God and constant temptation from the Devil. Caught between the forces of divinity and deviance, with the weight of the world on his shoulders, there''s nothing left to do but laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSpUzhklRGKcBgeuDdAxsOuizCs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3511'),
  ('53814219827323376', 'God''s Favorite Idiot', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Ben Falcone', null, 'Ben Falcone, Melissa McCarthy, Kevin Dunn, Usman Ally, Steve Mallory, Chris Sandiford, Ana Scotney', 'TV-MA', 'Clark Thompson, a midlevel tech-support employee, finds love with co-worker Amily Luck at exactly the same time he becomes the unwitting messenger of God. Also, there''s rollerskating, a lake of fire and an impending apocalypse.', 'Clark Thompson, a midlevel tech-support employee, finds love with co-worker Amily Luck at exactly the same time he becomes the unwitting messenger of God. Also, there''s rollerskating, a lake of fire and an impending apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lCe1vzmHvKCHLFz2tYYoArux1Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114201'),
  ('1109532067779014114', 'God''s Gift - 14 Days', 2014, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Ran', 'Lee Bo-young, Cho Seung-woo, Oh Min-suk, Kim Yoo-bin, Kim Tae-woo, Jung Gyu-woon, Cha Sun-woo, Han Seon-hwa', null, 'Kim Soo Hyun experiences the unfathomable when her daughter is kidnapped and murdered. Discovering a miraculous ability to go back in time exactly two weeks before the event, Soo Hyun races against the clock to unravel the plot and save her daughter. But when a private investigator sheds new light on the crime, Soo Hyun uncovers a secret far more treacherous than she could have ever imagined.', 'Kim Soo Hyun experiences the unfathomable when her daughter is kidnapped and murdered. Discovering a miraculous ability to go back in time exactly two weeks before the event, Soo Hyun races against the clock to unravel the plot and save her daughter. But when a private investigator sheds new light on the crime, Soo Hyun uncovers a secret far more treacherous than she could have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVstA8C7KN6UqT57MJBO8Qwb5NF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61143'),
  ('958169715863338536', 'God''s Quiz', 2010, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Park Jae-beom', 'Kim Sun-hee', 'Ryu Deok-hwan, Yoon Joo-hee, Park Jun-myun, Kim Jae-won, Park Hyo-ju, Kim Jun-han, Yoon Bo-ra, Kim Ki-doo', null, 'Han Jin Woo, Korea’s top medical examiner, leads a team of experts in conducting a medical crime investigation after strange events and mysterious deaths occur in a hospital. He first clashes with but is later aided by Kang Kyung Hee, an attractive female detective who possesses excellent skill in martial arts and a strong sense of justice.', 'Han Jin Woo, Korea’s top medical examiner, leads a team of experts in conducting a medical crime investigation after strange events and mysterious deaths occur in a hospital. He first clashes with but is later aided by Kang Kyung Hee, an attractive female detective who possesses excellent skill in martial arts and a strong sense of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ap1T5sWayZMbnp9gwgel9Ne6kEh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:42552'),
  ('106090742790864840', 'GODANNAR!!', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mai Nakahara, Takayuki Kondo, Mamiko Noto, Junko Minagawa, Aya Hisakawa, Kaori Shimizu, Akeno Watanabe, Yumi Kakazu', null, 'Five years ago, while battling an alien force, pilot Goh Saruwatari first met Anna Aoi. Today, on the day of their wedding, the ceremony is interrupted when the aliens strike again.', 'Five years ago, while battling an alien force, pilot Goh Saruwatari first met Anna Aoi. Today, on the day of their wedding, the ceremony is interrupted when the aliens strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4k600KdSjhaHkTQ69lhW4IGACB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31711'),
  ('771658233458341805', 'Goddess Bless You from Death', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'MTRD.S', null, 'Krittin Kitjaruwannakul, Naret Promphaopun, Kiettisak Vatanavitsakul, Supakorn Saokhor, Asre Wattanayakul, Phachara Thanakulwuttiporn', null, 'A gifted young man and a rational detective investigate brutal forest murders, uncovering ancient beliefs and dangers that defy all logic.', 'A gifted young man and a rational detective investigate brutal forest murders, uncovering ancient beliefs and dangers that defy all logic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymuCDUc3WdXFGW95lLemBty7mL2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252739'),
  ('1099829611510369134', 'Godfather of Harlem', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Chris Brancato, Paul Eckstein', null, 'Forest Whitaker, Erik LaRay Harvey, Ilfenesh Hadera, Antoinette Crowe-Legacy, Lucy Fry, Michael Raymond-James', 'TV-MA', 'Loosely based on infamous crime boss Bumpy Johnson, who in the early 1960s returned from ten years in prison to find the neighborhood he once ruled in shambles. With the streets controlled by the Italian mob, Bumpy attempts to regain his piece of Harlem.', 'Loosely based on infamous crime boss Bumpy Johnson, who in the early 1960s returned from ten years in prison to find the neighborhood he once ruled in shambles. With the streets controlled by the Italian mob, Bumpy attempts to regain his piece of Harlem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avhyzJycLNi3nXov2lREhDkP3ik.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:79086'),
  ('32543379549382834', 'Góðir Íslendingar', 2026, 'Comedy, Family, Talk', 'Allan Sigurðsson, Hannes Þór Arason, Hannes Þór Halldórsson', null, 'Hildur Vala Baldursdóttir', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6xMnm85viHKXwGzGxEMI607Fg7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317930'),
  ('376271988155389183', 'Godless', 2017, 'Western, Drama', 'Scott Frank', null, 'Jack O''Connell, Michelle Dockery, Scoot McNairy, Merritt Wever, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Tantoo Cardinal, Kim Coates, Sam Waterston', 'TV-MA', 'A ruthless outlaw terrorizes the West in search of a former member of his gang, who’s found a new life in a quiet town populated only by women.', 'A ruthless outlaw terrorizes the West in search of a former member of his gang, who’s found a new life in a quiet town populated only by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePOD0ofGWFDTbZR84QhM7kpYMPX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73467'),
  ('815730849044980662', 'Gods of Honour', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Sze Yu Lau', null, 'Benny Chan Ho-Man, Irene Wan, Chin Ka-Lok, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Yuen Wah, Dickson Lee Kar-Sing, Michelle Ye Xuan, Angela Tong Ying-Ying', 'NR', 'At the end of the Shang Dynasty, King Zhou''s tyranny made life unbearable for the people. Li Jing, one of the dynasty''s most renowned generals, and his wife Yin Shiniang, faced a strange event when their child was born as a ball of flesh. Believing it to be a demon, Li Jing split it open, revealing a two-year-old boy named Nezha. To protect her child, Shiniang sent Nezha to the Nuwa Temple to be raised. Nezha befriended Yang Jian and Lei Zhenzi, and the trio delved into the world of kung fu. Yang Jian''s sister, Yang Lian Hua, fell in love with Nezha at first sight. Meanwhile, King Zhou''s indulgence in beauty and favouritism towards Su Daji led to widespread destruction. Jiang Ziya then led Nezha, Lei Zhenzi, and Yang Jian to persuade King Wen and assist King Wu in leading an army against Zhou. Together, they fought against the injustice.', 'At the end of the Shang Dynasty, King Zhou''s tyranny made life unbearable for the people. Li Jing, one of the dynasty''s most renowned generals, and his wife Yin Shiniang, faced a strange event when their child was born as a ball of flesh. Believing it to be a demon, Li Jing split it open, revealing a two-year-old boy named Nezha. To protect her child, Shiniang sent Nezha to the Nuwa Temple to be raised. Nezha befriended Yang Jian and Lei Zhenzi, and the trio delved into the world of kung fu. Yang Jian''s sister, Yang Lian Hua, fell in love with Nezha at first sight. Meanwhile, King Zhou''s indulgence in beauty and favouritism towards Su Daji led to widespread destruction. Jiang Ziya then led Nezha, Lei Zhenzi, and Yang Jian to persuade King Wen and assist King Wu in leading an army against Zhou. Together, they fought against the injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcMwhWciyGtFLk2xW9oAU4FNLIK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32404'),
  ('141458765811235798', 'Gods'' Games We Play', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Hina Tachibana, Kanna Nakamura, Ami Koshimizu', null, 'In a world of idle gods, humans are forced into brain challenges with them. With three defeats, gods lose their right to challenge, while 10 victories spell human triumph. Fay, determined to achieve the impossible, enters the ultimate test of wits against the gods. Will he defy divinity, or is he just another loss in the making?', 'In a world of idle gods, humans are forced into brain challenges with them. With three defeats, gods lose their right to challenge, while 10 victories spell human triumph. Fay, determined to achieve the impossible, enters the ultimate test of wits against the gods. Will he defy divinity, or is he just another loss in the making?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXirDcJ3wTkpL4tMxEoIMWndFxM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156057'),
  ('86129599760107832', 'Godunov', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Ilya Tilkin', 'Sergei Bezrukov, Svetlana Khodchenkova, Andrey Merzlikin, Darya Ursulyak, Irina Pegova, Vladimir Steklov, Anton Kuznetsov, Aleksandr Semchev', null, 'The TV show is about the Godunov family, which covers the period from the reign of Ivan the Terrible to the accession of Mikhail Romanov to the throne.', 'The TV show is about the Godunov family, which covers the period from the reign of Ivan the Terrible to the accession of Mikhail Romanov to the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OJlKiv1O77fIIknd7giMOcY0DI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83801'),
  ('588749637094808172', 'Godzilla', 1978, 'Family, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Dick Robbins', null, 'Ted Cassidy, Jeff David, Al Eisenmann, Hilly Hicks, Don Messick, Brenda Thompson', null, 'Follow the adventures of the Calico, an ocean going research vessel under the command of Captain Carl Majors and his crew, scientist Dr. Quinn Darien, her teenage nephew Pete, first mate Brock, and the protector of the ship, Godzilla.', 'Follow the adventures of the Calico, an ocean going research vessel under the command of Captain Carl Majors and his crew, scientist Dr. Quinn Darien, her teenage nephew Pete, first mate Brock, and the protector of the ship, Godzilla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnd1AQqxFwhnVYbw0toQ2D8PCH1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5246'),
  ('682029738452411109', 'Godzilla Singular Point', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Yume Miyamoto, Shoya Ishige, Wataru Takagi, Taro Kiuchi, Misaki Kuno, Yohei Azakami, Jin Urayama', 'TV-14', 'Brought together by a mysterious song, a grad student and an engineer lead the fight against an unimaginable force that may spell doom for the world.', 'Brought together by a mysterious song, a grad student and an engineer lead the fight against an unimaginable force that may spell doom for the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thWc7mYiEFFdLyG2fqkeqmL9nrB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111177'),
  ('975914689267585923', 'Godzilla: The Series', 1998, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Jeff Kline, Richard Raynis', null, 'Ian Ziering, Charity James, Brigitte Bako, Rino Romano, Malcolm Danare, Tom Kenny', 'TV-Y7', 'Picking up where the blockbuster motion picture left off, Godzilla: The Series is a fast-paced animated adventure series that pits humanity against a new generation of giant monsters.', 'Picking up where the blockbuster motion picture left off, Godzilla: The Series is a fast-paced animated adventure series that pits humanity against a new generation of giant monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elcF4hnfQ4tx0lmW9tGKDsI3Vct.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11100'),
