  ('1094332870265427029', 'Golden Faith', 2002, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Jessica Hsuan, Deric Wan, Raymond Lam Fung, Michelle Ye Xuan, Paul Chun Pui, Myolie Wu Hang-Yee, Benz Hui Siu-Hung', null, 'Golden Faith is a TVB drama released in 2002 starring a cast that includes a strong mix of new generation actors such as Gallen Lo, Deric Wan, Jessica Hsuan, Raymond Lam, Anne Heung, Myolie Wu, Tavia Yeung and Michelle Ye and old generation powerhouse actors such as Paul Chun, Lau Dan, Shek Sau, Kwok Fung, Lau Kong and Gigi Wong. It is Gallen Lo''s final dramatic epic before he left TVB, Deric Wan''s comeback drama, Myolie Wu''s breakthrough role and Felix Lok''s first major role from random support characters. It is billed as a major production from the makers of At the Threshold of an Era.', 'Golden Faith is a TVB drama released in 2002 starring a cast that includes a strong mix of new generation actors such as Gallen Lo, Deric Wan, Jessica Hsuan, Raymond Lam, Anne Heung, Myolie Wu, Tavia Yeung and Michelle Ye and old generation powerhouse actors such as Paul Chun, Lau Dan, Shek Sau, Kwok Fung, Lau Kong and Gigi Wong. It is Gallen Lo''s final dramatic epic before he left TVB, Deric Wan''s comeback drama, Myolie Wu''s breakthrough role and Felix Lok''s first major role from random support characters. It is billed as a major production from the makers of At the Threshold of an Era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ng0LnzpfCjI6FpfM9VCUIdp5Wj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5712'),
  ('583931387397590626', 'Golden Globe Awards', 1944, 'Reality, Talk', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'An annual awards ceremony recognizing excellence in film and television, both domestic and foreign, bestowed by the Hollywood Foreign Press Association.', 'An annual awards ceremony recognizing excellence in film and television, both domestic and foreign, bestowed by the Hollywood Foreign Press Association.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYG3SHNKui9ps9RfN4u9MMwpy10.jpg', 82, 'tmdb:tv:71494'),
  ('528088349453764816', 'Golden Horse Awards', 1962, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The Taipei Golden Horse Film Festival and Awards (Chinese: 台北金馬影展; pinyin: Táiběi Jīnmǎ Yǐngzhǎn; Pe̍h-ōe-jī: Tâi-pak Kim-má iáⁿ-tián) is a film festival and awards ceremony held annually in Taiwan. It was founded in 1962 by the Government Information Office of the Republic of China (ROC) in Taiwan. The awards ceremony is usually held in November or December in Taipei, although the event has also been held in other locations in Taiwan in recent times', 'The Taipei Golden Horse Film Festival and Awards (Chinese: 台北金馬影展; pinyin: Táiběi Jīnmǎ Yǐngzhǎn; Pe̍h-ōe-jī: Tâi-pak Kim-má iáⁿ-tián) is a film festival and awards ceremony held annually in Taiwan. It was founded in 1962 by the Government Information Office of the Republic of China (ROC) in Taiwan. The awards ceremony is usually held in November or December in Taipei, although the event has also been held in other locations in Taiwan in recent times', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9H3q7q99hIwMFmxaA9pVD8jdoU.jpg', 62, 'tmdb:tv:206296'),
  ('1008571464786084524', 'Golden Kamuy', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chikahiro Kobayashi, Haruka Shiraishi, Takayuki Sugo, Kentaro Ito, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Toshihiko Seki, Jouji Nakata, Kenjiro Tsuda', 'TV-MA', 'A Russo-Japanese War veteran partners with an Ainu girl to find a treasure stolen from her people, but they’re not the only ones pursuing the gold.', 'A Russo-Japanese War veteran partners with an Ainu girl to find a treasure stolen from her people, but they’re not the only ones pursuing the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KjatL82mrWDogOlswIxwdrpe2n.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:76757'),
  ('697238307852031136', 'Golden Kamuy -The Hunt of Prisoners in Hokkaido-', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Mystery', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa, Shigeaki Kubo, Kenji Katagiri', null, 'Kento Yamazaki, Anna Yamada, Gordon Maeda, Yuma Yamoto, Akihisa Shiono, Asuka Kudo, Shuntaro Yanagi, Ryohei Otani', 'TV-MA', 'With two map pieces secured, Sugimoto ans Asirpa continue their hunt for the remaining 22 tattooed convicts whose bodies hold the key to hidden treasure.', 'With two map pieces secured, Sugimoto ans Asirpa continue their hunt for the remaining 22 tattooed convicts whose bodies hold the key to hidden treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itc21vzImGy6zvtbo9TC6BJ6Rvb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259882'),
  ('1075784112319956810', 'Golden Life', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roope Lehtinen, Mikko Pöllä', 'Balázs Lengyel, Virág Zomborácz, István Tasnádi', 'Szabolcs Thuróczy, Eszter Ónodi, Renátó Olasz, Laura Döbrösi, Bakonyi Csilla, Zsolt Anger, Zsolt Végh, Zoltán Rajkai', null, 'Shamed by his father''s dying words, con man Attila Miklosi tries to go straight but eventually succumbs to pressure from his demanding wife Janka and his boss, Endre Hollos, and returns to his life of crime. When his son tries to follow him into the criminal underworld, Attila questions if he will be able to shield the boy.', 'Shamed by his father''s dying words, con man Attila Miklosi tries to go straight but eventually succumbs to pressure from his demanding wife Janka and his boss, Endre Hollos, and returns to his life of crime. When his son tries to follow him into the criminal underworld, Attila questions if he will be able to shield the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioPvkki21jbjR1XYJlWIukqNVK2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64379'),
  ('535642443055271893', 'Golden Marriage', 2007, 'Drama', 'Xiaolong Zheng', 'Wang Wanping', 'Zhang Guoli, Jiang Wenli, Shen Aojun, Lin Yongjian, Li Jingjing, Miao Yiyi, Peng Xinyi, Yu Mingjia', null, 'Spanning decades, this heartfelt drama follows a mismatched couple as they weather family conflicts, heartbreak, and devastating loss.', 'Spanning decades, this heartfelt drama follows a mismatched couple as they weather family conflicts, heartbreak, and devastating loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0GQIOvWP3omQAQ1ok05nTPpZ5i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88124'),
  ('39593696944967664', 'Golden Time', 2013, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yui Horie, Makoto Furukawa, Ai Kayano, Kaito Ishikawa, Ibuki Kido, Takahiro Hikami', 'TV-14', 'Banri Tada is a freshman at a Tokyo law school. After an accident, he suffers severe memory loss. Despite the incident, he befriends fellow freshman, Mitsuo Yanagisawa, which leads him to the beautiful, yet obsessive, Kouko Kaga.', 'Banri Tada is a freshman at a Tokyo law school. After an accident, he suffers severe memory loss. Despite the incident, he befriends fellow freshman, Mitsuo Yanagisawa, which leads him to the beautiful, yet obsessive, Kouko Kaga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HfxpBAOTNbWRemKwaLKNRjzaiy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67389'),
  ('269602437371985727', 'Golden Trio', 2024, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Zhao Dongling', 'Zhang Guoli, Wang Gang, Zhang Tielin, Zhou Tao, Zhang Haowei, Sun Anke, Wang Zijian, Liu Jia', null, 'Xiao Changqing, Sun Qiancheng, and Chen Xincheng worked hard all their lives. After retirement, they finally got together and co-founded a warm retirement community. In the community, they solved problems that elderly people faced, including their own.', 'Xiao Changqing, Sun Qiancheng, and Chen Xincheng worked hard all their lives. After retirement, they finally got together and co-founded a warm retirement community. In the community, they solved problems that elderly people faced, including their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4edgc2TuV3PP7FvFV2zzWDRagNP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233952'),
  ('32926318869045198', 'Golden Years', 1991, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Stephen King', null, 'Felicity Huffman, Bill Raymond, Ed Lauter, R. D. Call, Keith Szarabajka, Frances Sternhagen', null, 'A science lab''s elderly janitor is caught in an explosion and inexplicably begins getting younger, making him a target for a sinister agency.', 'A science lab''s elderly janitor is caught in an explosion and inexplicably begins getting younger, making him a target for a sinister agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4qSLy9jjQr2e7aXyr8RVu07UZb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24404'),
