  ('247570762244042672', 'Good Job', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, '김정애', 'Jung Il-woo, Kwon Yu-ri, Um Mun-suk, Song Sang-eun, Lee Jun-hyeok, Shin Go-eun, Yoo Young-bok, Jo Young-jin', null, 'On Seon-woo is the head of the biggest company in Korea. He also secretly runs a private detective agency. On the other hand, Don Se Ra is a person with extraordinary vision and uses this ability to help people...', 'On Seon-woo is the head of the biggest company in Korea. He also secretly runs a private detective agency. On the other hand, Don Se Ra is a person with extraordinary vision and uses this ability to help people...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjxza7l3Foo9rkxYXFWMQGSn7m6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197072'),
  ('1070088080457192128', 'Good Luck Charlie', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Drew Vaupen, Phil Baker', 'Phil Baker, Drew Vaupen', 'Bridgit Mendler, Leigh-Allyn Baker, Bradley Steven Perry, Mia Talerico, Eric Allan Kramer, Jason Dolley', 'TV-G', 'Teens PJ and Teddy and tween brother Gabe are typical kids -- that is, until their mother has another baby. The arrival of their new sister completely upends the entire household. When their mother heads back to work after Charlie''s birth, it''s up to the kids and their dad to keep the home fires burning -- and to keep Charlie out of trouble as she learns to sit up, crawl, walk and run. Teddy, as the older sister, makes a personalized video diary for Charlie, in each episode adding a nugget of wisdom for her baby sibling.', 'Teens PJ and Teddy and tween brother Gabe are typical kids -- that is, until their mother has another baby. The arrival of their new sister completely upends the entire household. When their mother heads back to work after Charlie''s birth, it''s up to the kids and their dad to keep the home fires burning -- and to keep Charlie out of trouble as she learns to sit up, crawl, walk and run. Teddy, as the older sister, makes a personalized video diary for Charlie, in each episode adding a nugget of wisdom for her baby sibling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyYwkXW1vd3YpiFVlb7y0hgIzuu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:21641'),
  ('531822677628488393', 'Good Luck Girl!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Yumi Uchiyama, Koki Uchiyama, Haruka Tomatsu, Kikuko Inoue, Yoshihisa Kawahara, Hiroshi Naka, Hiro Shimono', 'TV-14', 'Ichiko unwittingly absorbs happiness energy from everyone around her. It’s up to the poverty god Momiji to end Ichiko’s positivity consumption and restore the world’s balance.', 'Ichiko unwittingly absorbs happiness energy from everyone around her. It’s up to the poverty god Momiji to end Ichiko’s positivity consumption and restore the world’s balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3Ldkrr6wNOwhGW8qR6UKIECKzx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45968'),
  ('806210192816814984', 'Good Luck!!', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yumiko Inoue', null, 'Takuya Kimura, Ko Shibasaki, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Hitomi Kuroki, Yasunori Danta, Rina Uchiyama, Naoto Takenaka, Yoon Son-ha', null, 'A young, maverick airline copilot navigates love, ambition and workplace drama while struggling to prove himself worthy of promotion to captain.', 'A young, maverick airline copilot navigates love, ambition and workplace drama while struggling to prove himself worthy of promotion to captain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utl57b7ZOoYI1pWgZuRbVwe8TwC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2146'),
  ('802655545997480009', 'Good Morning America', 1975, 'News, Talk', 'William F. Baker', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Good Morning America is a daily American television show on the ABC television network. The program features news, interviews, weather forecasts, special-interest stories, and segments such as "Pop News" and "Play of the Day". It is produced by ABC News and broadcasts from the Times Square Studios in New York City.', 'Good Morning America is a daily American television show on the ABC television network. The program features news, interviews, weather forecasts, special-interest stories, and segments such as "Pop News" and "Play of the Day". It is produced by ABC News and broadcasts from the Times Square Studios in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axm2r80XQQD8EAKLVJ02n53NP5z.jpg', 52, 'tmdb:tv:556'),
  ('453114626579549196', 'Good Morning Call', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yue Takasuka, Takashi Fujio, Keiko Kanome', null, 'Haruka Fukuhara, Shunya Shiraishi, Dori Sakurada, Yosuke Sugino, Moe Arai, Shugo Nagashima, Koya Nagasawa, Maryjun Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'A high school girl finally gets her own apartment, but she has to share it with the most popular boy in school. No one can know they''re living together.', 'A high school girl finally gets her own apartment, but she has to share it with the most popular boy in school. No one can know they''re living together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/651V944nJJePplsYTA6yH5uZgAD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65693'),
  ('262697604052980933', 'Good Morning, Miss Bliss', 1988, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Sam Bobrick', null, 'Hayley Mills, Dennis Haskins, Joan Ryan, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Max Battimo, Dustin Diamond, Heather Hopper, Lark Voorhies', 'TV-Y7', 'A middle school teacher keeps her personal and professional lives in balance as she helps her students.', 'A middle school teacher keeps her personal and professional lives in balance as she helps her students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iXfRWIhb11hPPQ88fvfxyLVZbD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4683'),
  ('1056109408455824226', 'Good Morning, Verônica', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Raphael Montes', 'Ilana Casoy, Carol Garcia, Davi Kolb', 'Tainá Müller, Rodrigo Santoro, Maitê Proença, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Klara Castanho, Camila Márdila, Adriano Garib, Liza Del Dala', 'TV-MA', 'While hunting for a dating-site predator, an underused cop discovers a husband and wife with a horrific secret — and a web of conspiracy hiding it.', 'While hunting for a dating-site predator, an underused cop discovers a husband and wife with a horrific secret — and a web of conspiracy hiding it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCjXfCDnbO46N0My7rJ23zQ5K1c.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:110115'),
  ('1079062716948873689', 'Good Mythical Morning', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Rhett McLaughlin, Link Neal', null, 'Link Neal, Rhett McLaughlin', 'TV-14', 'Two "Internetainers" (Rhett & Link) go far out and do the weirdest things, giving you a daily dose of casual comedy every Monday-Friday.', 'Two "Internetainers" (Rhett & Link) go far out and do the weirdest things, giving you a daily dose of casual comedy every Monday-Friday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMpBQr2aNOFAI6wsC47zsOG6qOh.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:65701'),
  ('430630331279619871', 'Good News Week', 1996, 'News, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Paul McDermott, Mikey Robins, Claire Hooper', null, 'Good News Week was an Australian satirical panel game show hosted by Paul McDermott that aired from 19 April 1996 to 27 May 2000, and 11 February 2008 to 28 April 2012. The show''s initial run aired on ABC until being bought by Network Ten in 1999. The show was revived for its second run when the 2007–2008 Writers Guild of America strike caused many of Network Ten''s imported US programmes to cease production. Good News Week drew its comedy and satire from recent news stories, political figures, media organisations, and often, aspects of the show itself. The show opened with a monologue by McDermott relating to recent headlines, after which two teams of three panellists competed in recurring segments to gain points. The show has spawned three short-lived spin-off series, the ABC''s Good News Weekend, Ten''s GNW Night Lite and Ten''s skit-based Good News World.', 'Good News Week was an Australian satirical panel game show hosted by Paul McDermott that aired from 19 April 1996 to 27 May 2000, and 11 February 2008 to 28 April 2012. The show''s initial run aired on ABC until being bought by Network Ten in 1999. The show was revived for its second run when the 2007–2008 Writers Guild of America strike caused many of Network Ten''s imported US programmes to cease production. Good News Week drew its comedy and satire from recent news stories, political figures, media organisations, and often, aspects of the show itself. The show opened with a monologue by McDermott relating to recent headlines, after which two teams of three panellists competed in recurring segments to gain points. The show has spawned three short-lived spin-off series, the ABC''s Good News Weekend, Ten''s GNW Night Lite and Ten''s skit-based Good News World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8GPWUUJe8jbGe3ac3OvU455Y41.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:12552'),
  ('664520994058885061', 'GOOD NIGHT WORLD', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Hirose, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Akio Otsuka, Aya Endo, Aoi Yuuki, Ryohei Kimura, Hiroki Nanami, Kenjiro Tsuda', 'TV-MA', 'Four miserable members of a dysfunctional household have no idea that they''ve formed a happy family unit in an immersive VR game — with each other.', 'Four miserable members of a dysfunctional household have no idea that they''ve formed a happy family unit in an immersive VR game — with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k91PSMjahbvSOIJ1oB9BxjFDDRH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231677'),
  ('141728324528955458', 'Good Omens', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Neil Gaiman', null, 'Michael Sheen, David Tennant', 'TV-MA', 'Aziraphale, an angel, and Crowley, a demon, join forces in order to prevent Armageddon. They attempt to raise the Antichrist in a balanced and human way, but are they focusing their efforts in the right direction?', 'Aziraphale, an angel, and Crowley, a demon, join forces in order to prevent Armageddon. They attempt to raise the Antichrist in a balanced and human way, but are they focusing their efforts in the right direction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omgCpyBV5sUT8AkeIcEwdPPgKZC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71915'),
  ('151427086674865459', 'Good Partner', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Choi Yuna, Kim Ga-ram', null, 'Jang Na-ra, Nam Ji-hyun, Kim Jun-han, Pyo Ji-hoon, Ji Seung-hyun, Han Jae-yi, Ahn Soo-eun', null, 'Cha Eun-kyung, a 17-year veteran divorce lawyer, faces a personal crisis when her own marriage is threatened while working alongside rookie lawyer Han Yu-ri, whose differing values lead to tension as they navigate their complex cases at Law Firm Daejung.', 'Cha Eun-kyung, a 17-year veteran divorce lawyer, faces a personal crisis when her own marriage is threatened while working alongside rookie lawyer Han Yu-ri, whose differing values lead to tension as they navigate their complex cases at Law Firm Daejung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rItshnQS7IsirJ9oKWap2rrn7XG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243761'),
  ('405430104683040059', 'Good People', 2022, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Matthieu Donck, Benjamin d''Aoust, Stéphane Bergmans', null, 'Lucas Meister, Bérangère McNeese, Peter van den Begin, Michaël Abiteboul, India Hair, François Damiens, Gwen Berrou, Dominique Pinon', null, 'Tom and Linda are thirtysomethings living in Belgium, along the French border. He is a policeman, she is a beautician, and they are on the verge of bankruptcy. Caught between a rock and a hard place, they embark on a get-rich-quick life insurance scam in an attempt to give themselves a fresh start someplace sunny. Their plan is going pretty well … until everything goes wrong, when Philippe, a French gendarme with whom Linda has an affair starts to investigate… Good People also tells the story of a small border town between France and Belgium and its people who can’t seem to face the evil eating away at their community.', 'Tom and Linda are thirtysomethings living in Belgium, along the French border. He is a policeman, she is a beautician, and they are on the verge of bankruptcy. Caught between a rock and a hard place, they embark on a get-rich-quick life insurance scam in an attempt to give themselves a fresh start someplace sunny. Their plan is going pretty well … until everything goes wrong, when Philippe, a French gendarme with whom Linda has an affair starts to investigate… Good People also tells the story of a small border town between France and Belgium and its people who can’t seem to face the evil eating away at their community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CVafdiX4IpmMyYVoLenp9BLeiF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213073'),
  ('450285532438409415', 'Good Sam', 2022, 'Drama', 'Katie Wech', null, 'Sophia Bush, Jason Isaacs, Skye P. Marshall, Michael Stahl-David, Omar Maskati, Wendy Crewson, Edwin Hodge, Davi Santos', 'TV-14', 'A gifted heart surgeon excels in her new leadership role as Chief of Surgery after her renowned boss falls into a coma. When her former boss wakes up months later demanding to resume his duties, Sam is tasked with supervising this egotistical expert with a scalpel who never acknowledged her stellar talent.', 'A gifted heart surgeon excels in her new leadership role as Chief of Surgery after her renowned boss falls into a coma. When her former boss wakes up months later demanding to resume his duties, Sam is tasked with supervising this egotistical expert with a scalpel who never acknowledged her stellar talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3daYD4eYimoQaPyKIgCADKUovcJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125952'),
  ('1050429996631305633', 'Good Times', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Eric Monte, Mike Evans', 'Mike Evans', 'Ja''net DuBois, Esther Rolle, Jimmie Walker, Ralph Carter, Bern Nadette Stanis, Johnny Brown, Janet Jackson, Ben Powers', null, 'Good Times is an American sitcom that originally aired from February 8, 1974, until August 1, 1979, on the CBS television network. It was created by Eric Monte and Mike Evans, and developed by Norman Lear, the series'' primary executive producer. Good Times is a spin-off of Maude, which is itself a spin-off of All in the Family along with The Jeffersons. The series is set in Chicago. The first two seasons were taped at CBS Television City in Hollywood. In the fall of 1975, the show moved to Metromedia Square, where Norman Lear''s own production company was housed.', 'Good Times is an American sitcom that originally aired from February 8, 1974, until August 1, 1979, on the CBS television network. It was created by Eric Monte and Mike Evans, and developed by Norman Lear, the series'' primary executive producer. Good Times is a spin-off of Maude, which is itself a spin-off of All in the Family along with The Jeffersons. The series is set in Chicago. The first two seasons were taped at CBS Television City in Hollywood. In the fall of 1975, the show moved to Metromedia Square, where Norman Lear''s own production company was housed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZlaGU4RJMhTKFxmQ6RAEYNjM0l.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:154'),
  ('220693783561501034', 'Good Times', 2024, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Carl Jones, Ranada Shepard', 'Judith Dent, Love Barnett, Jen Golum', 'Jay Pharoah, Marsai Martin, Gerald ''Slink'' Johnson, Yvette Nicole Brown, JB Smoove, Rashida Olayiwola', 'TV-MA', 'In this edgy, irreverent reimagining of the TV classic, a new generation of the Evans family keeps their heads above water in a Chicago housing project.', 'In this edgy, irreverent reimagining of the TV classic, a new generation of the Evans family keeps their heads above water in a Chicago housing project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/D9yYJsyDa0A3fFQXel7MFhTWkj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227837'),
  ('340977427972673341', 'Good Trouble', 2019, 'Drama', 'Peter Paige, Bradley Bredeweg, Joanna Johnson', null, 'Cierra Ramirez, Zuri Adele, Sherry Cola, Bryan Craig, Emma Hunton, Tommy Martinez, Josh Pence, Booboo Stewart', 'TV-14', 'After moving to The Coterie in Downtown Los Angeles, Callie and Mariana Foster realize that living on their own is not all that it’s cracked up to be.', 'After moving to The Coterie in Downtown Los Angeles, Callie and Mariana Foster realize that living on their own is not all that it’s cracked up to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmB1PghtrIBbdrFAmRncuO1wQLQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:80006'),
  ('491822676906651449', 'Good Will Society', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Xin Zhilei, White-K, Zhang Zixian, Annabel Yao, Shi Mingze', null, 'Neurosurgeon Liu Ziyi faces heartbreak when her fiancé is unexpectedly admitted to her hospital, prompting her to end their relationship gracefully. At the same time, cardiologist Qin Wenbin, known for his optimistic and easygoing nature, faces marital struggles despite his thriving career, leaving him at a crossroads in life.', 'Neurosurgeon Liu Ziyi faces heartbreak when her fiancé is unexpectedly admitted to her hospital, prompting her to end their relationship gracefully. At the same time, cardiologist Qin Wenbin, known for his optimistic and easygoing nature, faces marital struggles despite his thriving career, leaving him at a crossroads in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gUlJJUcVBsZZtqeGHfQF4SA3jC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276548'),
  ('890519842051012971', 'Good Witch', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sue Tenney', null, 'Catherine Bell, James Denton, Catherine Disher, Sarah Power, Rhys Matthew Bond, Trenna Keating, Kirsten Alter, Kylee Evans', 'TV-G', 'Cassie Nightingale, Middleton’s favorite enchantress, and her young-teenage daughter Grace, who shares that same special intuition as her mom, welcome Dr. Sam Radford and his son to town. When the New York transplants move in next to the Grey House, they are immediately spellbound by the mother-daughter duo next door, but Sam and Cassie quickly find they may not see eye to eye. With her signature charm, Cassie attempts to bring everyone together, ensuring all of Middleton is in for new changes, big surprises and, of course, a little bit of magic! "Good Witch” is based on Bell’s beloved character Cassie, the raven-haired enchantress who kept audiences spellbound for seven installments of Hallmark Channel''s longest-running and highest-rated original movie franchise of all time.', 'Cassie Nightingale, Middleton’s favorite enchantress, and her young-teenage daughter Grace, who shares that same special intuition as her mom, welcome Dr. Sam Radford and his son to town. When the New York transplants move in next to the Grey House, they are immediately spellbound by the mother-daughter duo next door, but Sam and Cassie quickly find they may not see eye to eye. With her signature charm, Cassie attempts to bring everyone together, ensuring all of Middleton is in for new changes, big surprises and, of course, a little bit of magic! "Good Witch” is based on Bell’s beloved character Cassie, the raven-haired enchantress who kept audiences spellbound for seven installments of Hallmark Channel''s longest-running and highest-rated original movie franchise of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5B9CdRs9MY6Fgknv5uZQKWtl6F.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:61864'),
  ('1128786867577039809', 'Goodbye Earth', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ahn Eun-jin, Yoo Ah-in, Jeon Seong-woo, Kim Yoon-hye, Kim Yeo-jin, Seo Ye-hwa, Yoon Seo-ah, Hong Woo-jin', 'TV-MA', 'As an asteroid hurtles towards Earth with nothing to stop it, one determined teacher fights to keep her former students safe — no matter the cost.', 'As an asteroid hurtles towards Earth with nothing to stop it, one determined teacher fights to keep her former students safe — no matter the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1LvLQSKRoGlU5egMHagDtsZ4K1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139547'),
  ('878460430865768731', 'Goodbye Mr. Black', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Moon Hee-jung', 'Lee Jin-uk, Moon Chae-won, Kim Kang-woo, Song Jae-rim, Yoo In-young, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Choi Jung-woo, Lee Won-jong', null, 'Cha Ji-Won is a UDT officer of the Navy Special Operations Force. He is positive and has personal charm, but he falls into a desperate situation due to a friend''s betrayal. He goes through numerous life or death situations. Cha Ji-Won then enters into a fake marriage with Swan to hide his identity. Through the bright persona of Swan, Cha Ji-Won falls in love and regains his trust of others.', 'Cha Ji-Won is a UDT officer of the Navy Special Operations Force. He is positive and has personal charm, but he falls into a desperate situation due to a friend''s betrayal. He goes through numerous life or death situations. Cha Ji-Won then enters into a fake marriage with Swan to hide his identity. Through the bright persona of Swan, Cha Ji-Won falls in love and regains his trust of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKInqfUZl5HkcBHzm8k3Zu9Wboi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65746'),
  ('606932836826690808', 'Goodness Gracious Me', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Meera Syal, Sanjeev Bhaskar, Anil Gupta', null, 'Nina Wadia, Meera Syal, Kulvinder Ghir, Sanjeev Bhaskar, Konnie Huq', null, 'Goodness Gracious Me is a BBC English language sketch comedy show originally aired on BBC Radio 4 from 1996 to 1998 and later televised on BBC Two from 1998 to 2001. The ensemble cast were four British Indian actors, Sanjeev Bhaskar, Kulvinder Ghir, Meera Syal and Nina Wadia. The show explored the conflict and integration between traditional Indian culture and modern British life. Some sketches reversed the roles to view the British from an Indian perspective, and others poked fun at Indian stereotypes. In the television series most of the white characters were played by Dave Lamb and Fiona Allen; in the radio series those parts were played by the cast themselves. The show''s title and theme tune is a bhangra rearrangement of a hit comedy song of the same name. The original was performed by Peter Sellers and Sophia Loren reprising their characters from the 1960 film The Millionairess. The show''s original working title was "Peter Sellers is Dead", but was changed because the cast generally liked Peter Sellers. In her 1996 novel Anita and Me, Syal had referred to British parodies of Asian speech as "a goodness-gracious-me accent". One of the more famous sketches featured the cast "going out for an English" after a few lassis. They mispronounce the waiter''s name, order the blandest thing on the menu and ask for twenty-four plates of chips. The sketch parodies often-drunk English people "going out for an Indian", ordering chicken phall and too many papadums. This sketch was voted the 6th Greatest Comedy Sketch on a Channel 4 list show.', 'Goodness Gracious Me is a BBC English language sketch comedy show originally aired on BBC Radio 4 from 1996 to 1998 and later televised on BBC Two from 1998 to 2001. The ensemble cast were four British Indian actors, Sanjeev Bhaskar, Kulvinder Ghir, Meera Syal and Nina Wadia. The show explored the conflict and integration between traditional Indian culture and modern British life. Some sketches reversed the roles to view the British from an Indian perspective, and others poked fun at Indian stereotypes. In the television series most of the white characters were played by Dave Lamb and Fiona Allen; in the radio series those parts were played by the cast themselves. The show''s title and theme tune is a bhangra rearrangement of a hit comedy song of the same name. The original was performed by Peter Sellers and Sophia Loren reprising their characters from the 1960 film The Millionairess. The show''s original working title was "Peter Sellers is Dead", but was changed because the cast generally liked Peter Sellers. In her 1996 novel Anita and Me, Syal had referred to British parodies of Asian speech as "a goodness-gracious-me accent". One of the more famous sketches featured the cast "going out for an English" after a few lassis. They mispronounce the waiter''s name, order the blandest thing on the menu and ask for twenty-four plates of chips. The sketch parodies often-drunk English people "going out for an Indian", ordering chicken phall and too many papadums. This sketch was voted the 6th Greatest Comedy Sketch on a Channel 4 list show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqu60bUMbYsateXg6IHbE4wFRf4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1753'),
  ('545887941815264733', 'Goodnight Sweetheart', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Laurence Marks, Maurice Gran', null, 'Nicholas Lyndhurst, Victor McGuire, Dervla Kirwan, Michelle Holmes, Elizabeth Carling, Emma Amos, Christopher Ettridge, David Ryall', 'NR', 'Gary Sparrow is an ordinary bloke in 1990s Britain, married to the ambitious Yvonne and working as a TV repairman. Then his whole world changes when he stumbles upon a portal to WWII-era London and begins a dual life as an accidental time traveler.', 'Gary Sparrow is an ordinary bloke in 1990s Britain, married to the ambitious Yvonne and working as a TV repairman. Then his whole world changes when he stumbles upon a portal to WWII-era London and begins a dual life as an accidental time traveler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjAlo4Xac1sMq6mAMJTvkPxbOON.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:5632'),
  ('947917592452410191', 'Goof Troop', 1992, 'Comedy, Kids, Animation', 'Karen Peterson, Robert Taylor', null, 'Bill Farmer, Dana Hill, Jim Cummings, Rob Paulsen, April Winchell, Nancy Cartwright', 'TV-Y7', 'Goofy is a single father raising his son, Max in Spoonerville. As it happens, Goofy and Max end up moving in next door to Goofy''s high school friend Pete and his family. Pete''s son PJ and Max become best friends practically doing everything together.', 'Goofy is a single father raising his son, Max in Spoonerville. As it happens, Goofy and Max end up moving in next door to Goofy''s high school friend Pete and his family. Pete''s son PJ and Max become best friends practically doing everything together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfUUKRmfKkxo7TOEOjWZ1xRHOH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2235'),
  ('703587692307975926', 'Gooische Vrouwen', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Linda de Mol, Will Koopman', null, 'Linda de Mol, Tjitske Reidinga, Derek de Lint, Peter Paul Muller, Daniël Boissevain, Susan Visser, Lies Visschedijk, Beppie Melissen', null, 'Gooische Vrouwen is a Dutch comedy-drama series, created by Linda de Mol for her brother John de Mol''s TV network Tien in 2005. However, after the show''s second season, Tien went bankrupt and Gooische Vrouwen was transferred to RTL4, where it ran for three more seasons until its finale in 2009. After its 42-episode run the show was followed by a theatrically released feature film in 2011. The show chronicles the everyday lives of four female friends living in het Gooi. Gooische Vrouwen has since been sold to Germany, Belgium, France and Serbia.', 'Gooische Vrouwen is a Dutch comedy-drama series, created by Linda de Mol for her brother John de Mol''s TV network Tien in 2005. However, after the show''s second season, Tien went bankrupt and Gooische Vrouwen was transferred to RTL4, where it ran for three more seasons until its finale in 2009. After its 42-episode run the show was followed by a theatrically released feature film in 2011. The show chronicles the everyday lives of four female friends living in het Gooi. Gooische Vrouwen has since been sold to Germany, Belgium, France and Serbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21fAiRTNvALCOYq0nFVlSkOfvrD.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:14670'),
  ('748214862869600071', 'Goosebumps', 1995, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Kids, Comedy', 'R.L. Stine', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Anything can turn spooky in this horror anthology series based on the best-selling books by master of kid horror, R.L. Stine. In every episode, see what happens when regular kids find themselves in scary situations, and how they work to confront and overcome their fears.', 'Anything can turn spooky in this horror anthology series based on the best-selling books by master of kid horror, R.L. Stine. In every episode, see what happens when regular kids find themselves in scary situations, and how they work to confront and overcome their fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/km7uuxaU4mzp49Hpt5hxnLx7p6F.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5835'),
  ('997108310405906293', 'Goosebumps', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Rob Letterman, Nicholas Stoller', null, 'Zack Morris, Isa Briones, Miles McKenna, Ana Yi Puig, Will Price, Rachael Harris, Justin Long', 'TV-14', 'A group of five high schoolers embark on a shadowy and twisted journey to investigate the tragic passing three decades earlier of a teen named Harold Biddle – while also unearthing dark secrets from their parents'' past.', 'A group of five high schoolers embark on a shadowy and twisted journey to investigate the tragic passing three decades earlier of a teen named Harold Biddle – while also unearthing dark secrets from their parents'' past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMrMPlEJAGAKBUWJzeacIwjRU2C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157004'),
  ('604301245467702303', 'Goosebumps: The Vanishing', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Rob Letterman, Nicholas Stoller', 'John James Goldbeck, Sean Rivas', 'David Schwimmer, Ana Ortiz, Jayden Bartels, Sam McCarthy, Elijah M. Cooper, Francesca Noel, Galilea La Salvia', 'TV-14', 'When twins Devin and Cece are sent to spend a summer in Gravesend, Brooklyn with their divorced dad, scientist Anthony Brewer, they must band together with new friends to save the neighborhood from a long-dormant threat.', 'When twins Devin and Cece are sent to spend a summer in Gravesend, Brooklyn with their divorced dad, scientist Anthony Brewer, they must band together with new friends to save the neighborhood from a long-dormant threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajghauMTZ4RKVeISDUzxcMWjXnI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281666'),
  ('1711899533812126', 'Gordita Chronicles', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Olivia Goncalves, Diana Maria Riva, Juan Javier Cardenas, Savannah Nicole Ruiz, Noah Rico, Cosette Hauer, Tati McQuay', 'TV-PG', 'A Latina reporter looks back on her childhood as a chubby, willful and reluctant Dominican immigrant growing up with her eccentric family in 1980s Miami.', 'A Latina reporter looks back on her childhood as a chubby, willful and reluctant Dominican immigrant growing up with her eccentric family in 1980s Miami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppJa0vyJDvPXmSBP1x6NTQuirzI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155775'),
  ('645343554252146901', 'Gordon Behind Bars', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay', null, 'Gordon sets up a business behind bars, attempting to get prisoners working and paying something back into the system. But training up a group of prisoners won''t be easy...', 'Gordon sets up a business behind bars, attempting to get prisoners working and paying something back into the system. But training up a group of prisoners won''t be easy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npHPfADDLy9duJ2LvgXhg318rGd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54905'),
  ('330160858327005060', 'Gordon Ramsay: Uncharted', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay', 'TV-14', 'Follow Gordon Ramsay as he meets with indigenous people around the globe to learn about the cultures, dishes and flavors unique to each location. Each episode concludes with Ramsay challenging himself with a local food legend by his side - putting his newfound skills to the test as they cook a feast together for the natives.', 'Follow Gordon Ramsay as he meets with indigenous people around the globe to learn about the cultures, dishes and flavors unique to each location. Each episode concludes with Ramsay challenging himself with a local food legend by his side - putting his newfound skills to the test as they cook a feast together for the natives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bh8xg3j9lG0oaNd76Xrad03hqoP.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:91405'),
  ('1015163703284292306', 'Gordon Ramsay''s 24 Hours to Hell and Back', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay', 'TV-14', 'Gordon Ramsay drives to struggling restaurants across the country in his state-of-the-art mobile kitchen and command center, Hell On Wheels, and tries to bring them back from the brink of disaster – all in just 24 hours.', 'Gordon Ramsay drives to struggling restaurants across the country in his state-of-the-art mobile kitchen and command center, Hell On Wheels, and tries to bring them back from the brink of disaster – all in just 24 hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TiwmRjAgnTXZUKIySVxsRltfZD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:79679'),
  ('1074831631506516796', 'Gordon Ramsay''s Secret Service', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay', null, 'Gordon Ramsay goes undercover to investigate the food handling practices of restaurants.', 'Gordon Ramsay goes undercover to investigate the food handling practices of restaurants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9MTFmWNEVSIQkvMkmPICal68a0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288712'),
  ('467469664516415611', 'Gordon Ramsay''s Ultimate Cookery Course', 2012, 'Reality', 'Gordon Ramsay', null, 'Gordon Ramsay', null, 'In this practical home cookery series Gordon Ramsay strips away the graft and complexity to show how to cook 100 simple, accessible and modern recipes to stake your life on.', 'In this practical home cookery series Gordon Ramsay strips away the graft and complexity to show how to cook 100 simple, accessible and modern recipes to stake your life on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqy92iD3QZ1SmZ7gaaDJoSlch3u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59442'),
  ('524885711541623771', 'Gordon, Gino and Fred''s Road Trip', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay, Fred Sirieix, Gino D''Acampo', 'TV-14', 'Three big egos, one small van. Gordon, Gino and Fred pack up their camper van once again and head off on a European adventure, but this time it''s personal as each episode takes us on a tour of their cherished homelands. With three countries, three weeks and three coqs au vin in close confinement what could possibly go wrong?', 'Three big egos, one small van. Gordon, Gino and Fred pack up their camper van once again and head off on a European adventure, but this time it''s personal as each episode takes us on a tour of their cherished homelands. With three countries, three weeks and three coqs au vin in close confinement what could possibly go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnDIhtrXrzGMfrQt2CzAKZluNVr.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:83118'),
  ('994500346035447467', 'Gordon''s Great Escape', 2010, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay', 'TV-14', 'Gordon''s Great Escape is a television series presented by chef Gordon Ramsay. Series 1 follows Ramsay''s first visit to India, where he explores the country''s culinary traditions. Produced by One Potato Two Potato, in association with Optomen, the series aired on three consecutive nights between 18 to 20 January 2010 as part of Channel 4''s ''Indian Winter'' promotion. The second series aired in May 2011, where Ramsay explored the culinary traditions of Southeast Asia, visiting Thailand, Cambodia, Malaysia, and Vietnam.', 'Gordon''s Great Escape is a television series presented by chef Gordon Ramsay. Series 1 follows Ramsay''s first visit to India, where he explores the country''s culinary traditions. Produced by One Potato Two Potato, in association with Optomen, the series aired on three consecutive nights between 18 to 20 January 2010 as part of Channel 4''s ''Indian Winter'' promotion. The second series aired in May 2011, where Ramsay explored the culinary traditions of Southeast Asia, visiting Thailand, Cambodia, Malaysia, and Vietnam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppcwsWX2RPghKkJgjYv3AIVciPC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31892'),
  ('150120907336701260', 'Gormenghast', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Comedy', 'Mervyn Peake, Malcolm McKay', null, 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Celia Imrie, Neve McIntosh, John Sessions, Fiona Shaw, Christopher Lee, Warren Mitchell', null, 'At the Castle of Gormenghast, the Groan family has ruled with dusty ceremony for more than seventy generations. A clever and ambitious new kitchen boy, Steerpike, begins to insinuate himself into the affections of Lady Fuchsia Groan and to murder his way to power.', 'At the Castle of Gormenghast, the Groan family has ruled with dusty ceremony for more than seventy generations. A clever and ambitious new kitchen boy, Steerpike, begins to insinuate himself into the affections of Lady Fuchsia Groan and to murder his way to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JCGZ9IT6oRhYpedhq85nxDuQFa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9215'),
  ('7922871251196061', 'Gormiti', 2009, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Paolo De Santis, Massimo Di Benedetto, Federico Zanandrea, Patrizia Mottola', 'TV-Y7', 'The show follows two brothers, Nick & Toby, who discover that they have the power to transform into powerful creatures known as Gormitis. Their two friends Jessica & Lucas join the fight and together they harness the power of the four elements. Now it''s up to them to save their world from destruction.', 'The show follows two brothers, Nick & Toby, who discover that they have the power to transform into powerful creatures known as Gormitis. Their two friends Jessica & Lucas join the fight and together they harness the power of the four elements. Now it''s up to them to save their world from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BLaYyvuUXJk5fFCp7Evj2r6NyX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:35725'),
  ('1123774929487448720', 'Gormiti', 2018, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Freddy Cordoba, Roger Cordoba', null, 'Stefano Broccoletti, Stefano de Filippis, Alessio De Filippis, Federico Di Pofi, Sara Ballerani, Mario Bombardieri, Pierluigi Astore, Stephanie Figueira', 'TV-Y', 'Four friends become guardians of the island Gorm and must harness powers of the elements to stop an evil lord and his army from ruling the kingdom.', 'Four friends become guardians of the island Gorm and must harness powers of the elements to stop an evil lord and his army from ruling the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCiaMxGrgo5Booppfi2Luns8YBl.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:96840'),
  ('824772600223107835', 'Gortimer Gibbon''s Life on Normal Street', 2014, 'Family, Kids', 'David Anaxagoras', null, 'Sloane Morgan Siegel, Drew Justice, Coco Grayson, David Bloom, Chandler Kinney', 'TV-Y7', 'Life is anything but normal for Gortimer and his two best friends, Ranger and Mel, as they navigate Normal Street - an ordinary suburb that has a hint of something magical just beneath the surface.', 'Life is anything but normal for Gortimer and his two best friends, Ranger and Mel, as they navigate Normal Street - an ordinary suburb that has a hint of something magical just beneath the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rg22mGHtJkirhVEOTbcxTdWiqB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60610'),
  ('207894144148729475', 'Gosenzo-sama Banbanzai!', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mamoru Oshii', null, 'Toshio Furukawa, Masako Katsuki, Kenichi Ogata, Machiko Washio, Tessyo Genda, Koichi Yamadera, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'The Yomota family is small and typical: father Kinekuni (42), mother Tamiko (38), and son Inumaru (17). One day, a beautiful girl appears at their front door, calling herself "Maroko Yomota," granddaughter of Inumaru who travels back in time with a time machine to visit her ancestors. Despite of Tamiko''s strong objection, Kinekuni and Inumaru welcome her to stay with them, and the structure of a happy family has begun to collapse.', 'The Yomota family is small and typical: father Kinekuni (42), mother Tamiko (38), and son Inumaru (17). One day, a beautiful girl appears at their front door, calling herself "Maroko Yomota," granddaughter of Inumaru who travels back in time with a time machine to visit her ancestors. Despite of Tamiko''s strong objection, Kinekuni and Inumaru welcome her to stay with them, and the structure of a happy family has begun to collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPl8JMTf0Yan8CXxwKH55mkMuu0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113157'),
  ('120845711203495009', 'Gosick', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Hidenobu Kiuchi, Noriko Shitaya, Yui Kano, Miyuki Sawashiro, Takuya Eguchi, Toru Okawa, Michiko Neya, Aoi Yuuki', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a fictional European country in 1924, a Japanese exchange student meets a mysterious, brilliant girl who only leaves the library to sleep. Her brother, a detective, relies on her exceptional mind to solve difficult mysteries.', 'Set in a fictional European country in 1924, a Japanese exchange student meets a mysterious, brilliant girl who only leaves the library to sleep. Her brother, a detective, relies on her exceptional mind to solve difficult mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkzcxkON0yCkx6JQTDEUJpax5HV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38560'),
  ('994810929234938436', 'Gossip Girl', 2007, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Stephanie Savage, Josh Schwartz', null, 'Blake Lively, Leighton Meester, Penn Badgley, Chace Crawford, Ed Westwick, Kaylee DeFer, Matthew Settle, Kelly Rutherford', 'TV-14', 'An exclusive group of privileged teens from a posh prep school on Manhattan''s Upper East Side whose lives revolve around the blog of the all-knowing albeit ultra-secretive Gossip Girl.', 'An exclusive group of privileged teens from a posh prep school on Manhattan''s Upper East Side whose lives revolve around the blog of the all-knowing albeit ultra-secretive Gossip Girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRvSUuU1VQQkZZ578jKJpcUCuL8.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1395'),
  ('860678678296025260', 'Gossip Girl', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Joshua Safran', null, 'Thomas Doherty, Emily Alyn Lind, Eli Brown, Jordan Alexander, Whitney Peak, Tavi Gevinson, Evan Mock, Johnathan Fernandez', 'TV-MA', 'Eight years after the original website went dark, a new generation of New York private school teens are introduced to the social surveillance of Gossip Girl.', 'Eight years after the original website went dark, a new generation of New York private school teens are introduced to the social surveillance of Gossip Girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XmRg3iF1drIikTzRLUfn7cJDio.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95249'),
  ('53224328519465930', 'Gossip Girl: Thailand', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sabina Meisinger, Carissa Springett, Victor Kritchapol Jarrusak, Chanon Ukkharachata, Chanon Makaramani, Nonny Nutcha Jeka, Stephane Saisean Pagniez, Ratchaneeboon Pheinwikraisophon', null, 'Serena Wijitranukul returns to Bangkok following her mysterious disappearance: everyone is extremely shocked including her best friend, Blair Waranon. Blair soon finds out that Serena had slept with her boyfriend, Nate Achirawat, the night of her disappearance. Meanwhile, Serena begins dating Dan Chanaseri while Nate struggles with his feelings for Blair. The two try to salvage what''s left of their relationship, only leaving Blair to lose her virginity to Nate''s best friend, Jak Benjakij, instead. In the meantime, Jenny Chanaseri constantly tries to make it in this upscale world by following around Blair and her friends.', 'Serena Wijitranukul returns to Bangkok following her mysterious disappearance: everyone is extremely shocked including her best friend, Blair Waranon. Blair soon finds out that Serena had slept with her boyfriend, Nate Achirawat, the night of her disappearance. Meanwhile, Serena begins dating Dan Chanaseri while Nate struggles with his feelings for Blair. The two try to salvage what''s left of their relationship, only leaving Blair to lose her virginity to Nate''s best friend, Jak Benjakij, instead. In the meantime, Jenny Chanaseri constantly tries to make it in this upscale world by following around Blair and her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siZzBwlS2aXiu7KP85TCqFK3awC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233603'),
  ('816431837914221383', 'Gossips Behind the Scene', 2008, 'Talk', null, null, 'Vincent Liang, Huang Kuo-Lun', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zE2YHWi22LYerDPrhaZJsxPrKs5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234265'),
  ('4725608509996209', 'Gotham', 2014, 'Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bruno Heller', null, 'Ben McKenzie, Donal Logue, David Mazouz, Sean Pertwee, Robin Lord Taylor, Erin Richards, Camren Bicondova, Cory Michael Smith', 'TV-14', 'Everyone knows the name Commissioner Gordon. He is one of the crime world''s greatest foes, a man whose reputation is synonymous with law and order. But what is known of Gordon''s story and his rise from rookie detective to Police Commissioner? What did it take to navigate the multiple layers of corruption that secretly ruled Gotham City, the spawning ground of the world''s most iconic villains? And what circumstances created them – the larger-than-life personas who would become Catwoman, The Penguin, The Riddler, Two-Face and The Joker?', 'Everyone knows the name Commissioner Gordon. He is one of the crime world''s greatest foes, a man whose reputation is synonymous with law and order. But what is known of Gordon''s story and his rise from rookie detective to Police Commissioner? What did it take to navigate the multiple layers of corruption that secretly ruled Gotham City, the spawning ground of the world''s most iconic villains? And what circumstances created them – the larger-than-life personas who would become Catwoman, The Penguin, The Riddler, Two-Face and The Joker?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLpSNnVoL2bjQdc1PcaHUPUzttP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:60708'),
  ('1085830382656460811', 'Gotham Comedy Live', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Gotham Comedy Club, a popular comedy venue in the Chelsea neighborhood of Manhattan, is the setting of an hourlong series that is shot in front of an audience at the club. Each episode features routines by several comics -- a list that has included such names as David Alan Grier, Gilbert Gottfried and Artie Lange -- in what the network says is an unedited and uncensored format. In addition to the big names of the field who take the Gotham stage, the show also features up-and-comers who want to make a name for themselves in the stand-up comedy business.', 'Gotham Comedy Club, a popular comedy venue in the Chelsea neighborhood of Manhattan, is the setting of an hourlong series that is shot in front of an audience at the club. Each episode features routines by several comics -- a list that has included such names as David Alan Grier, Gilbert Gottfried and Artie Lange -- in what the network says is an unedited and uncensored format. In addition to the big names of the field who take the Gotham stage, the show also features up-and-comers who want to make a name for themselves in the stand-up comedy business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZpMmD7hWIDG3cwYZEDrZo7L037.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:233598'),
  ('209051855237438276', 'Gotham Girls', 2000, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Paul Dini', 'Hilary Bader, Paul Dini', 'Arleen Sorkin, Diane Pershing, Tara Strong, Adrienne Barbeau', 'TV-PG', 'A Flash animation series staring Harley Quinn, Poison Ivy, Batgirl, Catwoman and Zatanna in short stories about the daily lives of the characters.', 'A Flash animation series staring Harley Quinn, Poison Ivy, Batgirl, Catwoman and Zatanna in short stories about the daily lives of the characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx5288muDMdOM5fNHEovKYEnDCo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15185'),
  ('1050125062119060201', 'Gotham Knights', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Natalie Abrams, Chad Fiveash, James Patrick Stoteraux', 'Nate Gualtieri', 'Oscar Morgan, Olivia Rose Keegan, Navia Robinson, Fallon Smythe, Tyler DiChiara, Anna Lore, Misha Collins', 'TV-14', 'In the aftermath of Bruce Wayne''s murder, his rebellious adopted son forges an unlikely alliance with the children of Batman''s enemies when they are all framed for killing the Caped Crusader.', 'In the aftermath of Bruce Wayne''s murder, his rebellious adopted son forges an unlikely alliance with the children of Batman''s enemies when they are all framed for killing the Caped Crusader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5riy7SdIhMhhYcDqeEOICVvXEHS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195868'),
  ('121758136329236928', 'Gotthard', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Stefan Dähnert', 'Maxim Mehmet, Pasquale Aleardi, Miriam Stein, Carlos Leal, Marie Bäumer, Joachim Król, Maximilian Simonischek, Christoph Gaugler', null, 'In the spring of 1873, people from all over the world come to the tiny village of Göschenen in the canton of Uri, to work on the biggest and most spectacular construction site of modern times: the tunnel through the Gotthard.', 'In the spring of 1873, people from all over the world come to the tiny village of Göschenen in the canton of Uri, to work on the biggest and most spectacular construction site of modern times: the tunnel through the Gotthard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urTlCuAjZucPdFSXKAv08V7Op6r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70130'),
  ('482665195317435202', 'Gourmet', 2008, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Wan-gyu', 'Kim Rae-won, Nam Sang-mi, Kim So-yeon, Won Ki-jun, Kwon Oh-joong, Choi Bool-am', null, 'Kim Rae-Won stars as the warm hearted chef-in-training Lee Sung-Chan, while actress Nam Sang-Mi plays a silly country girl, Kim Jin-soo, who trails Lee with high hopes of becoming a food columnist. Veteran actor Choi Bul-Am appears as Master Oh Sook-soo, Lee''s stepfather and the only person who truly believes in Lee''s potential. Sung-Chan is a happy and bright young man who loves to cook. Leaving the heavy responsibility of becoming the head chef of Oh''s famous restaurant to his stepbrother, he explores the world of cooking and discovers that he''s actually good at it. When Oh announces that he will not choose his own son to become the owner and head chef, cold-hearted jealousy and competition arise.', 'Kim Rae-Won stars as the warm hearted chef-in-training Lee Sung-Chan, while actress Nam Sang-Mi plays a silly country girl, Kim Jin-soo, who trails Lee with high hopes of becoming a food columnist. Veteran actor Choi Bul-Am appears as Master Oh Sook-soo, Lee''s stepfather and the only person who truly believes in Lee''s potential. Sung-Chan is a happy and bright young man who loves to cook. Leaving the heavy responsibility of becoming the head chef of Oh''s famous restaurant to his stepbrother, he explores the world of cooking and discovers that he''s actually good at it. When Oh announces that he will not choose his own son to become the owner and head chef, cold-hearted jealousy and competition arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Sw9U5kDOqAaZSNrkCIoJAsfqyP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31118'),
  ('419168722174160001', 'Gourmet Girl Graffiti', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rina Sato, Asuka Ohgame, Mikako Komatsu, Yuka Iguchi, Yu Kobayashi, Miyu Matsuki, Asuka Nishi, Ryo Hirohashi', null, 'After her grandmother passed away, high school student Ryō Machiko began living by herself. Although she recreated her grandmother''s recipes perfectly, she felt that something was missing. However, when a girl named Kirin begins visiting her home, she realizes that company makes any meal taste better. Together with their friend Shiina, they enjoy many different kinds of delicious foods together.', 'After her grandmother passed away, high school student Ryō Machiko began living by herself. Although she recreated her grandmother''s recipes perfectly, she felt that something was missing. However, when a girl named Kirin begins visiting her home, she realizes that company makes any meal taste better. Together with their friend Shiina, they enjoy many different kinds of delicious foods together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDVT3sfmuzUhlQwOg6zLN5KrkSM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72921'),
  ('302691408306158492', 'Government Cheese', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aeysha Carr, Paul Hunter', null, 'David Oyelowo, Simone Missick, Jahi Di''Allo Winston, Evan Ellison, Bokeem Woodbine, Jeremy Bobb, Louis Cancelmi, Adam Beach', 'TV-MA', 'When Hampton is released from prison, his long-awaited family reunion doesn''t quite go as he hoped. In his absence, Hampton''s wife and sons formed an unconventional family unit, and his return spins their world into chaos.', 'When Hampton is released from prison, his long-awaited family reunion doesn''t quite go as he hoped. In his absence, Hampton''s wife and sons formed an unconventional family unit, and his return spins their world into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K1HAVNCPig4zY7uuZ71OAMsSJT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241491'),
  ('263021588597691884', 'Government Job', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Dimitrije Banjac, Nikola Škorić, Dejan Ćirjaković', null, 'Dimitrije Banjac, Dejan Ćirjaković, Nikola Škorić', null, 'The backbone of the "Državni Posao (Government Job)" are satirical talks between the three actors, the comments are reminiscent of the "stand-up" form. These are short, witty comments and observations on daily life, circumstances, sociopolitical situation, sports, entertainment world, their personal opinions on various topics. The main idea is to present day in a non-existent government company and three employees of thinking about daily events in it, but also about life and society in general. Topics drawn from the daily and weekly press, for various blogs, websites, talk about movies, series, shows - radio and television. The idea is that actors humorously comment on current events, to laugh viewers and encourage them to think about them.', 'The backbone of the "Državni Posao (Government Job)" are satirical talks between the three actors, the comments are reminiscent of the "stand-up" form. These are short, witty comments and observations on daily life, circumstances, sociopolitical situation, sports, entertainment world, their personal opinions on various topics. The main idea is to present day in a non-existent government company and three employees of thinking about daily events in it, but also about life and society in general. Topics drawn from the daily and weekly press, for various blogs, websites, talk about movies, series, shows - radio and television. The idea is that actors humorously comment on current events, to laugh viewers and encourage them to think about them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sceVlRK5RvnU1qjNipyWDHQXB7x.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:46831'),
  ('533910989170557029', 'Grace', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Russell Lewis', null, 'John Simm, Richie Campbell, Brad Morrison, Laura Elphinstone', null, 'Brighton based Detective Superintendent Roy Grace is a hard-working police officer who has given his life to the job, but his career is currently at rock bottom. He’s fixated by the disappearance of his beloved wife, Sandy, and running enquiries into long forgotten cold cases with little prospect of success. Following another reprimand for his unorthodox police methods, Grace is walking a career tightrope and risks being moved from the job he loves most.', 'Brighton based Detective Superintendent Roy Grace is a hard-working police officer who has given his life to the job, but his career is currently at rock bottom. He’s fixated by the disappearance of his beloved wife, Sandy, and running enquiries into long forgotten cold cases with little prospect of success. Following another reprimand for his unorthodox police methods, Grace is walking a career tightrope and risks being moved from the job he loves most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9hE4eF8IGbcoyl419Nfllkv6Ag.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:120317'),
  ('662446749214620112', 'Grace & Favour', 1992, 'Comedy', 'David Croft, Jeremy Lloyd', null, 'Mollie Sugden, John Inman, Wendy Richard, Frank Thornton, Nicholas Smith, Fleur Bennett, Joanne Heywood, Billy Burden', null, 'Grace & Favour is a British sitcom sequel to the long-running series Are You Being Served ? The series begins with the staff of Grace Bros returning to the store to read the will of Young Mr Grace, the former head of the department store, recently deceased while scuba diving on holiday in the Caribbean with his personal secretary, Miss Jessica Lovelock. It aired on BBC1 for two series from 1992 to 1993 and marked the return of Are You Being Served ? creators and writers Jeremy Lloyd and David Croft.', 'Grace & Favour is a British sitcom sequel to the long-running series Are You Being Served ? The series begins with the staff of Grace Bros returning to the store to read the will of Young Mr Grace, the former head of the department store, recently deceased while scuba diving on holiday in the Caribbean with his personal secretary, Miss Jessica Lovelock. It aired on BBC1 for two series from 1992 to 1993 and marked the return of Are You Being Served ? creators and writers Jeremy Lloyd and David Croft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKS9HrlQWEutauQwl74uWAxIyvB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3943'),
  ('539762561164151726', 'Grace and Frankie', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Howard J. Morris, Marta Kauffman', null, 'Jane Fonda, Lily Tomlin, Martin Sheen, Sam Waterston, June Diane Raphael, Ethan Embry, Brooklyn Decker, Baron Vaughn', 'TV-MA', 'Elegant, proper Grace and freewheeling, eccentric Frankie are a pair of frenemies whose lives are turned upside down - and permanently intertwined - when their husbands leave them for each other. Together, they must face starting over in their 70s in a 21st century world.', 'Elegant, proper Grace and freewheeling, eccentric Frankie are a pair of frenemies whose lives are turned upside down - and permanently intertwined - when their husbands leave them for each other. Together, they must face starting over in their 70s in a 21st century world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aD3PaSeF8eHJFLliLlWYw4EcPt.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62320'),
  ('1006964681426868796', 'Grace Under Fire', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Chuck Lorre', null, 'Brett Butler, Dave Thomas, Casey Sander, Kaitlin Cullum, Sam Horrigan, Dylan Sprouse, Cole Sprouse, Lauren Tom', null, 'Grace Kelly is a tough woman with kids to raise. A recently divorced recovering alcoholic, Grace struggles with the pressures of being a single mother supporting three children. Grace doesn''t always handle situations with, well, grace, but she does get results.', 'Grace Kelly is a tough woman with kids to raise. A recently divorced recovering alcoholic, Grace struggles with the pressures of being a single mother supporting three children. Grace doesn''t always handle situations with, well, grace, but she does get results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XuykHIjMPRylWn1TWMJZ2uRZJw.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3394'),
  ('265485486163778110', 'Graceful Family', 2019, 'Drama, Family, Mystery', null, 'Kwon Min-soo, Park Min Kyung', 'Im Soo-hyang, Lee Jang-woo, Bae Jong-ok, Lee Kyu-han, Kim Jin-woo, Kong Hyun-joo, Moon Hee-kyung, Jung Won-joong', null, 'Mo Seok-hee is an only child and her father runs the large company MC Group. She is beautiful, smart and rich. Mo Seok-hee appears like she is arrogant, but she struggles over her mother’s death. Her mother was killed 15 years ago. Meanwhile, Heo Yoon-do is a lawyer, but he doesn’t even have an office. He solves small problems of neighborhood residents at a restaurant. He is full of love. Miraculously, Heo Yoon-do is headhunted to join the TOP team at MC Group. The TOP team manages the affairs of the family who runs the MC Group. Their job includes covering up immoral or illegal behaviors done by the family.', 'Mo Seok-hee is an only child and her father runs the large company MC Group. She is beautiful, smart and rich. Mo Seok-hee appears like she is arrogant, but she struggles over her mother’s death. Her mother was killed 15 years ago. Meanwhile, Heo Yoon-do is a lawyer, but he doesn’t even have an office. He solves small problems of neighborhood residents at a restaurant. He is full of love. Miraculously, Heo Yoon-do is headhunted to join the TOP team at MC Group. The TOP team manages the affairs of the family who runs the MC Group. Their job includes covering up immoral or illegal behaviors done by the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQTuXbytXxFxm8kQf7BndzkBIpp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91902'),
  ('178439057046935029', 'Graceful Friends', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kim Gyeong-seon, Song Hyun-wook, Park So-yeon', '박효연, 김경선', 'Bae Soo-bin, Yu Jun-sang, Song Yun-ah, Lee Tae-hwan, Kim Seung-o, Kwon Hyuk, Han Da-gam, Kim Hye-eun', 'TV-MA', 'After an unexpected death brings everyone''s dirty secrets to the surface, the lives and marriages of a close-knit group of friends unravel out of control.', 'After an unexpected death brings everyone''s dirty secrets to the surface, the lives and marriages of a close-knit group of friends unravel out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMvmOEnjxH2Z3pat4yjLFyJxRWm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99655'),
  ('660381817397422457', 'Graceland', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jeff Eastin', null, 'Daniel Sunjata, Aaron Tveit, Vanessa Ferlito, Serinda Swan, Manny Montana, Brandon Jay McLaren', 'TV-14', 'In Southern California, a beachfront property was seized and turned into a residence for undercover cops. They are all top agents of the DEA, FBI, and Customs and they are living in this house unofficially known as "Graceland". Coming of a new graduating at the top of his class, FBI rookie, Mike Warren, could make the life of a legendary FBI agent Paul Briggs and the others, more complicated or it could reveal the truth. It is based upon actual events.', 'In Southern California, a beachfront property was seized and turned into a residence for undercover cops. They are all top agents of the DEA, FBI, and Customs and they are living in this house unofficially known as "Graceland". Coming of a new graduating at the top of his class, FBI rookie, Mike Warren, could make the life of a legendary FBI agent Paul Briggs and the others, more complicated or it could reveal the truth. It is based upon actual events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oX3Hp4snTJH1chqnC8La0MkJJlZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:47318'),
  ('280201624992300964', 'Gracepoint', 2014, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Chris Chibnall', null, 'David Tennant, Anna Gunn, Michael Peña, Virginia Kull, Jacki Weaver, Josh Hamilton, Kevin Rankin, Kevin Zegers', 'TV-MA', 'When a young boy is found dead on an idyllic beach, a major police investigation gets underway in the small California seaside town where the tragedy occurred. Soon deemed a homicide, the case sparks a media frenzy, which throws the boy''s family into further turmoil and upends the lives of all of the town''s residents.', 'When a young boy is found dead on an idyllic beach, a major police investigation gets underway in the small California seaside town where the tragedy occurred. Soon deemed a homicide, the case sparks a media frenzy, which throws the boy''s family into further turmoil and upends the lives of all of the town''s residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smeC4HKFDWWhgg8R5ub86RpZhBJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61405'),
  ('415524328671593224', 'Grachi', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Soap', 'Mariela Romero', 'Catharina Ledeboer, Mariana Palos, Rosalba Pico Estrada', 'Isabella Castillo, Andrés Mercado, María Gabriela de Faría, Evaluna Montaner, Angela Rincon, Kimberly Dos Ramos, Sol Rodriguez', 'NR', 'Grachi is a young woman who will learn to use her magical powers. She will have to face Matilda and the evil Director of Escolarium, who plans to become the most powerful witch.', 'Grachi is a young woman who will learn to use her magical powers. She will have to face Matilda and the evil Director of Escolarium, who plans to become the most powerful witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNrwjZ1ANGP2NGHHzEVISPigkx3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:38233'),
