  ('390886147359341623', 'Grandfathered', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Chun', null, 'John Stamos, Paget Brewster, Josh Peck, Christina Milian, Kelly Jenrette, Ravi Patel', 'TV-14', 'Successful restaurateur and man-about-town Jimmy Martino is used to being the most suave, most handsome and most single person in the room. All that changes with the surprise appearance of Jimmy’s adult son, Gerald, and his baby daughter, Edie. Now Jimmy has to unlearn a lifetime of blissful selfishness and grapple with the fact that he went straight from single to grandfather in six seconds flat.', 'Successful restaurateur and man-about-town Jimmy Martino is used to being the most suave, most handsome and most single person in the room. All that changes with the surprise appearance of Jimmy’s adult son, Gerald, and his baby daughter, Edie. Now Jimmy has to unlearn a lifetime of blissful selfishness and grapple with the fact that he went straight from single to grandfather in six seconds flat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kxhllcajbzQwjYiyXFGJKXmvY5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63328'),
  ('968985121135071647', 'Grandma''s House', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Simon Amstell, Dan Swimer', null, 'Simon Amstell, Linda Bassett, Rebecca Front, James Smith, Samantha Spiro, Jamal Hadjkura', null, 'Simon Amstell stars as a fictionalised version of himself, a TV presenter who quits his job, leading to family drama, particularly with his mother, Tanya, and her boyfriend, Clive, all unfolding at his grandmother''s house.', 'Simon Amstell stars as a fictionalised version of himself, a TV presenter who quits his job, leading to family drama, particularly with his mother, Tanya, and her boyfriend, Clive, all unfolding at his grandmother''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51OKk4HqEdDL7ouygXCyIQEsVqi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33289'),
  ('819626766592585633', 'Grandpa and Grandma Turn Young Again', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Mamiko Noto, Shiori Mikami, Nao Toyama', 'TV-14', 'Shouzou and Ine Saitou have been happily married for as long as they can remember. Even in their old age with wrinkles and cracking limbs, the strength of this love is evident in their precious bond. And then, one day, they wake up to find they are young again! Despite their newfound youthful and attractive bodies, Shouzou and Ine remain the same as ever.', 'Shouzou and Ine Saitou have been happily married for as long as they can remember. Even in their old age with wrinkles and cracking limbs, the strength of this love is evident in their precious bond. And then, one day, they wake up to find they are young again! Despite their newfound youthful and attractive bodies, Shouzou and Ine remain the same as ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2ne0Z2EoznP3S6kcXB8LFMM1lU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239853'),
  ('660166839366909117', 'Grange Hill', 1978, 'Drama', 'Phil Redmond', null, 'Kim Hartman, Georgia May Foote, Lucien Laviscount, Jack McMullen, Kirsten Cassidy, Josh Brown, Lucas Lindo, Chris Perry-Metcalf', 'NR', 'Children''s drama series following the lives of students and teachers at Grange Hill comprehensive school.', 'Children''s drama series following the lives of students and teachers at Grange Hill comprehensive school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SziJYek4dEumfweUY9GnnOtcJS.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:3365'),
  ('496977023035133761', 'Granite Harbour', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kul Mahay, Adriel Leff', null, 'Romario Simpson, Hannah Donaldson, Dawn Steele, Michelle Jeram, Melina Åkerman Kvie, Kate Bracken, Alex Høgh Andersen, Afsaneh Dehrouyeh', null, 'Lance Corporal Davis Lindo arrives in Aberdeen Scotland as a new detective trainee. Having completed his final tour with the Royal Military Police, Lindo dreams of being a detective at New Scotland Yard. However, he finds himself being sent to train as a Detective Constable in the North East of Scotland, he must quickly adapt to his new life in Aberdeen, a world away from anything the soldier has known before.', 'Lance Corporal Davis Lindo arrives in Aberdeen Scotland as a new detective trainee. Having completed his final tour with the Royal Military Police, Lindo dreams of being a detective at New Scotland Yard. However, he finds himself being sent to train as a Detective Constable in the North East of Scotland, he must quickly adapt to his new life in Aberdeen, a world away from anything the soldier has known before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xHI2UUMBiKoox2QkI37C26j8EL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:215036'),
  ('578936142175584827', 'Grant', 2020, 'War & Politics, Documentary', null, null, 'Justin Salinger, Carel Nel, Jason K. Ralph, Brian Heydenrych, Francis Chouler, Dianne Simpson, Nicholas Dallas, Darron Araujo', 'TV-14', 'This documentary-series examines Grant''s life story using his perspective and experiences to explore a turbulent time in history: the Civil War and Reconstruction.', 'This documentary-series examines Grant''s life story using his perspective and experiences to explore a turbulent time in history: the Civil War and Reconstruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxRQTh6BE3rWqKPtqcx82G4RGOj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102395'),
  ('566550635407304155', 'Grantchester', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Daisy Coulam', null, 'Robson Green, Al Weaver, Tessa Peake-Jones, Kacey Ainsworth, Skye Lucia Degruttola, Rishi Nair', 'TV-14', 'In 1953 at the hamlet of Grantchester, Sidney Chambers—a charismatic, charming clergyman—turns investigative vicar when one of his parishioners dies in suspicious circumstances.', 'In 1953 at the hamlet of Grantchester, Sidney Chambers—a charismatic, charming clergyman—turns investigative vicar when one of his parishioners dies in suspicious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Itrb1x7OiA5A0XUreRuevR1hA6.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:61457'),
  ('1119682883006508816', 'Graves', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Joshua Michael Stern', null, 'Nick Nolte, Sela Ward, Callie Hernandez, Heléne Yorke, Chris Lowell, Skylar Astin', 'TV-MA', 'Former two-term President Richard Graves embarks on a Don Quixote-like quest to right the wrongs of his administration and reclaim his legacy 25 years after leaving the White House. His enlightenment takes place just as his wife Margaret Graves decides it’s finally time for her to pursue her own political ambitions.', 'Former two-term President Richard Graves embarks on a Don Quixote-like quest to right the wrongs of his administration and reclaim his legacy 25 years after leaving the White House. His enlightenment takes place just as his wife Margaret Graves decides it’s finally time for her to pursue her own political ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfWl1kOR6Y0CC7o1RDOaTYVAVoP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67371'),
  ('588343933181491408', 'Graveyard', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Evren Oğuz, Abdullah Oğuz, Onur Böber', null, 'Birce Akalay, Yerman Gur, Katie Anne Moy, Eylem Yıldız, Aybars Kuday, Adem Yilmaz, Halim Ercan, Arbil Tabur', 'TV-MA', 'Police Commissioner Önem leads a special investigations unit that solves tough cases involving violence against women.', 'Police Commissioner Önem leads a special investigations unit that solves tough cases involving violence against women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye6n3GdSaiSy81hiIRvf3vjVv1N.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:204255'),
  ('444407769209464077', 'Graveyard Carz', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mark Worman', null, 'Graveyard Carz is a reality television series that currently airs on Velocity. The show documents the select crew at Mark Worman''s collision shop Welby''s Car Care and their restoration, research and documentation of Chrysler vehicles. The restoration footage is bookended by Worman''s musings and commentary, usually at his workers'' expense. The crew also provides commentary on the projects, as well as about working with each other. Occasionally the owners of cars being restored visit the shop and tell their story. It is made on location at Worman''s collision shop in Springfield, Oregon.', 'Graveyard Carz is a reality television series that currently airs on Velocity. The show documents the select crew at Mark Worman''s collision shop Welby''s Car Care and their restoration, research and documentation of Chrysler vehicles. The restoration footage is bookended by Worman''s musings and commentary, usually at his workers'' expense. The crew also provides commentary on the projects, as well as about working with each other. Occasionally the owners of cars being restored visit the shop and tell their story. It is made on location at Worman''s collision shop in Springfield, Oregon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkLE9Kv1WvctL0LYRXuvpjvwF07.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:46791'),
  ('1129505146851008142', 'Graveyard Kitaro', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kimitoshi Chioka', null, 'Masako Nozawa, Chikao Ohtsuka, Isamu Tanonaka', null, 'Kitarō is a yōkai boy born in a cemetery, and aside from his mostly-decayed father, the last living member of the Ghost tribe. He is missing his left eye, but his hair usually covers the empty socket. He fights for peace between humans and yōkai, which generally involves protecting the former from the wiles of the latter.', 'Kitarō is a yōkai boy born in a cemetery, and aside from his mostly-decayed father, the last living member of the Ghost tribe. He is missing his left eye, but his hair usually covers the empty socket. He fights for peace between humans and yōkai, which generally involves protecting the former from the wiles of the latter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGMWgB4Rjk2jELgMOwaJgFcUGvz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37155'),
  ('982495280963335464', 'Gravion', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kenichi Suzumura, Hikaru Midorikawa, Haruna Ikezawa, Houko Kuwashima, Show Hayami, Jun Fukuyama, Mai Nakahara, Saeko Chiba', null, 'Gravion is an anime television series produced by Gonzo. It aired in Japan from October 7, 2002 to December 16, 2002 and ran for 13 episodes. In 2004, Gravion Zwei was released and aired from January 8 to March 25 in Japan, running for twelve additional episodes, answering the questions generated from the first series. Both Gravion and Gravion Zwei are created and directed by Masami Ōbari with mecha designs from Kunio Okawara. Both series were released in the United States by ADV Films.', 'Gravion is an anime television series produced by Gonzo. It aired in Japan from October 7, 2002 to December 16, 2002 and ran for 13 episodes. In 2004, Gravion Zwei was released and aired from January 8 to March 25 in Japan, running for twelve additional episodes, answering the questions generated from the first series. Both Gravion and Gravion Zwei are created and directed by Masami Ōbari with mecha designs from Kunio Okawara. Both series were released in the United States by ADV Films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgGBVK0oAi2FhWh5o8Z54Q9S7RS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12333'),
  ('725868647394842780', 'Gravitation', 2000, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Kazuhiko Inoue, Yasunori Matsumoto, Ai Orikasa, Fujiko Takimoto, Kappei Yamaguchi, Ryotaro Okiayu, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-MA', 'Aspiring singer Shuichi Shindo and his band, Bad Luck, work to become Japan''s next musical sensation, while he struggles to capture Eiri Yuki''s attention.', 'Aspiring singer Shuichi Shindo and his band, Bad Luck, work to become Japan''s next musical sensation, while he struggles to capture Eiri Yuki''s attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WGRX9mvcycn3PgNap0clEy0KgJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30979'),
  ('798966872149923168', 'Gravity', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eric Schaeffer', null, 'Krysten Ritter, Ivan Sergei, Eric Schaeffer, Ving Rhames, Rachel Hunter, Robyn Cohen, James Martinez, Seth Numrich', 'TV-MA', 'Gravity is an American comedy-drama television series created by Jill Franklyn and Eric Schaeffer. The series "follows the sometimes comic, sometimes tragic exploits of a group from an eccentric out-patient program of suicide survivors". It premiered on April 23, 2010 on Starz in the United States. On June 30, 2010, Starz reported that Gravity had been canceled.', 'Gravity is an American comedy-drama television series created by Jill Franklyn and Eric Schaeffer. The series "follows the sometimes comic, sometimes tragic exploits of a group from an eccentric out-patient program of suicide survivors". It premiered on April 23, 2010 on Starz in the United States. On June 30, 2010, Starz reported that Gravity had been canceled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/my3wzNVRGTCpaApDXJXcLDsgbE3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31393'),
  ('635430979139186519', 'Gravity Falls', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Alex Hirsch', null, 'Jason Ritter, Kristen Schaal, Alex Hirsch, Linda Cardellini', 'TV-Y7', 'Twin brother and sister Dipper and Mabel Pines are in for an unexpected adventure when they spend the summer helping their great uncle Stan run a tourist trap in the mysterious town of Gravity Falls, Oregon.', 'Twin brother and sister Dipper and Mabel Pines are in for an unexpected adventure when they spend the summer helping their great uncle Stan run a tourist trap in the mysterious town of Gravity Falls, Oregon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwi3p6PzKfQZ4YXBzv3CP5pO2dE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40075'),
  ('1043728336610803576', 'Gray', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'John J. McLaughlin', 'Patricia Clarkson, Rupert Everett, Wendy Crewson, Shawn Doyle, Jamaal Grant', null, 'CIA spy Cornelia Gray’s coming in from the cold after twenty years in hiding, dodging the Government agents who suspected her of being a traitor. She returns to her old life just as it is discovered that there is a new mole within her old spy network.', 'CIA spy Cornelia Gray’s coming in from the cold after twenty years in hiding, dodging the Government agents who suspected her of being a traitor. She returns to her old life just as it is discovered that there is a new mole within her old spy network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6u0kpkkEvIIOf4n5OMGVPGUAxHq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235727'),
  ('964073253476561039', 'Grease: Rise of the Pink Ladies', 2023, 'Drama', 'Annabel Oakes', 'Phylicia Pearl Mpasi', 'Marisa Davila, Cheyenne Isabel Wells, Ari Notartomaso, Tricia Fukuhara, Shanel Bailey, Madison Thompson, Johnathan Nieves, Jason Schmidt', 'TV-14', 'In 1954, a time before rock ‘n’ roll ruled, before the T-Birds were the coolest in the school, four fed-up outcasts dare to have fun on their own terms, sparking a moral panic that will change Rydell High forever.', 'In 1954, a time before rock ‘n’ roll ruled, before the T-Birds were the coolest in the school, four fed-up outcasts dare to have fun on their own terms, sparking a moral panic that will change Rydell High forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGu8u5F9Cjn9Ij2aMYtGmKHp5m1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94617'),
  ('308854285162895607', 'Great Barrier Reef', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Monty Halls', null, 'Monty Halls explores Australia''s Great Barrier Reef, one of the natural wonders of the world and the largest living structure on our planet.', 'Monty Halls explores Australia''s Great Barrier Reef, one of the natural wonders of the world and the largest living structure on our planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CYV2wJKRRf1MN7IfJIwAbqyt0U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46516'),
  ('179697782592159696', 'Great Barrier Reef with David Attenborough', 2015, 'Documentary', null, 'David Attenborough', 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'Following his visit to the Great Barrier Reef in 1957, naturalist and broadcaster David Attenborough returns and uses the latest filming techniques to unlock the secrets of the natural wonder.', 'Following his visit to the Great Barrier Reef in 1957, naturalist and broadcaster David Attenborough returns and uses the latest filming techniques to unlock the secrets of the natural wonder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ue5quQfo6HQl9vwf0msfpuD16b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64839'),
