  ('544802072554697407', 'Great Expectations', 2011, 'Drama', 'Brian Kirk', null, 'Douglas Booth, Jack Roth, Ray Winstone, David Suchet, Paul Rhys, Shaun Dooley, Gillian Anderson, Vanessa Kirby', 'TV-PG', 'Orphan Pip discovers through lawyer Mr. Jaggers that a mysterious benefactor wishes to ensure that he becomes a gentleman. Reunited with his childhood patron, Miss Havisham, and his first love, the beautiful but emotionally cold Estella, he discovers that the elderly spinster has gone mad from having been left at the altar as a young woman, and has made her charge into a warped, unfeeling heartbreaker.', 'Orphan Pip discovers through lawyer Mr. Jaggers that a mysterious benefactor wishes to ensure that he becomes a gentleman. Reunited with his childhood patron, Miss Havisham, and his first love, the beautiful but emotionally cold Estella, he discovers that the elderly spinster has gone mad from having been left at the altar as a young woman, and has made her charge into a warped, unfeeling heartbreaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcS3dqdpYj07cysAqkaCpKf6y7Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42518'),
  ('313152371755747440', 'Great Expectations', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Ze Xie, Chen Sicheng', null, 'Chen Sicheng, Yuan Hong, Tong Liya, Fu Dalong, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Zhang Li, Zhao Lixin, Ni Dahong', null, 'In 20th century Shanghai, Hong Sanyuan arrives with his mother and close friend, Qi Lin, in search of a better life. There, he came under the guidance of ferry leader Yan Hua. Hong becomes entangled in the power struggles between two large conglomerates, and eventually also becomes involved in political affairs.', 'In 20th century Shanghai, Hong Sanyuan arrives with his mother and close friend, Qi Lin, in search of a better life. There, he came under the guidance of ferry leader Yan Hua. Hong becomes entangled in the power struggles between two large conglomerates, and eventually also becomes involved in political affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykh8Mg0kfHLRAK1BFGUQe5fmXod.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102632'),
