  ('159682799142301307', 'Greyzone', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rasmus Thorsen, Oskar Söderlund, Morten Dragsted', null, 'Birgitte Hjort Sørensen, Ardalan Esmaili, Joachim Fjelstrup, Tova Magnusson, Johan Rabaeus, Virgil Katring-Rasmussen, Karin Franz Körlof, Lars Ranthe', 'TV-14', 'When a brilliant drone engineer, Victoria, is taken hostage in her own home, a series of dangerous events are set into motion in this high octane thriller.', 'When a brilliant drone engineer, Victoria, is taken hostage in her own home, a series of dangerous events are set into motion in this high octane thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AezOMa91QYDstgcxLhEkFDMqJEX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77484'),
  ('406273178220253728', 'Grid', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Lee Su-yeon', null, 'Seo Kang-joon, Kim A-joong, Lee Si-young, Kim Moo-yul, Jang So-yeon, Kim Sung-kyun, Heo Joon-seok, Lee Gyu-hoe', 'TV-14', 'In 1997, a mysterious ghost saved humankind and then disappeared. The mysterious ghost appears again 24 years later and helps a serial killer escape. Kim Sae Ha, Jung Sae Byeok and Song Eo Jin pursue the ghost for different reasons.', 'In 1997, a mysterious ghost saved humankind and then disappeared. The mysterious ghost appears again 24 years later and helps a serial killer escape. Kim Sae Ha, Jung Sae Byeok and Song Eo Jin pursue the ghost for different reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlC29GLbjwkwezeNGqyLrnuQUpb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135894'),
  ('562540371109425040', 'Grimgar of Fantasy and Ash', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Fukushi Ochiai, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Mikako Komatsu, Haruka Terui, Tomokazu Seki, Daisuke Namikawa', 'TV-14', 'When Haruhiro awakens, he’s in the dark surrounded by people who have no memory of where they came from or how they got there. As the darkness fades, a fantastic new world called “Grimgar” appears before them and their adventure begins—but first, they’ll have to choose their guild, class, and special abilities.', 'When Haruhiro awakens, he’s in the dark surrounded by people who have no memory of where they came from or how they got there. As the darkness fades, a fantastic new world called “Grimgar” appears before them and their adventure begins—but first, they’ll have to choose their guild, class, and special abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dP9okxs6ZrzPubTS3rhmrMDgMWe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65369'),
  ('115679917261170695', 'Grimm', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Greenwalt, Jim Kouf, Stephen Carpenter', null, 'David Giuntoli, Silas Weir Mitchell, Russell Hornsby, Sasha Roiz, Reggie Lee, Bree Turner, Claire Coffee, Elizabeth Tulloch', 'TV-14', 'After Portland homicide detective Nick Burkhardt discovers he''s descended from an elite line of criminal profilers known as "Grimms," he increasingly finds his responsibilities as a detective at odds with his new responsibilities as a Grimm.', 'After Portland homicide detective Nick Burkhardt discovers he''s descended from an elite line of criminal profilers known as "Grimms," he increasingly finds his responsibilities as a detective at odds with his new responsibilities as a Grimm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOptnt1QHi6bIHmOq6adnZTV0bU.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:39351'),
  ('1024971974032329858', 'Grimm''s Fairy Tale Classics', 1987, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Grimm''s Fairy Tale Classics is a Japanese animated anthology series by Nippon Animation. The episodes are adaptations of a variety of folk and fairy tales, and not limited to Grimm''s Fairy Tales.', 'Grimm''s Fairy Tale Classics is a Japanese animated anthology series by Nippon Animation. The episodes are adaptations of a variety of folk and fairy tales, and not limited to Grimm''s Fairy Tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpHfw8wNSFEFEZIrG7YGfudzlW7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9892'),
  ('459854503663712089', 'Grimme Award', 1964, 'News', null, null, null, null, 'Annual awarding of the Grimme Awards.', 'Annual awarding of the Grimme Awards.', null, 61, 'tmdb:tv:88795'),
  ('553112118985951385', 'Grimms Notes: The Animation', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Risa Taneda, Reina Ueda, Sumire Uesaka, Takahiro Mizushima, Junji Majima, Miyu Kubota, Aoi Yuuki', null, 'The story takes place in a world created by a beings known as "Story Tellers." At birth, all inhabitants of this world are bestowed with a "book of fate" where all their lives are written in advance. However, rogue Story Tellers known as Chaos Tellers are writing bad events into people''s books without them knowing. It is up to the holders of blank books of fate to seek out the Chaos Tellers and restore the world.', 'The story takes place in a world created by a beings known as "Story Tellers." At birth, all inhabitants of this world are bestowed with a "book of fate" where all their lives are written in advance. However, rogue Story Tellers known as Chaos Tellers are writing bad events into people''s books without them knowing. It is up to the holders of blank books of fate to seek out the Chaos Tellers and restore the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2maz7RReUStEmwXV1svJhCwd8MW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84665'),
  ('455745749886478405', 'Grimoire of Zero', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Yumiri Hanamori, Tsuyoshi Koyama, You Taichi, Takehito Koyasu, Masayuki Katou', 'TV-14', 'When a half-beast mercenary teams up with a witch who is in search of a magical tome that can destroy the world, a grand adventure ensues. Despite his hatred of witches, he enters an agreement that shewill make him human once she reaches her goal.', 'When a half-beast mercenary teams up with a witch who is in search of a magical tome that can destroy the world, a grand adventure ensues. Despite his hatred of witches, he enters an agreement that shewill make him human once she reaches her goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqjNMqv0Pj4idFHsr5wUQRyJ8rV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70875'),
  ('853573878271719954', 'Grimsburg', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Matthew Schlissel, Catlan McClelland', null, 'Jon Hamm, Erinn Hayes, Rachel Dratch, Alan Tudyk, Kevin Michael Richardson, Greg Chun, Martin Short', 'TV-14', 'Marvin Flute may be the greatest detective ever to catch a cannibal clown or correctly identify a mid-century modern armoire. But there’s one mystery he still can’t crack — his family. Now that he''s back in Grimsburg, a town where everyone has a secret or three, Flute will follow every lead he’s got to redeem himself with the ex-wife he never stopped loving, even if it means hanging out with the son he never bothered to get to know.', 'Marvin Flute may be the greatest detective ever to catch a cannibal clown or correctly identify a mid-century modern armoire. But there’s one mystery he still can’t crack — his family. Now that he''s back in Grimsburg, a town where everyone has a secret or three, Flute will follow every lead he’s got to redeem himself with the ex-wife he never stopped loving, even if it means hanging out with the son he never bothered to get to know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91KT0G2yCRJGIvsP5rZqzAOA5d8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:202224'),
  ('867633368754521362', 'Grisaia: Phantom Trigger', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Ayane Sakura, Kaori Nazuka, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yoshino Nanjo, Suzuko Mimori, Natsumi Takamori, Mikoi Sasaki', 'TV-14', 'What was once "Mihama Academy," a sanctuary for young girls, has now been transformed into a SORD (Special Organization for Research & Development) training school dedicated to fostering talent for national defense. Rena and Maki specialize in firearms, Tohka and Gumi excel at sniping, Chris handles explosives and data processing, and Murasaki is a skilled ninja for intelligence operations. Together, they take on cases too complex for the police or Self-Defense Forces, repeatedly facing dangerous missions. This is the story of these young girls, painted in blood and gunpowder.', 'What was once "Mihama Academy," a sanctuary for young girls, has now been transformed into a SORD (Special Organization for Research & Development) training school dedicated to fostering talent for national defense. Rena and Maki specialize in firearms, Tohka and Gumi excel at sniping, Chris handles explosives and data processing, and Murasaki is a skilled ninja for intelligence operations. Together, they take on cases too complex for the police or Self-Defense Forces, repeatedly facing dangerous missions. This is the story of these young girls, painted in blood and gunpowder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1AC8hMSPKK7OjeOldasielDWZE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280906'),
  ('447097918167969983', 'Griselda', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ingrid Escajeda, Carlo Bernard, Eric Newman', null, 'Sofía Vergara, Alberto Guerra, Christian Tappán, Martín Rodríguez, Juliana Aidén Martinez, Vanessa Ferlito, Alberto Ammann, José Velázquez', 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by real events, this fictional dramatization shows Griselda Blanco''s journey from Medellín to becoming "the Godmother" of Miami''s drug empire.', 'Inspired by real events, this fictional dramatization shows Griselda Blanco''s journey from Medellín to becoming "the Godmother" of Miami''s drug empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhEtK1lJKb3kqBtDBDXynGr3hJL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137893'),
  ('46651217325916607', 'Griselda Blanco: The Black Widow', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Yesmer Uribe', null, 'Juan Manuel Restrepo, Kristina Lilley, María Fernanda Yepes', 'NR', 'La Viuda Negra is a 2014 Spanish-language telenovela produced by RTI Producciones and Televisa for United States-based television network Univisión and for Colombia-based television network Caracol Television. It is an adaptation of the book La patrona de Pablo Escobar de José Guarnizo based on history from Griselda Blanco.', 'La Viuda Negra is a 2014 Spanish-language telenovela produced by RTI Producciones and Televisa for United States-based television network Univisión and for Colombia-based television network Caracol Television. It is an adaptation of the book La patrona de Pablo Escobar de José Guarnizo based on history from Griselda Blanco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkdGdQDXzL6uKDgSJRz3oJqOcrC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60637'),
  ('923508819459109930', 'Grisse', 2018, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Mike Wiluan, Ler Jiyuan, Tony Tilse', null, 'Adinia Wirasti, Jamie Aditya, Zack Lee, Alexandra Gottardo, Joanne Kam, Toshiji Takeshima, Marthino Lio, Wafda Saifan Lubis', null, 'Located in the middle of the 19th century, during the colonial era of Dutch India, the series "Grisse" follows a group of unusual characters who launch a rebellion against a brutal governor and finally have a chance to decide their fate.', 'Located in the middle of the 19th century, during the colonial era of Dutch India, the series "Grisse" follows a group of unusual characters who launch a rebellion against a brutal governor and finally have a chance to decide their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAvz3clFNMH3YpvdkmbvL1qCjUA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83873'),
  ('556149496954265210', 'Grizzly Adams', 1977, 'Western, Action & Adventure', 'Charles E. Sellier Jr.', null, 'Dan Haggerty, Denver Pyle, John Bishop, Don Shanks', null, 'An innocent fugitive from the law lives in the wilderness with a grizzly bear companion and helps passers-by in the forest.', 'An innocent fugitive from the law lives in the wilderness with a grizzly bear companion and helps passers-by in the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnD590es3gA7iuHsEzBIlePaR4P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:24123'),
  ('1075308457192345421', 'Grizzy & the Lemmings', 2016, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Antoine Rodelet, Josselin Charier', null, 'Pierre-Alain de Garrigues, Josselin Charier', 'TV-Y7', 'The forest ranger''s house is the only area of human civilization in the middle of untamed wilderness in a vast natural reserve in Canada. When the ranger is away, a bear named Grizzy feels that the ranger''s house is his territory, given that bears sit at the top of the food chain. After making his way inside the home, Grizzy takes advantage of all the modern conveniences there, including a comfortable sofa, air conditioning and fully equipped kitchen. He''s not alone, though, because a group of small creatures called lemmings also populate the ranger''s house when he is away. Because Grizzy and the lemmings are not civilized enough to live together in peace, it becomes an atmosphere of madness when the two sides try to outdo each other with tricks.', 'The forest ranger''s house is the only area of human civilization in the middle of untamed wilderness in a vast natural reserve in Canada. When the ranger is away, a bear named Grizzy feels that the ranger''s house is his territory, given that bears sit at the top of the food chain. After making his way inside the home, Grizzy takes advantage of all the modern conveniences there, including a comfortable sofa, air conditioning and fully equipped kitchen. He''s not alone, though, because a group of small creatures called lemmings also populate the ranger''s house when he is away. Because Grizzy and the lemmings are not civilized enough to live together in peace, it becomes an atmosphere of madness when the two sides try to outdo each other with tricks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpzSerTbEIspXUndYM7MGhhX7dm.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:74415'),
  ('537515756602224658', 'Groapa', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Millo Simulov', null, 'Daniel Nuță, Teona Stavarachi, Nicu Mihoc, Maria Buză, Marius Manole, Tudor Aaron Istodor, Antonia Scutaru, Ioana Brumar', null, 'The series "Groapa" presents a realistic and harsh picture of mafia life, family relationships, problems and love stories in a way that will make the people at home enjoy every second and understand that family is everything .', 'The series "Groapa" presents a realistic and harsh picture of mafia life, family relationships, problems and love stories in a way that will make the people at home enjoy every second and understand that family is everything .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4HQeg813SzPRLSDZzCbzuASZJO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:234955'),
  ('471008233743512335', 'Groom', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Adrien Ménielle, Robinson Latour, Florent Bernard', null, null, null, 'The son of a wealthy hotelier who must become a bellboy to reclaim his inheritance. The comedy follows the life of a grand hotel where internal wars, romantic relationships and a total lack of professionalism often put the welfare of hotel guests on the back burner.', 'The son of a wealthy hotelier who must become a bellboy to reclaim his inheritance. The comedy follows the life of a grand hotel where internal wars, romantic relationships and a total lack of professionalism often put the welfare of hotel guests on the back burner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dT2cFpGSc1sYK2ED3ZrrNQAKKd0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82504'),
  ('259404394408498828', 'Grosse Pointe Garden Society', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Jenna Bans, Bill Krebs', null, 'Melissa Fumero, AnnaSophia Robb, Ben Rappaport, Aja Naomi King, Nancy Travis, Matthew Davis, Alexander Hodge, Felix Avitia', null, 'When four members of a suburban garden club get entangled in a scandalous murder, they''re forced to bury the body – in their own well-manicured flower beds. In this juicy drama everyone''s got dirt… but some secrets never stay buried.', 'When four members of a suburban garden club get entangled in a scandalous murder, they''re forced to bury the body – in their own well-manicured flower beds. In this juicy drama everyone''s got dirt… but some secrets never stay buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klUDHKIwZWSKf8PR6oOTo351aby.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259454'),
  ('928416341631014454', 'Grossology', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Sylvia Branzei, Simon Racioppa, Richard Elliott', null, 'Paul O''Sullivan, Deven Mack, Michael D. Cohen, Krystal Meadows', 'TV-Y7', 'Brother and sister Ty and Abby Archer work for the government''s Grossology department as they solve crimes and save their world from disgusting supervillains.', 'Brother and sister Ty and Abby Archer work for the government''s Grossology department as they solve crimes and save their world from disgusting supervillains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5XknCHXcuN1DdV6PR304sFWfx2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6942'),
