  ('661750314399288203', 'Guerrilla', 2017, 'Drama', 'John Ridley', 'John Ridley', 'Freida Pinto, Babou Ceesay, Idris Elba, Daniel Mays, Nicholas Pinnock, Wunmi Mosaku, Rob Jarvis, Neve McIntosh', null, 'Set against the backdrop of one of the most explosive times in U.K. history, discover the story of a politically active couple whose relationship and values are tested when they liberate a political prisoner and form a radical underground cell in 1970s London.', 'Set against the backdrop of one of the most explosive times in U.K. history, discover the story of a politically active couple whose relationship and values are tested when they liberate a political prisoner and form a radical underground cell in 1970s London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5Cqh72RhEuspl3mfbs2mynefCl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70134'),
