  ('900996867459485269', 'Hack', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Koepp', null, 'David Morse, Andre Braugher', null, 'When corruption charges strip him of his job, his family and his pride, former cop Mike Olshansky forges a new identity as a Philadelphia cab driver, patrolling the city as a roving vigilante who works with local police.', 'When corruption charges strip him of his job, his family and his pride, former cop Mike Olshansky forges a new identity as a Philadelphia cab driver, patrolling the city as a roving vigilante who works with local police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75EwfXIG8r6xZjcwg6FZIOmZa7s.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10457'),
  ('744420279371739044', 'Hack My Home', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ati Williams, Jessica Banks, Brooks Atwood, Mikel Welch', 'TV-G', 'A team of four design wizards dreams up space-maximizing solutions and ingenious engineering ideas to transform families'' homes in inventive ways. Join families at a crossroads as the design wizards creatively transform their beloved homes to fit their changing lives.', 'A team of four design wizards dreams up space-maximizing solutions and ingenious engineering ideas to transform families'' homes in inventive ways. Join families at a crossroads as the design wizards creatively transform their beloved homes to fit their changing lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zESgw1Q4vFHD6n0wqN3GraeaxTQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228739'),
  ('681486799157892516', 'Hacka Doll', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miyu Takagi, Kaya Okuno, Nanami Yamashita, Reina Ueda, Ryoka Yuzuki', null, 'In 2xxx, amidst a highly-developed information society, human beings are drowning in a sea of information. This leads to a situation where people cannot find the necessary information. The only hope to solve this problem is a navigator program... Hacka Doll.', 'In 2xxx, amidst a highly-developed information society, human beings are drowning in a sea of information. This leads to a situation where people cannot find the necessary information. The only hope to solve this problem is a navigator program... Hacka Doll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KvG3KQLXyq9pNyedbFU6AIUzgz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73839'),
  ('509507204162333914', 'Hacked', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kenneth Dée, Veerle Peeters, Cedric De Vroey, Keanu Nys', null, 'Every day, Belgian companies, government agencies, and ordinary citizens fall victim to cybercriminals. But how do they operate? And how easy is it really to break into something? Our tech journalist Kenneth Dée puts it to the test with a team of hackers for the new Streamz series ‘Hacked’.', 'Every day, Belgian companies, government agencies, and ordinary citizens fall victim to cybercriminals. But how do they operate? And how easy is it really to break into something? Our tech journalist Kenneth Dée puts it to the test with a team of hackers for the new Streamz series ‘Hacked’.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5A9I4XD9riWXvgERKUIP3m0asPr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315808'),
  ('813522541425927149', 'Hackerville', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jörg Winger', null, 'Anna Schumacher, Voicu Dumitraș, Ada Lupu, Andi Vasluianu, Sabin Tambrea, Călin Chirilă, Toto Dumitrescu, Emanuel Pârvu', null, 'Following a cyber attack on a German bank, an investigator teams with local authorities and an elite hacker to track the suspects.', 'Following a cyber attack on a German bank, an investigator teams with local authorities and an elite hacker to track the suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHcg4cEVxT7355VRFGfbVp08Oe0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81807'),
  ('188080976191505499', 'Hacks', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lucia Aniello, Jen Statsky, Paul W. Downs', null, 'Jean Smart, Hannah Einbinder, Carl Clemons-Hopkins, Paul W. Downs, Megan Stalter, Mark Indelicato, Rose Abdoo', 'TV-MA', 'Explore a dark mentorship that forms between Deborah Vance, a legendary Las Vegas comedian, and an entitled, outcast 25-year-old.', 'Explore a dark mentorship that forms between Deborah Vance, a legendary Las Vegas comedian, and an entitled, outcast 25-year-old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ca5XiEFgyGsI38QT3wEKa1QVGX.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:124101'),
  ('333595345731315961', 'Had I Not Seen the Sun', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Chi-Feng Chien', null, 'Tseng Jing-hua, Moon Lee, Tan Shan-chien', 'TV-MA', 'Filmmaker Zhou Pin-yu interviews a serial killer in prison — an encounter that triggers a string of mysterious events tied to a buried past.', 'Filmmaker Zhou Pin-yu interviews a serial killer in prison — an encounter that triggers a string of mysterious events tied to a buried past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teWYMIihcVEXfthyTczzsYv3QuP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241576'),
  ('1112406480999336755', 'Hades Project Zeorymer', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Toshiki Hirano', 'Sho Aikawa', 'Toshihiko Seki, Chieko Honda, Mayumi Shou, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Rei Sakuma, Yuko Sasaki, Show Hayami, Masako Katsuki', null, 'A young man named Akitsu Masato is captured by a secret govt. project known as "Last Guardian". He is told that his life as a normal student was all a lie, and that his real destiny is to be the pilot of a great robot called "Zeorymer of the Heavens". The truth of this is hammered in when Masato sees his parents accept payment for raising him. The Last Guardian is preparing for the resurrection of "Hau Dragon", an organization bent on world conquest. 15 years ago, Hau Dragon built 8 great robots. Each of the mecha represents a force of nature. However, before any of the robots could be used, their creater Kihara Masaki destroyed the robots except for the leader: Zeorymer. He took Zeorymer and an embryo to the government. The embryo became the boy Masato. Now, Hau Dragon has rebuilt the other 7 mecha and wants the 8th. It will be up to Masato and Himuro to pilot Zeorymer and fight against the Hau Dragon, but neither Masato or Himuro are all that they seem.', 'A young man named Akitsu Masato is captured by a secret govt. project known as "Last Guardian". He is told that his life as a normal student was all a lie, and that his real destiny is to be the pilot of a great robot called "Zeorymer of the Heavens". The truth of this is hammered in when Masato sees his parents accept payment for raising him. The Last Guardian is preparing for the resurrection of "Hau Dragon", an organization bent on world conquest. 15 years ago, Hau Dragon built 8 great robots. Each of the mecha represents a force of nature. However, before any of the robots could be used, their creater Kihara Masaki destroyed the robots except for the leader: Zeorymer. He took Zeorymer and an embryo to the government. The embryo became the boy Masato. Now, Hau Dragon has rebuilt the other 7 mecha and wants the 8th. It will be up to Masato and Himuro to pilot Zeorymer and fight against the Hau Dragon, but neither Masato or Himuro are all that they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSNbvtDy1ohL66q0cld87qCWT0F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81014'),
  ('400436932062221365', 'Haechi', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kim Yi-young', 'Kim Yi-young', 'Jung Il-woo, Kwon Yul, Go Ara, Park Hoon, Lee Kyung-young, Jung Moon-sung, Bae Jung-hwa, Han Sang-jin', 'TV-14', 'Set during the Joseon Dynasty period, the series follows three people from different walks of life who came together to help Prince Lee Geum claim the throne and reform the Saheonbu.', 'Set during the Joseon Dynasty period, the series follows three people from different walks of life who came together to help Prince Lee Geum claim the throne and reform the Saheonbu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LvhwPDL4atqt3SuLDi1kfDtjdG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86094'),
  ('613488389680388125', 'Haganai: I Don''t Have Many Friends', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryohei Kimura, Kanae Itou, Marina Inoue, Kana Hanazawa, Yuka Iguchi, Emiri Kato, Mariya Ise, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-MA', 'Kodaka Hasegawa has just transferred to St. Chronica''s Academy and he''s having a hard time making friends. With his naturally blond hair and fierce looking eyes, people constantly mistake him for a delinquent. One day, he runs into his bad-tempered loner of a classmate, Yozora, while she''s talking to her imaginary friend, Tomo. Since neither of them have any friends, they decide to form a club and start recruiting some. Little by little, lonely classmates join their club to learn how to build friendships through cooking together, playing games, and other group activities. But, with so many misfits, will the club members really be able to get along?', 'Kodaka Hasegawa has just transferred to St. Chronica''s Academy and he''s having a hard time making friends. With his naturally blond hair and fierce looking eyes, people constantly mistake him for a delinquent. One day, he runs into his bad-tempered loner of a classmate, Yozora, while she''s talking to her imaginary friend, Tomo. Since neither of them have any friends, they decide to form a club and start recruiting some. Little by little, lonely classmates join their club to learn how to build friendships through cooking together, playing games, and other group activities. But, with so many misfits, will the club members really be able to get along?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaKPbowjQgbNgaQsTNBlU7e00FI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60730'),
  ('119819653849936245', 'HaHaHaHaHa', 2020, 'Reality', 'Chen Gezhou, Zhengyu Wang, 李笑', '李琳', 'Deng Chao, Chen He, Fan Zhiyi, Lu Han, Wang Mian', null, 'Road-type outdoor reality show. The five-kazakhstan tour group takes time out of the busy and trivial daily life to embark on a journey from east to west across China.', 'Road-type outdoor reality show. The five-kazakhstan tour group takes time out of the busy and trivial daily life to embark on a journey from east to west across China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wynP4QFfZNYHW0ETAbKVY9UjSbF.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:112732'),
  ('223789054902522716', 'Haibane Renmei', 2002, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryo Hirohashi, Junko Noda, Eri Miyajima, Fumiko Orikasa, Kazusa Murai', 'TV-14', 'A dream of falling from the sky...and then birth. Rakka is born from a large cocoon into the Old Home, greeted by a group of female beings with small wings on their backs and shining halos above their heads. Soon Rakka’s own wings grow, a halo is placed on her head and she is told that she must work in the nearby town of Grie. She soon realizes that the town and the entire world they live in are confined behind the Wall, a tall, impenetrable wall that none except the mysterious Toga are allowed to exit.', 'A dream of falling from the sky...and then birth. Rakka is born from a large cocoon into the Old Home, greeted by a group of female beings with small wings on their backs and shining halos above their heads. Soon Rakka’s own wings grow, a halo is placed on her head and she is told that she must work in the nearby town of Grie. She soon realizes that the town and the entire world they live in are confined behind the Wall, a tall, impenetrable wall that none except the mysterious Toga are allowed to exit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSrIXnPIUkapk0JwMldDZTusl5O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34164'),
  ('153684467986625275', 'Haibara''s Teenage New Game+', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yuto Uemura, Kanon Takao', null, 'Natsuki Haibara thought his high school years were a complete failure—until he suddenly wakes up as a freshman again, armed with all he learned in college. Determined to rewrite his school days, he joins the popular crowd, makes friends he never had, and grows closer to his crush. But second chances aren’t as easy as hitting “Restart.” Can Natsuki turn his regrets into a rainbow-colored youth?!', 'Natsuki Haibara thought his high school years were a complete failure—until he suddenly wakes up as a freshman again, armed with all he learned in college. Determined to rewrite his school days, he joins the popular crowd, makes friends he never had, and grows closer to his crush. But second chances aren’t as easy as hitting “Restart.” Can Natsuki turn his regrets into a rainbow-colored youth?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gle4UrLJK0s8YkkJEb7XUtdnTTy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316424'),
  ('557372086443110559', 'Haier Brothers', 1995, 'Kids, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Xiaotong Che, Gao Yang, Hewei Zou, Jiang Xiaohan', null, 'Haier Brothers, a pair of robots created by the Wizard, travel around the world with their friends to explore the stories of nature and overcome all kinds of difficulties on their journey.', 'Haier Brothers, a pair of robots created by the Wizard, travel around the world with their friends to explore the stories of nature and overcome all kinds of difficulties on their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNloAT0HIfxunLy3OgkBKPADIBf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91930'),
  ('720866814745624665', 'Haigakura', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Kaito Ishikawa', 'TV-14', 'The story is set in a secluded realm where deities and mortals both dwell. A youth named Ichiyō sets out to capture the gods who have fled and scattered all over the realm. Together with the subordinate god Tenkō, Ichiyō seeks the four evil gods who hold the key to the realm''s collapse.', 'The story is set in a secluded realm where deities and mortals both dwell. A youth named Ichiyō sets out to capture the gods who have fled and scattered all over the realm. Together with the subordinate god Tenkō, Ichiyō seeks the four evil gods who hold the key to the realm''s collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rk3IlmXhoSBwbTsYWWjnqtljnr3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244592'),
  ('888907515849537414', 'Haikara-san', 1982, 'Drama', null, null, 'Satomi Tezuka, Ichiro Mikuni, Shiho Fujimura, Kenzō Kawarasaki, Jiro Sakagami, Shirô Kimura, Judy Ongg', null, 'The 29th NHK Asadora. Starring Satomi Tezuka as a woman who starts a hotel in the Meiji era.', 'The 29th NHK Asadora. Starring Satomi Tezuka as a woman who starts a hotel in the Meiji era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Op2ojVX6ebGSOz0ZG40HQVj4Ue.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207581'),
  ('268111504251046094', 'Haikyu!!', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Kaito Ishikawa', 'TV-14', 'Inspired by a small-statured pro volleyball player, Hinata creates a volleyball team in his last year of middle school. Unfortunately the team is matched up against the "King of the Court" Tobio Kageyama’s team in their first tournament and inevitably lose. After the crushing defeat, Hinata vows to surpass Kageyama After entering high school, Hinata joins the volleyball team only to find that Tobio has also joined.', 'Inspired by a small-statured pro volleyball player, Hinata creates a volleyball team in his last year of middle school. Unfortunately the team is matched up against the "King of the Court" Tobio Kageyama’s team in their first tournament and inevitably lose. After the crushing defeat, Hinata vows to surpass Kageyama After entering high school, Hinata joins the volleyball team only to find that Tobio has also joined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBXEmHQaYoIAyOWRpu8v3cBGKcT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60863'),
