  ('285542514674282738', 'Hailey''s On It!', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Devin Bunje, Nick Stanton', null, 'Auliʻi Cravalho, Manny Jacinto, Gary Anthony Williams', 'TV-Y7', 'Hailey Banks is a risk-averse but resourceful teenager on a mission to complete every item on her long list of challenging (and sometimes impractical) tasks in order to save the world.', 'Hailey Banks is a risk-averse but resourceful teenager on a mission to complete every item on her long list of challenging (and sometimes impractical) tasks in order to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvsCloZWT4o9erWNOi643I265R3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138992'),
  ('829017913395722166', 'Haireta mou ton Platano', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Andreas Morfonios', 'Antonis Andris, Nikolas Stravopodis', 'Pinelopi Plaka, Thodoris Frantzeskos, Thanasis Kourlabas, Antigoni Drakoulaki, Tasos Kostis, Theodora Siarkou, Jenny Diagoupi, Penelope Pitsouli', null, 'The small Greek village of Platanos (Plane Tree) buries the elderly recluse Vangelas and notifies the deceased''s estranged children and grandchildren about his death. Vangela''s will leaves 3 million euros to his family, but requires them to move to the village and obey certain terms in order to inherit.', 'The small Greek village of Platanos (Plane Tree) buries the elderly recluse Vangelas and notifies the deceased''s estranged children and grandchildren about his death. Vangela''s will leaves 3 million euros to his family, but requires them to move to the village and obey certain terms in order to inherit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAu6or1W4G1q7wJxQfDmATtnIg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111551'),
  ('979098234950409107', 'Hak Lai, My Lady', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jinatcha Maneesriwong', 'Anajin Wanna Taengpasulert, Laneeya', 'Yotsawat Tawapee, Prapye Ramida Theerapat, Taentawan Taddeo Majoli Maggioli, Chertinnara Phongpeeradej, Supaporn Malisorn, Krissada Supphapprom, Samitpong Sakulpongchai, Rinyarat Watchararojsiri', null, 'After stealing the key to her mother’s safe box, Lalin heads out to find her biological father, but gets attacked along the way. Here she meets Pi, the owner of Huen Hak Phaeng Farm, whom she had an issue with prior. Chaos ensues when the key to her mother''s safe goes missing and she needs to stay at Huean Hak Phaeng Farm to find that key.', 'After stealing the key to her mother’s safe box, Lalin heads out to find her biological father, but gets attacked along the way. Here she meets Pi, the owner of Huen Hak Phaeng Farm, whom she had an issue with prior. Chaos ensues when the key to her mother''s safe goes missing and she needs to stay at Huean Hak Phaeng Farm to find that key.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3yKJpniY8ZdeXSS3vJ8x0SS4y8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218442'),
  ('436083106404655139', 'Hakata Tonkotsu Ramens', 2018, 'Animation, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Kensho Ono, Yuki Kaji, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Atsushi Imaruoka, Tomoaki Maeno, Aoi Yuuki, Kohsei Hirota', null, 'The city of Fukuoka houses a thriving criminal underbelly. It is here where Zenji Banba, a laid back detective crosses paths with Xianming Lin, a cross-dressing hit man.', 'The city of Fukuoka houses a thriving criminal underbelly. It is here where Zenji Banba, a laid back detective crosses paths with Xianming Lin, a cross-dressing hit man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tScQkhR6nIhiWFGIjdK8BKt9WTd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76126'),
  ('375588914816897430', 'Hakkenden: Eight Dogs of the East', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Satoshi Hino, Ayahi Takagaki, Tomoaki Maeno, Takuma Terashima, Hiroshi Kamiya, Daisuke Namikawa', 'TV-14', 'They would have lost their lives if they did not make the choice back then. The legendary eight beads and their owners... One is for someone important, and one is for his life as a human. The story of a destiny to encounter and fights lead by the beads, have just begun.', 'They would have lost their lives if they did not make the choice back then. The legendary eight beads and their owners... One is for someone important, and one is for his life as a human. The story of a destiny to encounter and fights lead by the beads, have just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GAmJkTKd3ekMvhQ8p8ap9Paltk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:48623'),
  ('373574361364915843', 'Hakkenden: Legend of the Dog Warriors', 1990, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bakin Kyokutei', null, 'Toshihiko Seki, Koichi Yamadera, Tomohiro Nishimura, Tessyo Genda, Minami Takayama, Noriko Hidaka, Akio Otsuka, Kappei Yamaguchi', null, 'During the war-torn feudal wars in Japan, the Awa clan faced certain extinction from a rival clan backed by demonic forces. However, a careless promise by their lord leads to both salvation and disgrace when their family dog brings back the head of the enemy warlord and insists on marrying the lord''s daughter. Their unnatural union bears fruit but when both are killed, the eight unborn pups are reincarnated as the eight Dog Warriors - The Hakkenden. As they slowly find each other and come together as a group, these eight warriors, who represent the eight separate aspects of Bushido, engage in bloody battles with demonic entities and evil samurai in a final attempt to redeem their clan!', 'During the war-torn feudal wars in Japan, the Awa clan faced certain extinction from a rival clan backed by demonic forces. However, a careless promise by their lord leads to both salvation and disgrace when their family dog brings back the head of the enemy warlord and insists on marrying the lord''s daughter. Their unnatural union bears fruit but when both are killed, the eight unborn pups are reincarnated as the eight Dog Warriors - The Hakkenden. As they slowly find each other and come together as a group, these eight warriors, who represent the eight separate aspects of Bushido, engage in bloody battles with demonic entities and evil samurai in a final attempt to redeem their clan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf93rGQTVo9X8uDWOzwc0q4Z2Ux.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28954'),
  ('495185373683953109', 'Hakone-chan', 2015, 'Animation', 'Yuuji Yanase, Daisuke Yui', null, 'Saki Ono, Taishi Murata, Mao Ichimichi, Yuuki Kuwahara, Ayaka Asai, Ayana Taketatsu, Aoi Yuuki', 'TV-14', 'Hakone, the spirit of the hot springs, has descended into the hot spring town. However, she had been sleeping for a long time, and she looked like a little girl! Toya, a high school student who happened to be there, will cooperate to regain her original power. A slapstick hot spring comedy created by the residents of the hot spring town and Hakone ! Finally decided to animate! !!', 'Hakone, the spirit of the hot springs, has descended into the hot spring town. However, she had been sleeping for a long time, and she looked like a little girl! Toya, a high school student who happened to be there, will cooperate to regain her original power. A slapstick hot spring comedy created by the residents of the hot spring town and Hakone ! Finally decided to animate! !!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXA8pAqm1TOzH5I40ukwgXtgFqz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90378'),
  ('268473128365356017', 'Hakumei and Mikochi', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Shino Shimoji, Risae Matsuda, Masaya Matsukaze, Mayumi Shintani, Atsumi Tanezaki, Chika Anzai, Megumi Ogata, Aoi Yuuki', 'TV-14', 'In a world inhabited by people only a few inches tall, young women Hakumei and Mikochi live together in a house built into a tree. Hakumei is an energetic and tomboyish carpenter, while Mikochi is a feminine and calm tailor. Despite their differences, they get along well and spend their days having fun living their lives in the woods. The two of them spend their time working, going on sightseeing adventures, and taking shopping trips into Tsumiki Marketplace by the ocean. They make many friends along the way, be they sentient woodland creatures like Iwashi the Weasel or fellow miniature people such as the songstress Konju and the inventor Sen. This is a relaxing look into the day-to-day lives of its titular characters as they explore and interact with their tiny world which seems to be straight out of a fairy tale.', 'In a world inhabited by people only a few inches tall, young women Hakumei and Mikochi live together in a house built into a tree. Hakumei is an energetic and tomboyish carpenter, while Mikochi is a feminine and calm tailor. Despite their differences, they get along well and spend their days having fun living their lives in the woods. The two of them spend their time working, going on sightseeing adventures, and taking shopping trips into Tsumiki Marketplace by the ocean. They make many friends along the way, be they sentient woodland creatures like Iwashi the Weasel or fellow miniature people such as the songstress Konju and the inventor Sen. This is a relaxing look into the day-to-day lives of its titular characters as they explore and interact with their tiny world which seems to be straight out of a fairy tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kH6xVLC5si3VHn1nhrGL8rDyGX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76127'),
  ('838931447403293540', 'Hakuoki', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tsunekiyo Fujisawa', null, 'Houko Kuwashima, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'Yukimura Chizuru is the daughter of a doctor who works in Edo; her father leaves Edo to work as a volunteer doctor and moves to Kyoto without his daughter. As time passes by, Chizuru starts worrying about losing contact with her father, so she decides to go to Kyoto in search of him. On the way, Chizuru is attacked by few criminals and witnesses a fight between an oni and the Shinsengumi. Taking her into custody and saving her, the Shinsengumi debate on what to do with Chizuru when they discover that she is the daughter of the doctor they are also looking for. So they decide to become Chizuru''s protectors and help her look for her father (the doctor). Lots of events happen while she stays with the Shinsengumi, as they discover mysterious secrets and also fight against the Bakumatsu group.', 'Yukimura Chizuru is the daughter of a doctor who works in Edo; her father leaves Edo to work as a volunteer doctor and moves to Kyoto without his daughter. As time passes by, Chizuru starts worrying about losing contact with her father, so she decides to go to Kyoto in search of him. On the way, Chizuru is attacked by few criminals and witnesses a fight between an oni and the Shinsengumi. Taking her into custody and saving her, the Shinsengumi debate on what to do with Chizuru when they discover that she is the daughter of the doctor they are also looking for. So they decide to become Chizuru''s protectors and help her look for her father (the doctor). Lots of events happen while she stays with the Shinsengumi, as they discover mysterious secrets and also fight against the Bakumatsu group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x98F4iTVwojYvpngeGbr9SXss7M.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44318'),
  ('105793687011837299', 'HAKYU HOSHIN ENGI', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Yuichi Nakamura, KENN, Tomoaki Maeno, Makoto Furukawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Nobunaga Shimazaki', null, 'When his clan is wiped out by a beautiful demon, young Taikobo finds himself in charge of the mysterious Houshin Project. Its mission: find all immortals living in the human world and seal them away forever. But who do you trust—and whose side are you really on—when you''ve been trained to hunt demons by a demon?', 'When his clan is wiped out by a beautiful demon, young Taikobo finds himself in charge of the mysterious Houshin Project. Its mission: find all immortals living in the human world and seal them away forever. But who do you trust—and whose side are you really on—when you''ve been trained to hunt demons by a demon?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hF5wnFp60yl4rHMOP3g0zVCakxh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75863'),
  ('656275313959949639', 'Hal & Harper', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cooper Raiff', null, 'Cooper Raiff, Lili Reinhart, Mark Ruffalo, Addison Timlin, Havana Rose Liu, Betty Gilpin, Alyah Chanelle Scott', null, 'Hal and Harper, two codependent siblings living in Los Angeles, try to preserve their childhood even though their single father forces them to grow up too fast.', 'Hal and Harper, two codependent siblings living in Los Angeles, try to preserve their childhood even though their single father forces them to grow up too fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqM46MePDr9BTU3qoNBFTBIZcqb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245640'),
  ('952182365478304840', 'Halef', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ercan Uğur', 'Ercan Uğur', 'İlhan Şen, Biran Damla Yılmaz, Onur Bilge, Veda Yurtsever, Aybüke Pusat, Sezin Bozacı, Mazlum Çimen, Mert Dogan', null, 'Serhat, a successful surgeon who escaped his destiny in Urfa and built a new life in Istanbul, married to Melek, is forced to return to his village to become an aga and marry Yildiz to end the family feud. With Melek''s arrival at the palace, he finds himself caught between love and duty, while buried secrets of the past are gradually revealed.', 'Serhat, a successful surgeon who escaped his destiny in Urfa and built a new life in Istanbul, married to Melek, is forced to return to his village to become an aga and marry Yildiz to end the family feud. With Melek''s arrival at the palace, he finds himself caught between love and duty, while buried secrets of the past are gradually revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8klMsEhz5erz1a8Njrb4x3EnyEl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:298629'),
  ('1124941916352309781', 'Half & Half', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Jeffrey Klarik', null, 'Rachel True, Essence Atkins, Telma Hopkins, Valarie Pettiford, Chico Benymon, Alec Mapa', null, 'Half & Half is an American sitcom that aired on UPN from September 23, 2002, to May 15, 2006. The show focuses on the lives of two paternal half-sisters in their twenties who were estranged throughout their childhood, and are finally developing a close relationship. The series is set in San Francisco. It was the second-most-watched show on UPN''s Monday night line-up and fourth overall on the network. The show was on The CW''s first draft line-up in March 2006, but due to several circumstances—including The CW''s contractual obligation to pick up Reba, the uncancelling of All of Us, and the pick-up of the Girlfriends spin-off The Game—Half & Half was left off the final Fall 2006 schedule and ended production. The series has aired in reruns on Global TV in Canada, Trouble in the UK and in local syndication in the United States. It also airs in the United States on TV One.', 'Half & Half is an American sitcom that aired on UPN from September 23, 2002, to May 15, 2006. The show focuses on the lives of two paternal half-sisters in their twenties who were estranged throughout their childhood, and are finally developing a close relationship. The series is set in San Francisco. It was the second-most-watched show on UPN''s Monday night line-up and fourth overall on the network. The show was on The CW''s first draft line-up in March 2006, but due to several circumstances—including The CW''s contractual obligation to pick up Reba, the uncancelling of All of Us, and the pick-up of the Girlfriends spin-off The Game—Half & Half was left off the final Fall 2006 schedule and ended production. The series has aired in reruns on Global TV in Canada, Trouble in the UK and in local syndication in the United States. It also airs in the United States on TV One.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TVku3ieyStr4mJihUZal2gay9I.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:619'),
  ('835596388947061325', 'Half CA', 2023, 'Drama', 'Arunabh Kumar, Harish Peddinti', null, 'Ahsaas Channa, Gyanendra Tripathi, Anmol Kajani, Prit Kamani, Rohan Joshi, Aishwarya Ojha, Sam Mohan, Manu Bisht', null, 'Two CA Aspirants from two different ends of the spectrum of the course, Archie and Niraj embark on the journey of one of the toughest courses and face the obstacles it has to offer.', 'Two CA Aspirants from two different ends of the spectrum of the course, Archie and Niraj embark on the journey of one of the toughest courses and face the obstacles it has to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ckzFeoUzaBYR23uv0f3C6BfeH5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230020'),
  ('123056640050152809', 'Half Man', 2026, 'Drama', 'Richard Gadd', null, 'Richard Gadd, Jamie Bell, Mitchell Robertson, Stuart Campbell, Neve McIntosh, Marianne McIvor', null, 'When Niall''s estranged ''brother'' Ruben shows up at his wedding, it leads to an explosion of violence that catapults us back through their lives.', 'When Niall''s estranged ''brother'' Ruben shows up at his wedding, it leads to an explosion of violence that catapults us back through their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mczVoq6ms8QMI9UfWSAVIocW1L7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257994'),
  ('1117387206444264710', 'Halfworlds', 2015, 'Mystery', 'Collin Chang, Joko Anwar', null, 'Thanabordee Jaiyen, Tia Taveepanichpan, Emma Emika, JeeJa Yanin, Myra Molloy, Teresa Daley, Nicole Theriault, David Asavanond', 'TV-MA', 'In the bustling streets and back alleys of Jakarta, a parallel world of bloodthirsty creatures from Indonesian mythology has lived alongside humans for generations. Taking on the appearance of humans themselves, the true identity of these "Demit" has been carefully concealed for centuries by a powerful family of mortals. The arrival of a mysterious supernatural event known only as the Gift will bring this hidden world to the surface. As the day of the Gift approaches, a young street artist named Sarah unexpectedly finds herself in the eye of the storm. Once the Demit realize who Sarah really is, and what she must do, humans and Demit are set on a collision course that could change the balance of their two worlds forever.', 'In the bustling streets and back alleys of Jakarta, a parallel world of bloodthirsty creatures from Indonesian mythology has lived alongside humans for generations. Taking on the appearance of humans themselves, the true identity of these "Demit" has been carefully concealed for centuries by a powerful family of mortals. The arrival of a mysterious supernatural event known only as the Gift will bring this hidden world to the surface. As the day of the Gift approaches, a young street artist named Sarah unexpectedly finds herself in the eye of the storm. Once the Demit realize who Sarah really is, and what she must do, humans and Demit are set on a collision course that could change the balance of their two worlds forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1fodBNgyaWok6dV1QjTirWo6QB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65267'),
  ('1037705462060460212', 'Halifax f.p.', 1994, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Roger Simpson', null, 'Rebecca Gibney', null, 'Halifax f.p. is an Australian television crime series produced by Nine Network from 1994 to 2002. The series stars Rebecca Gibney as Doctor Jane Halifax, a forensic psychiatrist investigating cases involving the mental state of suspects or victims. The series is set in Melbourne. The producers of the film were Beyond Simpson Le Mesurier; Australian Film Finance Corporation and aired on the Nine Network Australia Pty Ltd 21 Episodes of 90 and 102 minutes each were produced, and the series has screened in more than 60 countries. The budget for each episode was an average of $1.3 million. Funding came in part from the Australian Film Finance Corporation and Film Victoria.', 'Halifax f.p. is an Australian television crime series produced by Nine Network from 1994 to 2002. The series stars Rebecca Gibney as Doctor Jane Halifax, a forensic psychiatrist investigating cases involving the mental state of suspects or victims. The series is set in Melbourne. The producers of the film were Beyond Simpson Le Mesurier; Australian Film Finance Corporation and aired on the Nine Network Australia Pty Ltd 21 Episodes of 90 and 102 minutes each were produced, and the series has screened in more than 60 countries. The budget for each episode was an average of $1.3 million. Funding came in part from the Australian Film Finance Corporation and Film Victoria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8O8EknbSuSr3cV903XApwlWrKyp.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:15158'),
  ('627728626298839583', 'Halka', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Aziz Tuna C.', 'Aziz Tuna C.', 'Serkan Çayoğlu, Kaan Yıldırım, Nazan Kesal, Hande Erçel, Hazal Subaşı, Umut Karadağ, Erdal Yıldız, Burak Sergen', null, 'Two men unite against a criminal conspiracy, pursuing a dark past of notebooks, cases, and lies. They face the mafia, money, intrigue, and the terrifying Halka.', 'Two men unite against a criminal conspiracy, pursuing a dark past of notebooks, cases, and lies. They face the mafia, money, intrigue, and the terrifying Halka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yx8G3WmKnw5pHcrHsH96d0ZDvGv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85545'),
  ('275617408692398891', 'Hallo Kroket!', 2025, 'Kids, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'In the daily live show, the Ketnet wrappers draw you into the world of Ketnet and that of the Ketnetters. Expect famous guests, crazy scoops, fun performances, exciting games and so much more.', 'In the daily live show, the Ketnet wrappers draw you into the world of Ketnet and that of the Ketnetters. Expect famous guests, crazy scoops, fun performances, exciting games and so much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SG5skNN1GKTo6EsUag8KvptajY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:279257'),
  ('515447097746186363', 'Hallo Robbie!', 2001, 'Family', 'Markus Brunnemann', null, 'Marion Kracht, Karsten Speck, Till Demtrøder, Tim Braeutigam, Gerhard Olschewski, Tim Knauer, Laura Lehnhardt, Karina Kraushaar', null, 'Hallo Robbie! is a German television series.', 'Hallo Robbie! is a German television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFa6m9F9SBNCq3YN1LeWSWR2H66.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:40765'),
  ('148558452004258898', 'Halloween Baking Championship', 2015, 'Family, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'The country''s top bakers battle it out to create Halloween''s spookiest and most-irresistible treats. From spider cupcakes, cheesecake coffins and witch finger cookies to towering confections of terror, these bakers must prove their skills to the judges to land the $25,000 prize and the title of Halloween Baking Champion!', 'The country''s top bakers battle it out to create Halloween''s spookiest and most-irresistible treats. From spider cupcakes, cheesecake coffins and witch finger cookies to towering confections of terror, these bakers must prove their skills to the judges to land the $25,000 prize and the title of Halloween Baking Champion!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAVW4mcMTBEqFOaA3VRs5QHAbFy.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:74676'),
  ('929304464024752721', 'Halloween Wars', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jonathan Bennett, Shinmin Li, Aarti Sequeira', 'TV-G', 'Cake decorators, sugar artists and pumpkin carving experts battle it out as they create Halloween-themed edible displays. The last team to scare off the competition will take home a $50,000 grand prize.', 'Cake decorators, sugar artists and pumpkin carving experts battle it out as they create Halloween-themed edible displays. The last team to scare off the competition will take home a $50,000 grand prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wU1IWy50MwdjA035IUZJdLiZIKk.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:55323'),
  ('219407679039814933', 'Halo', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Kyle Killen, Steven Kane', null, 'Pablo Schreiber, Natascha McElhone, Joseph Morgan, Shabana Azmi, Christina Bennington, Natasha Culzac, Olive Gray, Yerin Ha', 'TV-14', 'Depicting an epic 26th-century conflict between humanity and an alien threat known as the Covenant, the series weaves deeply drawn personal stories with action, adventure and a richly imagined vision of the future.', 'Depicting an epic 26th-century conflict between humanity and an alien threat known as the Covenant, the series weaves deeply drawn personal stories with action, adventure and a richly imagined vision of the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UmNhZCEu8Vt3byMvNxNEPyf8EY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:52814'),
  ('842962769163477326', 'Halo 4: Forward Unto Dawn', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Stewart Hendler', null, 'Thom Green, Anna Popplewell, Darren O''Hare, Jen Taylor, Daniel Cudmore, Jenna Berman, Frank O''Connor, Chris Shields', 'TV-MA', 'UNSC Cadet Thomas Lasky must conquer his inner fears and join forces with super-soldier John-117 to take down a massive faction of the Covenant.', 'UNSC Cadet Thomas Lasky must conquer his inner fears and join forces with super-soldier John-117 to take down a massive faction of the Covenant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SkLtiW3TCsd2reJbuXSBemSV3X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56295'),
  ('240902959006776387', 'Halo Legends', 2010, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Frank O''Connor', null, null, null, 'This sweeping science-fiction saga delves into the rich “Halo” universe with seven exciting stories (told in eight parts) focused on Master Chief’s mysterious origins, the Spartans’ advanced combat capabilities, and the tense rivalry between Spartans and Orbital Drop Shock Troopers (ODSTs).', 'This sweeping science-fiction saga delves into the rich “Halo” universe with seven exciting stories (told in eight parts) focused on Master Chief’s mysterious origins, the Spartans’ advanced combat capabilities, and the tense rivalry between Spartans and Orbital Drop Shock Troopers (ODSTs).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2JIG3G7KDP6kJLqEUTtahoLAGS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60879'),
  ('823998060912724160', 'Halo: Nightfall', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Paul T. Scheuring', null, 'Mike Colter, Alexis Rodney, Alexander Bhat, Sarah Armstrong, Shaun Blaney, Alex Bhat', 'TV-PG', 'Taking place between the events of Halo 4 and Halo 5: Guardians, Halo: Nightfall follows the origin story of legendary manhunter Jameson Locke and his team as they are caught in a horrific terrorist attack while investigating terrorist activity on the distant colony world of Sedra.', 'Taking place between the events of Halo 4 and Halo 5: Guardians, Halo: Nightfall follows the origin story of legendary manhunter Jameson Locke and his team as they are caught in a horrific terrorist attack while investigating terrorist activity on the distant colony world of Sedra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOooLRV3eFNqft5WNRRnYwt8g8x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61634'),
  ('464784872654462553', 'Halo: The Fall of Reach', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Heath Corson, Kenneth Peters', 'Steve Downes, Jen Taylor, Travis Willingham, Britt Baron, Cole Jensen, Dane Jameson, Antony Del Rio, Michelle Lukes', 'TV-14', 'Kidnapped as children and conscripted into a brutal military training and augmentation program, the Spartans were designed to be the ultimate weapon against chaos and insurgency—but when a dangerous alien alliance known as the Covenant declares war on humanity, the Spartans might be our only hope.', 'Kidnapped as children and conscripted into a brutal military training and augmentation program, the Spartans were designed to be the ultimate weapon against chaos and insurgency—but when a dangerous alien alliance known as the Covenant declares war on humanity, the Spartans might be our only hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4etEBLWOyO7Z6pkPhNAxJTRWeXU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77184'),
  ('397563861840516593', 'Halston', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sharr White', 'Kristina Woo, Tim Pinckney, Stacey McCormack', 'Ewan McGregor, Rebecca Dayan, David Pittu, Krysta Rodriguez', 'TV-MA', 'His name built an empire. His style defined an era. American fashion designer Halston skyrockets to fame before his life starts to spin out of control.', 'His name built an empire. His style defined an era. American fashion designer Halston skyrockets to fame before his life starts to spin out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBRpPFcYAYLM7V3x6x7bP3Ucumj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99617'),
  ('632129284163382475', 'Halt and Catch Fire', 2014, 'Drama', 'Christopher Cantwell, Christopher C. Rogers', 'Katie Edgerton', 'Lee Pace, Scoot McNairy, Mackenzie Davis, Kerry Bishé, Toby Huss', 'TV-14', 'During the rise of the PC era in the early 1980s, an unlikely trio - a visionary, an engineer and a prodigy - take personal and professional risks in the race to build a computer that will change the world as they know it.', 'During the rise of the PC era in the early 1980s, an unlikely trio - a visionary, an engineer and a prodigy - take personal and professional risks in the race to build a computer that will change the world as they know it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtKo2gANo2QBgZN9ebTAa8hXnvv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:59659'),
  ('328534803372697528', 'Hamatora', 2014, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Wataru Hatano, Ryota Osaka, Yuki Takao, Jun Fukuyama, Sanae Kobayashi, Katsuki Murase, Yuki Ono', 'TV-14', '"Minimum"— Otherwise known as "small miracles", is a special power that only manifests within a few, select humans. Those who possess this ability are called "Minimum Holders." 2014: Yokohama. The detective duo of Nice and Murasaki, otherwise known as "Hamatora," wait again today for work with their friends at a table at Cafe Nowhere that they use as their agency. Suddenly, a job they receive seems to have a weird connection with the serial killer that their police friend, Art is searching for.', '"Minimum"— Otherwise known as "small miracles", is a special power that only manifests within a few, select humans. Those who possess this ability are called "Minimum Holders." 2014: Yokohama. The detective duo of Nice and Murasaki, otherwise known as "Hamatora," wait again today for work with their friends at a table at Cafe Nowhere that they use as their agency. Suddenly, a job they receive seems to have a weird connection with the serial killer that their police friend, Art is searching for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Z0ZI2ZSngF1nHvRVt9jnSGF026.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61791'),
