  ('600038356751123478', 'Hamish Macbeth', 1995, 'Drama', null, null, 'Robert Carlyle, Barbara Rafferty, Stuart McGugan', null, 'Hamish Macbeth is a comedy-drama series made by BBC Scotland and first aired in 1995. It is loosely based on a series of mystery novels by M. C. Beaton. The series concerns a local police officer, Constable Hamish Macbeth in the fictitious town of Lochdubh on the west coast of Scotland. The titular character was played by Robert Carlyle. It ran for three series from 1995 to 1997, with the first two series having six episodes and the third having eight.', 'Hamish Macbeth is a comedy-drama series made by BBC Scotland and first aired in 1995. It is loosely based on a series of mystery novels by M. C. Beaton. The series concerns a local police officer, Constable Hamish Macbeth in the fictitious town of Lochdubh on the west coast of Scotland. The titular character was played by Robert Carlyle. It ran for three series from 1995 to 1997, with the first two series having six episodes and the third having eight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ywr3qr3113VFoGarmm2vRpoNXh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15536'),
  ('817942151591568421', 'Hammarvik', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Soap', 'Camilla Läckberg', null, 'Disa Östrand, Linda Santiago, Martin Stenmarck, Christopher Wollter', null, 'When police officer Johanna Strand returns to her hometown Hammarvik to attend her mother''s funeral, she expects to stay only for a few nights but the body of a young woman is found and she decides to stay and investigate what happened.', 'When police officer Johanna Strand returns to her hometown Hammarvik to attend her mother''s funeral, she expects to stay only for a few nights but the body of a young woman is found and she decides to stay and investigate what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TxSc13KKRnyiKXJJohIA8GYGi8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:111820'),
  ('1010138576166371980', 'Hammer and Bolter', 2021, 'Animation', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Hammer and Bolter is an anthology series that delves into the dark corners of Warhammer, presenting a multitude of different characters and factions.', 'Hammer and Bolter is an anthology series that delves into the dark corners of Warhammer, presenting a multitude of different characters and factions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3DCi6ZXo0ISp8cIUHBJGmZggmy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132005'),
  ('94682797412326608', 'Hammer House of Horror', 1980, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Roy Skeggs', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Anthology series, in which each self-contained episode featured a different kind of horror. These varied from witches, werewolves, ghosts, devil worship and voodoo, but also included non-supernatural horror themes such as cannibalism, confinement and serial killers.', 'Anthology series, in which each self-contained episode featured a different kind of horror. These varied from witches, werewolves, ghosts, devil worship and voodoo, but also included non-supernatural horror themes such as cannibalism, confinement and serial killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qholDtTlB84TSE10qmliWFOvySz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43358'),
  ('189930103537294962', 'Hamster & Gretel', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Dan Povenmire', null, 'Meli Povenmire, Michael Cimino, Beck Bennett, Joey King, Matt Jones, Carolina Ravassa', 'TV-Y7', 'Siblings Gretel and Kevin are to be bestowed super powers by space aliens on their birthdays, but after Kevin''s powers accidentally go into Hamster, his pet hamster instead, they form the duo of "Hamster & Gretel". Now Kevin must figure out how to work with both Gretel and Hamster to protect their city from mysterious dangers.', 'Siblings Gretel and Kevin are to be bestowed super powers by space aliens on their birthdays, but after Kevin''s powers accidentally go into Hamster, his pet hamster instead, they form the duo of "Hamster & Gretel". Now Kevin must figure out how to work with both Gretel and Hamster to protect their city from mysterious dangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Mm4oQbsCbHbop7YQ9t0arXi9Ov.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156606'),
  ('239644228071817142', 'Hamtaro', 2000, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Kurumi Mamiya, Haruna Ikezawa, Ryoka Yuzuki, Ikue Otani', 'TV-G', 'The cute and cuddly pet of 10-year-old Laura, Hamtaro is a small hamster with a big sense of adventure! Join Hamtaro and the adorable rodent rascals who captured the hearts of millions of children the world over.', 'The cute and cuddly pet of 10-year-old Laura, Hamtaro is a small hamster with a big sense of adventure! Join Hamtaro and the adorable rodent rascals who captured the hearts of millions of children the world over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heeMIthcPavUaNJJl0YPARva2ua.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5622'),
  ('588680977566954527', 'Han River Police', 2023, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Kim Sang-chul', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Kim Hie-won, Lee Sang-yi, Bae Da-bin, Shin Hyeon-seung, Sung Dong-il, Nam Tae-woo, Park Ho-san', null, 'Han Dujin and his team investigate a criminal conspiracy in order to protect the Han River.', 'Han Dujin and his team investigate a criminal conspiracy in order to protect the Han River.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejuVj9BHwDxAYQiVtdpKn3R6sS1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211020'),
  ('103904577343511181', 'Hana-Kimi', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aya Yamane, Taku Yashiro, Kikunosuke Toya, Koki Uchiyama, Yuuichirou Umehara, Reiji Kawashima', null, 'Mizuki Ashiya is on a mission: disguise herself as a boy and enroll in a male boarding school to meet her idol, high jump star Izumi Sano. But after successfully infiltrating the school, she discovers he’s suddenly quit the sport! Now Mizuki must dodge suspicion, protect her cover, and somehow reach the boy she came all this way for—all while surviving the chaos of an all-boys dorm!', 'Mizuki Ashiya is on a mission: disguise herself as a boy and enroll in a male boarding school to meet her idol, high jump star Izumi Sano. But after successfully infiltrating the school, she discovers he’s suddenly quit the sport! Now Mizuki must dodge suspicion, protect her cover, and somehow reach the boy she came all this way for—all while surviving the chaos of an all-boys dorm!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCZn0Is62Tx4HC9WuFGYysjeHCx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254492'),
  ('784906360423060580', 'HANA-KIMI', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hiroyuki Gotō', null, 'Maki Horikita, Shun Oguri, Toma Ikuta, Mahiru Konno, Takaya Kamikawa, Seiko Matsuda, Takashi Ukaji, Kobayashi Susumu', null, 'Japanese-American track star Mizuki Ashiya transfers from a school in California to Japan, but not to just any old school. The school is Osaka High School—an all male high school! Mizuki Ashiya must disguise herself as a boy, all to get closer to her hero, Izumi Sano, a high-jump athlete who attends Osaka High. Now with short hair, flattened chest, and deeper voice, Mizuki becomes roommates with Izumi Sano, but trouble soon starts to brew. Izumi Sano discovers by accident that Mizuki is a girl and falls in love with her, but Mizuki is unaware of the fact. Complicating things, fellow classmate Shuichi Nakatsu starts to develop feelings for Mizuki, unaware that she is a girl!', 'Japanese-American track star Mizuki Ashiya transfers from a school in California to Japan, but not to just any old school. The school is Osaka High School—an all male high school! Mizuki Ashiya must disguise herself as a boy, all to get closer to her hero, Izumi Sano, a high-jump athlete who attends Osaka High. Now with short hair, flattened chest, and deeper voice, Mizuki becomes roommates with Izumi Sano, but trouble soon starts to brew. Izumi Sano discovers by accident that Mizuki is a girl and falls in love with her, but Mizuki is unaware of the fact. Complicating things, fellow classmate Shuichi Nakatsu starts to develop feelings for Mizuki, unaware that she is a girl!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43O4Izb9jMBt6rv3bsPOqbIsz1i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7030'),
  ('30404701187188804', 'Hanada Shounen-shi', 2002, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Kazuki Yao, Nachi Nozawa, Aya Hisakawa, Ayumi Kida, Houko Kuwashima, Ichiro Nagai, Kappei Yamaguchi', null, 'Hanada Shōnen Shi is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Makoto Isshiki about a mischievous young boy, called Hanada Ichiro, who attains the ability to see and talk to the supernatural after an accident to the back of his head. It was serialized in Mr. Magazine from 1993 to 1995. Hanada Shōnen Shi received the 1995 Kodansha Manga Award for the general category. It has been adapted into a 25-episode anime series by Madhouse and premiered on NTV on October 1, 2002. The series was adapted into a 2006 live-action film subtitled Ghosts and a Tunnel of Secrets by Shochiku.', 'Hanada Shōnen Shi is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Makoto Isshiki about a mischievous young boy, called Hanada Ichiro, who attains the ability to see and talk to the supernatural after an accident to the back of his head. It was serialized in Mr. Magazine from 1993 to 1995. Hanada Shōnen Shi received the 1995 Kodansha Manga Award for the general category. It has been adapted into a 25-episode anime series by Madhouse and premiered on NTV on October 1, 2002. The series was adapted into a 2006 live-action film subtitled Ghosts and a Tunnel of Secrets by Shochiku.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65xQIWb8O5nWKD5JPkZbHjPGADh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43228'),
  ('391162653526580423', 'Hanamaru Kindergarten', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Satoshi Hino, Erino Hazuki, Kaoru Mizuhara, Naomi Wakabayashi, Arisa Ogasawara, Ayumi Tsunematsu, Kei Shindo, MAKO', null, 'Anzu, Hiiragi, and Koume are three girls who attend the lively Hanamaru Kindergarten. There they have lots of adventures with their classmates and with Naozomi Tsuchida, their teacher who has just started working fresh out of school.', 'Anzu, Hiiragi, and Koume are three girls who attend the lively Hanamaru Kindergarten. There they have lots of adventures with their classmates and with Naozomi Tsuchida, their teacher who has just started working fresh out of school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49jZCqTAfmUN0qpTKWXElyxgjf3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42408'),
  ('244115203158526102', 'Hanasaki Mai Speaks Out', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Mio Imada, Koji Yamamoto, Kazuki Iio, Yū Kamio, Takaya Kamikawa, Rinko Kikuchi, Jun Kaname', null, 'Hanasaki Mai is but an ordinary employee of a bank, with zero diplomacy. She doesn''t think twice about pointing out her boss'' mistakes. Her job is to investigate any wrongdoings in the bank branches. She is the voice of the suppressed staff who are unable to go against their bosses. Her partner is the veteran staff, Soma Ken, whose career with the bank had reached a dead end, no promotions in sight. Together, they resolve all the non-compliance issues at the bank.', 'Hanasaki Mai is but an ordinary employee of a bank, with zero diplomacy. She doesn''t think twice about pointing out her boss'' mistakes. Her job is to investigate any wrongdoings in the bank branches. She is the voice of the suppressed staff who are unable to go against their bosses. Her partner is the veteran staff, Soma Ken, whose career with the bank had reached a dead end, no promotions in sight. Together, they resolve all the non-compliance issues at the bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCIzKW0ubyfYjFLtAtyOLJykl17.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70938'),
  ('137366610612971585', 'Hanasaku Iroha: Blossoms for Tomorrow', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Kanae Itou, Chiaki Omigawa, Aki Toyosaki, Haruka Tomatsu, Mamiko Noto, Yuki Kaji, Takako Honda, Tamie Kubota', 'TV-14', 'Ohana is sent off to live with her grandmother, who owns the hot spring inn. Upon arriving, she is put to work at the inn. Thrust into a life where the customers always come first, she struggles to find her place and fit in with her fellow coworkers.', 'Ohana is sent off to live with her grandmother, who owns the hot spring inn. Upon arriving, she is put to work at the inn. Thrust into a life where the customers always come first, she struggles to find her place and fit in with her fellow coworkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDWFlnPiN1EdKZDj4FMfjIwVJ5E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42417'),
  ('935847603929421925', 'HaNaYaMaTa', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Minami Tanaka, Reina Ueda, Kaya Okuno, Manami Numakura, Yuka Otsubo', 'TV-14', 'Naru is a high school girl who is average in every way. She loves fairy tale heroines, though she’s never had the courage to escape her ordinary life. One day, she sees Hannah, a transfer student, dancing in the moonlit and becomes inspired to learn Yosakoi dancing.', 'Naru is a high school girl who is average in every way. She loves fairy tale heroines, though she’s never had the courage to escape her ordinary life. One day, she sees Hannah, a transfer student, dancing in the moonlit and becomes inspired to learn Yosakoi dancing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MU7UxHjvFyjLlGwas0ocrGGae0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61528'),
  ('963803394471810657', 'Hand of God', 2014, 'Drama', 'Ben Watkins', null, 'Ron Perlman, Dana Delany, Garret Dillahunt, Elizabeth McLaughlin', 'TV-MA', 'A morally corrupt judge suffers a breakdown and believes that God is speaking directly to him, compelling him onto a path of vigilante justice.', 'A morally corrupt judge suffers a breakdown and believes that God is speaking directly to him, compelling him onto a path of vigilante justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTykpEIdJmWVM5Q3N4QrZHjkkbP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61263'),
  ('61163703545010732', 'Hand Shakers', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Sumire Morohoshi', 'TV-14', 'Tazuna is a high school student, living in Osaka, who loves to fiddle around with machines. One day, he receives a repair request from an university laboratory. He accepts the request and ends up meeting a girl named Koyori, who has been bedridden for a very long time. Suddenly, Tazuna and Koyori get pulled into a whole different world called “Ziggurat”. In this world, there are Hand Shakers, two people who touch hands and create the Nimrod. Their goal is to defeat other Hand Shakers in order to gain an audience with “God”, who will grant them wishes. Protect with your own Hands!', 'Tazuna is a high school student, living in Osaka, who loves to fiddle around with machines. One day, he receives a repair request from an university laboratory. He accepts the request and ends up meeting a girl named Koyori, who has been bedridden for a very long time. Suddenly, Tazuna and Koyori get pulled into a whole different world called “Ziggurat”. In this world, there are Hand Shakers, two people who touch hands and create the Nimrod. Their goal is to defeat other Hand Shakers in order to gain an audience with “God”, who will grant them wishes. Protect with your own Hands!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JJFZ4xXpkA40Vvnp0frYBgqf7b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69286'),
  ('1130154645077939319', 'Handa-kun', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuya Hirose, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Tetsuya Kakihara, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'Set six years prior to the events of Barakamon, detailing the life of Seishuu Handa as a high school student—and a very interesting life it is. In Handa-kun, Seishuu Handa is admired by his peers as a calligraphy genius and given the utmost respect, but Handa-kun himself is under the mistaken impression that the deference and attention he receives from the other students is actually bullying. Handa just wants to live a quiet life, but hilarity ensues as one character after another challenges his position as the school idol, and somehow comes away as a fan all while Handa is horrified and clueless.', 'Set six years prior to the events of Barakamon, detailing the life of Seishuu Handa as a high school student—and a very interesting life it is. In Handa-kun, Seishuu Handa is admired by his peers as a calligraphy genius and given the utmost respect, but Handa-kun himself is under the mistaken impression that the deference and attention he receives from the other students is actually bullying. Handa just wants to live a quiet life, but hilarity ensues as one character after another challenges his position as the school idol, and somehow comes away as a fan all while Handa is horrified and clueless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j79DiDWqfQZ7YhkEHS7MKuZKCh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67052'),
  ('269647329659277019', 'Handmade Love', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Ko Jae-hong', 'Lee Soo-hyuk, Lee Su Ji, Park Seung Ji, Seo Jeong-yeon, Rie Young-zin, Choi Su Jin, Yeon Je-hyung, Moon Ji-hoo', null, 'A romance fantasy that deals with Woven who has come down to the human world to heal human sorrows with clothes.', 'A romance fantasy that deals with Woven who has come down to the human world to heal human sorrows with clothes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghG4QGLbT7DKmh1YfL7wYGyGfQU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114521'),
  ('117369327668251137', 'Hands off: Sawaranaide Kotesashi-kun', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rikuya Yasuda, Hina Suguta, Yu Serizawa, Saya Aizawa, Manatsu Murakami, Ruriko Aoki', 'TV-MA', 'Kouyou Kotesashi, a sports doctor with massage skills, enrolls at Seiwa University Affiliated High School to secure a scholarship. He works as a live-in dorm manager, managing the school''s talented female athletes and managing their well-being through intense training and massage therapy.', 'Kouyou Kotesashi, a sports doctor with massage skills, enrolls at Seiwa University Affiliated High School to secure a scholarship. He works as a live-in dorm manager, managing the school''s talented female athletes and managing their well-being through intense training and massage therapy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTlVmoB4lcPcZaxUKF63Hqu2gUg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283880'),
  ('39293288930357361', 'Handsome Siblings', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wang Zixi, Ma Ming', null, 'Chen Zheyuan, Hu Yitian, Vicky Liang, Liang Jie, Tay Ping-Hui, Wang Zhen, Nikita Mao, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung', null, 'Clashing martial arts twins face relentless villains, thorny romance and brotherly rivalry as their troubled pasts catch up to them.', 'Clashing martial arts twins face relentless villains, thorny romance and brotherly rivalry as their troubled pasts catch up to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8rPZg0uEirxB3OrXk6yK0sUG8W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98039'),
  ('237127343224887714', 'Handwerkskunst!', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9zaFVQW7bhLWvjnCe6p8YpK5TC.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:223270'),
  ('724688127383997008', 'Handy Manny', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Marilyn Sadler, Roger Bollen', null, 'Wilmer Valderrama, Carlos Alazraqui, Dee Bradley Baker, Tom Kenny, Kath Soucie, Nika Futterman, Fred Stoller, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-Y', 'Manny Garcia, a kind, generous, outgoing handyman and his eclectic mix of talking tools help the people of Sheet Rock Hills with repairs both large and small, while teaching kids how to confront and conquer everyday problems.', 'Manny Garcia, a kind, generous, outgoing handyman and his eclectic mix of talking tools help the people of Sheet Rock Hills with repairs both large and small, while teaching kids how to confront and conquer everyday problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CCeh3UHSLedhi0wqz3dQmByaA6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10219'),
  ('1038621525572166581', 'Handyman Saitou in Another World', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryohei Kimura, Fairouz Ai, Nao Toyama, Cho, Ayaka Ohashi, Kouichi Souma, Yumiri Hanamori, Hinata Tadokoro', 'TV-14', 'Handyman Saito has never been anyone special. All his life, he’s had average grades, ordinary athletic skill, a commonplace job… But his unremarkable path takes a turn when he wakes up in another world. Here, warriors, wizards, and elves accompany him on quests delving deep into dungeons, and Saito realizes for the first time what it’s like to be needed. After all, who other than the handyman could be trusted to open locked treasure chests or repair his allies’ equipment? Beginning with a simple “thank you,” this is the story of an ordinary person’s fulfilling life.', 'Handyman Saito has never been anyone special. All his life, he’s had average grades, ordinary athletic skill, a commonplace job… But his unremarkable path takes a turn when he wakes up in another world. Here, warriors, wizards, and elves accompany him on quests delving deep into dungeons, and Saito realizes for the first time what it’s like to be needed. After all, who other than the handyman could be trusted to open locked treasure chests or repair his allies’ equipment? Beginning with a simple “thank you,” this is the story of an ordinary person’s fulfilling life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xp404PMU2cGsODMTIkkUizbYhcm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155942'),
  ('1061629111363380625', 'HANEBADO!', 2018, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Hitomi Ohwada, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Yuna Mimura, Konomi Kohara, Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'TV-14', 'Ayano Hanesaki, a first-year student at Kanagawa Prefectural Kitakomachi High School, has a badminton ability able to surpass others effortlessly yet avoids playing the sport. She meets Nagisa Aragaki, a third-year student who practices day and night aiming to become the best player in Japan. Encouraged by coach Tachibana Kentarou, supported by club colleagues, and fired up by various rivals, the two engage in their youth and adored sport so thrilling like a shuttle flown at high speed!', 'Ayano Hanesaki, a first-year student at Kanagawa Prefectural Kitakomachi High School, has a badminton ability able to surpass others effortlessly yet avoids playing the sport. She meets Nagisa Aragaki, a third-year student who practices day and night aiming to become the best player in Japan. Encouraged by coach Tachibana Kentarou, supported by club colleagues, and fired up by various rivals, the two engage in their youth and adored sport so thrilling like a shuttle flown at high speed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1MxY6A54M7jBNYSgBkaFMO4Wqa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80537'),
  ('343245843452168016', 'Hanekonma', 1986, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Kotaru Terauchi', 'Yuki Saito, Kirin Kiki, Ken Watanabe, Nenji Kobayashi', null, 'Rin Tachibana, nicknamed Hanekonma, grew up in Soma, Fukushima. Together with her parents, her sister and brother, and her grandparents, the story revolves around the Tachibana family and Rin''s life throughout many years.', 'Rin Tachibana, nicknamed Hanekonma, grew up in Soma, Fukushima. Together with her parents, her sister and brother, and her grandparents, the story revolves around the Tachibana family and Rin''s life throughout many years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rFTBRrOj2uKTNgoKm35PqGnDFY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109606'),
  ('410984446901613251', 'Hang Time', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Mark Fink', null, 'Daniella Deutscher, Megan Parlen, Adam Frost, Amber Barretto, Danso Gordon, Jay Hernandez, Phillip Glasser, Dick Butkus', null, 'New transfer student Julie Connor tries out for and wins a position on the Deering Tornadoes, her high school’s boys basketball team, much to the dismay of team captain Chris and snooty head cheerleader Mary Beth.', 'New transfer student Julie Connor tries out for and wins a position on the Deering Tornadoes, her high school’s boys basketball team, much to the dismay of team captain Chris and snooty head cheerleader Mary Beth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pT4BypFiwF2EpbOky2S97y9xZXc.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2715'),
  ('29770999785213059', 'Hang Ups', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Robert Delamere, Stephen Mangan', null, 'Stephen Mangan, Katherine Parkinson, Bebe Cave, Fionn O''Shea, Karl Theobald, Steve Oram', null, 'After the collapse of his previous group therapy practice, Richard is no longer able to conduct the traditional 50-minute sessions most therapists have with their patients. Instead, he''s developed a new form of therapy - weekly quick-fire sessions with his patients which take place online, through a webcam.', 'After the collapse of his previous group therapy practice, Richard is no longer able to conduct the traditional 50-minute sessions most therapists have with their patients. Instead, he''s developed a new form of therapy - weekly quick-fire sessions with his patients which take place online, through a webcam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swg4qZfaBcJA8cz3EYAFGfcmJRv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81683'),
  ('940849163899346354', 'Hangar 1: The UFO Files', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'John Ventre, Jason McClellan, Eddy Murte, Jeremy Ray, Jan Harzan', 'TV-PG', 'Delve deep into a vast archive of over 70,000 UFO files gathered over nearly half a century in Hangar 1. MUFON, an independent organization dedicated to investigating UFOs, has compiled these archives looking for connections, clues, and evidence to find the truth about UFOs.', 'Delve deep into a vast archive of over 70,000 UFO files gathered over nearly half a century in Hangar 1. MUFON, an independent organization dedicated to investigating UFOs, has compiled these archives looking for connections, clues, and evidence to find the truth about UFOs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7JYJGFK4aI50KxuuGphhRkIUw5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64900'),
  ('35255926885206733', 'Hangin'' with Mr. Cooper', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Franklin', null, 'Mark Curry, Saundra Quarterman, Holly Robinson Peete, Marquise Wilson, Raven-Symoné, Omar Gooding', null, 'Former NBA player Mark Cooper becomes a dedicated teacher and basketball coach in Oakland after his playing career ends. When he''s not dealing with his students and players, Mark spends time with his gorgeous female roommate and other friends.', 'Former NBA player Mark Cooper becomes a dedicated teacher and basketball coach in Oakland after his playing career ends. When he''s not dealing with his students and players, Mark spends time with his gorgeous female roommate and other friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6jjIhPcvNijt632WAa4AuXu73L.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4438'),
  ('125330683386355306', 'Hank Zipzer', 2014, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Nick James, Jayden Elijah, Alicia Lai, Madeline Holliday, Felicity Montagu, Henry Winkler, Javone Prince, Juliet Cowan', 'TV-Y', '12-year-old Henry ‘Hank’ Zipzer is a smart and resourceful boy with a unique perspective on the world. Hank has dyslexia, and when problems arise, he deals with them in a way no-one else would – putting him on a direct collision course with his teachers and parents, who don’t seem to appreciate his latest scheme as much as he thought they would... But, Hank always remains positive and convinced that the next big plan will deliver – after all, tomorrow is another day!', '12-year-old Henry ‘Hank’ Zipzer is a smart and resourceful boy with a unique perspective on the world. Hank has dyslexia, and when problems arise, he deals with them in a way no-one else would – putting him on a direct collision course with his teachers and parents, who don’t seem to appreciate his latest scheme as much as he thought they would... But, Hank always remains positive and convinced that the next big plan will deliver – after all, tomorrow is another day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plkIkNr0ZuG7KPHlSQNPtcU5Lgm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71781'),
  ('842003511979573506', 'Hanna', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'David Farr', 'Seth Lochhead', 'Esmé Creed-Miles, Mireille Enos, Dermot Mulroney, Ray Liotta', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the journey of an extraordinary young girl as she evades the relentless pursuit of an off-book CIA agent and tries to unearth the truth behind who she is.', 'Follow the journey of an extraordinary young girl as she evades the relentless pursuit of an off-book CIA agent and tries to unearth the truth behind who she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYUtjx1EN4SVTgxd2TB4cZTGSQb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:54155'),
  ('631304517634721596', 'Hannah Montana', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Barry O''Brien, Rich Correll, Michael Poryes', 'Rich Correll, Barry O''Brien, Kim C. Friese', 'Miley Cyrus, Emily Osment, Jason Earles, Billy Ray Cyrus, Moisés Arias', 'TV-G', 'At home and school, she''s Miley Stewart, a typical teenager, but when the lights go down and the curtain goes up, she emerges as the glamorous and talented Hannah Montana. Having the "Best of Both Worlds" is a complicated proposition, and keeping her identity under wraps leads Miley and her friends into some hilarious capers as she tries to balance her normal life with her rock star persona.', 'At home and school, she''s Miley Stewart, a typical teenager, but when the lights go down and the curtain goes up, she emerges as the glamorous and talented Hannah Montana. Having the "Best of Both Worlds" is a complicated proposition, and keeping her identity under wraps leads Miley and her friends into some hilarious capers as she tries to balance her normal life with her rock star persona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRqLl0SHA4diTL8zvUTgBw6DQeM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4610'),
  ('122950432585253172', 'Hannibal', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bryan Fuller', null, 'Mads Mikkelsen, Hugh Dancy, Laurence Fishburne, Caroline Dhavernas, Gillian Anderson', 'TV-MA', 'Both a gift and a curse, Graham has the extraordinary ability to think like his prey—he sees what they see, feels what they feel. But while Graham is pursuing an especially troubling, cannibalistic murderer, Special Agent Jack Crawford teams him with a highly respected psychiatrist – a man with a taste for the criminal minded – Dr. Hannibal Lecter.', 'Both a gift and a curse, Graham has the extraordinary ability to think like his prey—he sees what they see, feels what they feel. But while Graham is pursuing an especially troubling, cannibalistic murderer, Special Agent Jack Crawford teams him with a highly respected psychiatrist – a man with a taste for the criminal minded – Dr. Hannibal Lecter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbV2eLnKSIm1epSZt473UYfqaeZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:40008'),
  ('1062997860287950461', 'Hannity', 2009, 'War & Politics, Talk', null, null, 'Sean Hannity', 'NR', 'Hannity is a television show on the Fox News network, a replacement to the long-running show Hannity & Colmes. It is hosted by conservative political pundit Sean Hannity. Following the announcement on November 25, 2008 that Alan Colmes would leave the show, it was decided that the show would simply be entitled Hannity.', 'Hannity is a television show on the Fox News network, a replacement to the long-running show Hannity & Colmes. It is hosted by conservative political pundit Sean Hannity. Following the announcement on November 25, 2008 that Alan Colmes would leave the show, it was decided that the show would simply be entitled Hannity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgsiUbEtH6g8Px6T8gLu5DTQKtT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16279'),
  ('1003192726077438871', 'Hanno ucciso l''Uomo Ragno - La leggendaria storia degli 883', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Sydney Sibilia', null, 'Elia Nuzzolo, Matteo Oscar Giuggioli, Davide Calgaro, Ludovica Barbarito, Edoardo Ferrario', null, 'In the late 1980s, in the small Italian town Pavia, teenager Max finds solace in comic books and American music, standing out as a non-conformist in a place there is nothing to be rebellious about. After neglecting high school to pursue friendships and punk nights, failure inevitably catches up with him. But this opens doors to a life-changing opportunity, transferring to a new high school where he crosses paths with Mauro. Music makes the pair inseparable. Thanks to Mauro’s driving force, Max embraces his musical talent and together they compose the first songs that will be produced by Claudio Cecchetto. But when success overwhelms them, the question arises: will Max and Mauro, despite their differences, manage to stick together?', 'In the late 1980s, in the small Italian town Pavia, teenager Max finds solace in comic books and American music, standing out as a non-conformist in a place there is nothing to be rebellious about. After neglecting high school to pursue friendships and punk nights, failure inevitably catches up with him. But this opens doors to a life-changing opportunity, transferring to a new high school where he crosses paths with Mauro. Music makes the pair inseparable. Thanks to Mauro’s driving force, Max embraces his musical talent and together they compose the first songs that will be produced by Claudio Cecchetto. But when success overwhelms them, the question arises: will Max and Mauro, despite their differences, manage to stick together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7AkRxRGiD2s0lO8xY6RbVSPWFl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:273419'),
  ('1001001280872959192', 'Hanzawa Naoki', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jun Ikeido', null, 'Masato Sakai, Aya Ueto, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Ainosuke Kataoka, Kento Kaku, Miku Natsume, Michitaka Tsutsui, Noriko Eguchi', 'NR', 'Hanzawa Naoki works as a loan manager at the Osaka Nishi branch of Tokyo Central Bank. One day, Hanzawa makes a loan contract for 500 million yen with Nishi Osaka Steel Company. Hanzawa didn''t want to approve the loan, but he had to due to the branch manager''s order. Nishi Osaka Steel Company seems financially stable, but the company actually hides massive amounts of debt through fraudulent accounts. The company is caught. Three months later, Nishi Osaka Steel Company goes bankrupt. The bank''s branch manager is Asano. He is an ambitious man and tries to shift the blame to Hanzawa. Hanzawa then attends an inquiry about the loan failure at the bank''s headquarters in Tokyo. Hanzawa denies fault and promises to retrieve the 500 million yen loan. He did this because it''s the only way for Hanzawa to survive as a banker.', 'Hanzawa Naoki works as a loan manager at the Osaka Nishi branch of Tokyo Central Bank. One day, Hanzawa makes a loan contract for 500 million yen with Nishi Osaka Steel Company. Hanzawa didn''t want to approve the loan, but he had to due to the branch manager''s order. Nishi Osaka Steel Company seems financially stable, but the company actually hides massive amounts of debt through fraudulent accounts. The company is caught. Three months later, Nishi Osaka Steel Company goes bankrupt. The bank''s branch manager is Asano. He is an ambitious man and tries to shift the blame to Hanzawa. Hanzawa then attends an inquiry about the loan failure at the bank''s headquarters in Tokyo. Hanzawa denies fault and promises to retrieve the 500 million yen loan. He did this because it''s the only way for Hanzawa to survive as a banker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Qnk3QvC8gxTWH5uM8thovg1j4Q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:55925'),
  ('77440426833928063', 'Hap and Leonard', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Nick Damici, Jim Mickle', null, 'James Purefoy, Michael Kenneth Williams, Nicholas Logan', 'TV-MA', 'A darkly comic swamp noir story of two best friends set in the late 1980s. Based on the novels by Joe R. Lansdale, the series follows Hap Collins, an East Texas white boy with a weakness for Southern women, and Leonard Pine, a gay, black Vietnam vet with a hot temper.', 'A darkly comic swamp noir story of two best friends set in the late 1980s. Based on the novels by Joe R. Lansdale, the series follows Hap Collins, an East Texas white boy with a weakness for Southern women, and Leonard Pine, a gay, black Vietnam vet with a hot temper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v3o7UF5SbkbkMFPR0lJo9GyR53.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64835'),
  ('210077173342382350', 'Happily Divorced', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Peter Marc Jacobson, Fran Drescher', null, 'Fran Drescher, John Michael Higgins, Tichina Arnold, Valente Rodriguez, Robert Walden, Rita Moreno', 'TV-14', 'After eighteen years of marital life, Fran is shocked when her husband reveals that he is gay. Living under the same roof, the two of them date various men.', 'After eighteen years of marital life, Fran is shocked when her husband reveals that he is gay. Living under the same roof, the two of them date various men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvCwrdDm5wQ8kwoCx1snA78Kpup.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38919'),
  ('447073848331530939', 'Happily Ever After: Fairy Tales for Every Child', 1995, 'Animation', null, null, 'Robert Guillaume', 'TV-Y', 'Happily Ever After: Fairy Tales for Every Child is an American anthology animated television series.', 'Happily Ever After: Fairy Tales for Every Child is an American anthology animated television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4fvwf2hJVz3fPB4wIjEchuvXuD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10906'),
  ('289423127880337565', 'Happily Married', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Patrice Robitaille, Karine Gonthier-Hyndman, Marilyn Castonguay, François Létourneau, Sophie Desmarais, René Richard Cyr', null, 'In 1974, in the quiet suburb of Sainte-Foy, two discontented couples bring their kids to summer camp. Once home, they must face the pitiful state their marriages are in. Unable to deal with their problems, they become the most infamous criminals in the history of organized crime in Quebec City.', 'In 1974, in the quiet suburb of Sainte-Foy, two discontented couples bring their kids to summer camp. Once home, they must face the pitiful state their marriages are in. Unable to deal with their problems, they become the most infamous criminals in the history of organized crime in Quebec City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GcUu5vbvNF0SHOu5m8GMbKgM0o.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:97198'),
  ('1032409460686813398', 'Happiness', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Han Sang-un', 'Han Sang-un', 'Han Hyo-joo, Park Hyung-sik, Joo Jong-hyuk, Lee Ju-seung, Jo Woo-jin, Lee Jun-hyeok, Park Joo-hee, Bek Hyun-jin', 'TV-14', 'A new type of deadly virus spread throughout the city, and the apartment where has different social classes of people is sealed off. With the fear of the virus, and the conflicts of the different classes, the residents have to spend and survive in the new habitation.', 'A new type of deadly virus spread throughout the city, and the apartment where has different social classes of people is sealed off. With the fear of the virus, and the conflicts of the different classes, the residents have to spend and survive in the new habitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EnkVJwDP2QSJqOKte9EUjYKu4C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135340'),
  ('302061297749428273', 'Happiness as Flowers', 2005, 'Drama', '石钟山', 'Wang Wanping, 石钟山', 'Sun Li, Deng Chao, Xin Baiqing, Yin Tao, Yu Bin, Wang Liyun, Bai Zhidi, 王乙竹', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOoH0j2srueSUvAsPdik0JzdmQn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204149'),
  ('1063618739729721392', 'Happiness Charge PreCure!', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Megumi Nakajima, Megumi Han, Rina Kitagawa, Haruka Tomatsu, Naoko Matsui, Miyuki Kobori, Shouma Yamamoto, Ryosuke Kanemoto', null, 'The ruler of the evil Phantom Empire, Queen Mirage, begins her invasion on Earth using an army of Choiarks and powerful monsters called Saiarks. All across the world, Pretty Cures are dispatched to fight against the Phantom Empire threat. Hime Shirayuki, a princess from the Blue Sky Kingdom, which was taken over by the Phantom Empire, joins the fight as a Pretty Cure named Cure Princess, but always finds herself running away scared. Given a Crystal of Love by the Spirit of Earth, Blue, and told to seek out a partner to fight alongside her, Hime goes to the city of Pikarigaoka and randomly throw the crystal in the air, deciding to partner up with whoever it lands upon. This person turns out to be Megumi Aino, a kind-hearted girl always looking to help others, who is recruited by Hime to fight by her side as Cure Lovely.', 'The ruler of the evil Phantom Empire, Queen Mirage, begins her invasion on Earth using an army of Choiarks and powerful monsters called Saiarks. All across the world, Pretty Cures are dispatched to fight against the Phantom Empire threat. Hime Shirayuki, a princess from the Blue Sky Kingdom, which was taken over by the Phantom Empire, joins the fight as a Pretty Cure named Cure Princess, but always finds herself running away scared. Given a Crystal of Love by the Spirit of Earth, Blue, and told to seek out a partner to fight alongside her, Hime goes to the city of Pikarigaoka and randomly throw the crystal in the air, deciding to partner up with whoever it lands upon. This person turns out to be Megumi Aino, a kind-hearted girl always looking to help others, who is recruited by Hime to fight by her side as Cure Lovely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvi9BLlnB4IA0qr28RVFVRf5Lnn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105468'),
  ('734503862275142596', 'Happiness is Easy', 2021, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Han Jie', 'Chen Jianbin, Mei Ting, Zhai Xiaoxing, Tu Songyan, Liu Weiwei, Yu Mingjia, Chi Jia, Wu Xiaomin', null, 'Ma Liewen, a dedicated bookseller fights to keep his dream alive while caring for his ex-wife and forming a bond with Jian Dan, a former teacher recovering from heartbreak. As past and present collide, he must choose between love, duty, and his future.', 'Ma Liewen, a dedicated bookseller fights to keep his dream alive while caring for his ex-wife and forming a bond with Jian Dan, a former teacher recovering from heartbreak. As past and present collide, he must choose between love, duty, and his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuDw74NRuF6ekoPCTSXzrhwBS8Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138798'),
  ('800813784775978621', 'Happy Days', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Garry Marshall', null, 'Henry Winkler, Tom Bosley, Marion Ross, Anson Williams, Scott Baio, Ted McGinley, Erin Moran', 'TV-G', 'In 1950s Milwaukee the Cunningham family must contend with Fonzie, a motorcycle riding Casanova.', 'In 1950s Milwaukee the Cunningham family must contend with Fonzie, a motorcycle riding Casanova.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sepIwNPCEhkKvFOQSjXK6tekkjR.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:3845'),
  ('880914162549831077', 'Happy End', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alexey Kiselev', 'Evgeny Sangadzhiev, Vladimir Vasilyev, Mikhail Zubko', 'Elena Tronina, Denis Vlasenko, Aleksandr Gorchilin, Lyubov Tolkalina, Daniil Vorobyov, Lukerya Ilyashenko, Alexey Agranovich, Darya Feklenko', null, 'The series depicts the journey of a young couple who have decided to turn their relationship into a sexual attraction for the whole world through the webcam.', 'The series depicts the journey of a young couple who have decided to turn their relationship into a sexual attraction for the whole world through the webcam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8q1fKQ5Ur039ouEbOMVJyP2T9SV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122648'),
  ('255816383399918583', 'Happy Ending Romance', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lee seo jung', null, 'Jung Taek-woon, Ha Jong-woo, Park Hyun-chul, Kim Kwang-kyu, Im Too-chul, Jung Ji Yeon, Kim Nak-kyun, Shin Yu-eun', null, 'Jung-woo, unfairly ostracized from the literary world, finds refuge with Jung-hyun, a respected senior. Years later, their codependent lifestyle is disrupted by Tae-young, a young publisher seeking to publish Jung-woo''s comeback novel.', 'Jung-woo, unfairly ostracized from the literary world, finds refuge with Jung-hyun, a respected senior. Years later, their codependent lifestyle is disrupted by Tae-young, a young publisher seeking to publish Jung-woo''s comeback novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wTEYfOVfK3tzS3JEX4l2rKiMj6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214406'),
  ('302496750955458732', 'Happy Endings', 2011, 'Comedy', 'David Caspe', null, 'Eliza Coupe, Elisha Cuthbert, Zachary Knighton, Adam Pally, Damon Wayans Jr., Casey Wilson', 'TV-14', 'A fresh and funny take on modern friendship and what one urban family will do to stay friends after the perfect couple who brought them all together break up on their wedding day. The failed wedding forces them all to question their life choices. Then there are Alex and Dave themselves, who strike a truce and must learn to live with the changes their breakup has brought.', 'A fresh and funny take on modern friendship and what one urban family will do to stay friends after the perfect couple who brought them all together break up on their wedding day. The failed wedding forces them all to question their life choices. Then there are Alex and Dave themselves, who strike a truce and must learn to live with the changes their breakup has brought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lY44BjOnwCqtUO4VoKOz7IcG9RC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32829'),
  ('867510400134303947', 'Happy Face', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jennifer Cacicio', null, 'Annaleigh Ashford, Dennis Quaid, James Wolk, Tamera Tomakili, Khiyla Aynne, Benjamin Mackey', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Melissa Reed, daughter of Keith Jesperson, aka the Happy Face Killer. After decades of no contact, Keith forces his way back into his daughter’s life, and Melissa must find out if an innocent man is going to be put to death for a crime her father committed. In the process, she must face a reckoning of her own identity.', 'The story of Melissa Reed, daughter of Keith Jesperson, aka the Happy Face Killer. After decades of no contact, Keith forces his way back into his daughter’s life, and Melissa must find out if an innocent man is going to be put to death for a crime her father committed. In the process, she must face a reckoning of her own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGHZrYxOU2U2JLrmYO12qGl1VK4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243217'),
