  ('295203233850440108', 'Harmony of Mille-Feuille', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Mirai Ayase, Yuko Natsuyoshi, Kanoko Sudo, Misato Matsuoka, Miharu Hanai, Haruka Aikawa', null, 'The a cappella club is filled with unique individuals some might say they''re a bit odd. Even if they''re not flashy or popular, there''s a special kind of youth that connects through their voices, creating something truly unique.', 'The a cappella club is filled with unique individuals some might say they''re a bit odd. Even if they''re not flashy or popular, there''s a special kind of youth that connects through their voices, creating something truly unique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vhYCGOSFDzJmqwovAYajSOUrfy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260848'),
  ('266913044055200843', 'Harmony Secret', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Ticha Aphaiwongs', 'Punyapat Wangpongsathaporn, Saranphat Pedersen, Ladapa Thongkham, Jiratchaya Kittavornsakul, Akalavut Mankalasut, Nithi Smuthkochorn, Nuttanan Khunwat', null, 'Two business heiresses—Aiwarin and Maevika—from a hotel empire and from a department store dynasty, respectively, compete for a national Duty-Free bid. From the moment they meet, an undeniable attraction sparks.', 'Two business heiresses—Aiwarin and Maevika—from a hotel empire and from a department store dynasty, respectively, compete for a national Duty-Free bid. From the moment they meet, an undeniable attraction sparks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jstn8gZWCd5jcxosC2lnZ5nebcu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284488'),
  ('564515486952741352', 'Harper''s Island', 2009, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Ari Schlossberg', null, 'Elaine Cassidy, Christopher Gorham, Katie Cassidy, Cameron Richardson, Jim Beaver, C.J. Thomason, Adam Campbell, Matt Barr', 'TV-14', 'A group of family and friends travels to a secluded island for a destination wedding. They''ve come to laugh... to love... and, though they don''t know it... to die. As the wedding festivities begin, friendships are tested and secrets exposed as a murderer claims victims, one by one, transforming the wedding week of fun and celebration into a terrifying struggle for survival.', 'A group of family and friends travels to a secluded island for a destination wedding. They''ve come to laugh... to love... and, though they don''t know it... to die. As the wedding festivities begin, friendships are tested and secrets exposed as a murderer claims victims, one by one, transforming the wedding week of fun and celebration into a terrifying struggle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihpf4yvi9GWATXj7IApblIHRMP4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7354'),
  ('874026108574786063', 'Harriet the Spy', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Beanie Feldstein, Jane Lynch, Lacey Chabert, Kimberly Brooks, Crispin Freeman, Grey DeLisle, Bumper Robinson, Charlie Schlatter', 'TV-G', 'Outspoken and perpetually curious. That''s 11-year-old Harriet in a nutshell. But if she’s going to be Harriet M. Welsch, future writer, she''ll need to know everything. And to know everything means she''ll need to spy...on everyone.', 'Outspoken and perpetually curious. That''s 11-year-old Harriet in a nutshell. But if she’s going to be Harriet M. Welsch, future writer, she''ll need to know everything. And to know everything means she''ll need to spy...on everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlH2YAt8JxOoKgkF3HlDGt9d734.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136300'),
  ('691976706957163751', 'Harrow', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Stephen M. Irwin, Leigh McGrath', null, 'Ioan Gruffudd, Jolene Anderson, Darren Gilshenan, Damien Garvey, Ella Newton, Hunter Page-Lochard, Faustina Agolley, Miriama Smith', null, 'When a dark secret from this past threatens to be exposed, unorthodox and brilliant medical examiner, Doctor Daniel Harrow, must use all his forensic skills to keep it buried forever.', 'When a dark secret from this past threatens to be exposed, unorthodox and brilliant medical examiner, Doctor Daniel Harrow, must use all his forensic skills to keep it buried forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0H4iQBe1YL9I8pZF5jRifcF369.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77947'),
