  ('253615048709099054', 'Hart aber fair', 2001, 'Talk', null, null, 'Louis Klamroth', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25Z0phqdA4XhbS26LUwmTvMAcIK.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:81831'),
  ('164719096875496759', 'Hart of Dixie', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Leila Gerstein', null, 'Rachel Bilson, Jaime King, Cress Williams, Wilson Bethel, Tim Matheson, Scott Porter, Kaitlyn Black', 'TV-PG', 'New Yorker Zoe Hart has it all figured out - after graduating top of her class from medical school, she''ll follow in her father''s footsteps and become a cardio-thoracic surgeon. But when her dreams fall apart, Zoe decides to work at a small practice in Bluebell, Alabama.', 'New Yorker Zoe Hart has it all figured out - after graduating top of her class from medical school, she''ll follow in her father''s footsteps and become a cardio-thoracic surgeon. But when her dreams fall apart, Zoe decides to work at a small practice in Bluebell, Alabama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOwH2ZUtdzqeat5RhiD3oes2ASx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:39279'),
  ('942391143847272090', 'Hart to Hart', 1979, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery', 'Sidney Sheldon', null, 'Robert Wagner, Stefanie Powers, Lionel Stander', 'TV-G', 'Wealthy couple Jonathan and Jennifer Hart, a self-made millionaire and his journalist wife, moonlight as amateur detectives.', 'Wealthy couple Jonathan and Jennifer Hart, a self-made millionaire and his journalist wife, moonlight as amateur detectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK7eHDVQVYwwuxf91rmSNn6ykQn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3162'),
  ('297665620218171471', 'Haruchika – Haruta & Chika', 2016, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Natsuki Hanae, Haruka Chisuga, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Seiichiro Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'Haruta and Chika are members of their high school wind instrument club that is on the verge of being shut down. The two are childhood friends, and they spend their days practicing hard while also trying to recruit new members. When a certain incident happens within their school, they work together to solve it.', 'Haruta and Chika are members of their high school wind instrument club that is on the verge of being shut down. The two are childhood friends, and they spend their days practicing hard while also trying to recruit new members. When a certain incident happens within their school, they work together to solve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8J9yrbDdqJJkIpsjhGXHsrkA4Il.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65177'),
  ('978359138192113230', 'Haruka Nogizaka''s Secret', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aya Hisakawa, Kana Ueda, Mamiko Noto, Kaori Shimizu, Reiko Takagi', 'TV-14', 'Haruka Nogizaka is beautiful, intelligent, and talented at the piano. A true idol of Hakujo Academy. Yuuto Ayase on the other hand is an ordinary guy who, thanks to his hard-drinking older sister and her lecherous friend corrupting his life, has reportedly given up on women. However, one day in the school library, Yuuto stumbles into a rare issue of a magazine catering to anime and nerd culture--or rather, the girl holding it, who turns out to be none other than Haruka Nogizaka herself! Terrified of others realizing that she isn’t as “perfect” as she claims to be, Haruka runs away from Yuuto... but this is one woman that Yuuto just can’t give up on!', 'Haruka Nogizaka is beautiful, intelligent, and talented at the piano. A true idol of Hakujo Academy. Yuuto Ayase on the other hand is an ordinary guy who, thanks to his hard-drinking older sister and her lecherous friend corrupting his life, has reportedly given up on women. However, one day in the school library, Yuuto stumbles into a rare issue of a magazine catering to anime and nerd culture--or rather, the girl holding it, who turns out to be none other than Haruka Nogizaka herself! Terrified of others realizing that she isn’t as “perfect” as she claims to be, Haruka runs away from Yuuto... but this is one woman that Yuuto just can’t give up on!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6l9KeO4dERvwXevC2QjNRHVqIX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:36067'),
  ('189478927693678713', 'Harukana Receive', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Yuuki, Saki Miyashita, Atsumi Tanezaki, Rie Suegara, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Kanae Itou, Chisa Kimura, Akari Kito', 'TV-14', 'Oozora Haruka, who''s just moved to Okinawa, is generally cheerful and optimistic, but there''s one thing she feels insecure about: she''s taller than most other girls. Her cousin Higa Kanata also has one hang-up: she had to quit her beach volleyball because she was too short. The mismatched cousins find themselves paired up as a beach volleyball team.', 'Oozora Haruka, who''s just moved to Okinawa, is generally cheerful and optimistic, but there''s one thing she feels insecure about: she''s taller than most other girls. Her cousin Higa Kanata also has one hang-up: she had to quit her beach volleyball because she was too short. The mismatched cousins find themselves paired up as a beach volleyball team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW0dFlGV6kkdKbnQjSeYXtwQZq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80546'),
  ('754992260893382870', 'Harvey Beaks', 2015, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'C.H. Greenblatt', null, 'Max Charles, Angelina Wahler, Thomas Robinson, Scott Adsit, Kerri Kenney, C.H. Greenblatt, Matthew Zhang, Mason Vaughn', 'TV-Y7', 'A mild-mannered young bird and his best friends, a pair of rambunctious siblings called Fee and Foo, seek adventure and mischief in the magical forest that they call home.', 'A mild-mannered young bird and his best friends, a pair of rambunctious siblings called Fee and Foo, seek adventure and mischief in the magical forest that they call home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZyogSmk6UFKz6Cz3VOo93QRuB4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62487'),
  ('528363357172739251', 'Harvey Birdman, Attorney at Law', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Michael Ouweleen, Erik Richter', null, 'Gary Cole, Thomas Allen, Stephen Colbert, John Michael Higgins, Chris Edgerly, Paget Brewster, Peter MacNicol', 'TV-14', 'Harvey Birdman, Attorney at Law features ex-superhero Harvey T. Birdman of Birdman and the Galaxy Trio as an attorney working for a law firm alongside other cartoon stars from 1960s and 1970s Hanna-Barbera cartoon series. Similarly, Harvey''s clients are also primarily composed of characters taken from Hanna-Barbera cartoon series of the same era. Many of Birdman''s nemeses featured in his former cartoon series also became attorneys, often representing the opposing side of a given case.', 'Harvey Birdman, Attorney at Law features ex-superhero Harvey T. Birdman of Birdman and the Galaxy Trio as an attorney working for a law firm alongside other cartoon stars from 1960s and 1970s Hanna-Barbera cartoon series. Similarly, Harvey''s clients are also primarily composed of characters taken from Hanna-Barbera cartoon series of the same era. Many of Birdman''s nemeses featured in his former cartoon series also became attorneys, often representing the opposing side of a given case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBVSDa48aOcq7vF0xLFprRWZgbh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:416'),
  ('911031218657661534', 'Harvey Girls Forever!', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Emily Brundige, Aliki Theofilopoulos, Brendan Hay', null, 'Stephanie Lemelin, Kelly McCreary, Lauren Lapkus, Jack Quaid', 'TV-Y7', 'Kids rule in a place called Harvey Street, where a trio of girls right wrongs, ice cream is always an option, and every day feels like Saturday.', 'Kids rule in a place called Harvey Street, where a trio of girls right wrongs, ice cream is always an option, and every day feels like Saturday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5v94bS5jqPbg85Byu3owgFjoK1N.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:80592'),
  ('615274269022895026', 'Hassel', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Henrik Jansson-Schweizer, Morgan Jensen', null, 'Ola Rapace, Wilma Lidén, Aliette Opheim, Jens Hultén, Shanti Roney, Nanna Blondell', null, 'Detective Roland Hassel''s father figure and mentor, Yngve Ruda, is brutally murdered in the middle of the street. Devastated, Hassel decides to undertake his own covert investigation to find Ruda''s killer and avenge him with the support of ''Triton'', a special task force consisting of Hassel''s most devoted co-workers. But Hassel''s obsession with the case affects his family as well. As Hassel, his girlfriend Daniela and his 14-year-old stepdaughter Vida struggle to stay together as a real family they find themselves in a downward spiral taking them further and further into an abyss. Meanwhile, the evidence on Ruda''s killer leads away from the street and up the corridors of power in Stockholm and Brussels. But Hassel''s battle against crime and corruption knows no boundaries and he will stop at nothing.', 'Detective Roland Hassel''s father figure and mentor, Yngve Ruda, is brutally murdered in the middle of the street. Devastated, Hassel decides to undertake his own covert investigation to find Ruda''s killer and avenge him with the support of ''Triton'', a special task force consisting of Hassel''s most devoted co-workers. But Hassel''s obsession with the case affects his family as well. As Hassel, his girlfriend Daniela and his 14-year-old stepdaughter Vida struggle to stay together as a real family they find themselves in a downward spiral taking them further and further into an abyss. Meanwhile, the evidence on Ruda''s killer leads away from the street and up the corridors of power in Stockholm and Brussels. But Hassel''s battle against crime and corruption knows no boundaries and he will stop at nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNdMhxjDuSW1k41Oo80Zk3ycXvD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68360'),
  ('597121667337642137', 'Hasta el fin del mundo', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kary Fajer', 'Gabriela Ortigoza, Gerardo Luna', 'Marjorie de Sousa, David Zepeda, Claudia Álvarez, Diego Olivera, Julián Gil, Mariana Seoane, María Rojo, César Évora Díaz', null, 'After their father''s death, Sofía Ripoll, the oldest of three sisters, takes over the family''s fictional successful chocolate factory. Though she is engaged to a man who uses her for money, she quickly falls in love with Salvador Cruz, a former racecar driver who takes a job as her chauffeur.', 'After their father''s death, Sofía Ripoll, the oldest of three sisters, takes over the family''s fictional successful chocolate factory. Though she is engaged to a man who uses her for money, she quickly falls in love with Salvador Cruz, a former racecar driver who takes a job as her chauffeur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IIQPQxTHqyoHSCX0mC0Esw564w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61861'),
  ('314362954637631097', 'Hasta que el dinero nos separe', 2009, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Fernando Gaitán', null, 'Lalo, Claudia Troyo, Alberto Loztin, Pedro Fernández, Itatí Cantoral, Víctor Noriega, Luz Elena González, Carlos Cámara', null, 'Hasta Que el Dinero Nos Separe is a telenovela produced by Emilio Larrosa. It is a remake of the Colombian soap opera Hasta Que la Plata Nos Separe. Hasta Que el Dinero Nos Separe stars Itatí Cantoral, Pedro Fernández, Victor Noriega, Luz Elena González and Joana Benedek. The telenovela made its debut on June 29, 2009 at 8 pm in Mexico''s Canal de las Estrellas, in HD in some markets, and January 18, 2010 at 8/7 pm USA''s Univision, starting on April 26, 2010, it aired from 8 pm est to 10 pm est in HD in some markets, until June 1, 2010, when Soy Tu Dueña premiered on Univision at 9pm, thus returning the novela back to its former one hour airing time. On February 16, 2010 Hasta Que El dinero nos separe premiered on internet TV''s bsn Latino. "The Best Telenovela of the Year 2010."', 'Hasta Que el Dinero Nos Separe is a telenovela produced by Emilio Larrosa. It is a remake of the Colombian soap opera Hasta Que la Plata Nos Separe. Hasta Que el Dinero Nos Separe stars Itatí Cantoral, Pedro Fernández, Victor Noriega, Luz Elena González and Joana Benedek. The telenovela made its debut on June 29, 2009 at 8 pm in Mexico''s Canal de las Estrellas, in HD in some markets, and January 18, 2010 at 8/7 pm USA''s Univision, starting on April 26, 2010, it aired from 8 pm est to 10 pm est in HD in some markets, until June 1, 2010, when Soy Tu Dueña premiered on Univision at 9pm, thus returning the novela back to its former one hour airing time. On February 16, 2010 Hasta Que El dinero nos separe premiered on internet TV''s bsn Latino. "The Best Telenovela of the Year 2010."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6elQKPtzBlfVa2cHz96NZnBQcc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18685'),
  ('480429573178512293', 'Hasta que la plata nos separe', 2006, 'Drama', null, 'Andrés Burgos Vallejo', 'Liliana Gonzalez, Víctor Hugo Cabrera, Lincoln Palomeque, Marcela Carvajal', 'NR', 'Rafael Méndez and Alejandra Maldonado are salesmen from opposite sides of life. While Méndez depends on informal sales, and that without any higher education degree, Alejandra carries her duties as the Commercial Manager of a car dealership with an MBA degree and a hard attitude up her sleeve. An unfortunate car accident will bring them together, and they will have to get the best of each other in order to survive their respective realities.', 'Rafael Méndez and Alejandra Maldonado are salesmen from opposite sides of life. While Méndez depends on informal sales, and that without any higher education degree, Alejandra carries her duties as the Commercial Manager of a car dealership with an MBA degree and a hard attitude up her sleeve. An unfortunate car accident will bring them together, and they will have to get the best of each other in order to survive their respective realities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsg1BiSfwUP5ujM5zYMcXvYLwqR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100087'),
  ('688915760909121334', 'Hasta que la plata nos separe', 2022, 'Soap, Drama', 'Fernando Gaitán', null, 'Carmen Villalobos, Sebastián Martínez, Gregorio Pernía, Juliette Pardau, Fabián Ríos, Alejandra Ávila, Michelle Rouillard, José Daniel Cristancho', 'TV-14', 'Alejandra and Rafael come from completely different worlds, but a life-changing accident brings them together. A massive debt forces them to stay close, sparking a relationship full of tension, passion, and unexpected emotions. Between jealousy, heartbreak, and fate’s twists, their story takes unpredictable turns that will test their connection.', 'Alejandra and Rafael come from completely different worlds, but a life-changing accident brings them together. A massive debt forces them to stay close, sparking a relationship full of tension, passion, and unexpected emotions. Between jealousy, heartbreak, and fate’s twists, their story takes unpredictable turns that will test their connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWlPY4zmuJDelcOwb4ph9lGo5Ew.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196614'),
  ('448931322488199248', 'Hasta que te conocí', 2016, 'Drama', 'Raúl Olivares', 'Leonardo Aranguibel', 'Julián Román, Dolores Heredia, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, María Rojo, Irán Castillo, Marco Antonio Treviño, Damayanti Quintanar, Claudia Pineda', 'TV-14', '"Hasta que Te Conocí" unravels the life of the Divo de Juárez: Juan Gabriel. Gabriel''s extraordinary talent as a singer-songwriter allowed him to rise above poverty, betrayal, and prejudice, eventually making him one the most beloved performers in all of Ibero-America.', '"Hasta que Te Conocí" unravels the life of the Divo de Juárez: Juan Gabriel. Gabriel''s extraordinary talent as a singer-songwriter allowed him to rise above poverty, betrayal, and prejudice, eventually making him one the most beloved performers in all of Ibero-America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYv7MkPsn5lUtLLDEa6ksd1eekA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67637'),
  ('128273007092653386', 'Hataraki Man', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Rie Tanaka, Atsuko Tanaka, Yuji Ueda, Misato Fukuen, Kenyu Horiuchi, Rumi Shishido, Kazuya Nakai, Makoto Yasumura', 'TV-14', 'Hiroko Matsukata’s determined to work her way to the top, and at only 28, she’s now an editor at Jidai Weekly. But she’s had to dedicate her life to work while suppressing her feminine character traits to blend in with her uncouth male coworkers.', 'Hiroko Matsukata’s determined to work her way to the top, and at only 28, she’s now an editor at Jidai Weekly. But she’s had to dedicate her life to work while suppressing her feminine character traits to blend in with her uncouth male coworkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1psF9dqTPCi5nL4ZpXtZmc14zDT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115109'),
  ('245069790574370038', 'Határtalan szerelem', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Köllő Babett', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sh3LeELJeeOQt94S2gAh32lhjA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:314985'),
  ('1004735054862510761', 'Hate the Player: The Ben Johnson Story', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Q. Farrell', null, null, null, 'Canadian sprinter Johnson''s definitely-not-biased account of the doping controversy that rocked the 1988 Olympics when he tested positive for banned steroid use, going from hero to zero in 9.79 seconds in what some called "The Dirtiest Race in History". The series takes a revealing and satirical look at the events surrounding the legendary race and the scandal behind the scandal.', 'Canadian sprinter Johnson''s definitely-not-biased account of the doping controversy that rocked the 1988 Olympics when he tested positive for banned steroid use, going from hero to zero in 9.79 seconds in what some called "The Dirtiest Race in History". The series takes a revealing and satirical look at the events surrounding the legendary race and the scandal behind the scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaqTQ8OJ6SBRwvPQ4U53Sc8CCuf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317143'),
  ('734493621161687700', 'Haters Back Off', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Colleen Ballinger, Chris Ballinger', null, 'Colleen Ballinger, Angela Kinsey, Francesca Reale, Erik Stocklin, Steve Little', 'TV-14', 'Delve into the oddball family life of Miranda Sings, an incredibly confident, totally untalented star on the rise, who continues to fail upward by the power of her belief that she was born famous, it''s just no one knows it yet.', 'Delve into the oddball family life of Miranda Sings, an incredibly confident, totally untalented star on the rise, who continues to fail upward by the power of her belief that she was born famous, it''s just no one knows it yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSF3AymHUK4XLuh1rzIX1TnRXAM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67148'),
  ('1097368758983155949', 'Hatfields & McCoys', 2012, 'Western, Drama', 'Ted Mann', 'Ronald Parker, Ted Mann', 'Kevin Costner, Bill Paxton, Matt Barr, Tom Berenger, Powers Boothe, Andrew Howard, Jena Malone, Sarah Parish', 'TV-14', 'It’s the true American story of a legendary family feud—one that spanned decades and nearly launched a war between Kentucky and West Virginia. The Hatfield-McCoy saga begins with Devil Anse Hatfield and Randall McCoy.. Close friends and comrades until near the end of the Civil War, they return to their neighboring homes—Hatfield in West Virginia, McCoy just across the Tug River border in Kentucky—to increasing tensions, misunderstandings and resentments that soon explode into all-out warfare between their families. As hostilities grow, friends, neighbors and outside forces join the fight, bringing the two states to the brink of another civil war.', 'It’s the true American story of a legendary family feud—one that spanned decades and nearly launched a war between Kentucky and West Virginia. The Hatfield-McCoy saga begins with Devil Anse Hatfield and Randall McCoy.. Close friends and comrades until near the end of the Civil War, they return to their neighboring homes—Hatfield in West Virginia, McCoy just across the Tug River border in Kentucky—to increasing tensions, misunderstandings and resentments that soon explode into all-out warfare between their families. As hostilities grow, friends, neighbors and outside forces join the fight, bringing the two states to the brink of another civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ts6NhSkyn1GS3ZXYE7Z2jRUHRnT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43016'),
  ('400340127751479509', 'Hatim', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rahil Azam, Kiku Sharda, Nirmal Pandey, Pooja Rawal', null, 'Hatim is an Indian television series that aired on StarPlus from 26 December 2003 until 12 November 2004. It has elements of fantasy, drama, and many other genres. It was directed by Amrit Sagar and is based on a Persian story recounting the adventures of Hatim al-Tai of the Tayyi tribe of Arabia.', 'Hatim is an Indian television series that aired on StarPlus from 26 December 2003 until 12 November 2004. It has elements of fantasy, drama, and many other genres. It was directed by Amrit Sagar and is based on a Persian story recounting the adventures of Hatim al-Tai of the Tayyi tribe of Arabia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoTQPG6DJmKkMGaR2idZmUwTbEE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15785'),
  ('1093775719884842595', 'Hatoko no umi', 1974, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yusuke Okada, Isao Natsuyagi, Chitose Kobayashi, Yoshio Yoshida, Ben Hiura, Tetsuo Morishita, Masami Horiuchi, Kozue Saito', null, 'A woman who lost her memory after experiencing the atomic bombing of Hiroshima.', 'A woman who lost her memory after experiencing the atomic bombing of Hiroshima.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iQijzhTU8BkEz9ZhF8uaSxQQ6a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209119'),
  ('881977509398921445', 'Hatsukoi Limited.', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Mariya Ise, Aki Toyosaki, Shizuka Itoh, Minako Kotobuki, Shintaro Asanuma, Ayumi Fujimura, Miyu Irino, Takahiro Sakurai', 'TV-14', 'Ayumi and her friends are all just entering the eighth grade, as, one by one, they discover that love is infectious and you can catch it from anyone! Now Ayumi''s torn between two brothers, Koyoi has an altogether different kind of brother issue and budding theatrical impresario Sumire seems ready to do anything to land her leading man. Then there''s tom-boy Rika, aspiring artist Nao, Kei, who''s very ''mature'' for her age and older girl Misaki who really IS more mature.', 'Ayumi and her friends are all just entering the eighth grade, as, one by one, they discover that love is infectious and you can catch it from anyone! Now Ayumi''s torn between two brothers, Koyoi has an altogether different kind of brother issue and budding theatrical impresario Sumire seems ready to do anything to land her leading man. Then there''s tom-boy Rika, aspiring artist Nao, Kei, who''s very ''mature'' for her age and older girl Misaki who really IS more mature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TH837BXyZYo5YCOqyLSQvPTgDs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34744'),
  ('690990004206984759', 'Hatsumori Bemars', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Yasushi Akimoto', 'Yasushi Akimoto, Nonji Nemoto', 'Nanase Nishino, Mai Shiraishi, Nanami Hashimoto, Sayuri Matsumura, Kazumi Takayama, Erika Ikuta, Manatsu Akimoto, Mai Fukagawa', null, 'The park of Hatsumori, where Nanase and her friends grew, is in danger of being erased. Will it and its memories survive? Its future will be decided on a softball competition.', 'The park of Hatsumori, where Nanase and her friends grew, is in danger of being erased. Will it and its memories survive? Its future will be decided on a softball competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YcTYAU2zUTCSrnJwPsRTEpbdQx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93792'),
  ('327208223780681498', 'Hatton Garden', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Timothy Spall, Kenneth Cranham, Brían F. O''Byrne, David Hayman, Alex Norton, Geoff Bell', null, 'The story of the audacious jewellery, gold and cash burglary at the heart of London''s diamond district executed by an elderly gang of career criminals across the Easter Bank Holiday weekend in April 2015.', 'The story of the audacious jewellery, gold and cash burglary at the heart of London''s diamond district executed by an elderly gang of career criminals across the Easter Bank Holiday weekend in April 2015.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwpcXDkpCp7kMpWo0MbeP8iB3gU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89414'),
  ('654950226571279706', 'Haunted', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Matthew Fox, Lynn Collins, Michael Irby, Russell Hornsby, Jessalyn Gilsig, John Mann', 'TV-PG', 'Haunted is an American television program first aired in September 2002 on UPN. The program, which was filmed in Vancouver, was canceled in November 2002 due to low ratings. As a result, only seven of the completed episodes were aired. However, all eleven filmed episodes have subsequently been shown in international airings of the show. In August 2007, the series aired on HDNet. The series then began airing on Sci Fi in September 2007 and January 2008. In 2009, Chiller began airing this program as part of their daily marathon line-up. It plays there sporadically. A marathon of the entire series ran all day on October 31, 2010 on Universal HD.', 'Haunted is an American television program first aired in September 2002 on UPN. The program, which was filmed in Vancouver, was canceled in November 2002 due to low ratings. As a result, only seven of the completed episodes were aired. However, all eleven filmed episodes have subsequently been shown in international airings of the show. In August 2007, the series aired on HDNet. The series then began airing on Sci Fi in September 2007 and January 2008. In 2009, Chiller began airing this program as part of their daily marathon line-up. It plays there sporadically. A marathon of the entire series ran all day on October 31, 2010 on Universal HD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNrOi286RnnYYfcATdikA0v2esR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3830'),
  ('747703063322297952', 'Haunted', 2018, 'Documentary', 'David Price, Jordan Roberts', null, 'Michael Pitthan, Abigail Rice, Erika Guntherová, Daniel Rchichev, Kamila Trnková, Vanda Chaloupková, Oskar Hes', null, 'Real people sit down with friends and family to share terrifying true stories from their past, re-created through chilling re-enactments.', 'Real people sit down with friends and family to share terrifying true stories from their past, re-created through chilling re-enactments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35sVWjQKLdJpxtTuHI79pW4e5IC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:83247'),
  ('651961344393967088', 'Haunted Highway', 2012, 'Documentary, Mystery', null, null, null, null, 'Haunted Highway, is a paranormal investigation, reality television series, produced by BASE Productions, that began airing on the Syfy network July 3, 2012. The series features two teams of investigators; Jack Osbourne, investigator Dana Workman, and Fact or Faked: Paranormal Files investigators Jael de Pardo and Devin Marble. On the 5th episode of the series, Osbourne announced that he was diagnosed with multiple sclerosis and temporarily stepped down as host of the series. On April 22, 2013 it was announced that the series had been renewed for a 6-episode 2nd Season set to premiere in the fall of 2013.', 'Haunted Highway, is a paranormal investigation, reality television series, produced by BASE Productions, that began airing on the Syfy network July 3, 2012. The series features two teams of investigators; Jack Osbourne, investigator Dana Workman, and Fact or Faked: Paranormal Files investigators Jael de Pardo and Devin Marble. On the 5th episode of the series, Osbourne announced that he was diagnosed with multiple sclerosis and temporarily stepped down as host of the series. On April 22, 2013 it was announced that the series had been renewed for a 6-episode 2nd Season set to premiere in the fall of 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgvyvrjmx4gS8XGWlSV1WWwgM59.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44674'),
  ('738702635268075275', 'Haunted Hotel', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Matt Roller', null, 'Will Forte, Eliza Coupe, Skyler Gisondo, Natalie Palamides, Jimmi Simpson', 'TV-14', 'After inheriting a hotel from her late brother, a single mom moves in with his good-natured ghost — and high-maintenance guests who will never check out.', 'After inheriting a hotel from her late brother, a single mom moves in with his good-natured ghost — and high-maintenance guests who will never check out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4arTlVw8oceZDOhGv9GFrgGztUq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255752'),
  ('675091733208905079', 'Haunted: Latin America', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Real people''s terrifying tales of the chilling, unexplained and paranormal come to life with dramatic reenactments in this reality series.', 'Real people''s terrifying tales of the chilling, unexplained and paranormal come to life with dramatic reenactments in this reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4DF2tw0Pjl56bN1V1atnLyuugn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120587'),
  ('903935718439342891', 'Hausen', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tristan Göbel, Charly Hübner, Alexander Scheer, Lilith Stangenberg, Andrea Guo, Kathrin Wehlisch, Michael Specht, Stefan Haschke', null, 'After the death of his mother, 16-year-old Juri and his father Jaschek move into a rundown housing complex on the city outskirts. While Jaschek tries to establish a new life for himself and his son, as caretaker of the building, Juri gradually discovers that the house has a vicious life of its own and feeds on the suffering of its inhabitants', 'After the death of his mother, 16-year-old Juri and his father Jaschek move into a rundown housing complex on the city outskirts. While Jaschek tries to establish a new life for himself and his son, as caretaker of the building, Juri gradually discovers that the house has a vicious life of its own and feeds on the suffering of its inhabitants', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av0Up0LN0PCl3vorBmsuwdCGog2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109357'),
  ('1027995897134224656', 'Hausmeister Krause – Ordnung muss sein', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Tom Gerhardt', null, 'Tom Gerhardt, Janine Kunze, Axel Stein, Irene Schwarz', null, 'Hausmeister Krause – Ordnung muss sein is a German sitcom with Tom Gerhardt in the title role, shown from 1999 through 2010 on Sat.1. The series parodies typical German "squareness". Half-day janitor Dieter Krause is the embodiment of the German "square"; he is pernickety, blindly follows order, denounces others, is nosy, consistently puts his own interests above all else, acts subservient to his superiors and is brutish and unjust to those he deemes below him. Many plot elements — mishaps, misunderstandings, and frequent cases of mistaken identity — originate from Boulevard theatre. The characters in the series borrow heavily from those in Tom Gerhardt''s film Voll normaaal, in many cases sharing names. In Voll normaaal, Tom Gerhardt played the roles of both Dieter and Tommie Krause; in Hausmeister Krause, Tommie was played by Axel Stein. Daughter Carmen is played by Janine Kunze. Other characters from Voll normaaal, such as Tommie''s friend Mario, are relegated to the status of background characters. The scope of action also changed.', 'Hausmeister Krause – Ordnung muss sein is a German sitcom with Tom Gerhardt in the title role, shown from 1999 through 2010 on Sat.1. The series parodies typical German "squareness". Half-day janitor Dieter Krause is the embodiment of the German "square"; he is pernickety, blindly follows order, denounces others, is nosy, consistently puts his own interests above all else, acts subservient to his superiors and is brutish and unjust to those he deemes below him. Many plot elements — mishaps, misunderstandings, and frequent cases of mistaken identity — originate from Boulevard theatre. The characters in the series borrow heavily from those in Tom Gerhardt''s film Voll normaaal, in many cases sharing names. In Voll normaaal, Tom Gerhardt played the roles of both Dieter and Tommie Krause; in Hausmeister Krause, Tommie was played by Axel Stein. Daughter Carmen is played by Janine Kunze. Other characters from Voll normaaal, such as Tommie''s friend Mario, are relegated to the status of background characters. The scope of action also changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSJWpIdJGdllxH3AjsX1497Hmlz.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:41196'),
  ('202315252311209588', 'Have a Crush On You', 2023, 'Drama', 'Xu Su', 'Wang Jie, Zhang Chuyu', 'Peng Guanying, Wang Churan, Chuai Ni, Liu Ruilin, Nikita Mao, Li Zifeng, Zhu Junlin, Tian Lei', null, 'Ruan Liuzheng returns to her hometown after seven years, and becomes a neurosurgeon at Beiya Hospital. However, she didn''t expect to meet her ex-husband, Ning Zhiqian, who is the most experienced neurosurgeon. Ruan Liuzheng is no longer the weak and timid girl, and she shows resolute and determination in both her work and relationship. When they were in Africa to execute medical relief efforts, Ning Zhiqian was injured in a gunshot. Ruan Liuzheng didn''t leave his side, and fought hard to save him from the brink of death. The two have gained a new understanding of life, and begun a new relationship again.', 'Ruan Liuzheng returns to her hometown after seven years, and becomes a neurosurgeon at Beiya Hospital. However, she didn''t expect to meet her ex-husband, Ning Zhiqian, who is the most experienced neurosurgeon. Ruan Liuzheng is no longer the weak and timid girl, and she shows resolute and determination in both her work and relationship. When they were in Africa to execute medical relief efforts, Ning Zhiqian was injured in a gunshot. Ruan Liuzheng didn''t leave his side, and fought hard to save him from the brink of death. The two have gained a new understanding of life, and begun a new relationship again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isXUBTFNXyeo1XojeBLZMN4cpnT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220068'),
  ('715310334732299079', 'Have Gun, Will Travel', 1957, 'Western, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Sam Rolfe, Herb Meadow', null, 'Richard Boone', 'TV-G', 'Have Gun – Will Travel is an American Western television series that aired on CBS from 1957 through 1963. It was rated number three or number four in the Nielsen ratings every year of its first four seasons. It was one of the few television shows to spawn a successful radio version. The radio series debuted November 23, 1958. The television show is presently shown on the Encore-Western channel. Have Gun – Will Travel was created by Sam Rolfe and Herb Meadow and produced by Frank Pierson, Don Ingalls, Robert Sparks, and Julian Claman. There were 225 episodes of the TV series, 24 written by Gene Roddenberry. Other contributors included Bruce Geller, Harry Julian Fink, Don Brinkley and Irving Wallace. Andrew McLaglen directed 101 episodes and 19 were directed by series star Richard Boone.', 'Have Gun – Will Travel is an American Western television series that aired on CBS from 1957 through 1963. It was rated number three or number four in the Nielsen ratings every year of its first four seasons. It was one of the few television shows to spawn a successful radio version. The radio series debuted November 23, 1958. The television show is presently shown on the Encore-Western channel. Have Gun – Will Travel was created by Sam Rolfe and Herb Meadow and produced by Frank Pierson, Don Ingalls, Robert Sparks, and Julian Claman. There were 225 episodes of the TV series, 24 written by Gene Roddenberry. Other contributors included Bruce Geller, Harry Julian Fink, Don Brinkley and Irving Wallace. Andrew McLaglen directed 101 episodes and 19 were directed by series star Richard Boone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aJRq7FGs2axLOdZNJ2G4IOQtMx.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:10980'),
  ('116094436044412835', 'Have I Got a Bit More News for You', null, 'News, Comedy', null, null, 'Paul Merton, Ian Hislop', null, 'Based on the week’s news and fronted by guest hosts, this extended version of the satirical news quiz features more of the stuff that wouldn''t fit into the regular programme.', 'Based on the week’s news and fronted by guest hosts, this extended version of the satirical news quiz features more of the stuff that wouldn''t fit into the regular programme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOZuKQ2uWRfZPzn61bnzQT5LhMR.jpg', 37, 'tmdb:tv:44337'),
  ('1095390940882280956', 'Have I Got News for You', 1990, 'Comedy, News', null, null, 'Paul Merton, Ian Hislop', 'NR', 'Hilarious, totally-irreverent, near-slanderous political quiz show, based mainly on news stories from the last week or so, that leaves no party, personality or action unscathed in pursuit of laughs.', 'Hilarious, totally-irreverent, near-slanderous political quiz show, based mainly on news stories from the last week or so, that leaves no party, personality or action unscathed in pursuit of laughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/917ZwaLnDX5A5iVotS8NGObNtgO.jpg', 71, 'tmdb:tv:797'),
  ('565937943325398375', 'Have You Been Paying Attention?', 2013, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Tom Gleisner, Sam Pang, Ed Kavalee', null, 'Topical comedy-quiz show featuring five guests competing to see who can remember the most about events of the week. A fast-paced, funny look at international affairs, politics, sport and entertainment news, we test just how well our contestants have been paying attention.', 'Topical comedy-quiz show featuring five guests competing to see who can remember the most about events of the week. A fast-paced, funny look at international affairs, politics, sport and entertainment news, we test just how well our contestants have been paying attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UrQBNGHJJ71M4qD980CiE0VFup.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:67378'),
  ('808068141614206804', 'Have You Seen This Man?', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Sunny Hostin, Matt Dallal', null, 'Featuring one of the longest, most intense hunts in U.S. history. In 1997, the FBI arrested John Ruffo, who ran a small computer sales company from New York City, for committing a staggering $353 million bank fraud.', 'Featuring one of the longest, most intense hunts in U.S. history. In 1997, the FBI arrested John Ruffo, who ran a small computer sales company from New York City, for committing a staggering $353 million bank fraud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LIaDZ1FJmucUoujoju6kJTXhpj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195684'),
  ('769361733243470687', 'Haven', 2010, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Jim Dunn, Sam Ernst', null, 'Emily Rose, Lucas Bryant, Eric Balfour', 'TV-14', 'FBI agent Audrey Parker arrives in the small town of Haven, Maine to solve a murder and soon discovers the town''s many secrets—which also hold the key to unlocking the mysteries of her lost past.', 'FBI agent Audrey Parker arrives in the small town of Haven, Maine to solve a murder and soon discovers the town''s many secrets—which also hold the key to unlocking the mysteries of her lost past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aceumwROgphFLSyOXFfijaoSZJE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:33001'),
  ('792416427358462588', 'Haven of Grace', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maxime Crupaux, Baptiste Fillon', 'Malysone Bovorasmy, Sylvie Chanteux', 'Olivier Gourmet, Pierre Lottin, Panayotis Pascot, Margot Bancilhon, Astrid Whettnall, Philippe Rebbot, Gringe, Alyzée Costes', null, 'As he approaches sixty, the time has come for Pierre Leprieur to take stock of his life. What did he accomplish and what did he mess up during his life? He was formerly an influential trade unionist on the docks at Le Havre. The passing years saw his relationship with his wife and his now-adult children subside. One evening, with his whole family gathered together to celebrate his birthday, the party is ruined. His sons, Jean and Simon, find themselves accused of mass drug trafficking. Whilst their sister, Emma, a criminal lawyer, tries to get them out of this difficult situation, Pierre, who si convinced that he is being targeted, does his utmost to help them. Yet he knows that if he roots around too much, he could end up unearthing truths best left untold.', 'As he approaches sixty, the time has come for Pierre Leprieur to take stock of his life. What did he accomplish and what did he mess up during his life? He was formerly an influential trade unionist on the docks at Le Havre. The passing years saw his relationship with his wife and his now-adult children subside. One evening, with his whole family gathered together to celebrate his birthday, the party is ruined. His sons, Jean and Simon, find themselves accused of mass drug trafficking. Whilst their sister, Emma, a criminal lawyer, tries to get them out of this difficult situation, Pierre, who si convinced that he is being targeted, does his utmost to help them. Yet he knows that if he roots around too much, he could end up unearthing truths best left untold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKF238BG2j23xBLxQTIqdFqf6Hg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209483'),
  ('728354024969034997', 'Haven''t You Heard? I''m Sakamoto', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Koji Yusa, Mikako Takahashi, Mai Nakahara, Jouji Nakata, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Kujira, Masahito Yabe', 'TV-14', 'Sakamoto is not a normal high schooler. He’s smart, he’s dashing, he’s popular with girls. Much to the dislike of the male population of his school, who tries every trick in the book to mess Sakamoto up. But in the end, Sakamoto comes out of every trap with style and makes himself look cooler. Does he do this for popularity? Is this just who he is? No one really knows, but haven’t you heard? He’s Sakamoto!', 'Sakamoto is not a normal high schooler. He’s smart, he’s dashing, he’s popular with girls. Much to the dislike of the male population of his school, who tries every trick in the book to mess Sakamoto up. But in the end, Sakamoto comes out of every trap with style and makes himself look cooler. Does he do this for popularity? Is this just who he is? No one really knows, but haven’t you heard? He’s Sakamoto!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzWTW9DSToU7mW5RPos91fJSbBV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65944'),
  ('934187843146790570', 'Hawaii Five-0', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman, Peter M. Lenkov', null, 'Alex O''Loughlin, Scott Caan, Ian Anthony Dale, Meaghan Rath, Beulah Koale, Dennis Chun, Kimee Balmilero, Chi McBride', 'TV-14', 'Steve McGarrett returns home to Oahu, in order to find his father''s killer. The governor offers him the chance to run his own task force (Five-0). Steve''s team is joined by Chin Ho Kelly, Danny "Danno" Williams, and Kono Kalakaua.', 'Steve McGarrett returns home to Oahu, in order to find his father''s killer. The governor offers him the chance to run his own task force (Five-0). Steve''s team is joined by Chin Ho Kelly, Danny "Danno" Williams, and Kono Kalakaua.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIdCKlmM2nU4akIvFQaAIiU8YES.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:32798'),
  ('1129476527007941975', 'Hawaii Five-O', 1968, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Leonard Freeman', null, 'Jack Lord, Herman Wedemeyer, William Smith, Richard Denning, Sharon Farrell', 'TV-PG', 'Hawaii Five-O is an American police procedural drama series produced by CBS Productions and Leonard Freeman. Set in Hawaii, the show originally aired for 12 seasons from 1968 to 1980, and continues in reruns. Jack Lord portrayed Detective Lieutenant Steve McGarrett, the head of a special state police task force which was based on an actual unit that existed under martial law in the 1940s. The theme music composed by Morton Stevens became especially popular. Many episodes would end with McGarrett instructing his subordinate to "Book ''em, Danno!", sometimes specifying a charge such as "murder one".', 'Hawaii Five-O is an American police procedural drama series produced by CBS Productions and Leonard Freeman. Set in Hawaii, the show originally aired for 12 seasons from 1968 to 1980, and continues in reruns. Jack Lord portrayed Detective Lieutenant Steve McGarrett, the head of a special state police task force which was based on an actual unit that existed under martial law in the 1940s. The theme music composed by Morton Stevens became especially popular. Many episodes would end with McGarrett instructing his subordinate to "Book ''em, Danno!", sometimes specifying a charge such as "murder one".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iFAlqhfY1D0ithTrfKTxObPlUH.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:2303'),
  ('213339936856913083', 'Hawaiian Eye', 1959, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roy Huggins', null, 'Robert Conrad, Anthony Eisley, Poncie Ponce, Connie Stevens, Grant Williams, Troy Donahue', 'TV-PG', 'Private Eyes Tom Lopaka and Tracy Steele are based out of Hawaiian Village Resort where they work both hotel security and are hired by others to look into various matters. They''re helped by their trusty right-hand man Kazuo Kim who runs a taxi company and is always eager to help them.', 'Private Eyes Tom Lopaka and Tracy Steele are based out of Hawaiian Village Resort where they work both hotel security and are hired by others to look into various matters. They''re helped by their trusty right-hand man Kazuo Kim who runs a taxi company and is always eager to help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWshJZOZTsEUho82d8YrCV9ariR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5367'),
  ('820677234626012654', 'Hawkeye', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Jonathan Igla', 'Erin Cancino, Ellen Morton', 'Jeremy Renner, Hailee Steinfeld, Tony Dalton, Alaqua Cox, Fra Fee, Aleks Paunovic, Piotr Adamczyk, Vera Farmiga', 'TV-14', 'Former Avenger Clint Barton has a seemingly simple mission: get back to his family for Christmas. Possible? Maybe with the help of Kate Bishop, a 22-year-old archer with dreams of becoming a superhero. The two are forced to work together when a presence from Barton’s past threatens to derail far more than the festive spirit.', 'Former Avenger Clint Barton has a seemingly simple mission: get back to his family for Christmas. Possible? Maybe with the help of Kate Bishop, a 22-year-old archer with dreams of becoming a superhero. The two are forced to work together when a presence from Barton’s past threatens to derail far more than the festive spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct5pNE5dDHryHLDnxyZPYcqO1sz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88329'),
  ('960243077964584122', 'Hawkins', 1973, 'Mystery', 'David Karp', null, 'James Stewart', null, 'The cases of slow-talking but high-powered West Virginia attorney Billy Jim Hawkins.', 'The cases of slow-talking but high-powered West Virginia attorney Billy Jim Hawkins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrldbQUBtFPlhiOm0JO1M0Z7iRe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9844'),
  ('1139230172540912364', 'Hawthorne', 2009, 'Drama', 'John Masius', null, 'Jada Pinkett Smith, Suleka Mathew, Michael Vartan, Hannah Hodson, Vanessa Lengies', null, 'Christina Hawthorne is a compassionate and headstrong Chief Nursing Officer heading up a group of dedicated nurses at Richmond Trinity Hospital on the hospital''s front lines. She does everything in her power to help her patients. When necessary, she takes on doctors and administrators who are overworked, distracted or just unable to see the human being behind the hospital chart. But the long days at the hospital and Hawthorne’s intense focus on helping others take a toll on her personal life.', 'Christina Hawthorne is a compassionate and headstrong Chief Nursing Officer heading up a group of dedicated nurses at Richmond Trinity Hospital on the hospital''s front lines. She does everything in her power to help her patients. When necessary, she takes on doctors and administrators who are overworked, distracted or just unable to see the human being behind the hospital chart. But the long days at the hospital and Hawthorne’s intense focus on helping others take a toll on her personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZuFnSA7RtgEQJUBdHqbhtlbpmp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:18856'),
  ('209388117833321888', 'Hayate the Combat Butler', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Ueda, Mikako Takahashi, Rie Tanaka, Rie Kugimiya, Ryoko Shiraishi, Marina Inoue', 'TV-14', '16-year-old Hayate is really down on his luck. Because his unemployed parents are good-for-nothings who waste what money they have on gambling, Hayate had to start working at a young age to help out his family. Although such experience has made him inhumanly fast and tough and skilled at things boys aren''t normally skilled at, it has also left him in an awkward position, as his parents have racked up such a huge gambling debt that they have sold Hayate to the yakuza for the value of his organs. In a desperate attempt to avoid that fate, Hayate decides to become a "bad guy" and kidnap someone to be held for ransom, but his efforts to do so are mistaken as a confession of love by the girl he targets. When he helps save the (as it turns out) ultra-wealthy 13-year-old Nagi from real kidnappers, she takes him in and gives him a job as her new personal butler (and love interest) until he can pay off his debt. But Hayate is more attracted to Nagi''s beautiful teenage maid Maria, and head butler Klaus is initially disapproving of a boy with such a poor look. And then there''s Nagi''s pet Tama, who is also a force to be reckoned with.', '16-year-old Hayate is really down on his luck. Because his unemployed parents are good-for-nothings who waste what money they have on gambling, Hayate had to start working at a young age to help out his family. Although such experience has made him inhumanly fast and tough and skilled at things boys aren''t normally skilled at, it has also left him in an awkward position, as his parents have racked up such a huge gambling debt that they have sold Hayate to the yakuza for the value of his organs. In a desperate attempt to avoid that fate, Hayate decides to become a "bad guy" and kidnap someone to be held for ransom, but his efforts to do so are mistaken as a confession of love by the girl he targets. When he helps save the (as it turns out) ultra-wealthy 13-year-old Nagi from real kidnappers, she takes him in and gives him a job as her new personal butler (and love interest) until he can pay off his debt. But Hayate is more attracted to Nagi''s beautiful teenage maid Maria, and head butler Klaus is initially disapproving of a boy with such a poor look. And then there''s Nagi''s pet Tama, who is also a force to be reckoned with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXNV13f4MiJZJ1oQqwsjetqbn2x.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:56355'),
  ('760983648310856519', 'Haywire', 1999, 'Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'Comedy series spoofing television in the year 2020.', 'Comedy series spoofing television in the year 2020.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:22907'),
  ('786599988140633585', 'Hazbin Hotel', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Vivienne Medrano', null, 'Stephanie Beatriz, Keith David, Kimiko Glenn, Erika Henningsen, Blake Roman, Amir Talai', 'TV-MA', 'In attempt to find a non-violent alternative for reducing Hell''s overpopulation, the daughter of Lucifer opens a rehabilitation hotel that offers a group of misfit demons a chance at redemption.', 'In attempt to find a non-violent alternative for reducing Hell''s overpopulation, the daughter of Lucifer opens a rehabilitation hotel that offers a group of misfit demons a chance at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVYHMW8pdzJ9qG1OGRMKyGy9xor.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:94954'),
  ('137424226131707110', 'Hazel', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Ted Key', null, 'Shirley Booth, Bobby Buntrock, Lynn Borden, Ray Fulmer', 'TV-G', 'Hazel is an American sitcom about a fictional live-in maid named Hazel Burke and her employers, the Baxters. The five-season, 154-episode series aired in primetime from September 28, 1961 until April 11, 1966 and was produced by Screen Gems. The show aired on NBC for its first four seasons, and then on CBS for its final season. The first season, except for one color episode was in black and white, the remainder in color. The show was based on the popular single-panel comic strip by cartoonist Ted Key, which appeared in the Saturday Evening Post.', 'Hazel is an American sitcom about a fictional live-in maid named Hazel Burke and her employers, the Baxters. The five-season, 154-episode series aired in primetime from September 28, 1961 until April 11, 1966 and was produced by Screen Gems. The show aired on NBC for its first four seasons, and then on CBS for its final season. The first season, except for one color episode was in black and white, the remainder in color. The show was based on the popular single-panel comic strip by cartoonist Ted Key, which appeared in the Saturday Evening Post.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNFivasZZWSvGr3bORJ8h9ZUNcW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:10492'),
  ('759365515226026564', 'Hazell', 1978, 'Crime, Drama', 'Terry Venables, Gordon Williams', null, 'Nicholas Ball', null, 'Hazell is a British television drama based on the novel series by Terry Venables and Gordon Williams (collectively known as P.B. Yuill), and starring Nicholas Bell as James Hazell, a ''smart parody'' of Philip Marlowe and Sam Spade. The programme ran for two series, from January 1978 to July 1979.', 'Hazell is a British television drama based on the novel series by Terry Venables and Gordon Williams (collectively known as P.B. Yuill), and starring Nicholas Bell as James Hazell, a ''smart parody'' of Philip Marlowe and Sam Spade. The programme ran for two series, from January 1978 to July 1979.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKlC6GNcoZLmUB8J0qxFYVjJYfy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9479'),
  ('947530022479138244', 'HBO First Look', 1992, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'HBO First Look is an American television show on HBO that chronicles up and coming movies. It first started in 1992 with a documentary on A League of Their Own starring Tom Hanks, and still airs today. The series shows behind-the-scenes looks at the filming and interviews with the actors. The show is part documentary and part advertisement. It airs on HBO with no set schedule.', 'HBO First Look is an American television show on HBO that chronicles up and coming movies. It first started in 1992 with a documentary on A League of Their Own starring Tom Hanks, and still airs today. The series shows behind-the-scenes looks at the filming and interviews with the actors. The show is part documentary and part advertisement. It airs on HBO with no set schedule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoHqOyAHREbYu9SokTtLXoNMH2h.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:33833'),
  ('205377693798974651', 'HD Nation', 2009, null, null, null, null, null, 'HD Nation is your guide to the best in HD content, and the best in home theater gear, no matter what your budget is! Robert Heron and Patrick Norton review gear, give you the scoop on the latest Home Theater trends, DIY tutorials and answer your questions about HD, HDTVs, projectors, HTPCs and more!', 'HD Nation is your guide to the best in HD content, and the best in home theater gear, no matter what your budget is! Robert Heron and Patrick Norton review gear, give you the scoop on the latest Home Theater trends, DIY tutorials and answer your questions about HD, HDTVs, projectors, HTPCs and more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPZRSzwX3mGNDnbdvFuMoSP59G8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:54292'),
  ('1127313490384671738', 'He Is My Master', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Masumi Asano, Junko Minagawa, Kana Ueda, Ai Shimizu', null, 'A 14-year-old millionaire named Yoshitaka receives an enormous inheritance as a result of his parents’ death in an accident. Later, after firing the original maids, he needs to be looked after—so he decides to hire new live-in maids. Though he originally expects an elderly woman to take the job, two runaway girls, Izumi, 14, and Mitsuki, 13, end up accepting the job in exchange for a home and income. Another girl, Anna, later becomes a maid as well, and all three live in the mansion with Yoshitaka.', 'A 14-year-old millionaire named Yoshitaka receives an enormous inheritance as a result of his parents’ death in an accident. Later, after firing the original maids, he needs to be looked after—so he decides to hire new live-in maids. Though he originally expects an elderly woman to take the job, two runaway girls, Izumi, 14, and Mitsuki, 13, end up accepting the job in exchange for a home and income. Another girl, Anna, later becomes a maid as well, and all three live in the mansion with Yoshitaka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1R4F4XOY8Tyu2r4kfzZXNSgRdR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24411'),
  ('1127202514319100052', 'He Is Psychometric', 2019, 'Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Yang Jin-ah', 'Jinyoung, Shin Ye-eun, Kim Kwon, Kim Da-som, Cho Byeong-kyu, Jeon Mi-seon, Go Youn-jung, Ro Jong-hyun', null, 'Lee Ahn has the ability to read a person''s secrets as soon as he touches them. He meets a woman who has secrets that she desperately tries to hide. The two team up to bring down criminals.', 'Lee Ahn has the ability to read a person''s secrets as soon as he touches them. He meets a woman who has secrets that she desperately tries to hide. The two team up to bring down criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCWNdVLOXGFCEP9em00aKA0DLh9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87302'),
  ('214859113743648766', 'He Knew He Was Right', 2004, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', null, 'Oliver Dimsdale, Christina Cole, Laura Fraser, Ron Cook, David Tennant, Stephen Campbell Moore, Fenella Woolgar, Anna Massey', null, 'A man''s unfounded jealousy destroys his marriage after he forbids his wife from seeing her godfather, leading to suspicion, separation, and tragedy.', 'A man''s unfounded jealousy destroys his marriage after he forbids his wife from seeing her godfather, leading to suspicion, separation, and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKsX5jJjkmKoQbE77SGzw7YwHQi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8177'),
  ('74268877671274091', 'He Who Can''t Marry', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Masaya Ozaki', null, 'Hiroshi Abe, Yoh Yoshida, Izumi Inamori, Takashi Tsukamoto, Toshinori Omi, Mai Fukagawa, Mitsuko Kusabue, Rieko Miura', null, 'Kekkon dekinai otoko, known in English as He Who Can''t Marry, is a 2006 Japanese drama broadcast by Fuji TV. The theme song is "Swimmy" by Every Little Thing. The drama was produced by Kansai Telecasting Corporation and Media Mix Japan.', 'Kekkon dekinai otoko, known in English as He Who Can''t Marry, is a 2006 Japanese drama broadcast by Fuji TV. The theme song is "Swimmy" by Every Little Thing. The drama was produced by Kansai Telecasting Corporation and Media Mix Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnweJFspZCSSNp249GeYdAK67Ov.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13372'),
  ('36707445351009597', 'He-Man and the Masters of the Universe', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Roger Sweet', 'Brynne Stephens', 'John Erwin, Alan Oppenheimer, Linda Gary, Lou Scheimer, Erika Scheimer', 'TV-Y7', 'When Adam, Prince of the planet Eternia, raises his magic sword he transforms into He-Man (the most powerful man in the universe). With his allies and friends, he battles the evil Skeletor and his minions to protect the secrets of Castle Grayskull.', 'When Adam, Prince of the planet Eternia, raises his magic sword he transforms into He-Man (the most powerful man in the universe). With his allies and friends, he battles the evil Skeletor and his minions to protect the secrets of Castle Grayskull.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tawmMe0D3ncyzEmmfMraGucXBCA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:931'),
  ('69917141911285370', 'He-Man and the Masters of the Universe', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Donald F. Glut', null, 'Cam Clarke, Garry Chalk, Lisa Ann Beley, Brian Dobson, Kathleen Barr, Gabe Khouth, Nicole Oliver, Michael Donovan', 'TV-Y7', 'Years ago, two leaders battled for the fantastical land of Eternia, one became the good King Randor, the other grew into the evil monster Skeletor who plans to rise once again and take Eternia. To protect the kingdom, the mystical powers of Castle Greyskull chose a hero - Randor''s lazy, impulsive teenage son Adam.', 'Years ago, two leaders battled for the fantastical land of Eternia, one became the good King Randor, the other grew into the evil monster Skeletor who plans to rise once again and take Eternia. To protect the kingdom, the mystical powers of Castle Greyskull chose a hero - Randor''s lazy, impulsive teenage son Adam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MZQ7GH4WfxeZYkuDGZD7H69X4L.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3035'),
  ('963408571208457455', 'He-Man and the Masters of the Universe', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Rob David', null, 'Yuri Lowenthal', 'TV-Y7', 'Mighty teen Adam and his heroic squad of misfits discover the legendary power of Grayskull — and their destiny to defend Eternia from sinister Skeletor.', 'Mighty teen Adam and his heroic squad of misfits discover the legendary power of Grayskull — and their destiny to defend Eternia from sinister Skeletor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khU0nt0PAbX0t6IpBBvTxm1uzoZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96659'),
  ('622017923004562073', 'He''s Coming To Me', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', 'larza', null, 'Pawat Chittsawangdee, Prachaya Ruangroj, Harit Cheewagaroon, Wachirawit Ruangwiwat, Chanunphat Kamolkiriluck, Chanagun Arpornsutina, Nattapat Nimjirawat', null, 'After his death, Met is a ghost that is consumed by loneliness. That is until he meets a strange boy that can see him. The two bond in a state of happiness and joy as they develop into friends. But what happens when Met falls for the boy who is alive?', 'After his death, Met is a ghost that is consumed by loneliness. That is until he meets a strange boy that can see him. The two bond in a state of happiness and joy as they develop into friends. But what happens when Met falls for the boy who is alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCYxOTcwkibHInHRNxIJMb70ExI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87493'),
  ('808266405060935028', 'He''s Expecting', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Yoshitatsu Yamada', 'Takumi Saitoh, Juri Ueno, Mariko Tsutsui, Lily Franky, Ryo Iwamatsu, Kazuya Takahashi', null, 'When a successful ad executive who''s got it all figured out becomes pregnant, he''s forced to confront social inequities he''d never considered before.', 'When a successful ad executive who''s got it all figured out becomes pregnant, he''s forced to confront social inequities he''d never considered before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3d109BZmzJWW0HDnQNMzN6V484k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152291'),
  ('929444960532279348', 'He''s Into Her', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Donny Pangilinan, Belle Mariano, Kaori Oinuma, Jeremiah Lisbo, Vivoree Esclito, Joao Constancia, Criza Taa, Gello Marquez', null, 'A coming-of-age story that tackles what the young and the young at heart must be brave enough to fight for: family, friendship, and love.', 'A coming-of-age story that tackles what the young and the young at heart must be brave enough to fight for: family, friendship, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67lr8k68eBEQ5plBgI3JkZhWjM7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102735'),
  ('92592842802927338', 'Head 2 Head', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Dechchart Tasilp, Suvijak Piyanopharoj, Patchara Silapasoonthorn, Bhobdhama Hansa, Chayakorn Jutamas, Sujira Arunpipat, Vichuda Pindum', null, 'A rivalry turns upside down when Jerome’s strange new ability shows him a shocking future—one where his enemy becomes his soulmate.', 'A rivalry turns upside down when Jerome’s strange new ability shows him a shocking future—one where his enemy becomes his soulmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgY5E0Gc5LQMy4SD9vPk6EBOei1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278137'),
  ('1020014077055817995', 'Head Case', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Robert Bauer, Ali Wentworth', null, 'Ali Wentworth, Steve Landesberg, Michelle Arthur, Rob Benedict, Candace Brown, Aris Alvarado', 'TV-MA', 'Meet Therapist Dr Elizabeth Goode. She''s brash, unconventional, judgmental, but undeniably thriving as the "it" therapist to Hollywood''s maladjusted elite. On a daily basis Dr Goode dishes her own unique methodology to a waiting room filled with a who''s who from the world of entertainment, sports and music. (Celebrities appear on the show as themselves.)', 'Meet Therapist Dr Elizabeth Goode. She''s brash, unconventional, judgmental, but undeniably thriving as the "it" therapist to Hollywood''s maladjusted elite. On a daily basis Dr Goode dishes her own unique methodology to a waiting room filled with a who''s who from the world of entertainment, sports and music. (Celebrities appear on the show as themselves.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RHcS61dnEwB5lMK6HFCwenyZRt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:7089'),
  ('1039111462192944695', 'Head of the Class', 1986, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rich Eustis', null, 'Billy Connolly, William G. Schilling, Jeannetta Arnette, Michael DeLorenzo, Dan Frischman, Robin Givens, Khrystyne Haje, Tony O''Dell', 'TV-G', 'Head of the Class is an American sitcom that ran from 1986 to 1991 on the ABC television network. The series follows a group of gifted students in the Individualized Honors Program at the fictional Monroe High School in Manhattan, and their history teacher Charlie Moore. The program was ostensibly a vehicle for Hesseman, best known for his role as radio DJ Dr. Johnny Fever in the sitcom WKRP in Cincinnati. Hesseman left Head of the Class in 1990 and was replaced by Billy Connolly as teacher Billy MacGregor for the final season. After the series ended, Connolly appeared in a short-lived spin-off titled Billy. The series was created and executive produced by Rich Eustis and Michael Elias. Rich Eustis had previously worked as a New York City substitute teacher while hoping to become an actor.', 'Head of the Class is an American sitcom that ran from 1986 to 1991 on the ABC television network. The series follows a group of gifted students in the Individualized Honors Program at the fictional Monroe High School in Manhattan, and their history teacher Charlie Moore. The program was ostensibly a vehicle for Hesseman, best known for his role as radio DJ Dr. Johnny Fever in the sitcom WKRP in Cincinnati. Hesseman left Head of the Class in 1990 and was replaced by Billy Connolly as teacher Billy MacGregor for the final season. After the series ended, Connolly appeared in a short-lived spin-off titled Billy. The series was created and executive produced by Rich Eustis and Michael Elias. Rich Eustis had previously worked as a New York City substitute teacher while hoping to become an actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHa7u2ySBgRtUGpxAkd1Maf6ws6.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2589'),
  ('687487698198471370', 'Head of the Class', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Rich Eustis, Michael Elias', 'Alan Yanaga, Sofi Selig, Sam Elhindi', 'Isabella Gómez, Jorge Diaz, Jolie Hoang-Rappaport, Gavin Lewis, Dior Goodjohn, Brandon Severs, Adrian Matthew Escalona, Katie Beth Hall', 'TV-PG', 'Teacher Alicia Adams wants her group of overachieving high school students to focus less on grades and more on experiencing life.', 'Teacher Alicia Adams wants her group of overachieving high school students to focus less on grades and more on experiencing life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxqSX1hyErStQBO0SdkV7fu5jOp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122197'),
  ('198567829296121939', 'Head Over Heels', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Yong-wan', null, 'Cho Yi-hyun, Choo Young-woo, Cha Kang-yoon, Choo Ja-hyun', null, 'A teenage shaman determined to change fate sets out to save a mysterious boy destined to die. As danger looms, their fated encounter sparks a powerful first love that defies darkness and reclaims hope.', 'A teenage shaman determined to change fate sets out to save a mysterious boy destined to die. As danger looms, their fated encounter sparks a powerful first love that defies darkness and reclaims hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL42DhVhqjO3NxlB0oNg2Z4TAWP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258025'),
  ('359186867826762516', 'Headhunted to Another World: From Salaryman to Big Four!', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Konomi Kohara, Akio Otsuka, Takanori Hoshino, Nene Hieda, Chitose Morinaga, Ayami Tsukui, Takaya Kuroda', 'TV-14', 'In an alternate fantasy world, the Demon King reigns with a formidable army led by his Four Heavenly Kings. One happens to be Uchimura Denosuke, a normal salaryman unexpectedly plucked from his mundane life by the Demon King himself. But even in this new realm, Uchimura is bestowed no particular powers. Can he survive treacherous missions with only the knowledge of an office worker?', 'In an alternate fantasy world, the Demon King reigns with a formidable army led by his Four Heavenly Kings. One happens to be Uchimura Denosuke, a normal salaryman unexpectedly plucked from his mundane life by the Demon King himself. But even in this new realm, Uchimura is bestowed no particular powers. Can he survive treacherous missions with only the knowledge of an office worker?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jn74fTmDPlQLyHyhhErM82WqTlD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259559'),
  ('463916754989542245', 'Headhunters', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Geir Henning Hopland, Rolf-Magne G. Andersen', 'Rolf-Magne G. Andersen, Geir Henning Hopland', 'Axel Bøyum, Ingrid Unnur Giæver, Mikkel Bratt Silset, Martin Wallström, Dominique Tipper, Mads Ousdal, Ravdeep Singh Bajwa, Mats Eldøen', null, 'The place is Oslo, the year is 2002, and Roger Brown is a newly employed headhunter in an exclusive recruitment agency. He is given the prestigious task of finding a new top manager for the oil company Njord Oil. Roger is willing to do whatever it takes to quickly climb the career ladder. Takes place before the novel "Headhunters" by Jo Nesbø.', 'The place is Oslo, the year is 2002, and Roger Brown is a newly employed headhunter in an exclusive recruitment agency. He is given the prestigious task of finding a new top manager for the oil company Njord Oil. Roger is willing to do whatever it takes to quickly climb the career ladder. Takes place before the novel "Headhunters" by Jo Nesbø.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLLM6WfrkqbAEtz0cvez71WbkVp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152268'),
  ('1065720985715342452', 'Heading Out', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Sue Perkins', null, 'Sue Perkins, Shelley Conn, Nicola Walker, Joanna Scanlan, Steve Oram, Dominic Coleman', null, 'Sara is a woman approaching middle age who is popular and successful - she''s a veterinarian so skilled that she can spay a tortoise using just one hand - but has a chink in her armour: she''s afraid to tell her parents that she is a lesbian. So on the eve of her 40th birthday, friends Jamie and Justine give Sara an ultimatum - either tell her parents next time mum and dad visit or they will.', 'Sara is a woman approaching middle age who is popular and successful - she''s a veterinarian so skilled that she can spay a tortoise using just one hand - but has a chink in her armour: she''s afraid to tell her parents that she is a lesbian. So on the eve of her 40th birthday, friends Jamie and Justine give Sara an ultimatum - either tell her parents next time mum and dad visit or they will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GMhfbJ0lmm9cqkYOEcpSMkSgas.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46872'),
  ('26120892452397621', 'Headless Chickens', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jorge Valdano, Pablo Tébar', null, 'Hugo Silva, Gorka Otxoa, Dafne Fernández, Miguel Ángel Solá, Diogo Sales, Gorka Lasaosa, Óscar Casas, Kira Miró', 'TV-MA', 'In a recognizable world of madness, the world of elite soccer, young footballers become rich and famous overnight with little idea of how to manage it, and cheeky people try to make a living out of it.', 'In a recognizable world of madness, the world of elite soccer, young footballers become rich and famous overnight with little idea of how to manage it, and cheeky people try to make a living out of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOFOJzbSW90HsFEfwzh2PYLP9tZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222322'),
  ('636506287957388982', 'Headspace Guide to Meditation', 2021, 'Documentary, Animation', null, null, 'Andy Puddicombe', 'TV-G', 'The series shows how meditation can help in your daily life. From tackling stress to embracing gratitude, each episode first teaches the basics and techniques of the practice, and then concludes with a guided meditation. Push play, close your eyes, and explore the many benefits of meditation.', 'The series shows how meditation can help in your daily life. From tackling stress to embracing gratitude, each episode first teaches the basics and techniques of the practice, and then concludes with a guided meditation. Push play, close your eyes, and explore the many benefits of meditation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idWdyd1jGQiR6p9F4I1UqKbzYic.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114419'),
  ('986116403724422459', 'Headspace Guide to Sleep', 2021, 'Documentary, Animation', null, null, 'Evelyn Lewis Prieto', 'TV-G', 'Learn how to sleep better with Headspace. Each episode unpacks misconceptions, offers friendly tips and concludes with a guided wind-down', 'Learn how to sleep better with Headspace. Each episode unpacks misconceptions, offers friendly tips and concludes with a guided wind-down', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2GiaMo878GH56c5QYV7BFXFFGP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121628'),
  ('927434186263296487', 'Healer', 2014, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Drama', 'Song Ji-na, Kim Jin-woo', null, 'Ji Chang-wook, Yoo Ji-tae, Park Min-young, Park Sang-won, Do Ji-won, Woo Hee-jin, Kim Mi-kyeong, Oh Jong-hyuk', 'TV-14', 'A star reporter, a second-rate journalist and a man by the code name "Healer" are brought together by a long-buried incident that hides dark truths.', 'A star reporter, a second-rate journalist and a man by the code name "Healer" are brought together by a long-buried incident that hides dark truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Zc0XtzXasrfgOyCH7wX8stqkEu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61670'),
  ('184587305379256326', 'Healer Girl', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chihaya Yoshitake, Marina Horiuchi, Karin Isobe, Akane Kumada, Ayahi Takagaki, Hisako Tojo, Miyu Takagi', 'TV-14', 'The world can be healed through music, and these three girls want to make it happen. Meet Kana Fujii, Reimi Itsushiro, and Hibiki Morishima—three healers-in-training at the Karasuma Phoniatric Clinic learning the art of healing patients’ illnesses and injuries by singing. Join them on this musical adventure of kindhearted, powerful miracles sung to heal the world.', 'The world can be healed through music, and these three girls want to make it happen. Meet Kana Fujii, Reimi Itsushiro, and Hibiki Morishima—three healers-in-training at the Karasuma Phoniatric Clinic learning the art of healing patients’ illnesses and injuries by singing. Join them on this musical adventure of kindhearted, powerful miracles sung to heal the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1N4PMxaeZNF7QRK7159pYrwpbw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124572'),
  ('920447599381365173', 'Healin'' Good Precure', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Natsu Yorita, Hiyori Kouno, Suzuko Mimori, Ai Kakuma, Hana Takeda, Aki Kanada, Haruka Shiraishi', null, 'The Healing Garden, a secret world that has provided treatment to heal the Earth, is under attack by the Byougenzu, who plan to infect Earth with an illness, putting it in great danger! To solve this crisis, the three medical trainees of Earth, known as the Healing Animals, along with Latte, who holds a special power as the Princess of the Healing Garden, escape in search of their partners! Three ordinary girls come across the group by chance, and together, they transform into Pretty Cure and take on the Byougenzu!', 'The Healing Garden, a secret world that has provided treatment to heal the Earth, is under attack by the Byougenzu, who plan to infect Earth with an illness, putting it in great danger! To solve this crisis, the three medical trainees of Earth, known as the Healing Animals, along with Latte, who holds a special power as the Princess of the Healing Garden, escape in search of their partners! Three ordinary girls come across the group by chance, and together, they transform into Pretty Cure and take on the Byougenzu!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bw592IpjOLC4QNitCRAyA7KMgxx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96914'),
  ('810523581158727939', 'Hear Me', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Makbule Kosif, Gülsev Karagöz', 'Rabia Soytürk, Caner Topçu, Berk Hakman, Burak Can, Ege Kökenli, Sümeyye Aydoğan, Helin Kandemir, Aytaç Uşun', null, 'The life of high school student Ekim, who lives in a humble neighborhood, is shaken by a tragic event that takes place in front of her eyes: her best friend Leyla is injured in a hit-and-run accident. The car disappears inside a prestigious private school, attended by the richest kids of the city. When the neighbors demand justice, the school tries to bury the news by giving scholarships to three studious teenagers from the neighborhood. Ekim, Bekir and Ayşe are chosen, but they soon realize that their life is about to get harder. Yet, Ekim has no intention of letting this go quietly, and there is one thing she is sure of: the criminal is one of the students. While she tries to uncover this dark secret and ensure justice, she will be troubled by her emotions as her heart is turned upside down.', 'The life of high school student Ekim, who lives in a humble neighborhood, is shaken by a tragic event that takes place in front of her eyes: her best friend Leyla is injured in a hit-and-run accident. The car disappears inside a prestigious private school, attended by the richest kids of the city. When the neighbors demand justice, the school tries to bury the news by giving scholarships to three studious teenagers from the neighborhood. Ekim, Bekir and Ayşe are chosen, but they soon realize that their life is about to get harder. Yet, Ekim has no intention of letting this go quietly, and there is one thing she is sure of: the criminal is one of the students. While she tries to uncover this dark secret and ensure justice, she will be troubled by her emotions as her heart is turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxpu7cWd7Td1LlreFyZVJLrzMjV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205588'),
  ('183538983890933137', 'Heart Beat', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'RK Multispeciality Hospital is a beacon of hope and healing. Its doctors are resilient even when they have to deal with medical and personal challenges.', 'RK Multispeciality Hospital is a beacon of hope and healing. Its doctors are resilient even when they have to deal with medical and personal challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odnF5hyuYI8itcMLxFT6H9IpKoT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:248064'),
  ('85334520785199467', 'Heart Code', 2026, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Natsiya Prommart, Pattarawadee Laosa, Boy Surat Rungputtikul, Thanut Jiraratchakit, Trin Settachoke, Athiwad Sanidwong Na Ayoodthayaa, Phatthara Cheaujamporn, Paythai Ploymeeka', null, 'After the attempted attack on a senior police officer, the Special Crime Suppression Unit launches a training camp to identify elite female officers. Among them is Captain Thara, a well-known officer who grows close to Vicky, unaware that Vicky is the daughter of the senior officer linked to her father’s death 19 years ago.', 'After the attempted attack on a senior police officer, the Special Crime Suppression Unit launches a training camp to identify elite female officers. Among them is Captain Thara, a well-known officer who grows close to Vicky, unaware that Vicky is the daughter of the senior officer linked to her father’s death 19 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZQF0aHaxScOWRfAHzSWXTnyoVv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:303724'),
  ('555875662293824770', 'Heart of Gold', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'José Pinto Carneiro, Miguel Simal, Lígia Dias', 'Rita Blanco, João Reis, Mariana Pacheco, Maria João Bastos, Mariana Monteiro, Diogo Lopes, Miguel Guilherme, Lúcia Moniz', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etYErWfbmbbE5BbaxYoCCbR76DE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157371'),
  ('532595505199765498', 'Heart of the City', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Melek Gençoğlu, Ece Yörenç', 'Leyla Lydia Tuğutlu, Gürkan Uygun, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Kaan Yalçın, Barış Akkoyun, Bengü Ergin, Hazal Benli, Osman Alkaş', null, 'Derin and Ali are two people from different worlds. Derin is the daughter of a rich man, on the otherside Ali is a 24 years old boy who saw his mom being killed by his dad when he was young. So rauf anne took him as his son and now after many years he is back to istanbul , where he will meet derin and they start to enjoy time with each other.', 'Derin and Ali are two people from different worlds. Derin is the daughter of a rich man, on the otherside Ali is a 24 years old boy who saw his mom being killed by his dad when he was young. So rauf anne took him as his son and now after many years he is back to istanbul , where he will meet derin and they start to enjoy time with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2JQrUQEiHmOJfAiDqTl6LZyYdr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69535'),
  ('97123866908893609', 'Heart Signal', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Du Haitao, Victor Ma, Jerry Yan, Chunye Zhang, The8, Hani Kyzy, 钱庄', null, 'A dating reality show about eight strangers, 4 men and 4 women, living together in the Signal House.', 'A dating reality show about eight strangers, 4 men and 4 women, living together in the Signal House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goGRtZKhPhLGgtxVA5gBdDfFcDe.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:103147'),
  ('963506550696429075', 'Heart Surgeons', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Go Soo, Uhm Ki-joon, Seo Ji-hye, Jung Bo-seog, Nam Kyung-eup, Kim Ye-won, Jang So-yeon, Oh Dong-min', null, 'The series revolves around the thoracic surgery department of a hospital.', 'The series revolves around the thoracic surgery department of a hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7N21jcnmARis6sfMJhrwEl83wfT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82444'),
  ('165219968118465126', 'Heart''s Decree', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Mónica Agudelo', null, 'Laura Londoño, Luciano D''Alessandro, Mabel Moreno, Lina Tejeiro, Iván López, Rodrigo Candamil, Carlos Benjumea, Manuel Sarmiento', null, 'The Law of the Heart is a story that takes place in a successful law firm specializing in family law, specializing in divorce cases and, in general, in family and relationship conflicts. The decisions these lawyers make often affect them both inside and outside the office and in the courts. Some of them are guided by the law, but others are guided by their hearts—two paths that don''t always go hand in hand when it comes to resolving legal conflicts.', 'The Law of the Heart is a story that takes place in a successful law firm specializing in family law, specializing in divorce cases and, in general, in family and relationship conflicts. The decisions these lawyers make often affect them both inside and outside the office and in the courts. Some of them are guided by the law, but others are guided by their hearts—two paths that don''t always go hand in hand when it comes to resolving legal conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKNDNtXK3z893Vrvzvc3koW31ZE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92369'),
  ('335941952391449960', 'Heartbeat', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Keith Richardson, Gerry Mill', null, 'Derek Fowlds, William Simons, Tricia Penrose, Peter Benson, Gwen Taylor, Lisa Kay, Joseph McFadden, Nikki Sanderson', 'TV-14', 'Set during the 1960s in the fictional North Yorkshire village of Aidensfield, this enduringly popular series interweaves crime and medical storylines.', 'Set during the 1960s in the fictional North Yorkshire village of Aidensfield, this enduringly popular series interweaves crime and medical storylines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAmkMnqyKP6kD9QlXvJxkxMLwDB.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:2585'),
  ('859478347563861372', 'Heartbeat', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jill Gordon', null, 'Melissa George, Don Hany, Shelley Conn, Dave Annable, Maya Erskine, Rudy Martinez, Jamie Kennedy, JLouis Mills', 'TV-14', 'Based on the real life and achievements of Dr. Kathy Magliato, this unique character-driven medical drama follows Dr. Alex Panttiere, an outspoken world-renowned heart-transplant surgeon and one of the few women in her field. Stubborn and fearless, Alex always operates on her own terms. Watch as she revels in a racy personal life, manages the daily demands of skeptical faculty and dutiful interns, and pushes the boundaries of medical science to impressive new heights.', 'Based on the real life and achievements of Dr. Kathy Magliato, this unique character-driven medical drama follows Dr. Alex Panttiere, an outspoken world-renowned heart-transplant surgeon and one of the few women in her field. Stubborn and fearless, Alex always operates on her own terms. Watch as she revels in a racy personal life, manages the daily demands of skeptical faculty and dutiful interns, and pushes the boundaries of medical science to impressive new heights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gh1gdNKuQ36AWBbXlrKGIblHtKQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65938'),
  ('762781109758582723', 'Heartbeat', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Eda Tezcan, Makbule Kosif', 'Verda Pars, Ebru Hacıoğlu', 'Öykü Karayel, Gökhan Alkan, Ege Kökenli, Hakan Gerçek, Fatih Dönmez, Barış Aytaç, Burcu Türünz, Başar Doğusoy', null, 'Eylul the stubborn, school girl turns up to be a strong professional doctor by the help of her teacher Ali Asaf. After years of separation they meet up again but not as a teacher and student, instead as surgeons working side by side. Their love is met by many challenges and the inner conflict of the stubborn women who refuse to yield easily to her heart, refusing to repeat the miserable story of her dead mother.', 'Eylul the stubborn, school girl turns up to be a strong professional doctor by the help of her teacher Ali Asaf. After years of separation they meet up again but not as a teacher and student, instead as surgeons working side by side. Their love is met by many challenges and the inner conflict of the stubborn women who refuse to yield easily to her heart, refusing to repeat the miserable story of her dead mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjNvi0fOwjMlcKGukHmZB3zNnD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83028'),
  ('342581614300659139', 'HeartBeat', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lee Min-soo, Jeong Seung-ju, Kim Ha-na', 'Kim Ha-na, Jeong Seung-ju', 'Ok Taec-yeon, Won Ji-an, Yoon So-hee, Park Kang-hyun, Ko Kyu-pil, Yoon Byung-hee, Moon Seung-you, Baek Seo-hoo', null, 'A thrilling romance between a vampire who desires to experience heart-throbbing love, and a cold-blooded woman.', 'A thrilling romance between a vampire who desires to experience heart-throbbing love, and a cold-blooded woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRrvEw3OCK9aiwe6YbcpsqkEwIW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218099'),
  ('84881436257985015', 'Heartbreak High', 1994, 'Drama', 'Michael Jenkins, Ben Gannon', null, 'Callan Mulvey, Putu Winchester', 'TV-MA', 'The ins and outs of the classroom lives of a group of students who attend the fictional Hartley High School in Sydney.', 'The ins and outs of the classroom lives of a group of students who attend the fictional Hartley High School in Sydney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6O6bKf7u4xJshV21hP1d9Bn7l0h.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:12998'),
  ('625282480882290479', 'Heartbreak High', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hannah Carroll Chapman, Ben Gannon, Michael Jenkins', null, 'Ayesha Madon, James Majoos, Brodie Townsend, Chloé Hayden, Thomas Weatherall, Asher Yasbincek, Josh Heuston, Sherry-Lee Watson', 'TV-MA', 'A fresh look at Hartley High over 20 years on. With her new friends - outsiders Quinni and Darren - Amerie must repair her reputation, while navigating love, sex, and heartbreak.', 'A fresh look at Hartley High over 20 years on. With her new friends - outsiders Quinni and Darren - Amerie must repair her reputation, while navigating love, sex, and heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KTYMK7N2vRe8PowCyb799DbDRR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:158154'),
  ('42375956316068648', 'Heartbroken Chocolatier', 2014, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jun Matsumoto, Satomi Ishihara, Asami Mizukawa, Kiko Mizuhara, Junpei Mizobata, Kasumi Arimura, Ryuta Sato, Naoto Takenaka', null, 'After graduating from high school, Sota Koyurugi studies bakery at an institute. In high school, he fell in love with beautiful Saeko. Because of Sota''s effort, he is able to have a romantic relationship with Saeko right before Christmas. Saeko though tells Sota that she will be unable to meet him on Valentine''s Day, but can meet him on the day before Valentine''s Day. On that day, Sota gives Saeko chocolate that he made, but she doesn''t accept his gift. Saeko tells him that she didn''t think they were dating. Sota is heartbroken, but he doesn''t give up hope. To make Saeko love him, he travels to France with little money and studies chocolate there. This is because Saeko loves chocolate. 5 years later, Sota becomes a first-class Chocolatier. Now back in Japan, Sota opens his very own store.', 'After graduating from high school, Sota Koyurugi studies bakery at an institute. In high school, he fell in love with beautiful Saeko. Because of Sota''s effort, he is able to have a romantic relationship with Saeko right before Christmas. Saeko though tells Sota that she will be unable to meet him on Valentine''s Day, but can meet him on the day before Valentine''s Day. On that day, Sota gives Saeko chocolate that he made, but she doesn''t accept his gift. Saeko tells him that she didn''t think they were dating. Sota is heartbroken, but he doesn''t give up hope. To make Saeko love him, he travels to France with little money and studies chocolate there. This is because Saeko loves chocolate. 5 years later, Sota becomes a first-class Chocolatier. Now back in Japan, Sota opens his very own store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3GwRfhHIQtlSyn1hfF9hLOWjm4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72270'),
  ('246653459652379728', 'HeartCatch PreCure!', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Nana Mizuki, Fumie Mizusawa, Houko Kuwashima, Aya Hisakawa, Taeko Kawata, Motoko Kumai, Cocoro Kikuchi, Akira Ishida', null, 'Tsubomi Hanasaki is a girl in the second grade of middle school who likes flowers and plants. One day she experiences a weird dream. In that dream, a large blooming tree appears. Suddenly, it loses all of its flowers and 2 fairies appear. A few days later after Tsubomi has transferred to Myoudou Academy, suddenly the fairies from the dream appear before her and plead to Tsubomi to become the legendary warrior Pretty Cure, and protect the Heart Tree. However, Tsubomi declines as she doesn''t think that she would be able to do that. However, a mysterious enemy suddenly strikes and steals the Heart Flower of her classmate, Erika Kurumi. Now she doesn''t have a choice. To retrieve Erika''s Heart Flower, she has to transform into a Pretty Cure and fight. Working up the courage, Tsubomi turns into Cure Blossom and a new chapter of Pretty Cure begins!', 'Tsubomi Hanasaki is a girl in the second grade of middle school who likes flowers and plants. One day she experiences a weird dream. In that dream, a large blooming tree appears. Suddenly, it loses all of its flowers and 2 fairies appear. A few days later after Tsubomi has transferred to Myoudou Academy, suddenly the fairies from the dream appear before her and plead to Tsubomi to become the legendary warrior Pretty Cure, and protect the Heart Tree. However, Tsubomi declines as she doesn''t think that she would be able to do that. However, a mysterious enemy suddenly strikes and steals the Heart Flower of her classmate, Erika Kurumi. Now she doesn''t have a choice. To retrieve Erika''s Heart Flower, she has to transform into a Pretty Cure and fight. Working up the courage, Tsubomi turns into Cure Blossom and a new chapter of Pretty Cure begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WtUvsp45AJXRsitHbZdGmDqeJv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42981'),
  ('1088942880629539152', 'Heartland', 2007, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Heather Conkie', null, 'Amber Marshall, Graham Wardle, Shaun Johnston', 'TV-PG', 'Life is hard on the Flemings'' ranch in the Alberta foothills where abused or neglected horses find refuge with a kind, hard-working family. Debts abound and the bank is about to foreclose. Can they keep the ranch running?', 'Life is hard on the Flemings'' ranch in the Alberta foothills where abused or neglected horses find refuge with a kind, hard-working family. Debts abound and the bank is about to foreclose. Can they keep the ranch running?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uc2gtWczT58BiAUJWFz9P5aZmNF.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:14929'),
  ('805478316903416645', 'Heartless', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Mikkel Munch-Fals', null, 'Julie Zangenberg, Sebastian Jessen, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Allan Hyde, Frederikke Dahl Hansen, Julie Christiansen, Julie Grundtvig Wester, Thomas Ernst', null, 'Heartless follows Sofie and Sebastian - two siblings with a deep dark and fatal secret. In order to survive they must suck energy out of other people. We follow their quest for answers as to why they are this way and their search leads them to Ottmannsgaard, a boarding school with plenty of deep dark secrets of its own.', 'Heartless follows Sofie and Sebastian - two siblings with a deep dark and fatal secret. In order to survive they must suck energy out of other people. We follow their quest for answers as to why they are this way and their search leads them to Ottmannsgaard, a boarding school with plenty of deep dark secrets of its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYWT0YBSGZ1NG5EV7qPny4YhLIL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62288'),
  ('518426890807065402', 'Heartless', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alonso Laporta', null, 'Ivan Massagué, Kira Miró, Esmeralda Pimentel', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUryLfrVklR4vDFkJoGat2S9DYE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239663'),
  ('414703451327200143', 'Heartless City', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, 'Yoo Seong-yeol', 'Jung Kyung-ho, Nam Gyu-ri, Lee Jae-yoon, Kim Yu-mi, Son Chang-min, Yoon Hyun-min, Choi Moo-seong, Kim Min-sang', null, 'Nam Gyu Ri sizzles and sways in this noir thriller about getting in too deep. When her best friend suffers a brutal fate while undercover in the crime underworld, Han Soo Min is driven to pick up where her friend left off. But in the shadows, there are no rules and no reason: Soo Min falls for the organization’s king pin, who also happens to be the prime suspect of her friend’s murder. With a betrayal at every corner, can Soo Min afford to trust the unjust? As with all things noir, expect seduction, femme fatales and mystery!', 'Nam Gyu Ri sizzles and sways in this noir thriller about getting in too deep. When her best friend suffers a brutal fate while undercover in the crime underworld, Han Soo Min is driven to pick up where her friend left off. But in the shadows, there are no rules and no reason: Soo Min falls for the organization’s king pin, who also happens to be the prime suspect of her friend’s murder. With a betrayal at every corner, can Soo Min afford to trust the unjust? As with all things noir, expect seduction, femme fatales and mystery!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYdaEPynl8FXq2jBH6qlOsP3aDn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54244'),
  ('833688935986106', 'Hearts', 2021, 'Drama', 'Riccardo Donna', null, 'Daniele Pecci, Matteo Martari, Pilar Fogliati', null, 'Follows a pioneer of Italian cardiology and a specialist who returns from America and has to struggle with male stereotypes. The challenge of research and above all the fervent and driving atmosphere of the progressive Italy of the sixties.', 'Follows a pioneer of Italian cardiology and a specialist who returns from America and has to struggle with male stereotypes. The challenge of research and above all the fervent and driving atmosphere of the progressive Italy of the sixties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6E0xqdKt6zk26xo5br03fO4rI6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:136658'),
  ('593979437135698708', 'Hearts Afire', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Harry Thomason, Linda Bloodworth-Thomason', null, 'John Ritter, Markie Post, Billy Bob Thornton, Conchata Ferrell, Clark Duke, Leslie Jordan, J. Skylar Testa, Doren Fein', null, 'Frustrations and sparks fly in Washington, D.C. when a strict conservative hires a free spirited journalist as his boss''s press secretary. Their mismatched political views lead to arguments... and attraction.', 'Frustrations and sparks fly in Washington, D.C. when a strict conservative hires a free spirited journalist as his boss''s press secretary. Their mismatched political views lead to arguments... and attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSgRV4M3dc4sHtAHJzxD7qKyNGW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2779'),
  ('537435768887828916', 'Heartstopper', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alice Oseman', null, 'Joe Locke, Kit Connor, William Gao, Yasmin Finney, Corinna Brown, Kizzy Edgell, Tobie Donovan, Rhea Norwood', 'TV-14', 'Teens Charlie and Nick discover their unlikely friendship might be something more as they navigate school and young love in this coming-of-age series.', 'Teens Charlie and Nick discover their unlikely friendship might be something more as they navigate school and young love in this coming-of-age series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJJt1HG62h3WoGnLcRIbO2nNNkg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:124834'),
  ('880311118127108937', 'Heartstrings', 1994, null, null, null, 'Aaron Kwok, Gigi Lai Chi, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Felton Law Gwan-Joh, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Bao Fang, Jimmy Wong Shu-Kei, Sher Ng Wing-Hung', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qj4jG5c3ojnpGBZpsyKYDGsR3P3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109670'),
  ('1145867361864304435', 'Heartstrings', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Park Shin-hye, Jung Yong-hwa, Song Chang-eui, So I-hyeon, Kang Min-hyuk, Kim Yoon-hye, Lee Hyun-jin, Lim Se-mi', 'NR', 'Lee Gyu Won is the daughter of one of the top three maestros of pansori and is also a gayageum protégé herself. Following her grandfather’s wishes for her to study the gayageum, she enrolls as a major of gugak, or traditional Korean music. Lee Shin is unfriendly, yet a clever student in the Applied Music Department who also is the famed vocalist and talented guitarist of the handsome band named The Stupid. With charming looks equal to those of a handsome character in a romance comic and a cold, taciturn personality, he thinks gugak is boring and belittles it. As the vocalist Lee Shin and Gayageum Protégé Lee Gyu Won passionately confront each other to champion their respective music, they soon fall in love.', 'Lee Gyu Won is the daughter of one of the top three maestros of pansori and is also a gayageum protégé herself. Following her grandfather’s wishes for her to study the gayageum, she enrolls as a major of gugak, or traditional Korean music. Lee Shin is unfriendly, yet a clever student in the Applied Music Department who also is the famed vocalist and talented guitarist of the handsome band named The Stupid. With charming looks equal to those of a handsome character in a romance comic and a cold, taciturn personality, he thinks gugak is boring and belittles it. As the vocalist Lee Shin and Gayageum Protégé Lee Gyu Won passionately confront each other to champion their respective music, they soon fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4X4rvEzSqc0tKRrWZCCz5wkb2ix.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39198'),
  ('539142563642191901', 'Heat Guy J', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Masaya Matsukaze, Saeko Chiba, Takayuki Sugo, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Shin-ichiro Miki, Michiko Neya', 'TV-14', 'Heat Guy J is a 26 episode science fiction anime series created by Escaflowne director Kazuki Akane and Satelight. Heat Guy J was licensed and distributed in the U.S. in 2003 by Pioneer. It was re-released by Funimation Entertainment in the fall of 2009. The first 13 episodes of the show also was broadcast on the cable channel MTV2. A one volume manga was created based on the series, and was licensed and distributed by TOKYOPOP. The show was picked up for a UK DVD release by Manga Entertainment starting in March 2006. It was packaged in double DVD sets to make up for the long delayed release of the series.', 'Heat Guy J is a 26 episode science fiction anime series created by Escaflowne director Kazuki Akane and Satelight. Heat Guy J was licensed and distributed in the U.S. in 2003 by Pioneer. It was re-released by Funimation Entertainment in the fall of 2009. The first 13 episodes of the show also was broadcast on the cable channel MTV2. A one volume manga was created based on the series, and was licensed and distributed by TOKYOPOP. The show was picked up for a UK DVD release by Manga Entertainment starting in March 2006. It was packaged in double DVD sets to make up for the long delayed release of the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uf5CGkKfu4dEsO22kIbWFETqZmW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42731'),
  ('683123525035491641', 'Heated Rivalry', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jacob Tierney', 'Jacob Tierney', 'Hudson Williams, Connor Storrie, François Arnaud', 'TV-MA', 'Two of the biggest stars in Major League Hockey are bound by ambition, rivalry, and a magnetic pull neither of them fully understands. What begins as a secret fling between two fresh faced rookies evolves into a years-long journey of love, denial, and self-discovery. Over the next eight years, as they chase glory on the ice, they struggle to navigate their feelings for each other. Torn between the sport they live for and the love they can’t ignore, they must decide if there’s room in their fiercely competitive world for something as fragile – and powerful – as real love.', 'Two of the biggest stars in Major League Hockey are bound by ambition, rivalry, and a magnetic pull neither of them fully understands. What begins as a secret fling between two fresh faced rookies evolves into a years-long journey of love, denial, and self-discovery. Over the next eight years, as they chase glory on the ice, they struggle to navigate their feelings for each other. Torn between the sport they live for and the love they can’t ignore, they must decide if there’s room in their fiercely competitive world for something as fragile – and powerful – as real love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YCKbtAkYWCMDLHvkUjGhG7eWoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301507'),
  ('483219744122275315', 'Heathcliff', 1980, 'Animation', 'Brad Anderson, Joe Ruby, Ken Spears', null, 'June Foray, Henry Corden, Paul Winchell, Mel Blanc, Don Messick', null, 'Heathcliff is an animated TV series that debuted on October 4, 1980. It was the first series based on the Heathcliff comic strip and was produced by Ruby-Spears Productions. It ran until September 18, 1982 with a total of 25 episodes, under two different names.', 'Heathcliff is an animated TV series that debuted on October 4, 1980. It was the first series based on the Heathcliff comic strip and was produced by Ruby-Spears Productions. It ran until September 18, 1982 with a total of 25 episodes, under two different names.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHY7TpTAArpScdgsBKuwWU3MRki.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12803'),
  ('1069884573748020946', 'Heathcliff and the Catillac Cats', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Jean Chalopin, George Gately, Bruno Bianchi', null, 'Mel Blanc, Donna Christie, Peter Cullen, Jeannie Elias, Danny Mann, Marilyn Lightstone', null, 'Heathcliff knows he is the best cat around! Never have we seen such self-confidence topped off with a heavy dose of vanity, cunning, ruthlessness, and a mischievous love of gags. He cruises and struts down the street and watch out any person, cat, or dog who gets in his way! Although he may terrorize the neighborhood, let an outsider try to push anyone around and he is a veritable tiger of defense. On the other side of town are The Catillac Cats, which typically revolve around leader Riff-Raff''s get-rich-quick schemes or searches for food.', 'Heathcliff knows he is the best cat around! Never have we seen such self-confidence topped off with a heavy dose of vanity, cunning, ruthlessness, and a mischievous love of gags. He cruises and struts down the street and watch out any person, cat, or dog who gets in his way! Although he may terrorize the neighborhood, let an outsider try to push anyone around and he is a veritable tiger of defense. On the other side of town are The Catillac Cats, which typically revolve around leader Riff-Raff''s get-rich-quick schemes or searches for food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AAS88x2ncjskKTm4Je1cNdrnf3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13781'),
  ('740822793421498242', 'Heathers', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jason A. Micallef', null, 'Grace Victoria Cox, James Scully, Melanie Field, Brendan Scannell, Jasmine Mathews', 'TV-MA', 'A pitch-black comedy anthology set in the present day, as our heroine, Veronica Sawyer, deals with a very different but equally vicious group of Heathers. Based on the 1988 cult classic film.', 'A pitch-black comedy anthology set in the present day, as our heroine, Veronica Sawyer, deals with a very different but equally vicious group of Heathers. Based on the 1988 cult classic film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbK7GvYCrkqUevhGLcNuyja3ngm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73552'),
  ('877738384480576994', 'Heaven and Hell: Soul Exchange', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Haruka Ayase, Issey Takahashi, Tasuku Emoto, Kazuki Kitamura, Yuri Nakamura, Junpei Mizobata, Takaya Sakoda, Akiyoshi Nakao', null, 'Ayako is a 35-year-old detective who is hardworking and has a strong sense of justice. However, she is inflexible and works too hard, which causes her to fail often. One day, she arrested a wanted suspect for a murder case, but, unfortunately, her soul was exchanged with the suspect just when she was looking forward to her rewards.', 'Ayako is a 35-year-old detective who is hardworking and has a strong sense of justice. However, she is inflexible and works too hard, which causes her to fail often. One day, she arrested a wanted suspect for a murder case, but, unfortunately, her soul was exchanged with the suspect just when she was looking forward to her rewards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vikhGz5OV99WtNUomNXdIEwdyCl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116912'),
  ('152565402837849387', 'Heaven Official''s Blessing', 2020, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mo Xiang Tong Xiu', null, 'Jiang Guangtao, Ma Zhengyang, Zhao Yi, Tu Xiongfei', 'TV-14', 'Banished to the mortal realm to exorcise ghosts, an eight-century-old deity reckons with a demon and slowly uncovers dark secrets behind the many heavenly gods.', 'Banished to the mortal realm to exorcise ghosts, an eight-century-old deity reckons with a demon and slowly uncovers dark secrets behind the many heavenly gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4psWk1qJZKXlH78DjZUnvXCwSAM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112398'),
  ('948326855811655124', 'Heaven''s Design Team', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Yumi Hara, Asuna Tomari, Yuuichirou Umehara, Ryota Takeuchi, Takahiro Mizushima, Hina Kino, Junichi Suwabe', 'TV-14', 'I made the light, the water, and the earth below. Now it''s time to make the life that dwells upon it. Actually... that sounds like a giant headache, so I''ll contract it out! Heaven''s Design Team is an agency that creates made-to-order life forms for their client, God. Why does this life form look like that? Why does this life form live this way? Watch the trials and successes of the designers and engineers forced to breathe life into God''s absurd requests!', 'I made the light, the water, and the earth below. Now it''s time to make the life that dwells upon it. Actually... that sounds like a giant headache, so I''ll contract it out! Heaven''s Design Team is an agency that creates made-to-order life forms for their client, God. Why does this life form look like that? Why does this life form live this way? Watch the trials and successes of the designers and engineers forced to breathe life into God''s absurd requests!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pssa27KHi9GwQAn3BebhwoAlaIr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105044'),
  ('921334084156776012', 'Heaven''s Gate: The Cult of Cults', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Marshall Applewhite, Bonnie Nettles, Sawyer, Frank Lyford, Benjamin Zeller, Janja Lalich, Robert Balch', 'TV-MA', 'What started in 1975 with the disappearance of 20 people from a small town in Oregon, ended in 1997 with the largest suicide on US soil and changed the face of modern New Age religion forever. This four-part docuseries uses never-before-seen footage and first-person accounts to explore the infamous UFO cult that shocked the nation with their out-of-this-world beliefs.', 'What started in 1975 with the disappearance of 20 people from a small town in Oregon, ended in 1997 with the largest suicide on US soil and changed the face of modern New Age religion forever. This four-part docuseries uses never-before-seen footage and first-person accounts to explore the infamous UFO cult that shocked the nation with their out-of-this-world beliefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiIB8SpmO5qi8tE65sOftW7hWFo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113678'),
  ('783028389804146350', 'Heaven''s Lost Property', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Suu Minazuki', 'Yuko Kakihara', 'Soichiro Hoshi, Saori Hayami, Ayahi Takagaki, Kaori Fukuhara, Iori Nomizu, Mina, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-MA', 'Girl-crazy Tomoki’s quiet life gets turned upside down when beautiful, winged Ikaros falls from the sky – and starts calling him master! She seems a little bit lost on Earth, and her origins are shrouded in mystery. One thing’s for sure, though – she just might have the power to make Tomoki’s every dream come true! The heavenly hijinks continue in Heaven’s Lost Property: Forte! Tomoki may long for peace and quiet, but with Ikaros and Nymph still adjusting to life on Earth, things aren’t likely to calm down anytime soon. Plus, there’s a new Angeloid on the scene – and she’s been sent to eliminate Tomoki!', 'Girl-crazy Tomoki’s quiet life gets turned upside down when beautiful, winged Ikaros falls from the sky – and starts calling him master! She seems a little bit lost on Earth, and her origins are shrouded in mystery. One thing’s for sure, though – she just might have the power to make Tomoki’s every dream come true! The heavenly hijinks continue in Heaven’s Lost Property: Forte! Tomoki may long for peace and quiet, but with Ikaros and Nymph still adjusting to life on Earth, things aren’t likely to calm down anytime soon. Plus, there’s a new Angeloid on the scene – and she’s been sent to eliminate Tomoki!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8H4aVnkpueXv9EEZUI6G3thU9Lh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37437'),
  ('718421541436129625', 'Heaven''s Memo Pad', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Kenichi Suzumura, Masaya Matsukaze, Yui Ogura, Ai Kayano, Kouki Miyata, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Takahiro Sakurai, Hitomi Nabatame', null, 'Narumi Fujishima is an ordinary high school boy who remains isolated from his fellow classmates. One afternoon fellow classmate Ayaka Shinozaki invites Narumi to join the gardening club and introduces him to a reclusive detective named Alice. Alice hires Narumi as an assistant and puts him to work solving the strange mysteries of Angel fix, an illegal drug. Little does he know it could put him and Ayaka in serious trouble.', 'Narumi Fujishima is an ordinary high school boy who remains isolated from his fellow classmates. One afternoon fellow classmate Ayaka Shinozaki invites Narumi to join the gardening club and introduces him to a reclusive detective named Alice. Alice hires Narumi as an assistant and puts him to work solving the strange mysteries of Angel fix, an illegal drug. Little does he know it could put him and Ayaka in serious trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XEJWiv541Tzmw14lWDUFhiZqps.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68379'),
  ('854221050334840666', 'Heavenly Bites: Mexico', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Memo Villegas', null, 'Welcome to a food extravaganza, a visual poem to Mexico''s foodie ingenuity and the quirky and delicious flavors that are worth the stomach aches.', 'Welcome to a food extravaganza, a visual poem to Mexico''s foodie ingenuity and the quirky and delicious flavors that are worth the stomach aches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wROX6TYSbOWp2IRFvzyvQ4VudzH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155099'),
  ('869734545769489607', 'Heavenly Ever After', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Kim Sok-yun, Lee Nam-kyu, Kim Soo-jin', 'Lee Nam-kyu, Kim Soo-jin', 'Kim Hye-ja, Son Suk-ku, Han Ji-min, Lee Jung-eun, Cheon Ho-jin, Ryu Deok-hwan, Jeong Ji-an, You Hyun-soo', 'TV-MA', 'After life''s ups and downs, a loving couple separated by death reunites in heaven — only to discover he''s in his thirties while she''s in her eighties.', 'After life''s ups and downs, a loving couple separated by death reunites in heaven — only to discover he''s in his thirties while she''s in her eighties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQ3fDmgQ9GbmntzPY6vOOttSi6J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254389'),
  ('746450591757454866', 'Heavenly Sword and Dragon Sabre', 2003, 'Drama', null, 'Bing Chen', 'Alec Su, Alyssa Chia, Gao Yuanyuan, Chen Zihan, Florence Tan, Zhang Tielin, Zhang Guoli, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong', null, 'Based on the popular novel by Jin Yong Kam Yung. He also wrote Legend of the Condor Heroes and Return of the Condor Heroes. The Heavenly Sword and Dragon Sabre takes place during 14th Century China during the Mongolian Yuan Dynasty, roughly 100 years after the events of Return of the Condor Heroes. After decades of struggles, famine, and bitterness which the Chinese citizens blamed on the Yuan Dynasty''s misgovernment, the Martial Arts sects have begun to rebel. Prince Ruyong asks Cheng Kun, a Shaolin monk with an ulterior motive, for a plan on how to deal with the rebels. "The wielder of Heavenly Sword and/or Dragon Sabre rules the world." This well known legend in the Martial Arts community is the impetus for the tale of Zhang Wuji. The story begins with how his parents met (episodes 1-3), then tells his trials as an adolescent (episodes 4-8), proceeds to relate his rise to prominence (episodes 9-23) and reveals the secret behind Heavenly Sword and Dragon Sabre (episode 23), and ends with the confluence of Wuji''s love life, the Martial Arts sects'' long standing grudges, and cruel fate.', 'Based on the popular novel by Jin Yong Kam Yung. He also wrote Legend of the Condor Heroes and Return of the Condor Heroes. The Heavenly Sword and Dragon Sabre takes place during 14th Century China during the Mongolian Yuan Dynasty, roughly 100 years after the events of Return of the Condor Heroes. After decades of struggles, famine, and bitterness which the Chinese citizens blamed on the Yuan Dynasty''s misgovernment, the Martial Arts sects have begun to rebel. Prince Ruyong asks Cheng Kun, a Shaolin monk with an ulterior motive, for a plan on how to deal with the rebels. "The wielder of Heavenly Sword and/or Dragon Sabre rules the world." This well known legend in the Martial Arts community is the impetus for the tale of Zhang Wuji. The story begins with how his parents met (episodes 1-3), then tells his trials as an adolescent (episodes 4-8), proceeds to relate his rise to prominence (episodes 9-23) and reveals the secret behind Heavenly Sword and Dragon Sabre (episode 23), and ends with the confluence of Wuji''s love life, the Martial Arts sects'' long standing grudges, and cruel fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1u3mRlDQWVbrZB8FtNRpYFYTIBq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31952'),
  ('536195613700431634', 'Heavenly Sword and Dragon Slaying Sabre', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Joseph Zeng, Chen Yuqi, Zhu Xudan, Zhang Chaoren, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Cao Xiyue, Hei Zi, Tao Luoyi', 'TV-14', 'Near the end of the Yuan Dynasty, different camps of fighters wreak havoc in the realm of combat. There are rumors that the possessor of Dragon Slaying Saber and Heavenly Sword can become the invincible fighter', 'Near the end of the Yuan Dynasty, different camps of fighters wreak havoc in the realm of combat. There are rumors that the possessor of Dragon Slaying Saber and Heavenly Sword can become the invincible fighter', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pz6iBvIqPkUoTzZ4UKnx7LmSt9d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87164'),
  ('1126035533530566539', 'Heavy Metal L-Gaim', 1984, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Chieko Honda, Maria Kawamura, Hirokazu Hiramatsu, Hochu Otsuka, Maria Kawamura, Show Hayami, Asami Mukaidono, Banjo Ginga', null, 'Heavy Metal L-Gaim is an anime television series, begun in 1984, which was directed by Yoshiyuki Tomino. Its characters and mecha were designed by Mamoru Nagano, who would later go on to create The Five Star Stories. Heavy Metal L-Gaim takes place in the Pentagona System, a solar system made up of five planets. Oldna Poseidal, the legendary emperor from the planet Gastogal leads his 24 Temple Knights from planet to planet until all have fallen under his control. His final victory is on the planet Mizum in 3975 when he defeats Kamon Walha V, ruler of the Yaman Clan. Kamon hides his heir, Kamon Myroad on the planet Mizum with the legendary white mecha, L-Gaim. Fifteen years later, now grown up and known as Daba Myroad, he leads a rebellion to free the planets of Pentagona from Poseidal''s grasp.', 'Heavy Metal L-Gaim is an anime television series, begun in 1984, which was directed by Yoshiyuki Tomino. Its characters and mecha were designed by Mamoru Nagano, who would later go on to create The Five Star Stories. Heavy Metal L-Gaim takes place in the Pentagona System, a solar system made up of five planets. Oldna Poseidal, the legendary emperor from the planet Gastogal leads his 24 Temple Knights from planet to planet until all have fallen under his control. His final victory is on the planet Mizum in 3975 when he defeats Kamon Walha V, ruler of the Yaman Clan. Kamon hides his heir, Kamon Myroad on the planet Mizum with the legendary white mecha, L-Gaim. Fifteen years later, now grown up and known as Daba Myroad, he leads a rebellion to free the planets of Pentagona from Poseidal''s grasp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i49yxGwwjYl6BRmCuXkwxaY1IJS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9429'),
  ('862222695457350398', 'Heavy Object', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Eri Suzuki, Shizuka Itoh, Natsuki Hanae, Kaito Ishikawa, Saori Onishi, Hisako Kanemoto, Ryusuke Ohbayashi, Rina Sato', 'TV-14', '"Objects" are powerful, massive weapons that change the course of warfare and are manned by Elite Object pilots. An odd Elite girl named Milinda meets Quenser, a student who aims to become a Object mechanic, with the soldier-in-training Heivia on a snowy battlefield.', '"Objects" are powerful, massive weapons that change the course of warfare and are manned by Elite Object pilots. An odd Elite girl named Milinda meets Quenser, a student who aims to become a Object mechanic, with the soldier-in-training Heivia on a snowy battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTgE5w6bR4DFQ0fsSuvXvsZFw80.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64140'),
  ('4712910820555102', 'Heavy Rescue: 401', 2017, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A group of heavy recovery drivers work to keep traffic rolling on some of the busiest and most unforgiving roads on the planet, Ontario’s 400-series highways. When disaster strikes on these roads, the pressure is on to get them cleared and reopened.', 'A group of heavy recovery drivers work to keep traffic rolling on some of the busiest and most unforgiving roads on the planet, Ontario’s 400-series highways. When disaster strikes on these roads, the pressure is on to get them cleared and reopened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMxoA2C73Ps40uPVUIvBDgp2jqN.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:70378'),
  ('258256195384715623', 'Hebburn', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Graham Duff, Jason Cook', 'Jason Cook, Graham Duff', 'Gina McKee, Vic Reeves, Chris Ramsey, Kimberley Nixon, Lisa McGrillis, Pat Dunn, Curtis Appleby, Jason Cook', 'TV-PG', 'Hebburn is a warm and affectionate tale of north east family life. It tells the tale of the Pearson family and their impetuous and ambitious son, Jack, who has left Tyneside for the bright lights and glamour of Manchester. He has secretly married a middle class Jewish girl, Sarah, and realises that it is about time he introduced her to his family.', 'Hebburn is a warm and affectionate tale of north east family life. It tells the tale of the Pearson family and their impetuous and ambitious son, Jack, who has left Tyneside for the bright lights and glamour of Manchester. He has secretly married a middle class Jewish girl, Sarah, and realises that it is about time he introduced her to his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEJ05ofyQPCOGAtINEV0fxGU99q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45662'),
