  ('514729896218806527', 'Heirs of the Night', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Diederik Van Rooijen, GameOnX-Officiel', null, null, null, '1889: the five remaining vampire clans in Europe are training to survive. In their midst is 14-year-old Alisa who has the power to choose between eternal life as a vampire or for all vampires to live as humans.', '1889: the five remaining vampire clans in Europe are training to survive. In their midst is 14-year-old Alisa who has the power to choose between eternal life as a vampire or for all vampires to live as humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkD3oTxYfsOYThtTM6o5HQom1Ar.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93842'),
