  ('786332972552256009', 'Hello Mr. Gu', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Li Dian, Ma Hongwen', 'Hu Hui', 'Chen Jingke, Yan Zhichao, Guo Yunqi, Zhu Danni, Xin Ruiqi, Ding Jiawen, Liu Xiao Liang, Cheng Zi', null, 'A CEO with a phobia of crowds enters by accident a contractual marriage with a broke heiress. With opposing personalities, the two butt heads but eventually becomes each other''s confidant. The two imperfect souls heal each other and fall in love.', 'A CEO with a phobia of crowds enters by accident a contractual marriage with a broke heiress. With opposing personalities, the two butt heads but eventually becomes each other''s confidant. The two imperfect souls heal each other and fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Mq7H1cnZctl52lX5mMeG2VfM7U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122111'),
