  ('152769652360396292', 'Hermanos y detectives', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Patricio Vega, Damián Szifron', 'Patricio Vega, Damián Szifron', 'Rodrigo de la Serna, Rodrigo Noya, María Marull, Oscar Guzmán, Carlos Moreno', null, 'An administrative police officer, Franco Montero, receives as an inheritance the care of a half-brother that he did not know. Lorenzo Montero, a child prodigy with an IQ of 200 who changes his way of life and his work. The eleven-year-old''s intelligence puts Franco and his assistant Gustavo Mansilla in charge of the homicide division. By deducing and exploring the three, they solve the most striking cases.', 'An administrative police officer, Franco Montero, receives as an inheritance the care of a half-brother that he did not know. Lorenzo Montero, a child prodigy with an IQ of 200 who changes his way of life and his work. The eleven-year-old''s intelligence puts Franco and his assistant Gustavo Mansilla in charge of the homicide division. By deducing and exploring the three, they solve the most striking cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJDtZNF52GzSXeX87rMUmMZDNKJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78584'),
  ('321969150726887297', 'Hermoso', 2025, 'Drama', 'Xion Lim', null, null, null, 'Back in his hometown to escape a scandal, Kyle finds an unexpected connection with Andres, a quiet fisherman. Just as a new life begins to take shape, Kyle’s past threatens to unravel everything — and he must decide if love is worth the risk.', 'Back in his hometown to escape a scandal, Kyle finds an unexpected connection with Andres, a quiet fisherman. Just as a new life begins to take shape, Kyle’s past threatens to unravel everything — and he must decide if love is worth the risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwmghFcV6mMU4QfUPKT8uLcrXkt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:288975'),
