  ('118996588633435521', 'Het jaar van Fortuyn', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Michiel van Jaarsveld, Pieter Bart Korthuis, Nathan Vecht', null, 'Jeroen Spitzenberger, Ramsey Nasr, Fedja van Huêt, Carly Wijs, Jaap Spijkers, Frank Lammers, Thijs Römer, Teun Luijkx', null, 'A chronicle of the tempestuous campaign trail rivalry between Labour Party leader Ad Melkert and flamboyant newcomer Pim Fortuyn, as they go head-to-head leading up to the Netherlands’ 2002 general elections.', 'A chronicle of the tempestuous campaign trail rivalry between Labour Party leader Ad Melkert and flamboyant newcomer Pim Fortuyn, as they go head-to-head leading up to the Netherlands’ 2002 general elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6MkeNXVQ7LknPIaiynuQWlWCWW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124841'),
  ('800664277108204685', 'Hetalia', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Hiroki Takahashi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Akira Sasanuma, Aki Kanada', 'TV-MA', 'Forget what you learned in history class, and imagine all the nations of the world as guys on an inappropriate reality show. Pledge allegiance to your favorite superpower in Hetalia Axis Powers!', 'Forget what you learned in history class, and imagine all the nations of the world as guys on an inappropriate reality show. Pledge allegiance to your favorite superpower in Hetalia Axis Powers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiMKkopeJU4UB4OW3o4hpYS7CB8.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:35138'),
  ('584073107641014556', 'Hetalia: World Stars', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Atsushi Kosaka, Akira Sasanuma, Kokoro Tanaka, Asai Keiitirou, Daisuke Namikawa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Hiroki Takahashi, Katsuyuki Konishi', 'TV-MA', 'After six years of waiting, Hetalia is back! The countries of the world change into/become beautiful boys and take you through the most important events in history. Follow Italy, Germany and Japan in their crazy adventures!', 'After six years of waiting, Hetalia is back! The countries of the world change into/become beautiful boys and take you through the most important events in history. Follow Italy, Germany and Japan in their crazy adventures!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPzMa1HRYfPOwLa2LRteJsAk6gQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121301'),
