  ('180012682330670092', 'Hollywood Squares', 1998, null, 'Merrill Heatter', null, 'Tom Bergeron, John Moschitta Jr.', 'TV-PG', 'On September 14, 1998, a Hollywood Squares revival debuted with Tom Bergeron as its host. In addition to her production duties, Whoopi Goldberg served as the permanent center square, with series head writer Bruce Vilanch, Gilbert Gottfried, Martin Mull, and Caroline Rhea as regular panelists and Brad Garrett, Bobcat Goldthwait, Jeffrey Tambor, George Wallace, Kathy Griffin and various others as semi-regular panelists. Shadoe Stevens returned to announce, although he was not given a square on the panel as he had been when John Davidson was host.', 'On September 14, 1998, a Hollywood Squares revival debuted with Tom Bergeron as its host. In addition to her production duties, Whoopi Goldberg served as the permanent center square, with series head writer Bruce Vilanch, Gilbert Gottfried, Martin Mull, and Caroline Rhea as regular panelists and Brad Garrett, Bobcat Goldthwait, Jeffrey Tambor, George Wallace, Kathy Griffin and various others as semi-regular panelists. Shadoe Stevens returned to announce, although he was not given a square on the panel as he had been when John Davidson was host.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHwgcxGQH8KpgTL4KEV4eG2IAn8.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:221468'),
  ('901161583615695237', 'Hollywood Squares', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Nate Burleson, Drew Barrymore', 'TV-14', 'Two contestants play tic-tac-toe to win money and prizes. The "board" for the game is a vertical stack of open-faced cubes, each occupied by a celebrity seated at a desk and facing the contestants. The celebrities are asked questions and the contestants judge the legitimacy of their answers to win the game.', 'Two contestants play tic-tac-toe to win money and prizes. The "board" for the game is a vertical stack of open-faced cubes, each occupied by a celebrity seated at a desk and facing the contestants. The celebrities are asked questions and the contestants judge the legitimacy of their answers to win the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndaQ2k2iTz4Gp29OKEnsJk9L8b9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:253410'),
  ('129302845855352554', 'Holmes of Kyoto', 2018, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Miyu Tomita, Kaito Ishikawa, Ryohei Kimura, Koji Yusa, Sanae Kobayashi, Rikiya Koyama, Yoji Ueda, Suzuna Kinoshita', null, 'Holmes, a young man whose family runs an antique shop in Kyoto, has the unique ability to read people and instantly distinguish genuine and high value antiques. When a local high school student, Aoi Maki, starts working alongside Holmes, together they begin to unravel the many mysteries surrounding the antiques brought to the shop.', 'Holmes, a young man whose family runs an antique shop in Kyoto, has the unique ability to read people and instantly distinguish genuine and high value antiques. When a local high school student, Aoi Maki, starts working alongside Holmes, together they begin to unravel the many mysteries surrounding the antiques brought to the shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkn6JYT5dluKkJHRN127oUVYQSZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80464'),
  ('112145479335988492', 'Holocaust', 1978, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Gerald Green', null, 'Tom Bell, Joseph Bottoms, Tovah Feldshuh, Rosemary Harris, Tony Haygarth, Michael Moriarty, Deborah Norton, George Rose', null, 'Berlin, Germany, 1935. The day Karl Weiss, a Jewish painter, and Inga Helms, a Christian woman, marry, is the one in which both of them and the entire Weiss family are caught up in the maelstrom of the Nazi regime, the storms of World War II and the horrors of the criminal Final Solution, the Holocaust, the Shoah; while Erik Dorf, an ambitious lawyer, undertakes his fall into hell at the hands of the sinister Reinhard Heydrich.', 'Berlin, Germany, 1935. The day Karl Weiss, a Jewish painter, and Inga Helms, a Christian woman, marry, is the one in which both of them and the entire Weiss family are caught up in the maelstrom of the Nazi regime, the storms of World War II and the horrors of the criminal Final Solution, the Holocaust, the Shoah; while Erik Dorf, an ambitious lawyer, undertakes his fall into hell at the hands of the sinister Reinhard Heydrich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK1gnzIOwZWuTqp4HGEPmjTMijg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15571'),
  ('742653173213629834', 'Holy Family', 2022, 'Drama', 'Manolo Caro', null, 'Najwa Nimri, Iván Pellicer', 'TV-MA', 'A family hiding a shocking secret starts over in Madrid, where new relationships complicate their plans and the past begins to catch up with them.', 'A family hiding a shocking secret starts over in Madrid, where new relationships complicate their plans and the past begins to catch up with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNFCvVA4LmeZkpaOGKOHvo74YUJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156883'),
  ('670717972053331365', 'Holy Knight', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Hiro Shimono', 'TV-14', 'Holy Knight is the story of a young male vampire slayer who reluctantly falls in love with a beautiful female vampire exchange student and their personal struggles to avoid their bloody predestined conflict.', 'Holy Knight is the story of a young male vampire slayer who reluctantly falls in love with a beautiful female vampire exchange student and their personal struggles to avoid their bloody predestined conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZzTXVq5hthmNJdeFjsBfVSjiId.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44883'),
  ('183978027455445669', 'Holy Land', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Dong Ho, Yeo Hoon-min, Joo Ah-reum', null, 'Holy Land tells the story of Kang Yoo (Dong Ho), a young boy who can''t get along with people at home or school. He starts learning the basics of boxing from a book, and one day he runs into some thugs and defends himself with his new boxing skills and since then he is called the "Hunter of Thugs". He runs into Sang Ho (Sung Woong) by chance and Sang Ho becomes his mentor. All the while Kang Yoo pushes himself to find out who he really is.', 'Holy Land tells the story of Kang Yoo (Dong Ho), a young boy who can''t get along with people at home or school. He starts learning the basics of boxing from a book, and one day he runs into some thugs and defends himself with his new boxing skills and since then he is called the "Hunter of Thugs". He runs into Sang Ho (Sung Woong) by chance and Sang Ho becomes his mentor. All the while Kang Yoo pushes himself to find out who he really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOPGr0MWK3qNJguk8gw0ggVjN68.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72164'),
  ('1081738554978037166', 'Home', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Sant', null, 'Rufus Jones, Rebekah Staton, Youssef Kerkour, Oaklee Pendergast', null, 'What happens when you return from a family holiday to France and open the boot to find a Syrian refugee where your luggage was supposed to be? That’s the situation facing new couple Peter and Katy when they get back to Dorking from their first family holiday with Katy’s young son John, who has spent the journey from Calais winding up his would-be stepdad. Their unexpected passenger is a bloke called Sami who hopes to claim asylum in Britain.', 'What happens when you return from a family holiday to France and open the boot to find a Syrian refugee where your luggage was supposed to be? That’s the situation facing new couple Peter and Katy when they get back to Dorking from their first family holiday with Katy’s young son John, who has spent the journey from Calais winding up his would-be stepdad. Their unexpected passenger is a bloke called Sami who hopes to claim asylum in Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjQeBJ4APY9ycya642d2wYQgWoc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87807'),
  ('539594486175219009', 'Home', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Discover the groundbreaking ideas and inspiring stories behind the world’s most imaginative dwellings. In this globe-spanning docuseries, meet the visionaries who are challenging conventional concepts of “home” and rethinking how we live.', 'Discover the groundbreaking ideas and inspiring stories behind the world’s most imaginative dwellings. In this globe-spanning docuseries, meet the visionaries who are challenging conventional concepts of “home” and rethinking how we live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUaqLCrqLHoUDUdQjEJ2hO40afe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98730'),
  ('756720911053833854', 'Home Alone', 2013, 'Reality', 'Lee Ji-sun', null, 'Park Na-rae, Jeon Hyun-moo, Key, Hwasa, Code Kunst, Kian84, Lee Jang-woo, Lee Ju-seung', 'TV-14', 'It can be a badge of honor to be “single.” “I Live Alone” is a documentary-style South Korean reality series that follows the members of a self-formed club called Rainbow, which is comprised of celebrities who are single and live alone.', 'It can be a badge of honor to be “single.” “I Live Alone” is a documentary-style South Korean reality series that follows the members of a self-formed club called Rainbow, which is comprised of celebrities who are single and live alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hqGagr94soBq70Lq7tPHvNmmxy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65282'),
  ('655626038854653176', 'Home and Away', 1988, 'Drama, Soap', 'Alan Bateman', null, 'Ray Meagher, Ada Nicodemou, Emily Symons, Shane Withington, James Stewart, Ethan Browne, Emily Weir, Nicholas Cartwright', 'TV-14', 'Home and Away is set in the fictional town of Summer Bay, a coastal town in New South Wales, and follows the personal and professional lives of the people living in the area. The show initially focused on the Fletcher family, Pippa and Tom Fletcher and their five foster children Frank Morgan, Carly Morris, Steven Matheson, Lynn Davenport and Sally Keating, who would go on to become one of the show''s longest-running characters. The show also originally and currently focuses on the Stewart family. Home and Away had proved popular when it premiered in 1988 and had risen to become a hit in Australia, and after only a few weeks, the show tackled its first major and disturbing storyline, the rape of Carly Morris; it was one of the first shows to feature such storylines during the early timeslot. H&A has tackled many adult-themed and controversial storylines; something rarely found in its restricted timeslot.', 'Home and Away is set in the fictional town of Summer Bay, a coastal town in New South Wales, and follows the personal and professional lives of the people living in the area. The show initially focused on the Fletcher family, Pippa and Tom Fletcher and their five foster children Frank Morgan, Carly Morris, Steven Matheson, Lynn Davenport and Sally Keating, who would go on to become one of the show''s longest-running characters. The show also originally and currently focuses on the Stewart family. Home and Away had proved popular when it premiered in 1988 and had risen to become a hit in Australia, and after only a few weeks, the show tackled its first major and disturbing storyline, the rape of Carly Morris; it was one of the first shows to feature such storylines during the early timeslot. H&A has tackled many adult-themed and controversial storylines; something rarely found in its restricted timeslot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vn0eKMiG69bhQtxb7qLRo8SSqu5.jpg', 39, 'tmdb:tv:2354'),
  ('31459866318946514', 'Home Before Dark', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Dana Fox, Dara Resnik', null, 'Brooklynn Prince, Jim Sturgess, Abby Miller, Kylie Rogers, Michael Weston, Aziza Scott, Joelle Carter, Louis Herthum', 'TV-14', 'Young investigative journalist Hilde Lisko moves with her family to the small town her father left behind, only to unearth shocking secrets in her pursuit of the truth.', 'Young investigative journalist Hilde Lisko moves with her family to the small town her father left behind, only to unearth shocking secrets in her pursuit of the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mt4P2epJrSaqrlkMP9fTUKLP9OE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98161'),
  ('1150456792508629374', 'Home Economics', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Michael Colton, John Aboud', 'Glenn Boozan, Zac Oyama, Ariana Quiñónez', 'Topher Grace, Caitlin McGee, Jimmy Tatro, Karla Souza, Sasheer Zamata, Lidia Porto, Shiloh Bearman, Jordyn Curet', 'TV-PG', 'The heartwarming yet uncomfortable relationship between three adult siblings: one in the 1%, one middle-class and one barely holding on.', 'The heartwarming yet uncomfortable relationship between three adult siblings: one in the 1%, one middle-class and one barely holding on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svYYne5mdKQVyIFwzkMVS2t35Ok.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:114413'),
  ('308353475996137249', 'Home Fires', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Catherine Oldfield', null, 'Samantha Bond, Ruth Gemmell, Claire Rushbrook, Fenella Woolgar, Clare Calbraith, Daisy Badger, Leanne Best, Leila Mimmack', 'TV-PG', 'The story of a group of inspirational women in a rural Cheshire community with the shadow of World War II casting a dark cloud over their lives. As the conflict takes hold and separates the women from their husbands, fathers, sons and brothers, the characters find themselves under increasing and extraordinary pressures in a rapidly fragmenting world. By banding together as the Great Paxford Women’s Institute, they help maintain the nation’s fabric in its darkest hour, and discover inner resources that will change their lives forever.', 'The story of a group of inspirational women in a rural Cheshire community with the shadow of World War II casting a dark cloud over their lives. As the conflict takes hold and separates the women from their husbands, fathers, sons and brothers, the characters find themselves under increasing and extraordinary pressures in a rapidly fragmenting world. By banding together as the Great Paxford Women’s Institute, they help maintain the nation’s fabric in its darkest hour, and discover inner resources that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRqKhlhk1wVueOnjWb009YDYbU8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62048'),
  ('106644555372055821', 'Home for Christmas', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Per-Olav Sørensen', null, 'Ida Elise Broch, Gabrielle Leithaug, Eric Curtis Johnson, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Hege Schøyen, Dennis Storhøi, Oddgeir Thune, Felix Sandman', 'TV-MA', '30-something Johanne navigates romance and family drama during the festive season, juggling exes and new relationships in her search for connection.', '30-something Johanne navigates romance and family drama during the festive season, juggling exes and new relationships in her search for connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6a5DxPZnwnt8IvDr4qnCSPh66h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:95612'),
  ('762681135483235143', 'Home for Good', 2026, null, null, null, 'Art Edmonds', null, 'Home for Good centers on giving “life-changing home transformations for deserving recipients who have overcome extraordinary challenges while also providing home safety and DIY guidelines.', 'Home for Good centers on giving “life-changing home transformations for deserving recipients who have overcome extraordinary challenges while also providing home safety and DIY guidelines.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:318742'),
  ('1105984812040440360', 'Home Game', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'This docuseries profiles unique and dangerous traditional sports from around the world, as well as the communities and cultures where they thrive.', 'This docuseries profiles unique and dangerous traditional sports from around the world, as well as the communities and cultures where they thrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4A1023Tel6t4gatJz6UsK9iKKt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105274'),
  ('1131109026324597027', 'Home Ground', 2018, 'Drama', 'Johan Fasting', null, 'Ane Dahl Torp, Morten Svartveit, John Carew, Axel Bøyum, Emma Bones', null, 'When a newly promoted football club lose their trainer just before the start of the league season, a female, Helena Mikkelsen, gets the historic chance to coach the team, even before an ambitious retired professional.', 'When a newly promoted football club lose their trainer just before the start of the league season, a female, Helena Mikkelsen, gets the historic chance to coach the team, even before an ambitious retired professional.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFUgPxvQSdVMxmgVBsvxdKOO5Go.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76482'),
  ('32535457542648999', 'Home Grown', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Philippe De Schepper', null, 'Dirk van Dijck, Sebastien Dewaele, Rhoda Montemayor, Sien Eggers, Maaike Cafmeyer, Wouter Bruneel, Piv Huvluv, Jan Hammenecker', null, 'A local Belgian potato farmer loses all his money and tries to earn it back by growing cannabis.', 'A local Belgian potato farmer loses all his money and tries to earn it back by growing cannabis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAfyts2xi1asJ0RkgHO5vs6uFb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61519'),
  ('140354741473576991', 'Home Improvement', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Carmen Finestra, Matt Williams, David McFadzean', null, 'Tim Allen, Patricia Richardson, Earl Hindman, Richard Karn, Debbe Dunning, Zachery Ty Bryan, Taran Noah Smith', 'TV-PG', 'The daily trials and tribulations of handyman Tim Taylor, a TV show host raising three boys with help from his loyal co-host, domineering wife, and unseen neighbor.', 'The daily trials and tribulations of handyman Tim Taylor, a TV show host raising three boys with help from his loyal co-host, domineering wife, and unseen neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa3J2ZXeg7TiziuXGyfz99HdYDS.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1558'),
  ('566360149642793830', 'Home Invasion', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Johan Glans, Morena Baccarin, Nishi Munshi, Jadah Marie, Leo Oliva, Ross Philips, Luke Dimyan, Marilyn Cutts', null, 'Petty criminal Mick has to pay a debt back to some scary people, so he and his partner Tom decide to break into a house... which they discover is inhabited by aliens.', 'Petty criminal Mick has to pay a debt back to some scary people, so he and his partner Tom decide to break into a house... which they discover is inhabited by aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n48mo56fVNWZzjAYDKKrO8Dyzu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126080'),
