  ('617572215888428746', 'Hooperman', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Steven Bochco, Terry Louise Fisher', null, 'John Ritter, Barbara Bosson, Felton Perry, Sydney Walsh, Clarence Felder, Alix Elias, Joseph Gian, Debrah Farentino', null, 'A full-time police detective becomes a part-time landlord when he inherits his murdered landlady''s building — along with her ferocious little dog.', 'A full-time police detective becomes a part-time landlord when he inherits his murdered landlady''s building — along with her ferocious little dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koZX2kubM1GpjOVmo6mWuwuqQhE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9846'),
  ('862384617823304203', 'Hoops', 2020, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Ben Hoffman', null, 'Jake Johnson, Rob Riggle, Natasha Leggero, Cleo King, Ron Funches, A.D. Miles, Gil Ozeri, Sam Richardson', null, 'A foul-mouthed high school basketball coach is sure he''ll hit the big leagues if he can only turn his terrible team around. Good luck with that.', 'A foul-mouthed high school basketball coach is sure he''ll hit the big leagues if he can only turn his terrible team around. Good luck with that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3umUQ5DcZe7mSZGImCAStl2FRbm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106238'),
  ('493017837266322986', 'Hooten & The Lady', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tony Jordan', null, 'Michael Landes, Ophelia Lovibond, Jessica Hynes, Shaun Parkes, Jonathan Bailey', null, 'Hugely charismatic, roguish American adventurer Hooten and his fantastically feisty partner in crime, Lady Alexandra travel the world, from the Vatican to The Himalayas, the Amazon to Egypt, in their quest to save the world''s lost treasures.', 'Hugely charismatic, roguish American adventurer Hooten and his fantastically feisty partner in crime, Lady Alexandra travel the world, from the Vatican to The Himalayas, the Amazon to Egypt, in their quest to save the world''s lost treasures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfD26Lsst9auQkoHb7GxTzuvuo3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67826'),
  ('248389368229073531', 'Hope & Faith', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Joanna Johnson', null, 'Faith Ford, Kelly Ripa, Ted McGinley, Megan Fox, Macey Cruthird, Paulie Litt', 'TV-PG', 'Hope, a down-to-earth, happily married mother of three has her tidy world turned upside down when her celebrity sister moves in. Faith was living the Hollywood life as a soap opera star before her character was killed off.', 'Hope, a down-to-earth, happily married mother of three has her tidy world turned upside down when her celebrity sister moves in. Faith was living the Hollywood life as a soap opera star before her character was killed off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2ysVqKDuwEDwYtipaiVOE0SZaP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1509'),
  ('1030085153668537320', 'Hope on the Street', 2024, 'Documentary', 'j-hope', null, 'j-hope, Boogaloo Kin', null, 'In 2024, j-hope of BTS begins a new journey in his 12th year, returning to his dancer roots. Accompanied by his former instructor, the popping champion Boogaloo Kin, he explores the streets of Osaka, Seoul, Paris, New York, and Gwangju, meeting inspiring street dancers along the way. Follow j-hope as he pursues a dream connecting his past, present, and future.', 'In 2024, j-hope of BTS begins a new journey in his 12th year, returning to his dancer roots. Accompanied by his former instructor, the popping champion Boogaloo Kin, he explores the streets of Osaka, Seoul, Paris, New York, and Gwangju, meeting inspiring street dancers along the way. Follow j-hope as he pursues a dream connecting his past, present, and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuEgLvnYyKFQYpAQhNuVZN3Fciu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246711'),
  ('545299399780452161', 'Hope or Dope', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Jung Su-yoon', 'Won Ji-an, Yoon Chan-young, Yoon Hyun-soo, Han Se-jin, Yang Seo-hyun, Park Joo-young, Choi Young-do, 차승윤', null, 'A story about an 18-year-old Da Jung who discovered a field of marijuana as a teenager, and her friends who desperately look for their lost, ordinary life. A human drama about growing up, experiencing love and wounds, as Da Jung who was used by her parents to transport drugs, meets Yoon Tak, a rural man and his friends in the countryside.', 'A story about an 18-year-old Da Jung who discovered a field of marijuana as a teenager, and her friends who desperately look for their lost, ordinary life. A human drama about growing up, experiencing love and wounds, as Da Jung who was used by her parents to transport drugs, meets Yoon Tak, a rural man and his friends in the countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Mu0NpVkQlZBuWxKaCe6bG2RQy3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158715'),
  ('912984019241322299', 'Hope Street', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Paul Marquess, Susanne Farrell', null, 'Niamh McGrady, Aaron McCusker, Kerri Quinn', 'TV-PG', 'The arrival of DC Leila Hussain sets tongues wagging – what brings this big city girl to a sleepy Northern Irish seaside town? Warm-hearted detective drama in a stunning setting.', 'The arrival of DC Leila Hussain sets tongues wagging – what brings this big city girl to a sleepy Northern Irish seaside town? Warm-hearted detective drama in a stunning setting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dC8CpDwcj9l9tD8XwQoWHK5cNn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:139492'),
  ('818967773067014072', 'Hope Valley: 1874', 2026, 'Drama', 'Alfonso H. Moreno', 'Elizabeth Stewart', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Benjamin Ayres, Jill Hennessy, Roan Curtis, Lachlan Quarmby', null, 'Back to the earliest days of the community that would one day grow into beloved Hope Valley, exploring faith, courage, and the joy of building a life together from the ground up.', 'Back to the earliest days of the community that would one day grow into beloved Hope Valley, exploring faith, courage, and the joy of building a life together from the ground up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeLjXfVcjfVyMOQueM9ODMnc2On.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:308136'),
  ('822138441782665038', 'Horace and Pete', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Louis C.K., Steve Buscemi, Edie Falco, Steven Wright, Kurt Metzger, Alan Alda, Jessica Lange', null, 'The owners of a dive bar in Brooklyn, Horace and Pete, along with bar regulars share their experiences and lives with each other while drinking or working at the bar.', 'The owners of a dive bar in Brooklyn, Horace and Pete, along with bar regulars share their experiences and lives with each other while drinking or working at the bar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMLW6dhKcAzTweIuxl1iL0Ogbda.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65454'),
  ('932388237247274367', 'Hori-san and Miyamura-kun', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', 'HERO', null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Asami Seto, Kana Ueda, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yumiko Kobayashi, Akiko Hasegawa, Hiro Shimono, Kana Asumi', 'TV-14', 'Within everyone there exists a side preferably kept hidden, even from close friends. For the smart and popular Kyouko Hori, it’s the fact that she has to do all the housework and care for her little brother, Souta, because of her parents'' busy work schedules. For the gentle Izumi Miyamura, whom everybody sees as an otaku, it''s his nine hidden piercings and large body tattoo. So what happens when they accidentally discover each other''s hidden sides? Sharing parts of themselves that they couldn''t with anyone else, strong bonds of friendship soon begin to form between Miyamura and Hori, as well as those around them. As their hidden personas start to dissipate, they slowly learn how to open up to others.', 'Within everyone there exists a side preferably kept hidden, even from close friends. For the smart and popular Kyouko Hori, it’s the fact that she has to do all the housework and care for her little brother, Souta, because of her parents'' busy work schedules. For the gentle Izumi Miyamura, whom everybody sees as an otaku, it''s his nine hidden piercings and large body tattoo. So what happens when they accidentally discover each other''s hidden sides? Sharing parts of themselves that they couldn''t with anyone else, strong bonds of friendship soon begin to form between Miyamura and Hori, as well as those around them. As their hidden personas start to dissipate, they slowly learn how to open up to others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTiNcs7Rfu2AzfexlSNl7VTxHiM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71376'),
  ('732447417189229338', 'Horimiya', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Koki Uchiyama, Seiichiro Yamashita, Yurie Kozakai, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Mao Ichimichi, Reina Kondo, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'A secret life is the one thing they have in common. At school, Hori is a prim and perfect social butterfly, but the truth is she''s a brash homebody. Meanwhile, under a gloomy facade, Miyamura hides a gentle heart, along with piercings and tattoos. In a chance meeting, they both reveal a side they''ve never shown. Could this blossom into something new?', 'A secret life is the one thing they have in common. At school, Hori is a prim and perfect social butterfly, but the truth is she''s a brash homebody. Meanwhile, under a gloomy facade, Miyamura hides a gentle heart, along with piercings and tattoos. In a chance meeting, they both reveal a side they''ve never shown. Could this blossom into something new?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSOKGl5KIeOCAtigUDCfFZe2cOi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110070'),
  ('1038004055954089797', 'Horimiya: The Missing Pieces', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Koki Uchiyama, Seiichiro Yamashita, Yurie Kozakai, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Mao Ichimichi, Reina Kondo, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'A new anime project that adapts popular side stories that were left out of the main anime series. As the graduation ceremony at Katagiri High School comes to an end, Kyouko Hori, her boyfriend Izumi Miyamura, and their friends begin to look back on their time as students. The moments they shared together may be fleeting, but each one is a colorful piece of their precious memories.', 'A new anime project that adapts popular side stories that were left out of the main anime series. As the graduation ceremony at Katagiri High School comes to an end, Kyouko Hori, her boyfriend Izumi Miyamura, and their friends begin to look back on their time as students. The moments they shared together may be fleeting, but each one is a colorful piece of their precious memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEJVHbXaC94y6thJ3nA6lBBnHjs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228663'),
