  ('482890502176275888', 'Hormones', 2013, 'Drama', 'Songyos Sugmakanan', null, 'Thiti Mahayotaruk, Nichaphat Chatchaipholrat, Narikun Ketprapakorn, Sananthachat Thanapatpisal, Teeradon Supapunpinyo, Kanyawee Songmuang, Kemisara Paladesh, Tonhon Tantivejakul', 'TV-MA', 'High school students in Bangkok wrestle with issues such as sex, teen pregnancy, drugs, school violence, family turmoil and more in this Thai drama.', 'High school students in Bangkok wrestle with issues such as sex, teen pregnancy, drugs, school violence, family turmoil and more in this Thai drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xOSxPDjUNCIejkgnZYPqldlsIM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:53128'),
  ('877883210762537646', 'Hornblower', 1998, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', 'C. S. Forester', null, 'Ioan Gruffudd, Paul McGann, Robert Lindsay, Paul Copley, Sean Gilder, Julia Sawalha', null, 'Set during the 18th century Napoleonic Wars, Horatio Hornblower, a young and shy midshipman, rises through the ranks to become an admiral.', 'Set during the 18th century Napoleonic Wars, Horatio Hornblower, a young and shy midshipman, rises through the ranks to become an admiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wF4O8zmo2O0B6dQpzTDYruKOpcA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:814'),
  ('586128808549659028', 'Horny', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Irina Denezhkina, Semyon Slepakov', 'Irina Denezhkina, Semyon Slepakov', 'Mariya Shalaeva, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Olga Dibtseva, Nikolay Shrayber, Ivan Shmakov, Sergey Burunov, Maksim Leonidov, Konstantin Zheldin', null, 'Realizing that something needs to change in life, a simple girl Sasha Gvozdikova leaves Yekaterinburg for Moscow, abandoning a boring job and a married lover. She writes short stories and dreams of getting them published, but overestimates her writing talent. Together with Sasha, two of her best friends from Yekaterinburg, Katya and Alyona, live in Moscow. The plot of the story revolves around three heroines who are trying to find themselves in metropolitan life and in relationships.', 'Realizing that something needs to change in life, a simple girl Sasha Gvozdikova leaves Yekaterinburg for Moscow, abandoning a boring job and a married lover. She writes short stories and dreams of getting them published, but overestimates her writing talent. Together with Sasha, two of her best friends from Yekaterinburg, Katya and Alyona, live in Moscow. The plot of the story revolves around three heroines who are trying to find themselves in metropolitan life and in relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aS2WIs4TqzT8ZKFwJROnJPUSJfW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156897'),
  ('247534454054096595', 'Horrible Histories', 2009, 'Family, Comedy', 'Terry Deary', 'Susie Donkin', null, 'TV-PG', 'Based on the best-selling children''s books and liberally splattered with guts, blood and poo, a group of British comedians offer an anarchic and unconventional take on some of history''s most gruesome and funny moments, with topics including the Stone Age, the Middle Ages, the Egyptians and the Romans, among others.', 'Based on the best-selling children''s books and liberally splattered with guts, blood and poo, a group of British comedians offer an anarchic and unconventional take on some of history''s most gruesome and funny moments, with topics including the Stone Age, the Middle Ages, the Egyptians and the Romans, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwj7zkWHtveXUaB9cwrQIMvmgeQ.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:32419'),
  ('582631994222302615', 'Horrid Henry', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Francesca Simon', 'Olly Smith, Katherine Sandford, Joe Williams', 'Lizzie Waterworth, Tamsin Heatley, Wayne Forester, Emma Tate, Aidan Cook', 'TV-Y', 'Life is not fair! Horrid Henry feels that the rest of the world is against him and he wages a constant war against the adults. Like any headstrong young boy, he is determined, relentless, he doesn''t hold back and he never admits defeat! He will stop at nothing to outwit the enemy and teachers, relatives and babysitters avoid him at all costs.', 'Life is not fair! Horrid Henry feels that the rest of the world is against him and he wages a constant war against the adults. Like any headstrong young boy, he is determined, relentless, he doesn''t hold back and he never admits defeat! He will stop at nothing to outwit the enemy and teachers, relatives and babysitters avoid him at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZBlUaLeJaE66BTttAlox3fTU4u.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:43183'),
  ('979211448261982915', 'Horror at the Cecil Hotel', 2017, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Leland Krane', null, 'William V. Ryder, William Jousset, Josh Dean, Hadley Meares, Joan Renner, Frank C. Girardot, Gregg McCrary, Gil Carrillo', 'TV-14', 'Not long after the Cecil Hotel in Los Angeles opened in 1924, a guest committed suicide in one of its rooms, beginning a decades-long string of murders, suicides or otherwise unexplained...', 'Not long after the Cecil Hotel in Los Angeles opened in 1924, a guest committed suicide in one of its rooms, beginning a decades-long string of murders, suicides or otherwise unexplained...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8svN4ZwRn5LRz2cDAPEFoJy1Zq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83131'),
  ('659706603093239815', 'Horseland', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Andy Heyward', null, 'Dana Donlan, David Kalis, Emily Hernandez, Jerry Longe', 'TV-Y7', 'Horseland is an American animated series produced by DIC Entertainment. It is a comic mischief program following events in the lives of a group of children riding at Horseland, an equestrian school and stables. Their adventures include riding, and raising and entering their horses in competitions. The show premiered on September 16, 2006 as part of CBS''s new Saturday morning cartoon block, KOL Secret Slumber Party on CBS. Concurrent with the series, the online virtual pet game that it was based upon was updated to complement the show by launching a new "Junior version" of the game based on the program and featuring its various characters and locations. After three seasons, the show''s original run ended on CBS on September 19, 2009.', 'Horseland is an American animated series produced by DIC Entertainment. It is a comic mischief program following events in the lives of a group of children riding at Horseland, an equestrian school and stables. Their adventures include riding, and raising and entering their horses in competitions. The show premiered on September 16, 2006 as part of CBS''s new Saturday morning cartoon block, KOL Secret Slumber Party on CBS. Concurrent with the series, the online virtual pet game that it was based upon was updated to complement the show by launching a new "Junior version" of the game based on the program and featuring its various characters and locations. After three seasons, the show''s original run ended on CBS on September 19, 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN6bWeZ7Ft7W5XQkDIKMmbA439v.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3656'),
  ('1032531345378551095', 'Hortensia SAGA', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Aya Uchida, Yuuichirou Umehara, Reina Ueda, Yui Horie, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yu Kobayashi, Yuka Otsubo', 'TV-14', 'Despite the constant threat of invasion by neighboring countries who covet Hortensia’s fertile lands, Hortensia has long managed to avoid the maelstrom of war thanks to its two main territories, the principalities of Olivier and Camelia, serving as its sword and shield. But on December 5, 767, Camelia suddenly rises in revolt against Hortensia...', 'Despite the constant threat of invasion by neighboring countries who covet Hortensia’s fertile lands, Hortensia has long managed to avoid the maelstrom of war thanks to its two main territories, the principalities of Olivier and Camelia, serving as its sword and shield. But on December 5, 767, Camelia suddenly rises in revolt against Hortensia...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gv33UfXRp0JjAKU0JbCPCqSVkAL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104852'),
  ('167493315988627435', 'Hoshi Shinichi no Fushigina Fushigina Tanpen Dorama', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Kiko Mizuhara, Kanji Furutachi, Amane Okayama, Hairi Katagiri, Tetta Sugimoto, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Tōru Shinagawa, Kisuke Iida', null, 'Hoshi Shinichi is the "God of Short Stories" who published more than 1001 short stories during his lifetime, some of which are included in textbooks and continue to be read today. His stories often feature mystery, science fiction, or fantasy elements. A sometimes "humorous" and sometimes "cynic" look at society and mankind. Always short, but always surprising and unpredictable. Is it a poisonous allegory or a wake-up call? See some of his greatest gems come to life in this 2022 live-action adaptation', 'Hoshi Shinichi is the "God of Short Stories" who published more than 1001 short stories during his lifetime, some of which are included in textbooks and continue to be read today. His stories often feature mystery, science fiction, or fantasy elements. A sometimes "humorous" and sometimes "cynic" look at society and mankind. Always short, but always surprising and unpredictable. Is it a poisonous allegory or a wake-up call? See some of his greatest gems come to life in this 2022 live-action adaptation', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A73MDYNZN4sJWRzkunJfpABbMba.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158056'),
  ('15303818613218507', 'Hospital Central', 2000, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jordi Rebellón, Antonio Zabálburu, Mar Regueras, Nani Jiménez, Begoña Maestre, Pablo Carbonell, Bárbara Muñoz, Mónica Estarreado', null, 'Follows the professional and personal lives of the staff of the fictitious Hospital Central in Madrid.', 'Follows the professional and personal lives of the staff of the fictitious Hospital Central in Madrid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au5aHdFzXUXCMWLeGIKXEyKunrM.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:12288'),
  ('710751267659761094', 'Hospital Playlist', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Woo-jung, Shin Won-ho', null, 'Cho Jung-seok, Yoo Yeon-seok, Jung Kyung-ho, Kim Dae-myung, Jeon Mi-do, Shin Hyun-been, Ahn Eun-jin, Kwak Sun-young', 'TV-14', 'Every day is extraordinary for five doctors and their patients inside a hospital, where birth, death and everything in between coexist.', 'Every day is extraordinary for five doctors and their patients inside a hospital, where birth, death and everything in between coexist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MSjQkH2FrG0t4l84L5HmiSFrS7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96102'),
  ('770984298184291026', 'Hospital Ship', 2017, 'Drama', 'Yoon Sun Joo', 'Yoon Sun Joo', 'Ha Ji-won, Kang Min-hyuk, Kim Kwang-kyu, Jung Kyung-soon, Kwon Min-a, Lee Han-wi, Kim In-sik, Jang Seo-won', null, 'A story of young doctors, who provide medical care to remote island residents via a hospital ship.', 'A story of young doctors, who provide medical care to remote island residents via a hospital ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnUbaSeyXZErslzKsoyFRze2Xvs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73257'),
  ('1075758444090690570', 'Hostage', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Matt Charman', null, 'Suranne Jones, Julie Delpy, Corey Mylchreest, Ashley Thomas, Martin McCann, Isobel Akuwudike, Hiftu Quasem, Sophie Robertson', 'TV-MA', 'When the British prime minister''s husband is kidnapped and the French president starts receiving threats, both leaders must face an impossible choice.', 'When the British prime minister''s husband is kidnapped and the French president starts receiving threats, both leaders must face an impossible choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghcxxmSLByYyFLAL8TNWmAel1Ym.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248937'),
  ('150306731259507081', 'Hostages', 2013, 'Drama', 'Alon Aranya, Omri Givon, Rotem Shamir', null, 'Toni Collette, Dylan McDermott, Tate Donovan, Quinn Shephard, Mateus Ward, Billy Brown, Sandrine Holt, Tyler Elliot Burke', 'TV-14', 'A high-octane suspense drama that centers on Dr. Ellen Sanders, a premier surgeon thrust into a chilling political conspiracy when she and her family are held captive in their home by rogue FBI Agent Duncan Carlisle, a desperate man doing the wrong thing for the right reasons, who orders Dr. Sanders to assassinate the President when she operates on him.', 'A high-octane suspense drama that centers on Dr. Ellen Sanders, a premier surgeon thrust into a chilling political conspiracy when she and her family are held captive in their home by rogue FBI Agent Duncan Carlisle, a desperate man doing the wrong thing for the right reasons, who orders Dr. Sanders to assassinate the President when she operates on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEhRPLvj7LrLWindkC92laYTUTj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55083'),
