  ('324352103639876873', 'Hotel Transylvania: The Series', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Mark Steinberg', null, 'Bryn McAuley, Evany Rosen', 'TV-Y7', 'Mavis navigates life without her dad, Dracula, around and discovers one of the few common human and monster truths: being a teenager bites.', 'Mavis navigates life without her dad, Dracula, around and discovers one of the few common human and monster truths: being a teenager bites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdPDFNqO7NWUtZIt66nMOmji7hg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72442'),
