  ('1048716822627562711', 'How To Build a Sex Room', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Melanie Rose', 'TV-MA', 'Couples looking for more spice in the bedroom hire luxury interior designer Melanie Rose to create stylish spaces where they can carry out any fantasy they wish.', 'Couples looking for more spice in the bedroom hire luxury interior designer Melanie Rose to create stylish spaces where they can carry out any fantasy they wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMUdxFWsBFyHeoF5zBOwv1bUltB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204777'),
  ('982388761523788827', 'How to Change Your Mind', 2022, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Michael Pollan', 'Alex Gibney', 'Michael Pollan', 'TV-MA', 'Author Michael Pollan leads the way in this docuseries exploring the history and uses of psychedelics, including LSD, psilocybin, MDMA and mescaline.', 'Author Michael Pollan leads the way in this docuseries exploring the history and uses of psychedelics, including LSD, psilocybin, MDMA and mescaline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rxVzVimaxhzyHGSd96ijKX7Twu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204304'),
  ('828939347616816081', 'How to Create a Sex Scandal', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'In 2005, the sleepy community of Mineola, Texas, is thrown into turmoil when local children reveal shocking stories about a pedophile sex ring that took place at a local swingers club. As arrests are made, life sentences handed down, and lives ruined, it soon becomes apparent that there is a lot more to the story than meets the eye. Now, the startling long-term repercussions of the scandal are revealed.', 'In 2005, the sleepy community of Mineola, Texas, is thrown into turmoil when local children reveal shocking stories about a pedophile sex ring that took place at a local swingers club. As arrests are made, life sentences handed down, and lives ruined, it soon becomes apparent that there is a lot more to the story than meets the eye. Now, the startling long-term repercussions of the scandal are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocT6vwIwFrj3C8wFLtT0hRL58pS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226403'),
  ('635589293944057523', 'How to Die Alone', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Natasha Rothwell', null, 'Natasha Rothwell, Conrad Ricamora, Jocko Sims, KeiLyn Durrel Jones', 'TV-MA', 'Mel is a broke, fat, Black JFK airport employee who''s never been in love and forgotten how to dream, until an accidental brush with death catapults her on a journey to finally take flight and start living by any means necessary.', 'Mel is a broke, fat, Black JFK airport employee who''s never been in love and forgotten how to dream, until an accidental brush with death catapults her on a journey to finally take flight and start living by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/161kiFeNwUQVPyXOzBDrlnphKM0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258582'),
  ('605797380138563893', 'How to Fix a Drug Scandal', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Luke Ryan, Shannon O''Neill, Scott Allen, Shawn Musgrave, Paul Solotaroff, Karl Kenzler, Jared Olanoff, Annie Dookhan', 'TV-MA', 'The four-part docuseries revolves around Amherst, Massachusetts, drug lab chemist Sonja Farak who became addicted to the narcotics she was supposed to be testing. In covering her tracks, Farak falsified thousands of results and opened the door to overturning hundreds of wrongful convictions.', 'The four-part docuseries revolves around Amherst, Massachusetts, drug lab chemist Sonja Farak who became addicted to the narcotics she was supposed to be testing. In covering her tracks, Farak falsified thousands of results and opened the door to overturning hundreds of wrongful convictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwpEiOoQBFLMZlNBLCOoejwbcW3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100407'),
  ('971059323137607991', 'How to Get Away with Murder', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Peter Nowalk', null, 'Viola Davis, Billy Brown, Jack Falahee, Rome Flynn, Aja Naomi King, Matt McGorry, Conrad Ricamora, Amirah Vann', 'TV-14', 'A sexy, suspense-driven legal thriller about a group of ambitious law students and their brilliant, mysterious criminal defense professor. They become entangled in a murder plot and will shake the entire university and change the course of their lives.', 'A sexy, suspense-driven legal thriller about a group of ambitious law students and their brilliant, mysterious criminal defense professor. They become entangled in a murder plot and will shake the entire university and change the course of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJs8Y6T88NcgksxA8UaVl4YX8p8.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61056'),
  ('281266410616772470', 'How to Get Rich', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ramit Sethi', 'TV-14', 'Money holds power over us — but it doesn''t have to. Finance expert Ramit Sethi works with people across the US to help them achieve their richest lives.', 'Money holds power over us — but it doesn''t have to. Finance expert Ramit Sethi works with people across the US to help them achieve their richest lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toThjfZ0mgZfQDz7NROBDHaRD7v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222839'),
  ('177935064691112506', 'How to Get to Heaven from Belfast', 2026, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Lisa McGee', null, 'Roisin Gallagher, Sinéad Keenan, Caoilfhionn Dunne, Darragh Hand', 'TV-MA', 'Three lifelong pals embark on a chaotic quest to solve the mystery of their old friend''s suspicious death and keep their own dark secret under wraps.', 'Three lifelong pals embark on a chaotic quest to solve the mystery of their old friend''s suspicious death and keep their own dark secret under wraps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lFI03QZgXwGZLKtzUw4L8ZnyBv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233079'),
  ('463828395955214546', 'How to Grow a Planet', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Iain Stewart', null, 'Geologist Iain Stewart explain in three stages of natural history the crucial interaction of our very planet''s physiology and its unique wildlife. Biological evolution is largely driven bu adaptation to conditions such as climate, soil and irrigation, but biotopes were also shaped by wildlife changing earth''s surface and climate significantly, even disregarding human activity.', 'Geologist Iain Stewart explain in three stages of natural history the crucial interaction of our very planet''s physiology and its unique wildlife. Biological evolution is largely driven bu adaptation to conditions such as climate, soil and irrigation, but biotopes were also shaped by wildlife changing earth''s surface and climate significantly, even disregarding human activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDOx0aq5kNfrtUjWIgPFuqKKfjk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59515'),
  ('1101812781308412306', 'How to Hate You', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yoo SoWon, Oh KwanJin, Jung SooHyun', 'jeong soo hyun', 'Kim Ji-in, Lee Jong-won, Kim Yoo-jin, Jaemin', null, 'How to Hate You is about the dating adventures of Oh Mi Ri, a college freshman who finds herself struggling to navigate love and friendship on campus.', 'How to Hate You is about the dating adventures of Oh Mi Ri, a college freshman who finds herself struggling to navigate love and friendship on campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2iB5s4q4fkw5PPYhCgGOwyfnnP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88400'),
  ('820575378052641070', 'How to Keep a Mummy', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Ai Kayano, Keisuke Komoto, Himika Akaneya, Seiichiro Yamashita', 'TV-14', 'When high school student Sora Kashiwagi finds himself staring down a mysterious oversized package sent to him by his self-proclaimed "adventurer" father, the last thing he expects is for it to be opened from the inside... by a little mummy so small it can fit in the palm of his hand!', 'When high school student Sora Kashiwagi finds himself staring down a mysterious oversized package sent to him by his self-proclaimed "adventurer" father, the last thing he expects is for it to be opened from the inside... by a little mummy so small it can fit in the palm of his hand!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h3CIQcCKKxVGvfp2FC4YXp0Hjl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76132'),
  ('874080671333504269', 'How to Live With Your Parents (For the Rest of Your Life)', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Claudia Lonow', null, 'Sarah Chalke, Elizabeth Perkins, Jon Dore, Rachel Eggleston, Stephanie Hunt, Brad Garrett', 'TV-PG', 'Polly is a single mom who has recently divorced. The transition hasn''t been easy for her, especially in this economy. So, like a lot of young people living in this new reality, she and her daughter, Natalie, have moved back home with her eccentric parents, Elaine and Max.', 'Polly is a single mom who has recently divorced. The transition hasn''t been easy for her, especially in this economy. So, like a lot of young people living in this new reality, she and her daughter, Natalie, have moved back home with her eccentric parents, Elaine and Max.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NvzmUDJ7UUB9OANzv7xZ19cPxH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44432'),
  ('407437455960226969', 'How to Make It in America', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ian Edelman', 'Jesse Wigutow', 'Bryan Greenberg, Victor Rasuk, Lake Bell, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Kid Cudi, Luis Guzmán, Edgar Garcia, Nick Chinlund', 'TV-MA', 'Trying to make a name for themselves in New York''s competitive fashion scene, Ben Epstein and his friend and business partner Cam Calderon use their street knowledge and connections to bring their ambitions to fruition. With the help of Cam''s cousin Rene, who is trying to market his own high-energy drink, and their well-connected friend Domingo, the burgeoning entrepreneurs set out to make it big, encountering obstacles along the way that will require all their ingenuity to overcome.', 'Trying to make a name for themselves in New York''s competitive fashion scene, Ben Epstein and his friend and business partner Cam Calderon use their street knowledge and connections to bring their ambitions to fruition. With the help of Cam''s cousin Rene, who is trying to market his own high-energy drink, and their well-connected friend Domingo, the burgeoning entrepreneurs set out to make it big, encountering obstacles along the way that will require all their ingenuity to overcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSKGT90ScJbHsL6FvMn7Aiov6tS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32023'),
  ('184776540779841048', 'How to Rock', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jim O''Doherty', null, 'Samantha Boscarino, Max Schneider, Halston Sage, Cymphonique Miller, Lulu Antariksa, Noah Crawford, Christopher O''Neal', 'TV-G', 'How to Rock is an American teen sitcom that ran on Nickelodeon from February 4 to December 8, 2012. It stars Cymphonique Miller as Kacey Simon. The series is based on the 2011 book, How to Rock Braces and Glasses by Meg Haston published by Little, Brown Books For Young Readers and Alloy Entertainment. The series was officially green-lit on May 23, 2011 with a 20-episode production order, later increased to 26. Two of the ordered episodes were merged into a special episode so 25 episodes actually aired. The series began filming in August 2011. It is the first television sitcom to be produced by Alloy Entertainment. The first promo aired with Merry Christmas, Drake & Josh on December 10, 2011. It was confirmed by the series showrunner David M. Israel on August 26, 2012 that How to Rock would not be returning for a second season.', 'How to Rock is an American teen sitcom that ran on Nickelodeon from February 4 to December 8, 2012. It stars Cymphonique Miller as Kacey Simon. The series is based on the 2011 book, How to Rock Braces and Glasses by Meg Haston published by Little, Brown Books For Young Readers and Alloy Entertainment. The series was officially green-lit on May 23, 2011 with a 20-episode production order, later increased to 26. Two of the ordered episodes were merged into a special episode so 25 episodes actually aired. The series began filming in August 2011. It is the first television sitcom to be produced by Alloy Entertainment. The first promo aired with Merry Christmas, Drake & Josh on December 10, 2011. It was confirmed by the series showrunner David M. Israel on August 26, 2012 that How to Rock would not be returning for a second season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKg9vvxkQu3ViSkDXlE4zjYC6fX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39034'),
  ('1057618361771312743', 'How to Ruin Christmas', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katleho Ramaphakela, Rethabile Ramaphakela', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Prodigal daughter Tumi tries to make things right after completely ruining what should have been her sister''s picture-perfect Christmas wedding.', 'Prodigal daughter Tumi tries to make things right after completely ruining what should have been her sister''s picture-perfect Christmas wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shXZvITyeSbiH55UaUyp3ZMCBNp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:114649'),
  ('645378529853140740', 'How to Screw It All Up', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jaime Olías, Pablo Sanhermelando', null, 'Naira Lleó, Malva Vela, Nadia Al Saidi, Óscar Ortuño, Gabriel Guevara, Sergi Méndez', 'TV-MA', 'After her school’s year-end trip is canceled, Alba discovers that some of her classmates are secretly planning an epic road trip – and does everything she can to land an invite.', 'After her school’s year-end trip is canceled, Alba discovers that some of her classmates are secretly planning an epic road trip – and does everything she can to land an invite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haLytkfNteZO9k925IL7EMBbvcW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202246'),
  ('157865011717112329', 'How to Sell Drugs Online (Fast)', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Matthias Murmann, Philipp Kässbohrer', 'Stefan Titze, Sebastian Colley', 'Maximilian Mundt, Danilo Kamperidis, Lena Klenke, Damian Hardung, Leonie Wesselow, Roland Riebeling, Jolina Amely Trinks, Leonidas Emre Pakkan', 'TV-MA', 'To win back his ex-girlfriend, a nerdy teen starts selling ecstasy online out of his bedroom -- and becomes one of Europe''s biggest dealers.', 'To win back his ex-girlfriend, a nerdy teen starts selling ecstasy online out of his bedroom -- and becomes one of Europe''s biggest dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xg7U76h1DNtwa0eBOIbFdiM80DR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:88236'),
  ('837400355688351040', 'How to Survive Being Single', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sebastián Zurita, Emiliano Zurita', null, 'Sebastián Zurita, Tato Alexander, Pamela Almanza, Lucía Gómez-Robledo, Octavio Hinojosa Martínez, Juanita Arias, Roberto Flores', 'TV-MA', 'Sebastián, an actor known for just one role he played years ago, is about to get engaged, but life has other plans for him. Just when his life seemed to be all mapped out, he is thrown back in the fold with his long time friends who are bad at relationships. All of the sudden, he goes back to the life he left almost 10 years ago: being single.', 'Sebastián, an actor known for just one role he played years ago, is about to get engaged, but life has other plans for him. Just when his life seemed to be all mapped out, he is thrown back in the fold with his long time friends who are bad at relationships. All of the sudden, he goes back to the life he left almost 10 years ago: being single.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98g6g0hWlVeQNhO1Q5NARDP1aXy.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:103787'),
  ('941118761484508578', 'How To with John Wilson', 2020, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'John Wilson', 'Alice Gregory', 'John Wilson', 'TV-MA', 'In a uniquely hilarious odyssey of self-discovery and cultural observation, documentary filmmaker and self-described "anxious New Yorker" John Wilson covertly and obsessively films the lives of his fellow New Yorkers while attempting to give everyday advice on relatable topics. The awkward contradictions of modern life are eased by Wilson’s candid, unpolished commentary. Building upon Wilson’s previously released "how to" short films, each episode takes wildly unexpected turns but is grounded in John''s refreshing honesty.', 'In a uniquely hilarious odyssey of self-discovery and cultural observation, documentary filmmaker and self-described "anxious New Yorker" John Wilson covertly and obsessively films the lives of his fellow New Yorkers while attempting to give everyday advice on relatable topics. The awkward contradictions of modern life are eased by Wilson’s candid, unpolished commentary. Building upon Wilson’s previously released "how to" short films, each episode takes wildly unexpected turns but is grounded in John''s refreshing honesty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpHziYpJniprEFDFwMbOHabgnow.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:110971'),
  ('579164171337827839', 'How TV Ruined Your Life', 2011, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Charlie Brooker', null, 'Charlie Brooker', null, 'How TV Ruined Your Life is a six-episode BBC Two television series written and presented by Charlie Brooker. Charlie Brooker, whose earlier TV-related programmes include How to Watch Television, Charlie Brooker''s Screenwipe and You Have Been Watching, examines how the medium has bent reality to fit its own ends. Produced by Zeppotron, the series aired its first episode in January 2011.', 'How TV Ruined Your Life is a six-episode BBC Two television series written and presented by Charlie Brooker. Charlie Brooker, whose earlier TV-related programmes include How to Watch Television, Charlie Brooker''s Screenwipe and You Have Been Watching, examines how the medium has bent reality to fit its own ends. Produced by Zeppotron, the series aired its first episode in January 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Jf1O7Hna6nPjBpfu1biqpMsDjI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35383'),
  ('474865121314948469', 'How We Got to Now', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Steven Johnson', null, 'Steven Johnson', null, 'How We Got To Now with Steven Johnson is a six part documentary series that reveals the story behind the remarkable ideas that made modern life possible; the unsung heroes that brought them into the world – and the unexpected and bizarre consequences each of these innovations has triggered.', 'How We Got To Now with Steven Johnson is a six part documentary series that reveals the story behind the remarkable ideas that made modern life possible; the unsung heroes that brought them into the world – and the unexpected and bizarre consequences each of these innovations has triggered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQbNTCYyG0IzQ0sQ6A0exczvP7k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61896'),
  ('71162088334725187', 'How We Roll', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Pete Holmes, Katie Lowes, Chi McBride, Julie White, Mason Wells', null, 'Stoic Midwest husband and dad, Tom gets laid off from a car assembly line and makes the extraordinary decision to provide for his family by following his dream of becoming a professional bowler. Tom begins his new career with the loving okay from his wife, Jen the unfaltering support of Archie, his mentor and the proud owner of Archie’s Lanes: Home of the Curly Fry, the cautious backing of his protective mom, Helen, and the encouragement of his son, Sam.', 'Stoic Midwest husband and dad, Tom gets laid off from a car assembly line and makes the extraordinary decision to provide for his family by following his dream of becoming a professional bowler. Tom begins his new career with the loving okay from his wife, Jen the unfaltering support of Archie, his mentor and the proud owner of Archie’s Lanes: Home of the Curly Fry, the cautious backing of his protective mom, Helen, and the encouragement of his son, Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fNRPoSx2iaN9CGBfDUJcmzuOUa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156915'),
  ('465383506721191408', 'Howards End', 2017, 'Drama', 'Hettie Macdonald', null, 'Hayley Atwell, Matthew Macfadyen, Julia Ormond, Tracey Ullman, Philippa Coulthard, Joseph Quinn, Alex Lawther, Sandra Voe', 'TV-14', 'The social and class divisions in early 20th century England through the intersection of three families - the wealthy Wilcoxes, the gentle and idealistic Schlegels and the lower-middle class Basts.', 'The social and class divisions in early 20th century England through the intersection of three families - the wealthy Wilcoxes, the gentle and idealistic Schlegels and the lower-middle class Basts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixhPFHnwuYZT0D9UPcE9tyZ8uNU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74630'),
  ('676532656930390729', 'Howards'' Way', 1985, 'Drama, Soap', 'Allan Prior, Gerard Glaister', null, 'Kate O''Mara, Jan Harvey, Glyn Owen, Stephen Yardley, Lana Morris, Susan Gilmore, Edward Highmore, Robert Vahey', null, 'The BBC''s answer to Dynasty, Howards'' Way was launched in 1985 with an enormous 1 million pound budget. The main characters in the show were ''best boat designer in the world'' Tom Howard, his boutique running wife Jan Howard, ''I''ll have a drink'' Jack Rolfe and a nasty man called Ken Masters. It starred Maurice Colbourne.', 'The BBC''s answer to Dynasty, Howards'' Way was launched in 1985 with an enormous 1 million pound budget. The main characters in the show were ''best boat designer in the world'' Tom Howard, his boutique running wife Jan Howard, ''I''ll have a drink'' Jack Rolfe and a nasty man called Ken Masters. It starred Maurice Colbourne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDJafkG0EvfYXtxQJlws4BcD7OB.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1492'),
  ('457288753381279590', 'Hozuki''s Coolheadedness', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Noriaki Sugiyama, Ayaka Suwa, Touko Aoyama, Satomi Sato, Yui Ogura, Hiroki Yasumoto, Atsumi Tanezaki', 'TV-14', 'Hōzuki is the aide to the great king of Hell, King Enma. Calm and super-sadistic, Hōzuki tries to resolve the various problems in Hell, including a rampaging Momotarō and his companions. However, he also likes spending his free time on his hobbies, such as fawning over cute animals and raising "Goldfish Flowers."', 'Hōzuki is the aide to the great king of Hell, King Enma. Calm and super-sadistic, Hōzuki tries to resolve the various problems in Hell, including a rampaging Momotarō and his companions. However, he also likes spending his free time on his hobbies, such as fawning over cute animals and raising "Goldfish Flowers."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1lI5HInStAwD43elO3LubKoHdc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61529'),
