  ('946767790872400620', 'Hunted', 2017, 'Reality, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Michael Rosenbaum, Chad Light, Andy Stumpf, Steve Masterson, Zaira Pirzada, Ryan Phillips, Charles DeBarber, Aki Peritz', 'TV-PG', '16 people attempt the nearly impossible task of living off the grid, as investigators combine state-of-the-art tracking methods with traditional tactics in the world''s most elaborate game of hide & go seek.', '16 people attempt the nearly impossible task of living off the grid, as investigators combine state-of-the-art tracking methods with traditional tactics in the world''s most elaborate game of hide & go seek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CmOZ2wPh5bcVqDYWsyfUeRDlLX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69828'),
  ('1150689908362124270', 'Hunter', 1984, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Frank Lupo', null, 'Fred Dryer, Stepfanie Kramer, Charles Hallahan, Darlanne Fluegel', 'TV-14', 'Hunter is an American police drama television series created by Frank Lupo, and starring Fred Dryer as Sgt. Rick Hunter and Stepfanie Kramer as Sgt. Dee Dee McCall, which ran on NBC from 1984 to 1991. However, Kramer left after the sixth season to pursue other acting and musical opportunities. In the seventh season, Hunter partnered with two different women officers. The titular character, Sgt. Rick Hunter, was a wily, physically imposing, and often rule-breaking homicide detective with the Los Angeles Police Department. The show''s main characters, Hunter and McCall, resolve many of their cases by shooting dead the perpetrators. The show''s executive producer during the first season was Stephen J. Cannell, whose company produced the series.', 'Hunter is an American police drama television series created by Frank Lupo, and starring Fred Dryer as Sgt. Rick Hunter and Stepfanie Kramer as Sgt. Dee Dee McCall, which ran on NBC from 1984 to 1991. However, Kramer left after the sixth season to pursue other acting and musical opportunities. In the seventh season, Hunter partnered with two different women officers. The titular character, Sgt. Rick Hunter, was a wily, physically imposing, and often rule-breaking homicide detective with the Los Angeles Police Department. The show''s main characters, Hunter and McCall, resolve many of their cases by shooting dead the perpetrators. The show''s executive producer during the first season was Stephen J. Cannell, whose company produced the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEBo13onK8U45qnIC0Xh8TnxMtv.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4571'),
  ('34497594552291267', 'Hunter Street', 2017, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Mystery', 'Reint Scholvinck, Melle Runderkamp', null, 'Kyra Isako Smith, Eliyha Altena, Kate Bensdorp, Thomas Jansen, Sarah Nauta, Wilson Mbomio', 'TV-G', 'Sleuthy foster siblings Max, Tess, Sal, Anika, and Daniel Hunter find new quests, more mysteries, and even new Hunter sibs!', 'Sleuthy foster siblings Max, Tess, Sal, Anika, and Daniel Hunter find new quests, more mysteries, and even new Hunter sibs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rm1g7V1qMbus6rlwKP0aTxywhDH.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71128'),
  ('143576045727659122', 'Hunter with a Scalpel', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Park Ju-hyun, Park Yong-woo, Kang Hoon, Ryu Seung-su, Bin Chan-uk, Ryu Hae-jun, Lee Doo-seok, Choi Kwang-je', null, 'A prominent female forensic investigator suffers from antisocial personality disorder and the process in which the shadow of the father she killed threatens her honor and life.', 'A prominent female forensic investigator suffers from antisocial personality disorder and the process in which the shadow of the father she killed threatens her honor and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgLhGiCIV59FuPYKb6BDFGMsmFx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281967'),
  ('300630590820115399', 'Hunter x Hunter', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Kanako Mitsuhashi, Yuki Kaida, Hozumi Goda, Hiroki Takahashi, Shiori Ohta, Tanuki Sugino, Yoshikazu Nagano', 'TV-14', 'Gon Freecss discovers that the father he had always been told was dead was actually alive the whole time. Ging is a famous Hunter: an individual who has proven themself an elite member of humanity. Gon becomes determined to follow in his father''s footsteps, pass the rigorous Hunter Examination.', 'Gon Freecss discovers that the father he had always been told was dead was actually alive the whole time. Ging is a famous Hunter: an individual who has proven themself an elite member of humanity. Gon becomes determined to follow in his father''s footsteps, pass the rigorous Hunter Examination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eobAuhCJA8oRp814V67WhezVXtQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45952'),
  ('738614247056422837', 'Hunter x Hunter', 2011, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Megumi Han, Mariya Ise, Issei Futamata, Miyuki Sawashiro, Keiji Fujiwara', 'TV-14', 'Gon, a young boy who lives on Whale Island, dreams of becoming a Hunter like his father, who left when Gon was still young.', 'Gon, a young boy who lives on Whale Island, dreams of becoming a Hunter like his father, who left when Gon was still young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2EEr2uBvRlAwJ8d8zTG2Y19mIa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46298'),
  ('292752846618167552', 'Hunters', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Natalie Chaidez', null, 'Nathan Phillips, Julian McMahon, Britne Oldford, Mark Coles Smith, Lewis Fitz-Gerald, Laura Gordon, Shannon Berry, Gareth Davies', 'TV-14', 'The disappearance of a decorated FBI agent''s wife leads him to a secret government unit assembled to hunt a group of ruthless terrorists - shadowy figures that may or may not be from this world.', 'The disappearance of a decorated FBI agent''s wife leads him to a secret government unit assembled to hunt a group of ruthless terrorists - shadowy figures that may or may not be from this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EUETA5wONEgYsoSUgpu19So00K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65551'),
  ('706695298948623352', 'Hunters', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Weil', null, 'Logan Lerman, Al Pacino, Lena Olin, Jerrika Hinton, Josh Radnor, Kate Mulvany, Louis Ozawa, Tiffany Boone', 'TV-MA', 'A diverse band of Nazi Hunters living in 1977 New York City discover that hundreds of high ranking Nazi officials are living among us and conspiring to create a Fourth Reich in the U.S. The eclectic team of Hunters set out on a bloody quest to bring the Nazis to justice and thwart their new genocidal plans.', 'A diverse band of Nazi Hunters living in 1977 New York City discover that hundreds of high ranking Nazi officials are living among us and conspiring to create a Fourth Reich in the U.S. The eclectic team of Hunters set out on a bloody quest to bring the Nazis to justice and thwart their new genocidal plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjsz10d1abJXZwT9b8CTgniRJh9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79622'),
  ('1137711066692670943', 'Huntik: Secrets & Seekers', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Iginio Straffi', null, 'Alessio Nissolino, Perla Liberatori, Patrizio Prata, Jolanda Granato, Daniele Demma, Dario Penne, Antonio Guidi, Claudio Moneta', null, 'Huntik: Secrets & Seekers is an Italian/American animated television series, begun in 2009, created and directed by Iginio Straffi. It was a co-production between Big Bocca Productions, a company owned by Richard McWilliam, CEO and owner of Upper Deck and Rainbow S.p.A. It acts like one of the spin-offs to the Winx Club series. All of the show''s designs, animation and visual style were created in Italy, while the scriptwriting and original voice recording were done in the United States. It aired on The CW4Kids at 11:30am Eastern Standard Time on Saturdays. In Europe, the series used to air on Disney XD, and on CITV. In India, the series'' first season aired on Disney XD in 2010. The series premiered on January 3, 2009, with one episode in the US and the first four episodes in Europe, making Jetix the home for premieres beyond the first episode. It was revealed in a magazine with the new season of the Winx Club, that the second season of Huntik would air in fall 2012 in the US. However, the second season began airing in the spring of 2012 in UK on CITV & Australia on channel eleven. The first season was released on DVD by Anime Works in 2010.', 'Huntik: Secrets & Seekers is an Italian/American animated television series, begun in 2009, created and directed by Iginio Straffi. It was a co-production between Big Bocca Productions, a company owned by Richard McWilliam, CEO and owner of Upper Deck and Rainbow S.p.A. It acts like one of the spin-offs to the Winx Club series. All of the show''s designs, animation and visual style were created in Italy, while the scriptwriting and original voice recording were done in the United States. It aired on The CW4Kids at 11:30am Eastern Standard Time on Saturdays. In Europe, the series used to air on Disney XD, and on CITV. In India, the series'' first season aired on Disney XD in 2010. The series premiered on January 3, 2009, with one episode in the US and the first four episodes in Europe, making Jetix the home for premieres beyond the first episode. It was revealed in a magazine with the new season of the Winx Club, that the second season of Huntik would air in fall 2012 in the US. However, the second season began airing in the spring of 2012 in UK on CITV & Australia on channel eleven. The first season was released on DVD by Anime Works in 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3pL45juySE3NtAbrTrqMFtwhS0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:16361'),
  ('424605011906473539', 'Hunting', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery', null, 'Zhao Dongling', 'Wang Kai, Hu Jun, Wang Ou, Liu Yijun, Deng Jiajia, Fu Jing, Wang Tonghui, Qiao Dawei', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKVFlf0rFvMG1ZcaBYarJBjdst0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101996'),
  ('637299539332285614', 'Hunting a Monster', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', 'Carles Tamayo', 'Carles Tamayo, Ramón Campos', 'Carles Tamayo, Lluís Gros, Ariadna Arias, Marc Brugat, Alex Fernández Oller', 'TV-14', 'Convicted sex offender Lluís asks filmmaker Carles to make a documentary about his life to fix his image. He agrees, expecting an apology, but realizes Gros remains unrepentant. Carles undigs more of Gros''s crimes and fights for justice.', 'Convicted sex offender Lluís asks filmmaker Carles to make a documentary about his life to fix his image. He agrees, expecting an apology, but realizes Gros remains unrepentant. Carles undigs more of Gros''s crimes and fights for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCC4ZTfpHh7Ljm1I7QUSHXgccYC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258847'),
  ('654475687094354726', 'Hunting Hitler', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Daniels', null, null, 'TV-14', 'An FBI cold case that has laid dormant for 70 years, leads a group of world-renown investigators on the ultimate manhunt to finally answer the question: Did Adolf Hitler survive World War II?', 'An FBI cold case that has laid dormant for 70 years, leads a group of world-renown investigators on the ultimate manhunt to finally answer the question: Did Adolf Hitler survive World War II?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rppjLBQfGzuZOUncN1m7Yfp0npg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64626'),
  ('473039651643545148', 'Hunting Season', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jon Marcus', 'Jon Marcus', 'Ben Baur, Marc Sinoway, Jake Manabat', null, 'Hunting Season is an American LGBT-themed comedy-drama web series created by Jon Marcus. Following the romantic and sexual exploits of Alex and his small group of friends in New York City, the story was inspired by and largely based on the 2005–08 blog The Great Cock Hunt and the 2008 novel of the same name published by Kensington Books.', 'Hunting Season is an American LGBT-themed comedy-drama web series created by Jon Marcus. Following the romantic and sexual exploits of Alex and his small group of friends in New York City, the story was inspired by and largely based on the 2005–08 blog The Great Cock Hunt and the 2008 novel of the same name published by Kensington Books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83khviW6CA92AticO65mLHLuvc4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68151'),
  ('1133476578927255789', 'Hurricane Katrina: Race Against Time', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Russel Honoré, Malik Rahim, Thanh Truong, Kevin Goodman, Marty Bahamonde, Lynette Boutte, Ivor Van Heerden, Alice Craft-Kerney', 'TV-14', 'Offers the most intimate and profound exploration into the wide-ranging impacts of the Hurricane Katrina disaster to date. Weaving together critical moments of the crisis and the past events that precipitated it, the series delivers an unparalleled, emotionally raw examination of the storm’s personal, political and societal fallout.', 'Offers the most intimate and profound exploration into the wide-ranging impacts of the Hurricane Katrina disaster to date. Weaving together critical moments of the crisis and the past events that precipitated it, the series delivers an unparalleled, emotionally raw examination of the storm’s personal, political and societal fallout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1wXiQvxCCZXvhQZaADaSumhVYv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294862'),
  ('341848473659446639', 'Hurts Like Hell', 2022, 'Drama, Documentary', null, 'Siwat Decharat', 'Nat Kitcharit, Thaneth Warakulnukroh, Vithaya Pansringarm, Nopachai Jayanama, Suppakorn Kitsuwan, Chonnikan Netjui, Phuripat Poonsuk, Kiartwaran Piboonsin', 'TV-MA', 'From illegal gambling to match-fixing, discover the seedy underworld behind the once-revered sport of Muay Thai in this drama inspired by real events.', 'From illegal gambling to match-fixing, discover the seedy underworld behind the once-revered sport of Muay Thai in this drama inspired by real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bHFQlGnWdcWpNFc4gLHaMEywjT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204129'),
  ('1029015809473822246', 'Husband for Rent aka Husband for Hire', 2013, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Perla Farías, David Posada', null, 'Gabriel Coronel, Sonya Smith, Juan Soler, Sarah Mintz, Miguel Varoni, Roberto Manrique, Kimberly Dos Ramos, Ricardo Chávez', 'TV-14', 'Marido En Alquiler is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Studios, Miami and Brazilian Rede Globo. It is a remake of the Brazilian telenovela, Fina Estampa, although the working title for the project was Reina Madre. Sonya Smith and Juan Soler star as the protagonists, marking the latter''s debut with Telemundo after signing an exclusivity agreement with the network in 2013, with Maritza Rodríguez and Miguel Varoni star as the main antagonists.', 'Marido En Alquiler is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by United States-based television network Telemundo Studios, Miami and Brazilian Rede Globo. It is a remake of the Brazilian telenovela, Fina Estampa, although the working title for the project was Reina Madre. Sonya Smith and Juan Soler star as the protagonists, marking the latter''s debut with Telemundo after signing an exclusivity agreement with the network in 2013, with Maritza Rodríguez and Miguel Varoni star as the main antagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mMGWB5RVN21Ez6CgnkIIIMCVj5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44949'),
  ('997396513084082155', 'Husdrömmar', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gert Wingårdh', null, 'What happens when you choose to realize your big dream of a house? How does that affect your life and relationships? In eight programs we follow eight dreams of houses - villas, penthouses, new buildings and renovations.', 'What happens when you choose to realize your big dream of a house? How does that affect your life and relationships? In eight programs we follow eight dreams of houses - villas, penthouses, new buildings and renovations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wR8Lws4OzRujpgEE16kfjQ0JyZx.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:70750'),
  ('489996969185189576', 'Hush', 2022, 'Drama', 'Angela Burt-Murray', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Dr. Draya Logan, a renowned marriage and sex therapist, finds herself entangled in lies, sex and murder.', 'Dr. Draya Logan, a renowned marriage and sex therapist, finds herself entangled in lies, sex and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hO5fNwb819dRwAS6XjDSNbgvP1D.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:204869'),
  ('291157605549097031', 'Huss', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Peter Lindblom, Jörgen Bergmark, Anna Platt', 'Karin Franz Körlof, Shirin Golchin, Filip Berg, Tove Wiréen, Nikolai Shervin, Kajsa Ernst, Victor Dohlsten, Robin Stegmar', null, 'When Katarina Huss starts as a police officer, she must learn to cope with the hard everyday life on the streets of Gothenburg. At the same time, her colleagues seem to be hiding something and soon she is drawn into a tangle of corruption and betrayal.', 'When Katarina Huss starts as a police officer, she must learn to cope with the hard everyday life on the streets of Gothenburg. At the same time, her colleagues seem to be hiding something and soon she is drawn into a tangle of corruption and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWXqp0qIJDC1IcCSMkl9pc3UtpG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121143'),
  ('76303480637643107', 'Hussar', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Garik Kharlamov, Pavel Rassomakhin, Katerina Kovalchuk, Ekaterina Radchenko, Sergey Belov, Gosha Kutsenko, Zoya Berber, Tatyana Tikhmenyova', null, '1812. Lieutenant Grigory Rylsky must deliver secret documents to Kutuzov. As soon as they reach the commander, the Russian army will begin its offensive. But on the way to headquarters, the lieutenant catches sight of a village girl and suddenly finds himself in the future, in the apartment of a young scientist, Dmitry Zhuravlev, and his wife, Katya, who are on the verge of divorce. While trying to return Gusar to the past, the time machine breaks down, and the lieutenant is forced to remain in the 21st century until the scientist repairs the machine.', '1812. Lieutenant Grigory Rylsky must deliver secret documents to Kutuzov. As soon as they reach the commander, the Russian army will begin its offensive. But on the way to headquarters, the lieutenant catches sight of a village girl and suddenly finds himself in the future, in the apartment of a young scientist, Dmitry Zhuravlev, and his wife, Katya, who are on the verge of divorce. While trying to return Gusar to the past, the time machine breaks down, and the lieutenant is forced to remain in the 21st century until the scientist repairs the machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QQmprzyt1a9DLRPg3SRxjGhmz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100042'),
  ('559500655247479232', 'Hustle', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Tony Jordan', null, 'Adrian Lester, Robert Glenister, Matt Di Angelo, Kelly Adams, Robert Vaughn, Rob Jarvis', 'TV-14', 'A motley group of London con artists pull of a series of daring and intricate stings.', 'A motley group of London con artists pull of a series of daring and intricate stings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xty7kinvhVH3RzMdjNQSpJj2pEm.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:3764'),
  ('457078220699900088', 'Hwajung', 2015, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Kim Yi-young', 'Kim Yi-young', 'Seo Kang-joon, Cha Seung-won, Lee Tae-hwan, Han Joo-wan, Lee Yeon-hee, Kim Jae-won, Shin Eun-jung, Cho Seong-ha', null, 'Fair Princess Jungmyung lives a life of the highest privilege, until her half-brother Prince Gwanghae executes the rightful crown prince and usurps the throne. Exiled from court, Jungmyung goes under disguise as a man and learns to adapt to life as a commoner — never forgetting Gwanghae''s wrongdoing. But amidst rampant corruption throughout the kingdom, can Jyungmyung exact her vengeance, restore order and take back her rightful place in the palace?', 'Fair Princess Jungmyung lives a life of the highest privilege, until her half-brother Prince Gwanghae executes the rightful crown prince and usurps the throne. Exiled from court, Jungmyung goes under disguise as a man and learns to adapt to life as a commoner — never forgetting Gwanghae''s wrongdoing. But amidst rampant corruption throughout the kingdom, can Jyungmyung exact her vengeance, restore order and take back her rightful place in the palace?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJw73nXlDxooReri4hW5gC48Dou.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62409'),
  ('366502569381234499', 'Hwang Jin Yi', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kim Cheol-kyu', '윤선주', 'Ha Ji-won, Wang Bit-na, Jang Keun-suk, Kim Jae-won, Shim Eun-kyung, Kim Bo-yeon, Kim Young-ae, Ryu Tae-joon', null, 'Hwang Jin Yi is the illegitimate child of a noble and Heon Keum, a noted musician gisaneg. The story centers on the four men in her life and her pursue in the art of dancing. Her first love with a nobleman''s son Kim Eun Ho ends in tragedy. Her love affair with Kim Jung Han does not have a happy ending either. Byuk Kye Soo is the Emporer''s relative who are obsessed with her and tried every trick but still could not have her. Finally there is her devoted bodyguard Yi Saeng who never deserted her in times of need. Meanwhile, there is Bu Yong who not only is Hwang Ji Yi''s rival in dancing but also in love.', 'Hwang Jin Yi is the illegitimate child of a noble and Heon Keum, a noted musician gisaneg. The story centers on the four men in her life and her pursue in the art of dancing. Her first love with a nobleman''s son Kim Eun Ho ends in tragedy. Her love affair with Kim Jung Han does not have a happy ending either. Byuk Kye Soo is the Emporer''s relative who are obsessed with her and tried every trick but still could not have her. Finally there is her devoted bodyguard Yi Saeng who never deserted her in times of need. Meanwhile, there is Bu Yong who not only is Hwang Ji Yi''s rival in dancing but also in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqlGadEsH2A88ezd9vSlIjU5sUf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6702'),
  ('26139667004047452', 'Hwarang: The Poet Warrior Youth', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Yun Seong-sik', 'Park Eun-young', 'Park Seo-jun, Go Ara, Park Hyung-sik, Do Ji-han, Minho, Jo Yoon-woo, V, Sung Dong-il', null, 'An elite group of young warriors trained in morals and martial arts finds love and friendship in Silla during Korea’s ancient Three Kingdoms period.', 'An elite group of young warriors trained in morals and martial arts finds love and friendship in Silla during Korea’s ancient Three Kingdoms period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXEiMRfG2IiSpa7gVWY401L6n21.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66496'),
  ('370914355236232410', 'Hyakko', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yui Horie, Michiko Neya, Aya Hirano, Houko Kuwashima, Fumiko Orikasa, Masayo Fujita, Yuhko Kaida, Hiroko Igarashi', null, 'Hyakko is a Japanese manga created by Haruaki Katō. It started serialization on Flex Comix''s free web comic FlexComix Blood on January 16, 2007. An anime adaptation produced by Nippon Animation was first aired in October 2008 in Japan. An OVA was released on October 17, 2009.', 'Hyakko is a Japanese manga created by Haruaki Katō. It started serialization on Flex Comix''s free web comic FlexComix Blood on January 16, 2007. An anime adaptation produced by Nippon Animation was first aired in October 2008 in Japan. An OVA was released on October 17, 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIKLdSdiXgSOXrzaEnL0a6weYI5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34058'),
  ('974496971515356710', 'Hyakujuu Sentai Gaoranger', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Noboru Kaneko, Kei Horie, Takeru Shibaki, Kazuyoshi Sakai, Mio Takeuchi, Tetsuji Tamayama, Takemi, Kouichi Sakaguchi', 'TV-PG', 'Long ago, a great, destructive war between humans the Orgs was ended; the people of Earth were believed to be the victors. But now, 1,000 years later, the Orgs have returned. And five new warriors have been selected by the Power Animals to claim the responsibility of protecting humanity once again, by becoming Gaorangers!', 'Long ago, a great, destructive war between humans the Orgs was ended; the people of Earth were believed to be the victors. But now, 1,000 years later, the Orgs have returned. And five new warriors have been selected by the Power Animals to claim the responsibility of protecting humanity once again, by becoming Gaorangers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrErA1GiQcZikGG3c0bITFlCO6f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5357'),
  ('498517367836758228', 'Hybrid Child', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shungiku Nakamura', null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yuki Ono, Ryohei Kimura, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Tsubasa Yonaga, Daisuke Hirakawa', null, 'The Hybrid Child is an amazing doll that can grow if it is lavished with enough love and care from its owner. Neither fully machine nor fully human, the various Hybrid Child models develop strong emotional bonds with their owners.', 'The Hybrid Child is an amazing doll that can grow if it is lavished with enough love and care from its owner. Neither fully machine nor fully human, the various Hybrid Child models develop strong emotional bonds with their owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwxHDoSJb6qMJJidlDAp1A9ziGQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83018'),
  ('92239851688800157', 'Hybrid x Heart Magias Academy Ataraxia', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kenji Akabane, Akari Kageyama, Chinatsu Akasaki, Juri Nagatsuma, Rika Kinugawa, Iori Nomizu, Satosaki Mei, Hina Kino', null, 'Hida Kizuna possesses the HHG (Heart Hybrid Gear) ability, but it is not strong enough to make him particularly important. His older sister calls him to transfer to a strategic defense school, where many of the students (many of which are large-breasted girls) use their HHG abilities to fight invaders from another world while wearing extremely skimpy pilot outfits. Kizuna''s fighting ability doesn''t measure up, but his sister has another plan—apparently having erotic experiences with Kizuna will allow the girls to replenish their energy or power-up. It looks like his new school life is going to be full of embarrassment.', 'Hida Kizuna possesses the HHG (Heart Hybrid Gear) ability, but it is not strong enough to make him particularly important. His older sister calls him to transfer to a strategic defense school, where many of the students (many of which are large-breasted girls) use their HHG abilities to fight invaders from another world while wearing extremely skimpy pilot outfits. Kizuna''s fighting ability doesn''t measure up, but his sister has another plan—apparently having erotic experiences with Kizuna will allow the girls to replenish their energy or power-up. It looks like his new school life is going to be full of embarrassment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s53DVqH9F2cw22O8enndCBQgTsF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67011'),
  ('486681491035009908', 'Hyde, Jekyll, Me', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jo Young-kwang, Kim Ji-woon, Park Shin-woo', null, 'Hyun Bin, Han Ji-min, Sung Joon, Lee Hye-ri, Lee Seung-joon, Han Sang-jin, Shin Eun-jung, Lee Duck-hwa', 'NR', 'A chaebol executive with a split personality spars with a circus leader determined to save her troupe, which he’s trying to eject from his theme park.', 'A chaebol executive with a split personality spars with a circus leader determined to save her troupe, which he’s trying to eject from his theme park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSus8FBfnEAGkrVNDkAW4L1qB5Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61890'),
  ('543150439173056104', 'Hyena', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jang Tae-yoo, Kim Ru-ri', 'Kim Ru-ri', 'Kim Hye-soo, Ju Ji-hoon, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Ho-jung, Song Young-gyu, Hwang Bo-ra, Jun Suk-ho, Hyun Bong-sik', null, 'To survive in a dog-eat-dog world, two rival lawyers with high-class clientele tear apart anything that stands in the way of their ambitions.', 'To survive in a dog-eat-dog world, two rival lawyers with high-class clientele tear apart anything that stands in the way of their ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6iQysC0Vl3SW4G6x9NjL9pfieD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95110'),
  ('56987389469971588', 'Hyeri''s Club', 2024, 'Talk, Reality', null, null, 'Lee Hye-ri', null, 'Variety Show with actress and singer Lee Hyeri.', 'Variety Show with actress and singer Lee Hyeri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BlbyG0CDJsbupqzErGqfTwhPki.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:257662'),
  ('148030727283996789', 'Hymn of Death', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Jong-suk, Shin Hye-sun, Park Sun-im, Lee Ji-hoon, Kim Kang-hyun, Kim Myung-soo, Kim Won-hae, Hwang Young-hee', 'TV-14', 'Based on a true story, the drama tells the tragic love story of Kim Woo Jin, a married stage drama writer, and Yun Shim Duk, Korea''s first professional soprano, who meet while studying at Tokyo University in the 1920s. Yun Shim Duk''s recording of "Death Song" became the first Korean pop song in 1926.', 'Based on a true story, the drama tells the tragic love story of Kim Woo Jin, a married stage drama writer, and Yun Shim Duk, Korea''s first professional soprano, who meet while studying at Tokyo University in the 1920s. Yun Shim Duk''s recording of "Death Song" became the first Korean pop song in 1926.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2D3abE1uHwmTrs94im2smVMw1K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83755'),
  ('881453086949857747', 'Hyori''s Bed and Breakfast', 2017, 'Reality', 'Jung Hyo-min, 윤신혜', null, 'Lee Hyo-ri, Lee Sang-soon, Yoona', null, 'The famous diva, Lee Hyo-ri, has been taking a long hiatus from the spotlight and enjoying her life in the suburbs of Jeju Island with her husband. The couple has decided to open up their home as a Bed and Breakfast to various people to offer them a time of healing and rest from their busy lives.', 'The famous diva, Lee Hyo-ri, has been taking a long hiatus from the spotlight and enjoying her life in the suburbs of Jeju Island with her husband. The couple has decided to open up their home as a Bed and Breakfast to various people to offer them a time of healing and rest from their busy lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzDW6siDqFYU3xTS1Etb8nhXCA6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72763'),
  ('181243295954867524', 'Hyouge Mono', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Koji Ohkura, Rikiya Koyama, Tsutomu Isobe, Mitsuhiro Sakamaki, Tokuyoshi Kawashima, Shin-ichiro Miki, Masashi Hirose, Ryusuke Ohbayashi', null, 'Sasuke Furuta is a vassal of the great warlord Nobunaga Oda and a man obsessed with tea ceremony and material desires in his pursuit of a fortuitous life. Having learned from Nobunaga and the legendary tea master Soueki Senne, Sasuke walks the way of the Hyouge Mono.', 'Sasuke Furuta is a vassal of the great warlord Nobunaga Oda and a man obsessed with tea ceremony and material desires in his pursuit of a fortuitous life. Having learned from Nobunaga and the legendary tea master Soueki Senne, Sasuke walks the way of the Hyouge Mono.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPoPwLY1HPFMr4FBIKMsj2uK4w5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77401'),
  ('1045285762004234755', 'Hyouka', 2012, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Satomi Sato, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Ai Kayano', 'TV-14', 'Oreki Houtarou is a minimalistic high school boy. One day, he joins the Classic Literature Club at his elder sister''s request. There he meets Chitanda Eru, Fukube Satoshi, and Ibara Mayaka. Chitanda is a calm beautiful girl but she turns into an embodiment of curiosity once she says, "I''m curious." Fukube is a smiling boy with a fantastic memory who calls himself a database. Ibara is a short girl and is strict with others and herself. They begin to investigate a case that occurred 45 years ago. Hints of the mystery are buried in an old collection of works of the former members of Classics Club. The collection is titled "Hyouka."', 'Oreki Houtarou is a minimalistic high school boy. One day, he joins the Classic Literature Club at his elder sister''s request. There he meets Chitanda Eru, Fukube Satoshi, and Ibara Mayaka. Chitanda is a calm beautiful girl but she turns into an embodiment of curiosity once she says, "I''m curious." Fukube is a smiling boy with a fantastic memory who calls himself a database. Ibara is a short girl and is strict with others and herself. They begin to investigate a case that occurred 45 years ago. Hints of the mystery are buried in an old collection of works of the former members of Classics Club. The collection is titled "Hyouka."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoAig2n9LkukqnizytaBtOSwif7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65329'),
  ('662949691025754637', 'Hype House', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Thomas Petrou, Larri Merritt, Kouvr Annon, Chase Hudson, Nikita Dragun, Mia Hayward, Alex Warren, Vinnie Hacker', 'TV-14', 'From humble beginnings to overnight fame, these are the stories of the most popular personalities on social media as they come into their own, fall in love and tackle new chapters in their lives.', 'From humble beginnings to overnight fame, these are the stories of the most popular personalities on social media as they come into their own, fall in love and tackle new chapters in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIppViBWffdcN2m6ffOsl0NKhHw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124031'),
  ('854506208689292269', 'Hyper Knife', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kim Jung-hyun, Kim Sun-hee', 'Kim Sun-hee', 'Park Eun-bin, Sul Kyung-gu, Yoon Chan-young, Park Byung-eun, Lee Jung-sic', null, 'Seok, an eager yet genius neurosurgeon is reunited with Deokhee, the professor who ruined her life long ago. Once, the two surgeons cared for each other more than anyone else. But now with nothing but hatred toward each other, Seok is furious that he is back in her life and vows to take revenge.', 'Seok, an eager yet genius neurosurgeon is reunited with Deokhee, the professor who ruined her life long ago. Once, the two surgeons cared for each other more than anyone else. But now with nothing but hatred toward each other, Seok is furious that he is back in her life and vows to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHkiSxa7O8kPjyyTJ9ue2mqYJVx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245079'),
  ('798344455034987904', 'Hyper Police', 1997, 'Animation', 'Mee (minoru Tachikawa)', null, 'Ryuzou Ishino, Chiyako Shibahara, Yuko Miyamura, Akio Otsuka, Koichi Tochika, Toshihiko Seki, Yumi Hikita, Naoki Bando', null, 'Sasahara Natsuki is a poor bounty hunter in a world where monsters and humans live together. Most of her cases involve monsters infringing upon the rights of humans, who are protected by law from their generally more powerful neighbors. Being half-human and half cat-beast, Natsuki straddles the two societies and tries to understand and respect both while enforcing the law. She is assisted by a werewolf named Batanen who is afraid to admit he loves her; another werewolf named Tommy; and a Kyubi fox demon named Sakura who has her own plans--which include eating Natsuki to complete her her nine tails and thereby her magical powers.', 'Sasahara Natsuki is a poor bounty hunter in a world where monsters and humans live together. Most of her cases involve monsters infringing upon the rights of humans, who are protected by law from their generally more powerful neighbors. Being half-human and half cat-beast, Natsuki straddles the two societies and tries to understand and respect both while enforcing the law. She is assisted by a werewolf named Batanen who is afraid to admit he loves her; another werewolf named Tommy; and a Kyubi fox demon named Sakura who has her own plans--which include eating Natsuki to complete her her nine tails and thereby her magical powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rkHrnGE00GAQA59opYQSbyANKG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34807'),
  ('752604099124238909', 'Hyper Speed Transforming Gyrozetter', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Yuka Iguchi, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Akio Suyama, Arisa Kiyoto, Rie Tanaka, Jouji Nakata, Kenta Miyake', 'NR', 'Chousoku Henkei Gyrozetter or Chō Soku Henkei Gyrozetter (literally Hyper Speed Transformation Gyrozetter) is a multimedia franchise created by Square Enix, spanning a transforming Japanese arcade game, a manga series written by Ryutaro Ichmura and illustrated by Teruaki Mizuno, and an anime series by A-1 Pictures on the Fall 2012 Anime lineup.', 'Chousoku Henkei Gyrozetter or Chō Soku Henkei Gyrozetter (literally Hyper Speed Transformation Gyrozetter) is a multimedia franchise created by Square Enix, spanning a transforming Japanese arcade game, a manga series written by Ryutaro Ichmura and illustrated by Teruaki Mizuno, and an anime series by A-1 Pictures on the Fall 2012 Anime lineup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icIocMORqayBXRdIca4Lq5DPDfU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76897'),
  ('1005203989587364002', 'Hyperdimension Neptunia', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rie Tanaka, Asami Imai, Kana Asumi, Rina Sato, Aoi Yuuki, Eri Kitamura, Yui Horie, Kana Hanazawa', 'TV-14', 'This is Gameindustri. Beings called Goddesses rule the countries of this unreal world. The four goddesses govern four states: Planeptune, Lastation, Lowee and Leanbox. For many long years these countries fought each other over the Share, the source of the Goddesses'' power. However, fearful that the conflict would pointlessly erode their strength, the goddesses signed a Friendship Treaty forbidding them from taking the Share by force. Under the treaty, the Goddesses and their younger sisters took a step forward to a new stage in their relations. It is the dawn of a new, dynamic era marked occasionally by shared laughter, disputes as well as cooperation. But what does the future hold in store for Gameindustri...?', 'This is Gameindustri. Beings called Goddesses rule the countries of this unreal world. The four goddesses govern four states: Planeptune, Lastation, Lowee and Leanbox. For many long years these countries fought each other over the Share, the source of the Goddesses'' power. However, fearful that the conflict would pointlessly erode their strength, the goddesses signed a Friendship Treaty forbidding them from taking the Share by force. Under the treaty, the Goddesses and their younger sisters took a step forward to a new stage in their relations. It is the dawn of a new, dynamic era marked occasionally by shared laughter, disputes as well as cooperation. But what does the future hold in store for Gameindustri...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDM3a18dtkJjg0ReuQy2bO1zcho.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63525'),
  ('274053934043118169', 'Hyperdrive', 2006, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kevin Cecil, Andy Riley', 'Kevin Cecil, Andy Riley', 'Nick Frost, Miranda Hart, Kevin Eldon, Dan Antopolski, Stephen Evans, Petra Massey', null, 'Set in 2151 and 2152, it follows the crew of HMS Camden Lock as they stumble through their heroic mission to protect British interests in a changing galaxy.', 'Set in 2151 and 2152, it follows the crew of HMS Camden Lock as they stumble through their heroic mission to protect British interests in a changing galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUpHbyVK0O32KDqd2U0egJHfWif.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2538'),
  ('127075819636587394', 'Hyperdrive', 2019, 'Reality', 'Charlize Theron, Aaron Catling', null, 'Lindsay Czarniak, Mike Hill, Rutledge Wood, Michael Bisping', 'TV-PG', 'Elite street racers from around the world test their limits in supercharged custom cars on the biggest, baddest automotive obstacle course ever built.', 'Elite street racers from around the world test their limits in supercharged custom cars on the biggest, baddest automotive obstacle course ever built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvhVHPKdsyj1j2m3diD5mazl2bG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91766'),
  ('911520805252849943', 'Hyperventilation', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', 'Lewin', null, 'Park Joo-kwang, Choi Se-jun, 시오, 양양', null, 'It''s winter. Myeongyi came to the highschool reunion party to see Seonho, a guy he secretly had a crush on. Yet, it is hard for Myeongyi to have fun with others because of his shy disposition. He sneaks out of the party for smoking. Then, Seonho also gets up and follows after Myeongyi.', 'It''s winter. Myeongyi came to the highschool reunion party to see Seonho, a guy he secretly had a crush on. Yet, it is hard for Myeongyi to have fun with others because of his shy disposition. He sneaks out of the party for smoking. Then, Seonho also gets up and follows after Myeongyi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s618IMXalsFYFz98juAtMrN6KP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137478'),
  ('4809444421767665', 'HYPNOSISMIC -Division Rap Battle- Rhyme Anima', 2020, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yukihiro Nozuyama, Soma Saito, Yusuke Shirai, Shintaro Asanuma, Yu Kobayashi, Show Hayami, Chiaki Takahashi, Subaru Kimura', 'TV-MA', 'Legendary rap group The Dirty Dawg could have taken Japan by storm, but then they broke up. Now each member fights in one of the four rival groups. Battles for turf are fought with rap and the Hypnosis Mic, a microphone that can affect the human spirit.', 'Legendary rap group The Dirty Dawg could have taken Japan by storm, but then they broke up. Now each member fights in one of the four rival groups. Battles for turf are fought with rap and the Hypnosis Mic, a microphone that can affect the human spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8z45YRcsnUVRp6qEHkGSoql6CQM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96139'),
  ('475096706711352147', 'Hysteria', 2014, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'An investigative thriller about a haunted young doctor who is summoned back to her hometown to investigate an epidemic that may be linked to social media - and her own tragic past.', 'An investigative thriller about a haunted young doctor who is summoned back to her hometown to investigate an epidemic that may be linked to social media - and her own tragic past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxLLlTtf9FT9pLRMIT2Ca7bXjdH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61282'),
  ('612706977153278049', 'Hysteria!', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Matthew Scott Kane', null, 'Julie Bowen, Anna Camp, Emjay Anthony, Chiara Aurelia, Kezii Curtis, Nikki Hahn, Bruce Campbell, Garret Dillahunt', 'TV-MA', 'When a beloved varsity quarterback disappears during the "Satanic Panic" of the late 1980s, a struggling high school heavy metal band of outcasts realize they can capitalize on the town''s sudden interest in the occult by building a reputation as a Satanic metal band, until a bizarre series of murders, kidnappings, and reported "supernatural activity" triggers a leather-studded witch hunt that leads directly back to them.', 'When a beloved varsity quarterback disappears during the "Satanic Panic" of the late 1980s, a struggling high school heavy metal band of outcasts realize they can capitalize on the town''s sudden interest in the occult by building a reputation as a Satanic metal band, until a bizarre series of murders, kidnappings, and reported "supernatural activity" triggers a leather-studded witch hunt that leads directly back to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG3mGUouuSACs2KLdJWjEHpuG8L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224361'),
