  ('918951058643613051', 'Ingobernable', 2017, 'War & Politics, Drama, Crime', 'Luis Gamboa, Rodrigo Ordoñez, Fernanda Eguiarte', null, 'Tamara Mazarrasa, Eréndira Ibarra, Alberto Guerra, Kate del Castillo, Maxi Iglesias, Álvaro Guerrero, Alicia Jaziz Zapién, Aida López', 'TV-MA', 'The First Lady of Mexico has big plans to improve conditions for the country. As she starts to lose faith in her husband, President Diego Nava, she finds herself at a crossroad where she will need to find a way to deal with a great challenge.', 'The First Lady of Mexico has big plans to improve conditions for the country. As she starts to lose faith in her husband, President Diego Nava, she finds herself at a crossroad where she will need to find a way to deal with a great challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mREc0h6fpGRQ3OEfiWqD9TfudaC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70897'),
  ('1140440119051111328', 'Ingoku Danchi: Deviant''s Apartment Complex', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aika Wakuno, Kana Yuuki, Ai Shimizu, Youko Itou, Misato Fukuen, Sayuri Yahagi, Kazuki Asami, Tomokazu Sugita', null, 'Yoshida is a tiny, frail high school graduate who became an unwilling manager of an apartment complex when his father, the former manager, injured himself. Unbeknownst to him, this apartment complex houses quite a few women with very... unusual sexual preferences. This becomes a problem when a mysterious entity begins giving "Libido Cloth" to these women—skimpy outfits that give them superpowers and cause them to go on lewd rampages! Will Yoshida be able to stop them?', 'Yoshida is a tiny, frail high school graduate who became an unwilling manager of an apartment complex when his father, the former manager, injured himself. Unbeknownst to him, this apartment complex houses quite a few women with very... unusual sexual preferences. This becomes a problem when a mysterious entity begins giving "Libido Cloth" to these women—skimpy outfits that give them superpowers and cause them to go on lewd rampages! Will Yoshida be able to stop them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEGZCXMAqa4aGZTwmXigdHiihCU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316427'),
  ('171106419713599166', 'Ingress: The Animation', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshiki Nakajima, Shigeo Kiyama, Kentaro Tone, Tarusuke Shingaki, Megumi Ogata, Reina Ueda, Hiroo Sasaki, Kohsuke Toriumi', 'TV-MA', 'After scientists discover a mysterious substance that can influence human minds, two factions wage an all-out battle to control its awesome power.', 'After scientists discover a mysterious substance that can influence human minds, two factions wage an all-out battle to control its awesome power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaubBjPlDCkFLCreyg2migPBpcl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83238'),
  ('141530023030780533', 'Inhuman Resources', 2020, 'Drama', 'Pierre Lemaitre', 'Perrine Margaine, Pierre Lemaitre', 'Éric Cantona, Suzanne Clément, Alex Lutz, Gustave Kervern, Aleksandra Yermak, Xavier Robic, Nicolas Martinez, Louise Coldefy', null, 'Alain Delambre, unemployed and 57, is lured by an attractive job opening. But things get ugly when he realizes he’s a pawn in a cruel corporate game.', 'Alain Delambre, unemployed and 57, is lured by an attractive job opening. But things get ugly when he realizes he’s a pawn in a cruel corporate game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izgG2cJeuZKuMpGzcrhzD9IotOA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101690'),
  ('445319034095535073', 'Initial D', 1998, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Atsushi Abe, Takehito Koyasu, Tomokazu Seki, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Yasuyuki Kase, Yuuka Hirose', 'TV-14', 'Takumi’s job as a tofu delivery boy has turned him into one of the most formidable drivers around. Behind the wheel of his Eight-Six, he’s one with the road—and his life shifts into high gear when the underground street racing world takes notice. Drivers from across the region are lining up for a shot at the new guy. Takumi’s not just focused on winning—he’s out to prove he’s the best.', 'Takumi’s job as a tofu delivery boy has turned him into one of the most formidable drivers around. Behind the wheel of his Eight-Six, he’s one with the road—and his life shifts into high gear when the underground street racing world takes notice. Drivers from across the region are lining up for a shot at the new guy. Takumi’s not just focused on winning—he’s out to prove he’s the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CMG53GMx0OFFmF4dzhlFuebarq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:40424'),
  ('343851256540350060', 'Injustice', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Anthony Horowitz', null, 'James Purefoy, Dervla Kirwan, Nathaniel Parker, Sasha Behar, Charlie Creed-Miles, Obi Abili, Lisa Diveney, Kirsty Bushell', 'NR', 'William Travers, an accomplished criminal lawyer living happily with his wife in rural Suffolk, is recovering from a traumatic series of events that have shaken his faith in the legal system when he is drawn into a case involving an old friend.', 'William Travers, an accomplished criminal lawyer living happily with his wife in rural Suffolk, is recovering from a traumatic series of events that have shaken his faith in the legal system when he is drawn into a case involving an old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miXmw5Z7GSu8niv5bo6WM9CgB23.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39604'),
  ('728988856672790400', 'Ink Master', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A group of the country''s most creative and skilled tattoo artists compete for a hundred thousand dollars and the title of Ink Master. The stakes couldn''t be higher with "living canvasses" donating their skin to be permanently marked in this adrenalized competition elimination.', 'A group of the country''s most creative and skilled tattoo artists compete for a hundred thousand dollars and the title of Ink Master. The stakes couldn''t be higher with "living canvasses" donating their skin to be permanently marked in this adrenalized competition elimination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2qHivDbnmndHGw3iNhw1LPZIpM.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:46286'),
  ('1138738752097963987', 'Ink Master: Angels', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kelly Doty, Nikki Simpson, Ryan Ashley Malarkey', 'TV-14', 'Ink Master competitors travel the country and go head to head with some of America’s most talented tattoo artists. Contestants face a variety of tattoo-based challenges to see who has what it takes to beat the Angels and earn a spot on Ink Master.', 'Ink Master competitors travel the country and go head to head with some of America’s most talented tattoo artists. Contestants face a variety of tattoo-based challenges to see who has what it takes to beat the Angels and earn a spot on Ink Master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFZYLp5MZvvh24AxaAXFEuqDJBJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74395'),
  ('215926769523828271', 'Inkigayo', 1998, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Seo Beom-jun, Yeonjun, Roh Jeong-eui', null, 'The program is a weekly music show that features and introduces viewers to the most popular artists in Korea. Every week, they ask viewers to vote and select the most popular song of the week.', 'The program is a weekly music show that features and introduces viewers to the most popular artists in Korea. Every week, they ask viewers to vote and select the most popular song of the week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvY5NH73JRvfJI714MF6Ja4TM3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65278'),
  ('125264368958743561', 'Innate', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Fran Carballal, Enrique Lojo', null, 'Elena Anaya, Imanol Arias, Emma Suárez, Roberto Álamo, Aura Garrido, Teo Soler, Ane Gabarain, Fernando Guallar', null, 'A psychologist is forced to confront her past when a new series of murders echoes the crimes that put her serial killer father behind bars 25 years ago.', 'A psychologist is forced to confront her past when a new series of murders echoes the crimes that put her serial killer father behind bars 25 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FfKufoT62ogWu3vNfH1gmaIZbx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283133'),
  ('117274934441625937', 'Innocence, Fight Against False Charges', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kenji Ikeda', 'Kazunao Furuya', 'Kentaro Sakaguchi, Haruna Kawaguchi, Shuri, Bokuzo Masana, Eiji Akaso, Tetta Sugimoto, Kotaro Shiga, Mantaro Koichi', null, 'This work is a human drama that attorney, Taku Kurokawa challenges reversal play with weapons, passion, and science as a weapon to cause "miracle" to clear false charges. Kurokawa who plays Sakaguchi actively opposes fake crime defense, which is said to be impossible, reproduces the events that occurred on the scene in an experiment and tries to elucidate the incident. In addition, Naoki Fujiki appears as a new American lawyer, Kazuaki Wakakura who is swayed by the pioneer, Haruna Kawaguchi , a scientist who lends power to Taku, Kyoichiro Akiro .', 'This work is a human drama that attorney, Taku Kurokawa challenges reversal play with weapons, passion, and science as a weapon to cause "miracle" to clear false charges. Kurokawa who plays Sakaguchi actively opposes fake crime defense, which is said to be impossible, reproduces the events that occurred on the scene in an experiment and tries to elucidate the incident. In addition, Naoki Fujiki appears as a new American lawyer, Kazuaki Wakakura who is swayed by the pioneer, Haruna Kawaguchi , a scientist who lends power to Taku, Kyoichiro Akiro .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfANU2cj1KsnSArxkFi2qyxMlBx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86671'),
