  ('854774974883348843', 'Insect Detective', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery', null, '李京东, 黑猫', 'Zhang Yao, Chu Yue, Thassapak Hsu, Lawrence Wong, Zhu Gangrirao, Kornchid Boonsathitpakdee, Pornnappan Pornpenpipat, Pu Yixing', null, 'When a murder involving a deadly bullet ant puts him under suspicion, insect toxicology graduate Tan Jingtian teams up with a forensic doctor and police detectives to clear his name, uncover hidden truths, and track down a killer who has evaded capture for years.', 'When a murder involving a deadly bullet ant puts him under suspicion, insect toxicology graduate Tan Jingtian teams up with a forensic doctor and police detectives to clear his name, uncover hidden truths, and track down a killer who has evaded capture for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk8wqVWX7J7UW228WJXicgih8zG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112573'),
