  ('818196751183464998', 'Insensato Coração', 2011, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Gilberto Braga, Ricardo Linhares', 'João Ximenes Braga, Angela Carneiro, Izabel de Oliveira', 'Paolla Oliveira, Eriberto Leão, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Glória Pires, Camila Pitanga, Lázaro Ramos, Antônio Fagundes, Natália do Vale', null, 'Insensato Coração is a Brazilian telenovela that first aired on Rede Globo in 2011.', 'Insensato Coração is a Brazilian telenovela that first aired on Rede Globo in 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTmYFo5z8q3q3Pcj2WyBByc6CQb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40811'),
  ('459858248474113129', 'Inseparable', 2013, 'Drama', 'Vitaly Vorobyev', null, 'Yura Borisov, Maria Poezzhaeva, Maxím Anatóljewitsch Saussálin, Oleh Prymohenov, Evgeniya Loza, Yuliya Rutberg, Olha Larina, Yuriy Nazarov', null, 'It''s April of 1986. Pripyat, Ukraine. A core meltdown occurred at Reactor 4 of the Chernobyl Power Plant. Over thirty people died during the blast but the estimated death toll as a result of the radiation fallout will reach a four-digit number. This accident will be considered the world’s largest ecological disaster. Set at ground zero of a catastrophe, this film will reveal the details of the Chernobyl event. The shocking news of the explosion at the nuclear plant has spread, as the world watched the tragedy in fear and confusion. Hearts went out to those who displayed selfless courage and integrity in the initial efforts to stabilize the reactor power. But some were too busy being in love to notice what had just happened in nearby Chernobyl. The disaster has faded into the background... This is an account of love and loss, bravery and supernatural stoicism in the face of unbeatable odds.', 'It''s April of 1986. Pripyat, Ukraine. A core meltdown occurred at Reactor 4 of the Chernobyl Power Plant. Over thirty people died during the blast but the estimated death toll as a result of the radiation fallout will reach a four-digit number. This accident will be considered the world’s largest ecological disaster. Set at ground zero of a catastrophe, this film will reveal the details of the Chernobyl event. The shocking news of the explosion at the nuclear plant has spread, as the world watched the tragedy in fear and confusion. Hearts went out to those who displayed selfless courage and integrity in the initial efforts to stabilize the reactor power. But some were too busy being in love to notice what had just happened in nearby Chernobyl. The disaster has faded into the background... This is an account of love and loss, bravery and supernatural stoicism in the face of unbeatable odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5ovAuGNIgOOjTFv4PtewDbFJiR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55886'),
  ('513767302519762504', 'Inside', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jeanne Le Guillou, Bruno Dega', null, 'Noémie Schmidt, Béatrice Dalle, Hippolyte Girardot, Judith El Zein, Fleur Geffrier, Samuel Theis, Antoine Gouy, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet', null, 'When a 28-year-old woman who was interned against her will in a psychiatric hospital is murdered the night she was scheduled to leave, young and brilliant police inspector Angela is put in charge of the investigation.', 'When a 28-year-old woman who was interned against her will in a psychiatric hospital is murdered the night she was scheduled to leave, young and brilliant police inspector Angela is put in charge of the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzMDOcDv60kkuXSWt0F7uusGn8l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92424'),
  ('425520203997901958', 'Inside', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Josh Bradley, Tobi Brown, Simon Minter, KSI, Ethan Payne, Vikram Barn, Harry Lewis, Stephen Tries', null, 'In this Big Brother-like game show, 10 celebrity contestants are placed inside a house for seven days. Rather than kicking back and waiting for the money to clear in their accounts, they have to take part in challenges to avoid elimination. Each decision they make will come at a cost, with funds deducted as the week progresses.', 'In this Big Brother-like game show, 10 celebrity contestants are placed inside a house for seven days. Rather than kicking back and waiting for the money to clear in their accounts, they have to take part in challenges to avoid elimination. Each decision they make will come at a cost, with funds deducted as the week progresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7ntUzEoWtkgBhqO9DkpMG1dFld.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:256052'),
  ('947465514102369711', 'Inside Amy Schumer', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Amy Schumer, Daniel Powell', 'Kurt Metzger', 'Amy Schumer', 'TV-14', 'Take a journey into the provocative and hilariously wicked mind of Amy Schumer as she explores topics revolving around sex, relationships, and the general clusterf*ck that is life. Through a series of scripted vignettes, stand-up comedy, and man-on-the street candid interviews, Schumer tackles various themes such as "Denial," "Getting Your Way," and "Threesomes."', 'Take a journey into the provocative and hilariously wicked mind of Amy Schumer as she explores topics revolving around sex, relationships, and the general clusterf*ck that is life. Through a series of scripted vignettes, stand-up comedy, and man-on-the street candid interviews, Schumer tackles various themes such as "Denial," "Getting Your Way," and "Threesomes."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2CwT3O7WD03hJrZNNE4BtWt9sd.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:47562'),
  ('781521544979547946', 'Inside Bill''s Brain: Decoding Bill Gates', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Davis Guggenheim', null, 'Bill Gates, Melinda Gates, Davin Orness, Alex Bueermann, Mohammed Albaaj', 'TV-14', 'Take a trip inside the mind of Bill Gates as the billionaire opens up about those who influenced him and the audacious goals he''s still pursuing.', 'Take a trip inside the mind of Bill Gates as the billionaire opens up about those who influenced him and the audacious goals he''s still pursuing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RIVJnpIkPt90EwJQwPzqS1UTPG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93016'),
  ('500187384614153025', 'Inside Borussia Dortmund', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Marco Reus, Mario Götze, Jadon Sancho, Mats Hummels, Christian Pulisic, Axel Witsel, Manuel Akanji', null, 'In this 4-part docu-series, go behind-the-scenes with one of the Bundesliga’s biggest clubs and re-live the thrilling 2018/19 football season from the team’s point of view. Discover their training facilities, experience the locker room drama first-hand, and become acquainted with the players’ personal lives.', 'In this 4-part docu-series, go behind-the-scenes with one of the Bundesliga’s biggest clubs and re-live the thrilling 2018/19 football season from the team’s point of view. Discover their training facilities, experience the locker room drama first-hand, and become acquainted with the players’ personal lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJaKlognCPM3LJDwvX1Tq3NSRBe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91991'),
  ('935056718671511783', 'Inside Britain''s National Parks', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A look at four of Britain’s 15 national parks, capturing these unique places and meeting the people who live and work in the New Forest, Pembrokeshire Coast, Dartmoor and Northumberland.', 'A look at four of Britain’s 15 national parks, capturing these unique places and meeting the people who live and work in the New Forest, Pembrokeshire Coast, Dartmoor and Northumberland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urcuR1DQhfHVjAinGqOumvEXQWw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317030'),
  ('1047322183775766574', 'Inside Comedy', 2012, 'Comedy, Documentary, Talk', null, null, 'David Steinberg', null, 'Half hour comedy documentary series from veteran funny-man David Steinberg and Steve Carell reveals the inspirations, influences and idols of some of the greatest comics of our time.', 'Half hour comedy documentary series from veteran funny-man David Steinberg and Steve Carell reveals the inspirations, influences and idols of some of the greatest comics of our time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tHx9hWRUWX7GZCSlVAtUFmUCXR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:59397'),
  ('551008472847093699', 'Inside Edge', 2017, 'Drama', 'Karan Anshuman', null, 'Angad Bedi, Siddhant Chaturvedi, Amit Sial, Natasha Suri, Naveen Kaushik, Manuj Sharma, Vikram Kochhar, Jitin Gulati', 'TV-MA', 'The story of the Mumbai Mavericks, a T20 cricket franchise playing in the Powerplay League. Set in a landscape of conflicting interests, where selfishness is almost a virtue, where sex, money, and power are mere means to an end, Inside Edge is a story that pulls no punches, minces no words, and takes no prisoners. Come witness the game behind the game.', 'The story of the Mumbai Mavericks, a T20 cricket franchise playing in the Powerplay League. Set in a landscape of conflicting interests, where selfishness is almost a virtue, where sex, money, and power are mere means to an end, Inside Edge is a story that pulls no punches, minces no words, and takes no prisoners. Come witness the game behind the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfGyOXhabq3CrjSLx7LJjCrWTHy.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72739'),
  ('613388550920917229', 'Inside Job', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Shion Takeuchi, Scott Thomas, Alisha Brophy', null, 'Lizzy Caplan, Clark Duke, Christian Slater, Brett Gelman, John DiMaggio, Tisha Campbell, Bobby Lee, Andy Daly', 'TV-MA', 'For employees of the Deep State, conspiracies aren''t just theories — they''re fact. And keeping them a secret is a full-time job.', 'For employees of the Deep State, conspiracies aren''t just theories — they''re fact. And keeping them a secret is a full-time job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwJUDMJ4i3KBYjeUFK9Js87iJEa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97727'),
  ('560467249743467666', 'Inside Lapenko', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Anton Lapenko, Aleksey Smirnov', null, 'Anton Lapenko, Ivan Lapenko, Yuri Lapenko, Vyacheslav Lapenko, Rodion Lapenko, Nikita Lapenko', null, 'A comedic Russian web-series featuring a myriad of characters, living in a city somewhere in either 1980s USSR or 1990s Russia, all played by one person — Anton Lapenko. The concept and plot originated from skits on Anton''s Instagram. The series is made in the style of VHS and Soviet perestroika-cinema and the bulk of the dialogue is improvised', 'A comedic Russian web-series featuring a myriad of characters, living in a city somewhere in either 1980s USSR or 1990s Russia, all played by one person — Anton Lapenko. The concept and plot originated from skits on Anton''s Instagram. The series is made in the style of VHS and Soviet perestroika-cinema and the bulk of the dialogue is improvised', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QmgzNuBaNdsEfLKYHDBZXqiQHc.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:96319'),
  ('927232936077113490', 'Inside Man', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Steven Moffat', null, 'David Tennant, Stanley Tucci, Dolly Wells, Lydia West, Lyndsey Marshal, Louis Oliver, Atkins Estimond, Dylan Baker', null, 'A prisoner on death row in the US, a vicar in a quiet English town, and a maths teacher trapped in a cellar cross paths in the most unexpected way.', 'A prisoner on death row in the US, a vicar in a quiet English town, and a maths teacher trapped in a cellar cross paths in the most unexpected way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tZONSnzKylgzHJvtoOGjRmYlgU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121710'),
