  ('656286863529127188', 'Intervention', 2005, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Sam Mettler, Rob Sharenow', null, 'Jeff VanVonderen, Candy Finnigan, Ken Seeley, Donna Chavous, Maureen Brine', 'TV-14', 'People whose uncontrollable addiction to drugs, alcohol or compulsive behavior has brought them to the brink of destruction and has devastated their family and friends are presented with a life-changing opportunity of intervention and rehab. Each addict must confront their darkest demons in order to begin their journey to recovery in the hopes that they can turn their lives around before it’s too late.', 'People whose uncontrollable addiction to drugs, alcohol or compulsive behavior has brought them to the brink of destruction and has devastated their family and friends are presented with a life-changing opportunity of intervention and rehab. Each addict must confront their darkest demons in order to begin their journey to recovery in the hopes that they can turn their lives around before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voryX0sQ7NjWmkuYy13IZBqwT2d.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:11145'),
  ('701758074539717989', 'Interview with the Vampire', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rolin Jones', null, 'Jacob Anderson, Sam Reid, Assad Zaman, Delainey Hayles, Eric Bogosian, Jennifer Ehle, Sheila Atim', 'TV-MA', 'A century-old vampire from New Orleans reunites with an ailing journalist to recount his life of bloodlust and his tumultuous relationship with the rakish Frenchman who turned him.', 'A century-old vampire from New Orleans reunites with an ailing journalist to recount his life of bloodlust and his tumultuous relationship with the rakish Frenchman who turned him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Afv4pPhqVMg2wOmhuDLiGUw4r4O.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:128098'),
  ('1113203578445262185', 'Interviews with Monster Girls', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Minami Shinoda, Kaede Hondo, Yoko Hikasa, Junichi Suwabe, Shiina Natsukawa, Lynn', 'TV-14', 'The story takes place in an age where "Ajin" (demi-human), more casually known as "Demi," have slowly started to become accepted into human society. Tetsuo Takahashi is a biology teacher who ends up teaching three such Demi, hoping to understand more about them while also managing to catch their attention.', 'The story takes place in an age where "Ajin" (demi-human), more casually known as "Demi," have slowly started to become accepted into human society. Tetsuo Takahashi is a biology teacher who ends up teaching three such Demi, hoping to understand more about them while also managing to catch their attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tm5UMGq9HA958N4ophH38YyqfWv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69282'),
  ('256698208040169287', 'İntikam', 2013, 'Drama', 'Mesude Erarslan', 'Hasan Cömert', 'Beren Saat, Yiğit Özşener, Mert Fırat, Alican Yücesoy, Engin Hepileri, Zafer Algöz, Arzu Gamze Kılınç, Başak Daşman', null, 'İntikam is a Turkish series broadcast on Kanal D. It is a licensed adaptation of Revenge and is jointly produced by Disney and In D house Productions, the production wing of Kanal D.', 'İntikam is a Turkish series broadcast on Kanal D. It is a licensed adaptation of Revenge and is jointly produced by Disney and In D house Productions, the production wing of Kanal D.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74xdx6zixGG72s7zHVWTXm0TqwW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:47669'),
  ('211037268774673676', 'Intimacy', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Laura Sarmiento, Verónica Fernández', null, 'Itziar Ituño, Patricia López Arnaiz, Daniel Cabrera, Verónica Echegui, Ana Wagener, Emma Suárez, Yune Nogueiras, Marc Martínez', 'TV-MA', 'A rising politician''s career is threatened when a surreptitiously recorded video of her sex life is leaked to the public.', 'A rising politician''s career is threatened when a surreptitiously recorded video of her sex life is leaked to the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AninoKw9HranR7ioImNYYA8dMu3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123534'),
  ('1109931213779722365', 'Intimate Portrait', 1993, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Meredith Vieira', 'TV-PG', 'Intimate Portrait is a biographical television series on the Lifetime Television cable network focusing on different celebrities, which includes interviews with each subject. Among the people profiled were Grace Kelly, Natalie Wood, Carly Simon, Jackie Kennedy, Katharine Hepburn, Carol Burnett, Tanya Tucker, and Marla Maples.', 'Intimate Portrait is a biographical television series on the Lifetime Television cable network focusing on different celebrities, which includes interviews with each subject. Among the people profiled were Grace Kelly, Natalie Wood, Carly Simon, Jackie Kennedy, Katharine Hepburn, Carol Burnett, Tanya Tucker, and Marla Maples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3S3G8DTeWrXcQn1QQSfAZ9sWXk2.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:9937'),
  ('209609103280486541', 'Into the Badlands', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Alfred Gough, Miles Millar', null, 'Emily Beecham, Orla Brady, Daniel Wu, Nick Frost, Alexia Ioannides, Aramis Knight, Maddison Jaizani, Lewis Tan', 'TV-14', 'In a land controlled by feudal barons, a great warrior and a young boy embark on a journey across a dangerous land to find enlightenment. A genre-bending martial arts series very loosely based on the classic Chinese tale Journey to the West.', 'In a land controlled by feudal barons, a great warrior and a young boy embark on a journey across a dangerous land to find enlightenment. A genre-bending martial arts series very loosely based on the classic Chinese tale Journey to the West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtceMKMxHSriLFUGAUfqHsW7uCo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:47450'),
  ('327578606503531457', 'Into the Fire: The Lost Daughter', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Cathryn Terkanian', 'TV-MA', 'A tenacious mother unravels the complex mystery surrounding the 1989 disappearance of the daughter she placed for adoption.', 'A tenacious mother unravels the complex mystery surrounding the 1989 disappearance of the daughter she placed for adoption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMs6mEHPPtrTQ4mjc6hBHl6bApJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261649'),
  ('409909464238299435', 'Into the Night', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jason George', null, 'Pauline Étienne, Laurent Capelluto, Jan Bijvoet, Mehmet Kurtuluş, Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Nicolas Alechine, Ksawery Szlenkier, Anton Kouzemin', 'TV-MA', 'When the sun suddenly starts killing everything in its path, passengers on an overnight flight from Brussels attempt to survive by any means necessary.', 'When the sun suddenly starts killing everything in its path, passengers on an overnight flight from Brussels attempt to survive by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/na6fk6WculNrUPCPPQSPNjNyjvX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93811'),
  ('757372312380084263', 'Into The Ring', 2020, 'Comedy, War & Politics, Drama', 'Hwang Seung-ki', 'Moon Hyun-Kyeong', 'Nana, Park Sung-hoon, Yoo Da-in, Han Jun-woo, Oh Dong-min, Bae Hae-seon, Ahn Nae-sang, Shin Do-hyun', null, 'A poor young woman decides to try her hand at civil service when she hears that a district representative position has an annual salary of 50 million won. She teams up with the newly-demoted Seo Gong Myung to penalize corrupt politicians.', 'A poor young woman decides to try her hand at civil service when she hears that a district representative position has an annual salary of 50 million won. She teams up with the newly-demoted Seo Gong Myung to penalize corrupt politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1d8szoDrvv0jZILRO1BEuaehhVv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104735'),
  ('990863177388890395', 'Into the Universe with Stephen Hawking', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Stephen Hawking', 'Stephen Hawking', 'Stephen Hawking, Benedict Cumberbatch, Melissa Ricci', 'TV-PG', 'Hawking gives us the ultimate guide to the universe, a ripping yarn based on real science, spanning the whole of space and time -- from the nature of the universe itself, to the chances of alien life, and the real possibility of time travel.', 'Hawking gives us the ultimate guide to the universe, a ripping yarn based on real science, spanning the whole of space and time -- from the nature of the universe itself, to the chances of alien life, and the real possibility of time travel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BkIRNhff8X0unbo0309GpbDYfY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32609');
